window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1101,"title":"Chapter 1101: Chapter 1100 - Apocryphal Antiquity! II","paragraphs":["The Authority of the Antiquity burned the remaining 4 Universes where Universal Constructs still lay as they foretold of his glorious descension soon.","It would be happening within a single hour as within this period of time...some beings would actually feel as if it was prolonged to days while others would feel like it finished within mere seconds!","Those that felt time seemed to be moving too fast were of course the side where Oathkeeper led, these beings feeling like the authority of the Antiquity seemed to be getting closer and closer much too fast. Those with Chronos felt like this single hour was too slow as these beings were facing a terrifying entity that was ripping apart all they knew.","The Apex Paragon and his Universal Emperor Slime!","Chronos’s group could barely keep up as they received news after news of their Hegemonies falling as the Universal Constructs they protected were destroyed one after another.","At this moment in time, only the Abyssal, Omicron, Liberated, and the Euthenia Universe that Noah’s subordinates had just conquered were the only Universes that were still undergoing the Universal Amalgamation, their boundaries separating them beginning to fade at this moment as they were about to become a single Universe!","When they did so, the Universal Constructs would also resonate as the authority they were cultivating within...would bloom and arrive in the Primordial Cosmos.","This overarching situation was being followed by all, but the one major player that everyone was paying attention to at this moment was still the Apex Paragon.","The Oathkeeper had been recuperating his essence as he planned to set off in the next hour even if he didn’t fully regain his mana reserves, and yet he just kept on receiving news after news about the Apex Paragon decimating more and more Hegemonies as he took out 4 Universal Constructs in what seemed just minutes!","Even a being like him that held a tremendously powerful Cosmic Treasure began to question the existence that was the Apex Paragon at this moment, not being able to understand how this being was doing the things he was doing!","The words that this Apex Paragon said to him just continued repeating in his mind over and over again as he kept on hearing of the shocking actions of this being.","’Is it truly...?’","The powerful existence that wielded a Cosmic Treasure began to doubt at this moment as the situation continued to unfold.","On the side of Chronos, this being had a stern expression as he spoke to the Hegemonies around him that were still in a stupor from hearing what the beings that stood with them just minutes ago had already died.","\"The vast majority of us will remain here and defend this Universal Construct with our very lives, the Goliath will be accompanied by a few of us from here to defend the Construct in the Abyssal Universe.\"","His eyes released baleful flames of wrath and somberness as he looked at everyone and continued.","\"The Universal Constructs in the Ethenia and Omicron Universes...shall be sacrificed as we focus all of our forces within the Abyssal and Liberated Universes!\"","RUMBLE!","\"The authority of the Antiquity continues to increase as his descent is merely less than an hour away...and we have to hold on just this single hour! Against a single Paragon and his Hegemony, we cannot lose our dream when we are this close!\"","...!","OOOOH!","The magisterial might of Hegemonies erupted out as their bodies burst with regality and power.","There were Universal Realm experts!","They had grand lives and stories that others only ever aspired to have...and they could not be hindered by a mere Paragon and his Hegemony!","With an eruption of regal might and power, the words of Chronos were passed down as the revolving situation changed rapidly.","The movements of these Hegemonies were seen as shockingly, the Oathkeeper received word from the Wings of Primordial destiny that Hegemonies were moving from the Euthenia and Omicron Universes as they all clustered together in the Abyssal and Liberated Universes!","The eyes of this Ancient being shone brightly as he utilized the Wings of Primordial Destiny and sent a message to a single being specifically at this moment.","\"Chronos and the Goliath are abandoning the Euthenia and Omicron Universes to be sure that the Universal Constructs of the Liberated and the Abyssal Universes aren’t destroyed. I will aim for the Abyssal Universe while you...take the Liberated Universe!\"","...!","A shocking message that even the Oathkeeper felt weird about when he sent it, realizing that he was actually handing off a task that an existence like him would have trouble with towards a Paragon!","Yet the reply he received...","\"Sure.\"","\"...\"","Noah received the message as he arrived in the Euthenia Universe, getting into this Universe just in time to see the faces of angered and shamed Hegemonies flashing away as they left behind an empty and an unprotected Universal Construct!","They had actually made his job this easy as he patted the viscous body of the Blue Slime, their figures streaking across the void as they appeared beside the Universal Constructs that was pulsating madly within seconds.","The figure of the Blue Slime shot out like a streak of light, expanding to cover and devour this Universal Construct as well! His body glimmered brightly as yet another 15 Billion Galaxies were transformed into Dao Galaxies, this being now having 65 Billion in total!","Thereafter, both the Slime and Noah’s figure flashed with a spatial light silently as they disappeared, Noah letting his other Clone within this Universe that just had its beings finishing pledging fealty do the work of transporting them into the Dark Universe.","When he reappeared, Noah was in the Omicron Universe that was now also abandoned by its protectors, the slime repeating its actions of swallowing the Universal Construct within this Universe as well! With this, a total amount of 80 Billion Dao Galaxies swirled magnificently within its Origin, needing only 20% more before reaching genuine Antiquity!","After this....only 2 Universes remained that still had Universal Constructs, with Noah needing to face the overabundance of Hegemonies in the Liberated universe!"]},{"number":1102,"title":"Chapter 1102: Chapter 1101 - Apocryphal Antiquity! III","paragraphs":["With the Omicron Universe, the Emperor Penguin and Barbatos were leading the charge while following behind the lead of the clone of the Blue Slime, this Universe actually having its existences all pledge fealty under the Tyrannical Emperor a moment after Noah entered and destroyed the Universal Construct.","He left just as quickly as his main body in the Dark Universe simply shone with brilliance and tabulated the incoming Marks of Antiquity.","With the addition of the Omicron and Euthenia Universe as well as his forces still targeting the levels of Paragons and below in the Abyssal and Liberated Universe...Noah currently stood at 43 Billion Dao Galaxies as he was very close to becoming a Hegemony himself!","The only thing that stood in his way was time, as well as the large amounts of Hegemonies that were currently waiting for him.","WAA!","At this time, his figure flashed into the Liberated Universe as he used the Expansive senses of the Slime to very quickly locate the Universal Construct as well as...its protectors!","It was frighteningly quiet at this moment as the figures of Noah and the Blue Slime turned into streaks of light, appearing near the Construct soon after as Noah locked eyes with the numerous beings protecting it.","Chronos was at the very forefront as his eyes were filled with utter seriousness and somberness as he gazed upon Noah.","What caused Noah’s eyes to constrict when he faced these Hegemonies though...was the fact that around all of them, a glimmering Universe was manifested outside brilliantly!","Each of them were actually manifesting their Origins outside as they released horrendous waves of power, the many Daos and laws they controlled shining brilliantly across their Galaxies and Dao Galaxies.","Noah could actually count 14 Manifested Universes before him as it represented 14 Hegemonies! At the very forefront, Chronos majestically walked out as he looked at Noah with an impassive face!","\"You know...I really hate beings like you the most.\"","RUMBLE!","\"Beings that obtain everything without putting in any work, beings that are handed their power by another influence as they use it as if it was their own!\"","...!","Chronos’s vibrant voice reverberated out as Noah listened silently, this being actually believing that Noah was something sent by the Primordial Cosmos themselves to stand in his way.","This was the only way to explain the unexplained power this being used! The only way to understand why a Paragon could do the things that he did!","\"...\"","Noah tilted his head as he smiled devilishly at this being’s words, his Cthulhu form merely vibrating with power as when faced with 14 terrifying Hegemonies, he wasn’t too bothered as he began to prepare!","Aside from this Universe, a similar scene was about to play out in the Abyssal Universe as outside its boundaries, a stern Oathkeeper had appeared as within his hands...a Sword of Primordial Essence vibrated intensely.","\"Lend me your strength...\"","He spoke powerfully to the Hegemonies behind him as they bellowed out, their bodies lighting up as essence freely left them and flowed into the Oathkeeper in an inefficient manner, but it flowed in nonetheless as the Sword of Primordial Essence shone even brighter, beginning to pierce and sink deeply into the Universal Barrier!","Behind the barrier, the swirling black hole that was the face of the Goliath swirled powerfully as multiple Hegemonies stood beside him, this entire party looking up as they were ready for battle!","2 Universes, 2 battles.","2 battles that would decide the unknown fate of many things!","Whether the Antiquity descended or not would depend on these two battles...and the Antiquity himself as this powerful Entity was truly relentless.","A moment after the nigh simultaneous destruction of 2 Universal Constructs by Noah and now with only 2 remaining, this Antiquity silently and with eyes flashing coldly actually burned another set of Universes as he used their essence once more!","In the unique area of space across time and dimensions, he uttered coldly while gritting his teeth.","\"20 minutes!\"","RUMBLE","An extremely heavy price continued to be paid by the Antiquity as no matter what, he promised himself he had to descend!","His shocking actions were met with happiness in the Liberated and Abyssal Universe by Chronos and his party, while Noah’s eyes only flashed with bright light as he waved his hands and brought forth other clones of the Blue Slime.","THRUM!","Two more planetary sized Blue Slimes appeared as their mission were finished in the Euthenia and Omicron Universes, their bodies only glimmering with power and strength as they also stared down at the group of 14 Hegemonies.","The glimmer of Manifested Universes foretold of a shocking battle to occur as before Noah even made a move, Chronos had already waved his hands as an enormous purple clock appeared in the skies releasing an immense amount of the essence of Chronos!","At this point in time though, a voice stretched out from a being that had been very silent recently.","\"From the memories of all the Hegemonies...you were the one to lead and propose for the genocide of the Universal Emperor Slimes.\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of the Blue Slime reverberated out strongly as the eyes of this being locked onto Chronos’s figure and spoke out!","He had devoured many Hegemonies so far as he didn’t just obtain their power...he also obtained their memories! From them, he knew of the Deep history of the Universal Emperor Slimes as well a the events leading to it.","Inexplicably sometime in the past, conflicts had begun to rise ever so slowly around the powerful Paragons and Hegemonies stemming from the race of Universal Emperor Slimes, almost as if a being was moving behind the scenes and orchestrating everything.","They progress so far as to cause a war with this unique race, where Universal Emperor Slimes were branded taboo as they used their power of Devouring to upset the very balance of the Cosmos!","When a Universal Emperor Slime held an entire Universe hostage for hundreds of years, this was the last straw as Chronos was the one to lead the campaign after that to eradicate them all.","This being now looked at the Blue Slime coldly as while the regal purple clock rotated above him, he replied slowly.","\"In another lifetime, the Universal Emperor Slimes stood in my way and posed issues to my plans, so I eradicated them this time around.\"","RUMBLE!","\"But it seems I wasn’t thorough enough, where even a little child like you was left behind...and here you are causing me problems yet again.\"","....!","A cold and remorseless voice!","The Blue Slime heard this clearly as its body vibrated with emotions, the knowledge that it would forever be the last of its kind because of such a reason from this existence being overwhelming!","Even though the Blue Slime was immensely powerful, it still held the mentality of a young boy as such emotions were felt strongly.","\"It’s okay.\"","Above the Blue Slime, Noah patted his body sadly as he spoke, the Blue Slime calming down as in the Dark Universe, Noah’s main body was actually holding on to a small miniaturized form of the Blue Slime in his hands.","\"It’s okay. Turn the strength of those emotions and rage towards the one that caused this. Let them feel what you feel!\"","WAA!","The eyes of the Blue Slime shimmered a beautiful cerulean blue as it nodded, the blue crown above it spinning madly as in the Liberated Universe, essence erupted out in waves!","The last battle to decide the descent of an Antiquity began at this moment!"]},{"number":1103,"title":"Chapter 1103: Chapter 1102 - Apocryphal Antiquity! IV","paragraphs":["All the previous battles that Noah had been in didn’t involve extremely high tier Daos like the Dao of Chronos from his enemies.","But this time around, the existence that even held the title of Chronos had prepared and stood against him as the regal purple clock he summoned shone menacingly in the light!","But against the rage of the Blue Slime...this purple light seemed to pale in comparison!","RUMBLE!","Its three clones glimmered with wondrous cerulean light that illuminated the nearby tens of thousands of miles, two of the clones shining with an essence that was deeply crimson in color as it represented Extinction.","The central clone shone a glorious blue as an opposing clock just as big as Chronos’s appeared behind them, causing pure power to crackle in the air as one essence of Chronos faced another!","Then...there was the beautiful manifestation of their Universes.","The 14 Hegemonies had already manifested their Universes as at this time, the Blue Slime manifested its own. Yet...there was a shocking change with the appearance of its manifestation as the eyes of Chronos and other Hegemonies opened wide, their hearts trembling from what they saw!","This was because when the three slimes manifested their Universes, they didn’t display three Universes...but each slime had one that was bright blue in color that seemed extremely real, and another that seemed less brighter, but it was still there.","Two Universes! It was the scene of a single being manifesting two Universes that made Chronos and the others nearly go mad in a stupor, as this was a sign of Antiquity! Even though one of the universes seemed incomplete, it still should be like this!","\"OOOOOH!\"","But to the Blue Slime, it didn’t matter what level of shock they had.","A terrifying bellow exploded out with a myriad of emotions, the feelings of a being that had its entire race taken away rolling out as the Blue Slime tugged on the endless mana reserves of Noah to let loose!","The two clones shining with the essence of Extinctions spoke out at this moment as their voices caused the void to crack and splinter.","\"Apocalyptic Extinction.\"","RUMBLE....RIIIP!","The void quaked as it ripped apart, terrifying hurricanes and typhoons containing dense essence of Extinction blooming before the 14 Hegemonies as they threatened to cover everything, while the central Blue Slime caused the essence of Chronos to flood out towards the Hegemony of Chronos himself as their clocks shone brightly!","Chronos had an extremely disgusted expression, still looking at the manifested universes of the Blue Slimes as his eyes were tinged with maddened wrath and envy.","Wasn’t that the process of Antiquity? To have more than a single universe?","How did a Blue Slime that had just become a Hegemony achieve this?","’How did a fucking child like that deserve this?!’","\"HOW?!\"","RUMBLE!","Chronos bellowed out maddeningly as his anger and frustration over something he chased throughout multiple lifetimes seemed to be handed out so easily to others.","He moved with purpose as he wanted to rip apart this Blue Slime, and it seemed like all three Blue Slimes wanted to target Chronos too as the typhoons and hurricanes swirling with the essence of Extinction were focused onto him!","Yet the moment they were about to come in contact and cause a shocking impact...","WAP!","All three figures of the Blue Slime disappeared.","...!","The 14 Hegemonies had prepared greatly in advance and even manifested their Universes, but their focus had been too closely attached to the Hegemony of Devouring and the deadly essence he released.","They weren’t too focused on the master of this blue shimmering Hegemony as they only kept him in their eyes in case he used one of the moves they heard about from others!","But they didn’t see him move and they couldn’t attack a Paragon anyways, so they didn’t direct anything towards him. But at this moment...the figures of the three Blue Slimes disappeared as the gigantic Cthulhu that was above the central one actually appeared behind the 14 Hegemonies.","Behind the terrifying typhoons and hurricanes of Extinction they were facing, his eyes being extremely calm as they only shone with a gorgeous red light of power and regality!","His thoughts moved at an incredible pace as his Cosmic Treasure was prepared and ready, with him not even doing the flashy actions of winding up his fist and striking out as he simply put his palm out and...tapped his fingers.","...","RIIIP!","With a tap of his fingers, the very fabric of the universe was torn apart by a terrific Cosmic Treasure as this time around, his target was enough to cover everything!","...!","Shock and horror dawned on the faces of the Hegemonies as their Origins rotated madly, the moment the Ruination Sea dawning on them causing them to move! But three Blue Slimes had moved faster than them as they were already teleported near respective Hegemonies a moment before Noah ripped apart the Universe around them.","WAA!","When the restriction of the Ruination Sea dawned- when less than a millisecond passed as the slime clones looked at their targets...their viscuous bodies already extended to cover a few Hegemonies before they could even react as...","<<Universal Devouring>>.","WAP!","\"AHH!\"","A show of horror occurred as 4 Hegemonies instantly disappeared, and one had half of its body devoured as he barely moved out the range of the Blue Slime!","When the show of terror looked like it was about to continue, the Blue Slime actually came to a halt!","A complete stop as not a single part of its body moved an inch, as if this being was frozen in time.","But it wasn’t so.","It was because at this time, a prerequisite had been met.","Enough Universal Realm experts were devoured as it was more than sufficient to give way to something glorious!","While still within the Ruination Sea in the Liberated Universe and mostly, the main body of the Blue Slime that was currently in Noah’s hands in the Dark Universe...the figure of this wondrous existence began to glimmer with light.","A second later, an expansive and domineering pillar of light shot into the skies and void, this pillar shining with a brilliant blue color as it brought with it the picture of 2 glorious Universes that stretched for miles and miles!","With this shocking pillar of light came down a shocking Authority.","It was an Authority that few would briefly experience as the authority of an Apocryphal Antiquity!"]},{"number":1104,"title":"Chapter 1104: Chapter 1103 - A Universal Seed Blooms Within The Tyrannical Emperor! I","paragraphs":["Apocryphal meant something false.","Something of doubtful authenticity that was also seen as true!","At this moment, a unique species of a Universal Emperor Slime had unlocked a false path of Antiquity, but it had Antiquity attached to it nonetheless.","THRUM!","Its main body and clones harmonized as while Noah held the Blue Slime in his hands in the Dark Universe, his eyes followed the beautiful glimmer of a Blue pillar of light that shot to the skies, the ends of this pillar illuminating two vibrant Universes!","One had 80% of its Galaxies converged into Dao Galaxies as it was a few away from becoming a Splendiferous Universe, another Universe was newly built from the sacrifices of multiple Hegemonies.","They both shone with magisterial light as they brought down with them a shocking authority that even made Noah feel suffocated when it first appeared!","But he grasped on tightly onto the Blue Slime as this existence felt his thoughts, the pressure that he and many others in the Universal Core felt receding as the Blue pillar of light quickly faded.","In the Liberated Universe, the three pillars that each illuminated two bright Universes remained as they released a stifling feeling in the surroundings, but before anything could occur...a particular Hegemony bellowed out a guttural cry in the Ruination Sea as his body shone with a terrifying purple and unique green-white light!","It was the figure of Chronos where in the midst of this glorious arrival of an Apocryphal Antiquity, he actually became an existence that tried to shine just as brightly as the essence of both Reincarnation and Chronos roiled around him.","The unique mixture of Chronos and the essence of a Cosmic Dao that was almost always passively used permeated within the formed Ruination Sea, spreading out to the folds of the Liberated Universe that had yet to be ripped apart as they actually carried out a unique action!","OOOOOH!","The bellows of Chronos continued to resound out as he seemed to be pushing his Origin to the limit, something shocking actually occurring whoever his mixture of Reincarnation and Chronos passed.","The ripped apart fabric of the Universe actually seemed to be receding, as if they were being inverted back to a state they were in before they were ripped apart!","...!","This existence that uniquely comprehended Reincarnation and was the first to learn the essence of Chronos could actually close the ruptures of the Ruination Sea, inverting the entire area around them to a state it was before as he drained himself to make it possible.","THRUM!","In a short period of time, the ruptures wound back in time as this being that was closest to completely comprehending the Cosmic Dao of Chronos made a grand show of power.","\"...\"","The area was entirely silent as the 10 remaining Hegemonies still felt the Origins shaking, the feeling of being in a terrifying Ruination Sea still present at this very moment!","Their eyes towards Noah and the Blue Slime held hints of fear and disbelief as it was the singular figure of Chronos that had his hair flying around madly, his entire body clad in the aura of Reincarnation and Chronos as he looked towards Noah with utter fury and disbelief.","\"That...was Ruination!\"","RUMBLE!","This being uttered out these words as even he was in shock and didn’t seem to believe them even as he said them!","But he couldn’t mistake the feeling he had just now as he had actually gone through it a few times in the past! In previous timelines, he had at many times tried to see if he could survive the environment outside of the Primordial Cosmos, and he would die at each time without fail as multiple Lifetimes were ended in this manner.","Yet in this lifetime before he even left the Primordial Cosmos...he felt this same feeling again as it was induced by a being!","His words caused the surrounding Hegemonies to gape in shock, Noah’s eyes looking at Chronos coldly as he didn’t confirm or deny this being’s conjecture.","All he did...was look at the Blue Slime.","Apocryphal Antiquity...just what was it?","WAAA!","At his thoughts, the eyes of the 3 Slime clones opened as they released bright rays of starry blue light, their bodies finally regaining movement as the Blue pillar of light that shot to the skies converged around his head.","When the gorgeous show of light ended, one could only see two beautiful Universes floating soundly above the bodies of the Blue Slimes, these Universes presenting something that others only ever sought for but never achieved!","Chronos was still shocked by the knowledge that a Paragon had induced a Sea of Ruination to form, his attention barely being able to look at the Blue Slime that seemed to have achieved the formation of another Universe.","A signature of Antiquity!","And with it came...authority.","THRUM!","Just a single body of the Blue Slime lit up as above it, two illusory universes rotated beautifully and gave off a shocking sense of power, his voice coming out as it seemed undeniable.","\"Revert.\"","...!","A mere word, and yet the space that had just undergone a Temporal Inversion by Chronos was once more returned to how it was.","It even seemed Instantaneous as before the Hegemonies could even celebrate Chronos’s shocking feat, it was erased right away with a single word from the Blue Slime as the Ruination Sea was instantly reinstated!","They once again fell under hellish conditions as the Blue Slime eyed them coldly, the 2 Universes above it beginning to spin rapidly as they undulated with power.","OOOOH!","Chronos saw this shocking situation as his eyes shone unwillingly, his body beginning to burst with essence as he wanted to do again what he had just done before!","He wanted to use the combination of Reincarnation and Chronos to erase the Ruination Sea once more but he found that at this time, no matter how much mana he burned...nothing changed.","Not a single millimeter of space changed as no matter how much mana he released in the form of Dao Essence, he couldn’t change the surroundings!","This was because at this time, the Authority of Antiquity lingered in the surroundings after one such existence cast a skill.","Even though it was a false Antiquity as its power might be lesser, it was still Antiquity!","And such an authority could not be denied by a Hegemony!"]},{"number":1105,"title":"Chapter 1105: Chapter 1104 - A Universal Seed Blooms Within The Tyrannical Emperor! II","paragraphs":["While an Apocryphal Antiquity was just born in the Liberated Universe, the Oathkeeper had pierced through the boundary of the Abyssal Universe as his figure looked like a shining white like cutting through the intense aura leaking out of the Universal Constructs.","His descent was actually brought to a halt briefly as when the Blue Slime advanced, its aura had spread out to even be felt within the Abyssal Universe!","This was because the Liberated and Abyssal Universes were the only 2 remaining with the Universal Constructs within them as they were the ones to continue the process of Amalgamation, the barriers between these two Universes already being extremely thin as they could disappear at any moment to allow for complete fusion.","A complete fusion of the Universes and constructs as it would mean an apocalyptic event coming down!","But the Oathkeeper only stared at this briefly before he turned his attention to the figures of the Goliath and over 10 Hegemonies a few hundred miles away from him.","His body was currently receiving the essence of tens of Hegemonies that were outside of the boundary of the Abyssal Universe and could not pierce through the authority of a Hegemony as they didn’t hold a Cosmic Treasure. The mana of all of these Universal Realm experts flowed through him as he breathed out calmly.","He looked at the figure of the being that he considered his friend for millions of years, at the black hole that was the Goliath as he tried to find out why and just understand! But there was nothing as the Sword of PRimordial Essence glimmered, cutting apart the pressure resisting him as he warped and appeared right in front of the Goliath and the over 10 Hegemonies currently protecting the only other Universal Construct!","RUMBLE!","Pure Primordial Essence gushed out from his body as the Primordial Disk on the left hand and the Sword of Primordial Essence on the right hand swung down, the eyes of this being coldly looking towards the Goliath that had his figure erupting with the essence of extinction.","Two lifelong friends and backbones of the Primordial Cosmos aimed their might at each other as those around them just seemed like mere extras!","BOOM!","---","At the same time, in the Dark Universe.","While holding on to the bubbling figure of the main body of the Blue Slime in his hands, Noah was releasing a burst of golden light all around him as millions of Marks of Antiquity continued to converge and rush towards his Origin.","He was looking into his Origin as he counted the number of Galaxies being transformed into Dao Galaxies, this number actually being at 49 Billion at this moment!","It was all due to the fact that the other copies of the Blue Slimes moving with Noah’s subordinates had now reached the end point of their conquest of the remaining Universes, nearly all beings in the ranks of Paragon and below pledging Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor.","With the hard work of his summons and subordinates...Noah could see a glorious goal being achieved in the next minute!","The total number of Dao Galaxies neared the 50 Billion number he needed as after a second passed, 1 million remained.","A few more seconds passed as a hundred thousand remained! 50,000! 25,000! 10,000! 100!","RUMBLE!","Noah’s figure was in the skies above the stadium that showed the shocking events occurring in the Abyssal and Liberated Universe, but his subordinates were not focusing on this at the moment. Their eyes actually turned to the skies as Barbatos, the Emperor Penguin, Elena...all of those close to him gazed in his direction as they had begun to feel a unique aura that was less oppressive than the blue slime and yet unique on its own begin to rise.","The glorious color of gold surrounding Noah had expanded for miles as his seas of fortune and destiny churned brighty, a brilliant Mark of Antiquity coming down and smashing onto a Galaxy as this particular one caused a certain number to be hit.","50 Billion.","THRUM!","The moment this number was hit, golden lines of connection shot forth from all the newly added Dao Galaxies, going towards the normal galaxies as instantly, all Galaxies within Noah’s Universe were connected!","This was the prerequisite for Universal Seed, and Noah had now reached it in a spectacular fashion at that. 50 Billion Dao Galaxies and 50 Billion normal Galaxies. They all came together at this moment as...a Universal seed came to life.","As his Origin was condensed and pushed in and a golden seed formed!","Thereafter...this seed bloomed!","RUMBLE!","It shot out a vast array of colors as it illuminated everything, the glorious shine of crimson, gold, blue, white...an array of colors stretching out from Noah as a vast Universe expanded from his body.","It became visible to all as when it manifested itself, those around him didn’t feel pressure or terror...they just felt warmth!","The vast numbers of galaxies within this Universe were shining with multiple colors on one side and they were slightly dimmer on another, but it was one of the most beautiful things anyone could see in the Dark Universe as a second later...Noah recalled all of it back.","...!","\"Finally.\"","His voice echoed out as it seemed mesmerizing to those that heard it, his eyes flashing brightly as within them...one could see a swirling Universe!","The Universal Realm!","Hegemony!","RUMBLE!","This shocking change didn’t just occur to his main body as a second later, his Primordial Ruination Clone looking coldly at the despairing figures of the Hegemonies along with Chronos also began to shine with glorious color as the aura he released gradually changed.","It shot past the stages of a Paragon in but an instant as it blazed brightly, the corroded Hegemonies in the Ruination Sea being forced to look towards him in utter shock amidst their intense pain!","Within the chest of this Primordial Ruination Clone, there was also another change as a certain Cosmic Treasure received the essence of a Universal Realm expert.","Its owner had a drastic change in quality as from the Realm of Galactic Filament to Universal Realm, the functions this Cosmic Treasure could use were further enhanced!","[Congratulations on the fast advancement, Master. New features are now usable.]","The voice of the Cosmic Treasure reverberated in Noah’s mind brilliantly."]},{"number":1106,"title":"Chapter 1106: Chapter 1105 - A Universal Seed Blooms Within The Tyrannical Emperor! III","paragraphs":["As one climbed through the Realms of Power, the usage of powerful treasures becomes easier as many things that weren’t possible before had their paths opened widely!","The moment Noah established his Universe and the essence of the Universal Realm flowed into the Cosmic Treasure, more portions of it were unlocked as other features became available.","[Master can now use the old features with 100% more efficiency, with some changes made to what the Primordial Ruination Clone can do as two new features can now be accessed through the Ruination Clone and the Treasure itself. The number of applicable Ruination Affixes has also been increased to 12.]","The voice of RUINATION rang out in his mind as Noah communicated with it at fast speeds where not even a millisecond had passed in the outside world yet, the thoughts of the Cosmic Treasure flowing into him as it quickly sent in the information of the changes!","[Primordial Ruination Clone] :: Out of the innumerable number of creatures in the vast Cosmos, there are a few whose bodies uniquely rise above all others. The Primordial Ruination Clone is a feature that only the Master of RUINATION can utilize, allowing them to forge a Primordial Ruination Clone from the very essence of Ruination. As a creature made from the very essence of a Cosmic Dao, it has a +200,000% Increase in the speed of progression through the Realms of Power, +200,000% Increase in the Comprehension and Assimilation of all Daos, can display 400% of the strength of the Master of Ruination, along with its power increased by 2000% when in the Ruination Sea. It can seamlessly utilize the abilities of [Miniature Ruination Rupture Generation], [Instantaneous Universal Teleportation], [Ruination Essence Skill Conversion and Amplification], [Sword of Ruination], and [Cosmic Chains of Ruination], [@$%@#$%]...","Its abilities were enhanced stupendously as they literally doubled, with the power the Primordial Ruination Clone could display increased from 200% to 400%!","When it fought in the Ruination Sea...this power would be further increased by 2000%! It was an absurd number as Noah’s thoughts focused on the new features of the Cosmic Treasure that he just unlocked.","[Sword of Ruination] and [Cosmic Chains of Ruination].","[Sword of Ruination] :: A pure essence of Ruination from the Cosmic Treasure itself. It has great capabilities in increasing the battle power of the Master of Ruination. Grants +1,000,000% Enhanced Ruination Damage, +100,000% AOE Splash Damage, +100,000% Attack and Cast Speed, +50% Chance to trigger Ruination Nova on hit, +50% Chance to trigger Chained Ruination Strike on hit, and a 100% chance to trigger Ruination Rupture on Hit.","[Cosmic Chains of Ruination] :: A master capable enough to wield RUINATION can even devour Universes. This ability allows one to devour Universes in exchange for increasing the Comprehension and Assimilation of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination.","\"...\"","Noah had no words when he looked at the ecstatic features and their crazy numbers displayed, the little time he had making him focus on one particular feature!","His focus was mainly on the Sword of Ruination, but the [Cosmic Chains of Ruination] made him ecstatic as it provided a way for him to advance through the Comprehension and Assimilation of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination that had been moving too slowly on his opinion.","All he had to do in exchange...was destroy Universes in exchange for this increased Comprehension and Assimilation.","His thoughts flew around rapidly as while accounting for all this, his Primordial Ruination Clone began to emanate terrifying waves of power in the form of the Galaxy colored Cthulhu.","With the aura of a Hegemony wrapping around him, Noah called out softly as the essence he released was not hidden by Subterfuge and made abundantly clear.","Chronos and this group of Hegemonies already knew the truth, so there was nothing to hide!","Beautifully bloody crimson in color, it came out from the Cosmic Treasure in waves as he called out lightly.","[Sword of Ruination].","RUUMBLE!","The void quaked and split apart as instantaneously, an exquisitely designed crimson blade pulsating wildly with the essence of Ruination erupted from his hand!","Gorgeous runic inscriptions overlayed its hilt, the blade itself being a pulsating mass of Ruination that was over three thousand miles long and threatening to rip apart anything it touched.","Noah grasped onto the Sword of Ruination as the magisterial image of a titanic Cthulhu wielding a crimson sword the size of a star was inscribed onto the terrified eyes of all Hegemonies!","These Hegemonies that were fighting for their lives in the reestablished Ruination Sea found their hearts quaking as they first felt the rising aura of what seemed to be an Antiquity, and now the Apex Paragon was somehow releasing terrifying waves of power as a Hegemony!","All of these events...they could believe even as they saw them with their own eyes.","Then there was Chronos.","The one that had lived multiple lifetimes and put many things in play!","The one that had orchestrated the descent of Antiquity as the only way to reach this stage after searching over so many lifetimes!","Chronos and all of his profound Comprehension in Chronos and Reincarnation...actually couldn’t cast any skills under the authority of an Apocryphal Antiquity and the Ruination Sea surrounding him.","He and all the other Hegemonies were under this stifling feeling as the authority of the Blue Slime wrapped around this entire area, and now the stupendous aura of a Hegemony dawned upon them as well.","...!","It was a shocking, fearful, and horrendous phenomenon as soon after...","\"Haha...haha!\"","Maddened laughter could be heard as the figure of Chronos could be seen with a face that seemed to be wrathful and smiling at the same time.","\"Ascending to become a Hegemony that easily? Your pet becoming an Antiquity out of nowhere? You yourself grasping the Cosmic Dao of Ruination? Haha!\"","Maddened laughter was coming from Chronos as he seemed to be laughing and crying at the same time!","\"...\"","It was a truly saddening sight to see, the observation of an expert of such caliber breaking down.","It was the breaking down of a being that had lived too long searching for a single thing, and now when they were so close...it was about to be taken away from them.","In such a situation, Chronos could only madly laugh at the sequence of events playing out.","He truly couldn’t believe what he was seeing as none of it made sense!","\"How fair the Primordial Cosmos is! How adjudicating it is for it to deny me Antiquity over multiple lifetimes...but to then give it to others so damn freely just to stop me!\"","RUMBLE!","While having the essence of Ruination corrode his body and Origin, Chronos continued to speak madly as this being had truly reached the breaking point.","Amidst his ravings and breakdown, the newly risen aura of a Hegemony flashed around Noah’s eyes as the authority of an Antiquity flew from the figure of the Blue Slime, these two terrific existences moving to end things!"]},{"number":1107,"title":"Chapter 1107: Chapter 1106 - The Undeniable Descent Of The Great Usurper! I","paragraphs":["The folds between the two remaining universes connected with the Universal Constructs were extremely thin.","So thin that when certain beings made their advancement, it could closely be felt by others!","There was a certain being that felt this feeling even more than others as the Cosmic Treasure he wielded reacted to another.","Oathkeeper was within his Sword of Primordial Essence against the Goliath as he weaved in and out of the attacks of over ten other Hegemonies, but he couldn’t help but momentarily raise his head towards the direction where terrifying auras arose from!","One was an aura that far surpassed Hegemony, while another was the one that Oathkeeper felt really closely, as it was something directly opposed to the Cosmic Treasure he held!","\"Impossible...\"","He uttered out in shock as a thought passed through his mind, but he wasn’t the only one spacing out as even the Goliath and the Hegemonies around him were looking in this direction while quizzically wondering...","’Had the Antiquity already descended?’","...!","Yes! Sensing the aura that spilled above the level of Hegemonies, these beings actually wondered if the Antiquity was already descending, but they continued to protect the Construct behind them with their very lives!","---","In the artificially created Ruination Sea within the Liberated Universe.","As the Hegemonies saw the figures of Noah and the Blue Slime emanate power and begin to move, all Hegemonies aside from Chronos cried out fearfully as these powerful beings...actually began to call out weakly!","They didn’t call out to the emotionless Blue Slime, but the being that had just stepped into the Universal Realm at this moment.","They couldn’t call him the Apex Paragon anymore.","Sensing the aura around his body and the terrifying crimson blade the size of a planet grasped by his thousands of miles long galactic Chtulhu figure...these hegemonies had shameful and despairing looks in their eyes as they began to call out!","In their fear and shame, they addressed this being respectfully for what he was most renowned for, with a few of them uttering out different names.","\"Tyranny...Hegemony of Tyranny, please...spare us!\"","RUMBLE!","From the title of Tyrannical Emperor they saw this being use over and over again, a few Hegemonies bent over backwards amidst their fears as they called out the Hegemony of Tyranny!","But others took the Cosmic Daos that existences comprehended with more importance as after hearing Chronos shout out the name of a certain Cosmic Dao as well as the stifling environment they were in, they were able to put two and two together and realize the being before them could utilize Ruination.","So naturally, when they wanted to save their lives from being wasted in the Ruination Sea, they called out while trying to hide the shame and pain in their eyes.","\"Hegemony of Ruination...please stay your hand!\"","WAA!","\"Hegemony of Ruination....!\"","The glorious calls of certain titles began for the first time as a terrifying Cthulhu grasped onto a planetary sized Sword of Ruination, his figure flickering coldly with the glimmer of a Universe spinning in his eyes as he disappeared in a flash of red light!","RUMBLE!","At this moment, Noah actually tuned out the calls of the Hegemonies as he moved seamlessly in the Ruination Sea while grasping the Sword of Ruination. Its pulsing power coursed through his body as he appeared silently behind a planetary sized Hegemony and swung the terrifying sword.","RIIIP...BOOOM!","\"Ah...!\"","A terrifying explosion and scream rang out simultaneously as when the eyes turned towards a certain direction, they could see a Hegemony bisected cleanly in half as a rupture ran through his body! An explosion of Ruination essence erupted out with the hit as it caused the split apart body to fly out in separate directions, its aura immensely weakening as this existence was on death’s door right away.","\"...\"","A single swing of the Sword of Ruination, and Noah had nearly killed a Hegemony!","THUMP!","He could feel his heart beating wildly at such a power, emotions flooding into his mind for having arrived at such a juncture in his life.","To be capable of seamlessly cutting apart Universal Realm experts!","Of course, many factors came to make it possible as Noah’s Primordial Clone was at this moment having its power enhanced by +1,000% just by being in the Ruination Sea, and then you had the Sword of Ruination itself that had a 1 million percent enhancement of Ruination Damage.","That wasn’t to mention the Affixes attached to this Sword that could trigger Ruination Novas , Strikes, and Ruptures with every swing!","Such a power was so overbearing that the Hegemonies only struggled with their lives with even more fervor.","But Noah wasn’t alone.","As he held his blade after cutting apart a Hegemony with a swing of a Sword, two clones of Blue Slimes appeared where the two halves of the body shot out to as they devoured them seamlessly!","The other clone had already wildly spread out its essence to establish its authority as within the Ruination Sea, the other Hegemonies could not even move at this moment. This was why they had called upon the Hegemony of Ruination to spare them!","WAP!","A flash of blue light illuminated the crimson darkness.","WAP!","Yet again, this flashing blue light repeated!","Flashes of blue light were glimmering every millisecond at this moment, this light representing the tremendously fast speed the Blue Slime was moving at this moment in the Ruination Sea as it devoured the Hegemonies within it.","In but less a second, the power of an Apocryphal Antiquity showed itself as even without another point of comparison at this moment, it was terrifying enough as in this single second...the cries of all Hegemonies stopped!","Every flash of blue light was a Universal Devouring, stopping every desperate cry!","All the cries stopped because these pleading Hegemonies that could only struggle madly in the Ruination Sea had been devoured within the span of a single second by the terrifying Apocryphal Antiquity.","\"...\"","It was such incredulous speed that even Noah could barely follow it with his eyes, and this was due to his clone being fused with the Blue Slime!","At this moment, only Chronos remained.","His eyes were bright with a luster of purple and greenish white, the Daos of Chronos and Reincarnation swimming beautifully within them as he came face to face with the existences that would ruin his goals in this lifetime!"]},{"number":1108,"title":"Chapter 1108: Chapter 1107 - The Undeniable Descent Of The Great Usurper! II","paragraphs":["Chronos remained alone in the Ruination Sea as the terrifying essence within corroded his Origin.","It was eerily silent as after the sudden Devouring of all other remaining Hegemonies in just a second, the figures of three Blue Slimes and a single galaxy colored Cthulhu surrounded Chronos’s body!","4 planetary sized existences looking at a 2 meter tall human, it was an extremely stark contrast!","Yes Chronos’s face had turned placid as even with his end seemingly nearing, he actually locked his gaze on the figures of the Blue Slimes and especially Noah’s face.","The past Apex Paragon.","The current Hegemony of Tyranny and Ruination!","\"I have never met you before in my past life times.\"","RUMBLE!","He spoke amidst his destruction calmly, the madness of losing everything gone instantly as the mind of this ancient being shifted very quickly!","\"Don’t you find that weird? That across the countless lifetimes I’ve lived through, not once had you appeared, and yet here you are right now.\"","\"...\"","\"What exactly are you? Where did you come from?\"","Noah listened to the words of the Ancient being silently as the Blue Slimes were already making a move.","Glorious blue clocks erupted from each of them as they revolved in a circular manner around them, locking all of their figures in resplendent waves of the essence of Chronos at this moment.","The Hegemony of Chronos himself seemingly let go at this moment as a smile of peace came unto his face, his voice continuing to ring out.","\"When I wake up in another lifetime, do you think you’ll still be there this time around?\"","WAA!","It was a smile of confidence and strength he released, where he quickly overcame the maddened anger of being so close to Antiquity and having it be taken away!","If he had almost been successful once, he could always try again.","From his body, as the essence of Ruination sunk in and ravaged everything, the essence of Reincarnation began to erupt out and wrap around him as this being would actually rather just press the reset button.","A button to start over as he began yet another timeline!","Would he rest the whole Primordial Cosmos as everything was returned to an uncountable number of years in the past? Would he leave this timeline and start over in a different one? The intricacies of Reincarnation and Chronos were too hard to wrap one’s mind around as the answers were abstruse to even find.","Chronos wanted to press the reset button....but he would not be allowed to do so!","\"My Master is not done with you yet.\"","RUMBLE","The voice of the Blue Slime echoed out as the three blue clocks surrounded them circled majestically before they coalesced around Chronos, revolving around him madly as billions of chains with dense essence of Chronos and the authority of an Apocryphal Antiquity stretched out to bind him.","To bind not just his limbs, but his Origin and even consciousness as this being was put in a....","\"Temporal Prison.\"","...!","A prison of time.","The existence that had comprehended the Cosmic Dao of Chronos watched in genuine shock and stupor in the next second as under the authority of an Apocryphal Antiquity, his very Origin and Soul were being frozen as before he knew it...his thoughts entirely stopped!","\"...!\"","\"There will be no Reincarnation this time around.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s voice echoed out calmly as he waved his hands, the figure of Chronos frozen in time disappearing as he turned his direction towards the pulsating cocoon a few hundred miles away from them.","One could already see a phantom of the other Universal Construct in the Abyssal Universe, these two almost merging together as mere minutes remained before the descent of Antiquity!","\"Let’s finish it.\"","His voice didn’t even finish stretching out before one of the Blue Slimes appeared over the Universal Construct, swallowing it in a single gulp as a moment later, an explosive force rang out.","BOOM!","The second to last Universal Construct was destroyed as the Universal Amalgamation was disrupted yet again, with this time having only a single Universal Construct remaining!","The Liberated Universe was made free as far from them in the Abyssal Universe, the Oathkeeper’s eyes shone a brilliant gold as he received word from the Wings of Primordial Destiny on what had just occurred!","The Apex Paragon had reached Hegemony as the power his Universal Emperor Slime released seemed to surpass it, successfully defeating Chronos and destroying the Universal Construct in the Liberated Universe.","\"With this....it is possible!\"","WAA!","He spoke out with vigor as his Sword of Primordial Essence swung down, smashing into a mountain of Extinction that stemmed from the Goliath as these beings also turned towards the direction of the Liberated Universe!","Oathkeeper took this chance as he attacked even faster, his voice echoing out into their ears.","\"Even Chronos has failed! Give way and stop these absurd plans of yours!\"","BOOM!","An explosion of Primordial Essence occurred with every swing, Oathkeeper attacking madly as he could sense shocking reverberation from the only remaining Universal Construct.","He attacked with more and more fervor, but he could sense his mana draining more and more even with the inefficient transfer of mana he was getting from other Hegemonies at this moment!","As he felt this problem of mana, the words of the past Apex Paragon that had just turned Hegemony repeated in his mind.","If he just pledged Fealty...he would have all the mana he needed to face the enemies before him!","Did he really have to do this?","While such thoughts passed through his mind, his brilliant white Sword rushed down with even more haste.","The Universal Construct before them had begun to vibrate and pulse dangerously, giving the Oathkeeeper a bad feeling as Primordial Essence lit up from his body, his bellow coming out and covering everything!","\"OOOOOH!\"","The Sword of Primordial Essence shone gloriously as it tried to weave Oathkeeper through space, but the Goliath spread Extinction all around and stopped his advancement!","When everything seemed too late and over and done with though...vibrant spatial fluctuations erupted out as the battling Hegemonies saw the appearance of a certain Blue Slime and galaxy colored Cthulhu.","...!","Their eyes were flashing with magisterial might as without even a word, the Apocryphal Antiquity was the first to move with speed far surpassing Hegemonies, its body intent on Devouring the last Universal Construct!","Noah watched this scene as everything seemed to be playing in slow motion, his own heart utterly calm as he observed everything.","The shocked figures of the Goliath and the Hegemonies around him.","The valiant figure of the Oathkeeper shining with the glorious luster of white light!","Then there was the Blue Slime that had nearly reached the pulsating Universal Construct that looked like a cocoon about to break.","Like something beautifully terrifying would come out of it in the next moment!","\"...\"","The tides of fate and destiny roiled as the Universal fortunes of many beings coalesced, everything coming together at this moment as the pulsing Construct...became entirely black and dim in the next moment.","Right before the Blue Slime could reach it!","After it became entirely black and dim, it blazed out with Crimson light a moment later as this light opposed everything coming towards it, even the Blue Slime!","Along with this light came a sigh.","WAA!","A sigh of immensity and terror, a sigh of an ancient being that stemmed from within the Universal Construct!"]},{"number":1109,"title":"Chapter 1109: Chapter 1108 - The Undeniable Descent Of The Great Usurper! III","paragraphs":["In the Dark Universe.","Noah’s main body was floating in the skies while still holding on to the figure of the Blue Slime. But...his attention was entirely elsewhere as his eyes were fully covered with a layer of gold, with his Universal Fortune vibrantly swimming around him in lustrous waves.","His eyes were glazed gold as he was peering into his fortune and looking at everything through the Dao of Destiny!","When it came to the crucial moment of the clone of the Blue Slime reaching the only remaining Universal Construct and destroying it or not being able to reach it in time as the descent of an Antiquity was all but guaranteed...Noah was gazing upon his Destiny while waiting for the results of this exact moment.","What occurred here would determine many things, with his golden Destiny either turning black and reducing rapidly- meaning his journey was about to be tumultuous and he would even face a setback!","If the Antiquity descended, he expected this to be a setback as his Destiny would momentarily reduce and turn dark, where even his immense fortune would only be able to help slightly. But if the clone of the Blue Slime reached it...it meant he would come out on top as the entire Primordial Cosmos would be free of any apocalyptic threats as he could slowly grow his power.","\"...\"","So he watched on as the events played out, and he observed as the Blue Slime...did not reach the Universal Construct in time!","RUMBLE!","His heart was still calm even with such an outcome and setback, his glazed eyes observing his Destiny to see just what changes would occur to it as the expected reduction and darkening of his Destiny...did not occur.","Instead...","BZZZZT!","His eye shook and couldn’t help but squint as a second later, Noah fantastically observed his golden Destiny and fortune that were as vast as seas...to become an even more wondrous gold color as they began to churn and expand wildly, their size propagating outwards crazily as they nearly doubled!","...!","With the action of them failing to stop the descent of an Antiquity in time, his Destiny and Fortune had actually not reduced as they instead increased even further.","Just what was in store to cause this?!","---","In the Abyssal Universe where a certain Universal Construct had turned completely black before it released horrifying waves of crimson essence that were accompanied by the sigh of an ancient being.","It was a sigh that seemed to echo in the minds of every being present as it contained such power and might that all those listening found their Origins trembling.","\"No...!\"","The Oathkeeper looked at this scene with an ashen expression as his origin shook, his Sword of Primordial Essence shaking with might as it seemed like this being still wanted to fight until his last breath!","The Goliath and the other surrounding Hegemonies looked at this scene with shining eyes as they also became somber. They very well knew the result of their actions, knowing that this powerful being descending would have their own aims and reasons.","But they cared not!","They wanted the pathway towards Antiquity, and this was the promise that bound the descending being at this very moment.","So they simply watched on in fervor as the gloriously crimson cocoon began to crack and splinter.","BOOM...CRACK!","The cocoon was the size of a Galaxy, its outer shells breaking apart as from it, a pristine hand shot out!","The hand glimmered with a myriad of colors as after it shot out, it was followed by the eruption of a head. A head full of dark hair, and eyes that were shining a gorgeous cerulean blue luster that looked like 2 shining blue stars.","These shocking eyes scanned everything in the immediate surroundings as they flashed with immense light, this being continuing to step out of the cocoon as the Hegemonies could only watch in horror, while others watched in fervor!","Then there was Noah.","THRUM!","Essence was wildly swirling around him, the bounced Blue Slime having returned to his size as its two other clones were also on his left and right. When he looked at this scene before him, he actually didn’t feel any terror or apprehension like a few others as before his advancement into Hegemony, he already had cards he could play.","Now, after he became a Hegemony, there were even more cards that he could utilize as when he watched the eruption of a shocking existence that had their eyes release arcs of blue light, as he watched the aura of a genuine Antiquity spreading out...he wasn’t afraid!","His mind had already formed many pathways he could take, as all that was left for him was to choose one at this moment.","First, there was his newly gained hand that only came to be after he achieved Hegemony- for him to utilize the Cosmic Treasure and use the feature of [Cosmic Chains of Ruination] on this Abyssal Universe as he ripped it apart from the Primordial Cosmos and brought the Antiquity into the genuine Ruination Sea!","The second method was to try and utilize the power of the Apocryphal Antiquity he had with him, merging with the Blue Slime as he also utilized his Cosmic Treasure to create artificial ruptures and see if an Antiquity could possibly fall in this manner.","When the Blue Slime swallowed the second to last Universal Construct, his Dao Galaxies had increased to 95 Billion as he was only 5 Billion away from also achieving natural Antiquity. So this second method also had its feasibility depending on just how powerful the descending Antiquity would be!","Then there was the method of a Protagonist.","To simply cast [Deus Ex Machina] and see what would come out of it!","At this moment, his eyes were glimmering a beautiful gold as he questioned his immense fortune and destiny which path he should take?","Which path would allow him to obtain the most benefits?!","Gradually, an answer appeared in his mind as his eyes shone with an alluring light, gazing upon the complete eruption of the cocoon at this moment as from it...the figure of a being the size of a Galaxy erupted out!","The cocoon was as expansive as 25,000 Light Years, with this existence being slightly larger than this as one must recall...a single light year was 6 trillion miles! The length of this being was simply mind-boggling as he gazed upon the planetary sized beings and human sized Hegemonies in his surroundings as if they were mere ants.","\"You all...gave me a lot of trouble.\"","RUUUMBLE!","His voice echoed out in the Primordial Cosmos for the first time as it smashed into everyone’s minds, their Origins quaking just from this simple exposure!"]},{"number":1110,"title":"Chapter 1110: Chapter 1109 - To Be, Or Not To Be I","paragraphs":["\"You all...gave me a lot of trouble.\"","...!","Like a thunderclap descending down, the voice jolted everyone as their eyes were forced to focus on the being that had erupted out of the Universal Construct!","His dark hair fell to his shoulders as his blue eyes illuminated the surroundings a cerulean color, his body enclosed by a black robe that screamed power and regality.","The cerulean planetary-sized eyes moved faster than light as they took in everything, landing on the bodies of the Blue Slime as they lingered here with interest before they quickly locked on to the figure of the Oathkeeper!","The existence that had Primordial Essence practically leaking out of him as he held a Cosmic Treasure on one hand a Sword of Primordial Essence on the other.","The Antiquity saw one of the most important things he had to gain from this trip as the instant he locked onto the Oathkeeper’s figure, his hand that eclipsed all of them began to move forward!","He had just arrived as without wasting even a second, he made a move and thrust out a palm forward!","Due to its sheer size, it didn’t seem like it was just going for the Oathkeeper as it looked like an enormous palm that would smash into every single one of the Hegemonies in the surroundings.","At such a juncture, the black hole on the Goliath’s head shone vibrantly as his voice actually echoed out in a fearless fashion towards the Antiquity.","\"Great Usurper! The condition was for us to be shown the path towards Antiquity...and the guarantee of our lives!\"","RUMBLE!","\"None of us here can face death under your hands...the moment you do so would mean revoking the rights of your descent!\"","...!","Even with Chronos gone, the Goliath knew enough to voice this out fearlessly as the enormous palm of the Antiquity...did not pause.","\"Death...huh?\"","The foreign Antiquity spoke out in a mighty tone as his eyes concealed many things.","The number of Universes he had to burn to get here. The sacrifices he had to make. Ultimately...his plans for this Cosmos after he took the Cosmic Treasure before him!","All of them reflected on his eyes before his eyes as he found it laughable that these beings before him would even talk about death at this moment!","\"To live or die...to be, or not to be...a famous poet once said these words. But...when it comes to you all, death is much too simple, and it is not the only path!\"","RUMBLE!","His words echoed out as they meant nothing to Oathekeeper and the others, but to Noah...it was like a clap of thunder smashing down!","’What the fuck?’","His mind buzzed with shock and awe as he heard something that should have only stemmed from his homeworld, that only a being that had lived on a certain blue planet should be able to know!","A famous poet! To be or not to be!","He knew these words all too well as he very quickly linked them to something back in his homeworld, and he didn’t think such specific things could be heard from others that did not live and experience certain events in the same world as him!","How did...a monstrous being not even from the same Universe or Cosmos as him be able to utter such words?! How did an Antiquity that stemmed from some vast Cosmos far away speak so freely about such things?","Even as his mind buzzed with questions, he still made his moves silently as the Antiquity continued without pause.","\"Something that you all don’t know is that aside from life and death, aside from being or not being...there is also an in-between. There is also...Subjugation.\"","Ah!","The gaze of the Goliath and the Hegemonies around him turned ashen at such words, replaying them over and over again in their minds as it was not something they expected.","Aside from life and death...there were other states they could fall into!","This...was not something that these Hegemonies accounted for.","The figure of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos shook at such a reality as he continued to watch the extending hand.","\"Life is filled with pain and misery, with you all constantly struggling to make ends meet as you search for what? Power? Antiquity?\"","...!","\"After Antiquity, then what? You will always come to find out there is a higher power, and then there is an even higher power after the one you thought was the highest. So why struggle so much? Why not...just allow me to give you peace? Why not allow me to subjugate you all?\"","WAA!","The voice was mesmerizing and filled with authority, making the listening Hegemonies fall into a slumber as their eyes turned hazy!","Even the pulsing black hole that was on the Goliath turned dimmer at this moment.","The palm of the Antiquity came ever closer as he spoke, almost reaching their bodies as its true target actually began to be lifted off and fly towards this palm!","The body of the Oathkeeper...began to fly towards the hands of the Antiquity as the Cosmic Treasure within his hands glimmered brightly.","Then there was Noah and the Blue Slime.","Under the authority of the Apocryphal Antiquity that Noah could barely access from the Blue Slime, he was able to stay awake as he watched this terrifying being speak while moving his enormous hand towards the shaking figure of the Oathkeeper!","BZZZT!","His body and mind creaked as he allowed the essence of Ruination and the authority of an Apocryphal Antiquity to course through him, his voice ringing out.","\"I quite like being alive and well!\"","...!","His voice echoed out vibrantly as it was filled with the authority of the Blue Slime stretching out, causing the figure of the Oathkeeper and others to wake from their stupor as the Oathkeeper had an ashen expression while holding on to his Primordial Disk!"]},{"number":1111,"title":"Chapter 1111: Chapter 1110 - To Be, Or Not To Be II","paragraphs":["After coming out of the shocking pull of the Antiquity, Oathkeeper held onto the Cosmic treasure tightly as his mana madly poured into it, a pristine white light stretching out as droves of Primordial Essence wrapped around him!","His figure actually became more stable after the Primordial Essence wrapped around him, and it only continued in intensity as he was seemingly becoming wrapped up in a dense circle of essence.","With the dense authority of Antiquity, nobody could leave the surroundings. So instead, the Oathkeeper enclosed himself in as he could see the hands of the Antiquity were reaching out towards him. Towards the Cosmic Treasure within his hands!","So the last of his essence flooded out as he created a cocoon of Primordial Essence that wrapped around him tightly, this existence intent on keeping the hands of Antiquity away from the Cosmic Treasure!","Noah’s words caught the Antiquity by surprise as his consciousness went towards his position.","The moment that he finished his words, Noah had sighed deeply in his heart as he silently cast [Deus Ex Machina]!","This was what his Destiny told him would have the way for most benefits, and so it was done.","One of the skills of last resort that wasn’t Plot Armor or Save Point!","\"Life is definitely filled with struggles...but it is not as meaningless as you make it out to be!\"","RUMBLE!","Towards the words of Antiquity that spoke between life, death, and Subjugation...Noah replied with calm as he waited to see what the effects of the skill would be.","His mind was also playing with the wild possibilities of what it meant for this Antiquity before him to say things that he would only expect those on a certain blue planet would be able to know. Was there something really profound in here or was it all due to chance with the quintillions of existences and an uncountable number of galaxies within Universes and Cosmos?","Maybe he was reading too much into it as it was all coincidence or there was something else in play he wasn’t considering, but he focused on the current situation as he would not wait to see what would come from Deus Ex Machina.","The clones of the three Blue Slimes surrounded him as their aura pushed off the authority of the Antiquity, Noah’s voice continuing to echo out as the figures of the slimes shone with gorgeous splendor to resist the authority of the Great Usurper!","\"The struggles of life are always followed by joy and happiness...and this is what we are all searching for. You cannot take this away by either death or Subjugation!\"","RUMBLE","His words were resolute as the authority of an Apocryphal Antiquity stemming from three Slimes actually established itself on the surroundings, giving the figure of the enclosed Oathkeeper some support as the eyes of the Antiquity briefly went on to focus on Noah and the Blue Slimes.","\"You.\"","...!","A radiant blue light flashed as Noah’s eyes locked on with the Great Usurper!","One existence looked at another as their gazes caused sparks of light, but the might of the Antiquity settled on the Blue Slimes as his ancient voice continued.","\"You’re connected to this false existence? I’ve very rarely come across Apocryphal Antiquities...were you the one destroying the Tools of Descent?\"","WAA!","With his gaze turned in his direction, Noah felt the billowing pressure even more as his face remained impassive and didn’t reveal anything!","All he focused on was the difference between Apocryphal Antiquity and real Antiquity, wanting to know just how much the clones of the Blue Slime could withstand at this moment...as well as the gain of something he was scheming about even at this moment.","Of course, it was from the seeds he planted not too long ago- the action of bringing one of the most powerful existences within the Primordial Cosmos under him!","Silently, he sent a mental message to the Oathkeeper who was burning the last embers of his mana to wrap himself in a protective cocoon of Primordial Essence to prevent the Antiquity from getting his hands on the Primordial Disk.","\"We have to work together if we want to survive this and prevent your Cosmic Treasure from falling into his hands. I can provide you with all the mana you need to keep utilizing your treasure without having you burn your Origin! Just...swear Fealty!\"","RUMBLE!","His brilliant words echoed in the mind of the Oathkeeper as while wrapped in his protective cocoon, this being saw a prompt appear before his eyes that had appeared in front of many Paragons and lower ranked beings.","A prompt that asked him to pledge fealty not to the Tyrannical Emperor, but to the Hegemony of Tyranny!","\"...\"","Oathkeeper’s origin pulsed with weakness as his somber eyes watched this prompt, and then towards the brilliant blue eyes of the Antiquity that screamed of coldness.","He then looked in the corner of his eyes as he saw his old friend and the Hegemonies around him deflated with disappointment, his gaze eyes becoming extremely dim!","Noah had truly schemed at the most perfect time as in this moment where he was faced against an enemy of the Primordial Cosmos...the Oathkeeper actually released his high pride and standing as he uttered out slowly, his eyes locked onto the palm of the Antiquity that had almost reached them.","\"I swear fealty...to the Hegemony of Tyranny.\"","...","WAA!","On this day, one of the oldest beings in the Primordial Cosmos pledged Fealty to an existence that had only begun their path of power for less than a year.","The gorgeous glimmer of Primordial Essence that was covering his body trembled at this moment, Oathkeeper closing his eyes at such a juncture as his dried up Origin that barely had any mana to use at this moment...felt like a dry river that out of nowhere was blasted with mountainous waves of water!","Like a desert just had an entire sea poured onto it, and this sea was so vast that he couldn’t see the ends of it!"]},{"number":1112,"title":"Chapter 1112: Chapter 1111 - You Should Not Be Here! I","paragraphs":["The dry Origin filled up as in milliseconds, its capacity had exceeded its old amount by tens of times! The Oathkeeper observed such an incredulous scene in shock as he channeled all of this raging mana into the Cosmic Treasure, the cocoon he had built up for himself expanding by over 10 times as he seemed to be in an impenetrable fortress.","Yet even against this, the Antiquity’s eyes only shone with arcs of blue light- these arcs of light traveling faster than light as they wrapped around his hand and extended past his outstretched palm, wrapping around the pristine white cocoon that protected the Oathkeeper!","At the same time, this existence uttered out two words that caused the very atmosphere to tremble and vibrate fearfully.","\"Ruler’s Emanation.\"","RUUUUMBLE!","The very void trembled and folden as overbearing and immense waves of mental energies washed down over everything!","WAA!","Noah’s eyes constricted as he felt this terrifying force descending all around, the three clones of the Blue Slimes appearing all around him as they bore the brunt of it themselves. Noah felt a portion of it as his eyes shone with a gorgeous array of colors, his mind and Origin being utterly protected...but it wasn’t so for others.","The Goliath and the Hegemonies around him had dazed expressions as they seemed half asleep, as if they had lost the very control of their souls and could not put up any defenses!","The protected Oathkeeper in the depths of the cocoon of Primordial Essence and Noah were the only ones not affected as they watched the blue arcs of light stemming from the Antiquity wrap around the bright white cocoon and begin breaking down the Primordial Essence rapidly.","Per the method of descent, the Antiquity had agreed that he would give them a pathway towards Antiquity and that none of them would be killed! So when the Antiquity attacked, he didn’t attack to kill, only to incapacitate.","After all, he needed to do was incapacitate them all before using the loophole through their promise to instead Subjugate them. After they were subjugated under him...then he would naturally let them know how to achieve Antiquity!","THRUM!","So his target remained the most immediate acquiring of the Cosmic Treasure before him. As for the dazed Hegemonies that had their minds scrambled from his sheer mental pressure?","The eyes of the Great Usurper flashed a gorgeous blue once more as he began to speak.","\"Subju-\"","...!","But his words never finished.","At this moment in time, the eyes of the Antiquity flashed with even more brilliant light as instead of focusing the cocoon of Primordial Essence that held an enclosed Cosmic Treasure or the myriad of Hegemonies he was just about to subjugate...this being actually gazed upwards!","He wasn’t the only one as out of the Hegemonies not dazed...Oathkeeper in his Primordial essence cocoon also turned and gazed upwards!","Then there was Noah and the Blue Slime! At this moment, Noah actually had a smile appear on his terrifying tentacled face as he also gazed upwards. It was because he knew the effects of Deus Ex Machina had come to at this moment.","This was the reason why the Antiquity stopped what he was doing and gazed upwards! This was the reason that Oathkeeper and Noah and the Blue Slimes also all gazed upwards. From this direction...they could feel the blooming of an aura that none of them could put their fingers on!","It didn’t seem powerful, nor did it seem weak...but yet it had drawn all of their eyes as in the moment that the Antiquity gazed up, his cerulean blue eyes flashing with a powerful light as shock appeared within them.","\"Impossible...\"","The utter of the Antiquity reverberated out as a moment later, a genuine crack tore open in space as from it, dense Ruination and Primordial Essence poured out madly and with fervor, spilling out and causing the void of the Abyssal Universe to shake!","PA! PA! PA!","Yet even with such a fantastical scene playing out, a single sound could be heard that when one listened closely..it seemed like the sound of someone taking multiple steps calmly. The sounds of someone walking forward as when Noah’s eyes focused on the gushing Primordial and Ruination essence flooding out from the crack in the void, he saw the figure of someone dazzling stepping out.","Long slender legs covered by a shimmering white dress, a shroud and veil hiding everything about her figure...it was a shocking existence the size of a human that stepped out of the crack!","Her veiled head gazed down calmly at everyone below as the crack behind her closed, the Ruination and Primordial essence that threatened to drown out everything actually going towards her figure and disappearing silently amidst the fluttering of her dress!","...!","Noah gazed at such a scene with utter stupor as his jaws nearly touched the floor, but another existence did not have the same reaction as he repeated the same word he just uttered before.","\"Impossible!\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of the Great Usurper reverberated out once more as when this being gazed towards the newly appearing existence, it wasn’t that of shock, but more of incredulity and anger that such a being would appear here.","Incredulity that they would appear at this exact time and place just as he was proceeding with his goals!","But towards his bellow, the shrouded and veiled existence merely glanced towards him as a voice so profoundly beautiful and sonorous reached everyone’s ears, as if this being was directly speaking right beside them.","\"You...should not be here.\"","...!","WAA!","A shocking sentence that was not a question or a statement of confusion, but as if this being was stating a mere inviolable fact!","The Antiquity’s eyes flashed with intense light as their cerulean light flashed on this shrouded being, not focusing on her per se, but instead on a mark he could see on her white dress.","Inscribed there beautifully was a glimmering 12 sided star, this star seemingly holding a profound meaning to the Antiquity as his eyes shot forth arcs of light full of anger when saw it!","But the existence cared not for this.","The Antiquity, Noah, the Blue Slime, and the Oathkeeper...they could all see that even though this being was veiled, she was at this moment looking down towards them with a gaze akin to an empress looking at peasants. Akin to a human looking at an ant!","It didn’t matter whether they were Hegemonies, Apocryphal Antiquities, or real Antiquities....before her, they were all looked at as if they were mere ants!"]},{"number":1113,"title":"Chapter 1113: Chapter 1112 - You Shouldnt Be Here! II","paragraphs":["In the extremely tense unfolding situation, the Great Usurper continued to gaze up with anger as his eyes flashed coldly, his voice continuing to ring out.","\"I shouldn’t be here...and nor should you!\"","RUMBLE!","Against an existence that caused shock and awe just from her appearance alone, the Antiquity didn’t back down as in reply to this as at this moment, the vast Universes within his bodies vibrated immensely as he silently cast a certain skill.","It was a skill that would come at a great cost, but he used it nonetheless as he somewhat understood the extent of the ridiculous being that had appeared before him. As for how this existence had appeared?","A golden light of fate and destiny crossed through the eyes of the Antiquity as he discerned a few things, his eyes ultimately giving a barely discernible glance to the figures of Hegemonies below him as he silently cast the skill.","Yet, it seemed as if the existence above could have nothing escape from her eyes as the moment the Antiquity made this move, this existence also moved!","DING!","A gloved hand rose from the newly appearing figure as she tapped a few times in the void of space.","DING! DING! DING!","With every tap, resplendent white and crimson lines erupted out by the millions, these thin white and crimson lines causing Noah’s eyes to widen as they vibrated with Ruination and Primordial Essence!","Millions of these white and crimson lines bloomed as they went on to instantaneously wrap around the figure of the Antiquity, beginning to circle around his figure rapidly as the entire area turned utterly colorful.","Yet even with such a move being made, the Antiquity only looked towards the newly appearing being with anger as he didn’t make a move.","This was because he had no need to.","Just as Noah and all the others knew they couldn’t do anything to the being above...so did the Antiquity!","Even though he seemed angered by her appearance, the extent of his actions was to silently cast a certain skill! His Blue eyes were palpable with anger as he watched the veiled figure that released their voice again.","\"You do not belong in this Dimension. For your violation, you shall be sent to the Primordial Battlefields for 10 Million Years.\"","WAA!","The voice was as impassive as ever, causing a chill to run down everyone’s spines when they heard it!","But the angered Great Usurper actually smiled at this time, his blue eyes leaving the veiled figure above as he stared down at Oathkeeper once more.","At the Cosmic Treasure he had sacrificed many Universes to try and obtain.","Then, his eyes couldn’t help but wander over to Noah and the Apocryphal Antiquities surrounding him.","Then...his voice rang out!","\"I think not.\"","...!","After gazing upon the beings of this Cosmos he raised his head again as from his deeply blue eyes, one could see them beginning to emanate shocking cracks that very quickly spread out to cover his face!","\"Among the many things I will do...falling under the control of you hypocrites is not one of them.\"","The moment his words finished, Noah and everyone else watched in shock as a spectacular sight unfolded before their eyes. The beautifully blue eyes of the Antiquity had begun to crack, but the more shocking things were the Splendiferous Universes and large numbers of normal Universes that became manifested at this moment.","Every Hegemony looked at such a sight with envy and greed as this was what they searched for!","The sight of multiple Universes within an Origin was what they all sought, as such a thing represented Antiquity! Yet they were shocked to find that these wondrous manifested Universes from the Origin of this Antiquity...were actually burning.","Burning luminously in the dark void as they caused for the appearance of a beautiful scene!","The Hegemonies that had regained control of their bodies scrambled away at this moment as they thought this brazen Antiquity was about to self destruct with an attack to wipe them all, but no such thing happened as everything continued silently.","His Origin continued to burn as the Universes within it were being used up of all of their pristine essence for a use that nobody knew!","Only the existence above them seemed to have an idea as her fingers tapped out again.","DING!","The millions of lines made of Primordial and Ruination Essence stretched out as after circling the Antiquity, they shot into him like sharp needles as they sunk into his skin and Origin seamlessly.","BZZT!","It should have been an action that caused this being immense pain, and yet he remained silent as his Origin burned away silently, the cracks stemming from his eyes stretching to his as he looked like a porcelain figure that was about to break.","\"Hmm?\"","Even the existence seemed to find this unique as the lines of Primordial Essence and Ruination she sent out should have stopped this being from doing anything, yet whatever he had done seemed unstoppable!","He instead only silently gazed up towards this existence as he focused on the twelve-pointed star on her dress, his words ringing out calmly.","\"Hypocrites are all that you are...sitting upon your high pedestals and gazing upon everything currently happening as if you are above it all, even though you are the ones responsible.\"","RUMBLE!","\"I know the secret you all hide so well...I know what you all did!\"","...!","His cold and decisive words shot towards the veiled figure as this existence finally reacted when such things were mentioned to her.","WAA!","Behind her, flowers of Ruination and Primordial Essence bloomed as the millions of thin lines that bound the Antiquity shone brightly and began to move this being up, a majestic aura descending all around that even caused Noah and the Apocryphal Antiquity that was the Blue Slime to feel stifled!","At this moment, the bitingly cold voice of the newly appearing existence thrummed down gloriously.","\"What can a failed creature like you know? You have outlived your purpose as of this moment...and can cease to exist.\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1114,"title":"Chapter 1114: Chapter 1113 - A Heart! I","paragraphs":["The Antiquity’s body rose up while bound by lines of Ruination and Primordial Essence as he looked at the veiled figure that he could sense finally showing some emotions.","Noah and the others looked at this scene with their hearts thumping wildly as the power shown here was simply too fantastical for them to see!","After the shocking words were released from the newly arriving existence, instead of tapping her fingers- this being actually twisted her hand into a fist as the millions of lines of Ruination and Primordial Essence binding the Antiquity vibrated immensely and close in on...intent of decimating the being they held!","At such a juncture, time seemed to slow.","The cerulean blue eyes of the Antiquity shone brightly as cracks could be seen from them, these cracks having already spread throughout the body of this being!","The multiple burning Universes within had their immense force used as a few skills were cast, this Antiquity not worrying as at such a juncture a thought crossed his mind that he kept to himself.","It was a thought that he had while staring coldly at the 12 pointed star that showed the designation of this being, this Antiquity actually not caring about her identity as he cared more about what she represented!","’Even you will not be able to stop me...I have my Subjugations spread across a myriad of Cosmos and Dimensions as you all can just wait. No matter how many years it takes...no matter how much pain I have to endure! For that...I will do whatever it takes!’","...!","It was an extremely important thought that would only be known by this being alone, one that showed there were many hidden things behind the scenes that were truly not understood.","With such a thought, the Antiquity disappeared as the cracks spread throughout his bound body. He didn’t wait for the force of the existence above to decimate him as willingly...his figure exploded into blue particles of light that faded away into beautiful nothingness!","\"...\"","Noah watched this scene in utter awe as the Hegemonies around him felt stifled, never in their wildest dreams thinking the events would play out in this manner.","An Antiquity had descended, but before this being could even do anything...an existence that seemed even more powerful than an Antiquity had come down and quickly made nothing of this being!","Now, their eyes went towards this being that had brought such an abrupt end to everything as they wondered...what would this being do now?!","---","Across Dimensions and Spacetime.","Far from the Primordial Cosmos, in an entirely different Plane that was similar and yet different at the same time. Within a certain Cosmos of this Plane...an existence opened their eyes.","WAA!","The eyes shone a beautiful blue as they released arcs of light in the surroundings, illuminating the figure of a 2 meter tall human being with glimmering dark hair on an obsidian throne, this obsidian throne situated in what looked like a world of ice!","It wasn’t just a world of ice as when one looked further, they would be able to notice frozen glaciers and landscapes stretching out across this world into the stars, and then from the starry star as this frozen landscape actually covered an entire Galaxy.","An entire Galaxy frozen with ice all around, and at the center of it, this being seemingly stood there alone while waking up.","He rose up as if he had been asleep for a long time, his limbs stretching as he craned his neck while his eyes flashed coldly!","\"Another Subjugated Antiquity destroyed...it is truly hard to go against these Existences alone.\"","...!","Shocking words were released from him as his blue eyes glimmered brighty, gazing upwards as he seemed to tear across the folds of spacetime and look towards a certain direction.","His eyes had an enticing glow that could seemingly see past the veils of Dimensions, gazing far in the distance as in a short period of time, the events of a certain Cosmos were actually reflected onto his eyes!","Among the things reflected was the figure of an existence with a 12 pointed star, her gaze currently looking down towards a group of Hegemonies.","The existence with shimmering blue eyes actually also focused his gaze onto this group of Hegemonies as his eyes honed in on a certain person!","\"Now...what exactly can I find within this Cosmos even after facing such a loss? Why is Destiny still pulling me into this Cosmos so much...\"","He spoke under his breath as he could shockingly see the scenes of a place so far away that it shouldn’t have been possible, but the burning of an entire Splendiferous Universes and normal Universes of an Antiquity could make many things possible.","As this being gazed upon all of this silently, something began to form behind him as ice coagulated together to form the dazzling figure of a red haired girl, the ice forming the dazzling red hair being extremely contrasting as the fair face of this being smiled while speaking out.","\"Brother, I didn’t know you had returned...\"","---","Within the Primordial Cosmos.","The fantastical figure of a veiled existence gazed down upon a group of Hegemonies as her gaze focused on a single being in particular.","\"You.\"","RUMBLE!","Her words were extremely biting and apathetic, Oathkeeper and the others shivering when they heard them as the one that was most affected was the one that her gaze was directed on.","It was on the newly advanced Hegemony of Ruination!","\"You were the one that steered the folds of reality into this direction...for that and helping destroy an existence extending his reach into Dimensions he doesn’t belong in...you shall be rewarded.\"","...!","Noah heard the words as his mind buzzed, all his thoughts focusing on her mention of steering the folds of reality while connecting it to Deus Ex Machina!","The ability that rose from a Trait only made possible through a Cosmic Treasure had actually come to have such an effect, some of its mysteries becoming more clear to Noah now as it was actually something that directly steered the folds of reality into another direction!","When Noah pondered on destiny and his fortune, it had told him the use of Deus Ex Machina would give him the most benefits. Aside from everything that had occurred, just what was about to unfold that would bring everything to fruition?!"]},{"number":1115,"title":"Chapter 1115: Chapter 1114 - A Heart! II","paragraphs":["In the void within the Abyssal Universe, the figure of a pristine woman could be seen as she gazed down above multiple Hegemonies.","From her, one could feel immense coldness and apathy, and no one could feel it more than Noah himself!","This was because the existence was currently addressing him, where even with the veil covering everything about her, Noah found her words to be filled with immense apathy even though she was mentioning something like a reward.","It was extremely hard to explain the feeling he was currently experiencing as he came out of his thoughts when he saw the unique existence above them wave her hands, causing for the appearance of a sparkling and pulsating...heart.","Yes!","It was a pulsating heart that shone with a rainbow colored aura, its appearance causing a fantastical fragrance to descend down as it made the minds of the Hegemony buzz while Noah himself found his Origin becoming entirely focused on this heart.","The veiled gaze of the existence also went towards this pulsating multicolored heart as her sonorous yet apathetic voice continued to ring out.","\"Across the vast and nigh endless Ruination Sea, there are terrifying creatures known as Primordial Beasts roaming free.\"","...!","The veiled figure seemed to be explaining the origin of the shocking object she pulled out, Noah and the others listening carefully as their hearts trembled.","\"These Primordial Beasts are unique creatures that require the sustenance of Universes and Cosmos to survive and reproduce...and so they traverse across the Ruination Sea while devouring the Universes within the vast Cosmos they come across.\"","RUMBLE!","Shocking new information was revealed from this being as she said it so simply and without any emotion, her hands waving forward as the multicolored heart began to float over to Noah!","\"It's normally very hard for them to locate Cosmos, the chance being nearly impossible as the only time when that chance increases...is when Antiquity appears from a Cosmos.\"","...!","\"The appearance and aura of the Antiquity that violated rules and entered your Dimension, that Apocryphal Antiquity around you, and even my appearance here...they have all increased the chances of a Primordial Beast crossing countless light years from the Ruination Sea to possibly come in contact with your Cosmos.\"","Yes!","Once a Cosmos had advanced far enough to produce the emergence of an Antiquity, it was put in a whole new tear as if it was invisible before...it became a light that began to flicker in utter darkness at that moment.","And the more power and might it displayed...the more Antiquities and even the possibility of a Cosmic Realm Existence coming to be would mean a Cosmos would be blinking gloriously across the dark and crimson Ruination Sea!","Such words and knowledge caused the hearts of Oathkeeper and the others to tremble as Noah listened with shining eyes to the new concepts displayed before him.","Primordial Beasts that crossed the Ruination Sea!","To him, it meant they were very unique existences as they had to have the Dao of Ruination or something like the Primordial Dao to be able to do such things.","He had many questions to ask amidst all of this but the most important one was of course...about the heart before him.","\"When the Primordial Beasts find a Cosmos and begin Devouring, they can be repelled by the Antiquity or Antiquities within as when defeated...all of their essence and Origin are condensed into a Primordial Heart...\"","WAA!","As these words finished, the multicolored heart arrived before Noah's eyes as his hands reached out to it, grasping onto it as he felt the pulses it released as these alone caused his body to vibrate with excitement!","\"A Primordial Heart is extremely unique as with it, one can rapidly increase the number of Galaxies within their Universes or utilize the Heart to birth Dao Galaxies...making it possible for Antiquities to birth Universes fairly quickly.\"","Even while talking about such wondrous and fantastical realities, the voice of this being remained apathetic as she looked towards Noah grasping the heart and focusing on it with all of his mentality.","\"That is only if the Primordial Beast is defeated though. If it succeeds in Devouring many Universes and Cosmos...it can rise to become something that even those in the Cosmic Realm struggle with.\"","\"Use this Primordial Heart and prepare yourselves in the case a Primordial Beast ever comes across your Cosmos.\"","RUMBLE!","With such shocking and wild information laid out, the figure of the veiled existence began to shine with fantastical light as a crack unfolded behind her again.","Noah came out of his stupor at the incredible looking pulsating heart before his hands as his eyes once more focused on this figure.","He wanted to ask where she was from! He wanted to know what force she belonged to and why exactly she had been able to be influenced by Deus Ex Machina! He wanted to know how this existence could just come and go like this as he understood the reasoning behind her actions.","But when he looked at her apathetic air, he didn't say anything as he only spoke calmly.","\"Thank you.\"","WAA!","A simple gratitude, and that was it!","The veiled figure nodded with the same apathy as when the crack behind her began to gush out Ruination and Primordial Essence, she delved into it as she pulled everything in and closed it soon after.","\"...\"","Gone just as quickly as she had arrived.","With her departure, a pervasive silence descended onto the void of the Abyssal Universe!","The sequence of events caused every Hegemony's mind to buzz in a stupor as none of it was as expected.","This was more so for the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos and the Hegemonies on his side, the dreams of these beings taking the method of Antiquity from an Antiquity being dashed as when they all sobered up, their gazes unconsciously landed on the figure of Noah.","On the sparkling multicolored Primordial Heart that from the words of the veiled existence...it seemed like something that only the most powerful of Antiquities that could take down the terrifying Primordial Beasts could get their hands on!","Now, it was given to the Hegemony before them as their eyes glimmered brightly with intense light of wanting.","\"You all...!\"","RUMBLE","The bellow of the Oathkeeper reverberated out at this moment!"]},{"number":1116,"title":"Chapter 1116: Chapter 1115 - Becoming An Antiquity Is Easy! I","paragraphs":["\"You all...!\"","RUMBLE","The bellow of the Oathkeeper reverberated out as he came out of his protective circle of Primordial Essence.","His body burned with wild amounts of essence as at this moment, the identity of this being was much different!","He wasn’t just the Hegemony at the forefront of Hegemonies in the Primordial Cosmos, he had inadvertently now become the Vassal of a certain Hegemony of Tyranny.","Above his head, a glorious white star of Conquest now rotated slowly as it washed over him and caused his body to vibrate with immense power.","His body was currently overflowing with power as not only did he receive over 100 times his old Mana Reserves, he also obtained an extra addition of power as he, like all other Vassals who pledged fealty to Noah, also obtained 5% of his strength.","5% of a Hegemony that was Noah Osmont.","THRUM!","His power spilled out madly as the Primordial Essence that had wrapped around him changed to becoming thick white chains that shot out to the Goliath and the others, snaking towards them dangerously!","This wasn’t all as with his newly found reserves of Mana, the Oathkeeepr had the Primordial Disk within his hands shine luminously as he utilized the Cosmic Treasure to even cause the area around the Goliath and others to lock them down.","The Universe they were in was made up from Primordial Essence. If a being with enough mana utilized a Cosmic Treasure that could affect Primordial Essence, they could easily interfere with the Universe!","This was how Noah could throw a punch or tap the void and cause an enormous rupture to spread out, and now the Oathkeeper could do something to a similar extent after obtaining such immense mana reserves!","\"Do you see the result of your actions? What it brought all of you to?! Even now you don’t seem the least bit remorseful!\"","RUMBLE!","The thick chains of Primordial Essence actually smashed into The Goliath and the Hegemonies around him as they struggled powerfully, but actually found out that the might of the Oathkeeper felt like he was someone brand new entirely.","Only the Goliath was not resisting as this old existence simply looked towards his old friend in a daze.","His actions played before his eyes as they brought him here, and he did nothing at this moment as the black hole on his head gazed down, letting the thick chains of Primordial Essence wrap around him easily.","While the other Hegemonies struggled, they could do nothing without the aid of The Goliath as within seconds, they were all bound by Oathkeeper’s chains as this being’s golden figure stood above all of them!","His wings and eyes shone with a brilliant golden halo as with the overabundance of mana at his disposal, his might far surpassed the Hegemonies below him as he rounded all of them up.","It was a saddening sight to come across, the eyes of the Oathkeeper becoming hazy as he shook his head while causing the Cosmic Treasure in his hand to vibrate, the figures of Hegemonies before him becoming wrapped in Primordial Essence as their struggles became even more futile.","Soon enough, 12 circular balls of Primordial Essence were all that floated in the void, 12 Hegemonies becoming imprisoned in something that none of them could break out of!","It was only then that Oathkeeepr gazed towards a certain direction, towards the figure of the Hegemony of Tyranny that was currently looking towards a multicolored Primordial Heart.","\"...\"","Oathkeeper controlled the urge of his Origin that was telling him to do everything possible to get the multicolored heart before him, something that the Goliath and other Hegemonies felt when they also gazed forward as he tried to speak towards the Hegemony of Tyranny.","Yet...","WAP!","This being disappeared before his eyes in an instant along with the Primordial Heart, leaving behind the copies of the three Blue Slimes!","Oathkeeper’s eyes raised up when he saw one of the slimes shining, a figure actually separating from it as he felt the aura of the Hegemony of Tyranny actually appear before him again.","It wasn’t in the terrifying form of a Cthulhu, his figure currently being that of a normal human as when one looked at it closely...it was Noah’s true image at this moment!","His multicolored hair that he allowed to be influenced by too many law and Dao Essences, and his eyes that currently shone with a golden and crimson glow that only further enhanced his devilish handsomeness.","The figure of Noah Osmont appeared from his clone as he gazed towards the Oathkeeper with a light smile.","The Primordial Ruination Clone that was in the form of the Cthulhu had disappeared as Noah used his Cosmic Treasure to open up the Ruination Realm, sending the Primordial Clone into this area that had a time ratio of 1000:1 in order to take a look at the Primordial Heart that he had received from the unknown existence!","---","In the vast distances across Dimensions, a certain blue eyed Antiquity watched the unfolding events with scrutiny as he muttered undeath his breath.","\"For such an existence to actually take the time to give this Hegemony such a thing...just what is he? Could he be...\"","\"Bah, you’re getting lost in your thoughts again.\" Before the words of the Antiquity even ended, the voice of an existence made entirely of ice spoke towards him as she waved her hands before his eyes, showing an indignant expression before she continued.","\"Even with your strong mind, getting lost into the memories and lives of beings that have lived for millions of years still has an effect on you! Every time you wake up...you seem a little different.\"","WAA!","\"Less than a year has passed since you began dominating Realms and Dimensional Planes...and yet you talk as if you’ve lived for millions of years! I understand you living the memories of the beings you subjugate can do this but...sigh!\"","Shocking words left this red haired woman made of ice as the Antiquity smiled while patting her head, his gaze still looking upwards towards the far away Universe in an entirely different Dimension. His eyes released a light filled with conviction as he spoke out slowly.","\"You know why I have to do this though. There is nobody out there who even knows what is going on. Those that do know...they are too weak or cowardly to stand against beings like them.\"","As he spoke, his eyes locked in on the newly appearing figure of Noah as a light of destiny and fate crossed through his blue eyes.","His fortune and destiny were dancing wildly as they caused him to be quizzical at this moment, his strong mind ringing out and seemingly blaring when he gazed at this being!","The Antiquity seemed dazed as he uttered out incoherently.","\"A possibility still lies within the Primordial Cosmos...with...this being?\"","...!","Such a thought caused the Antiquity’s eyes to focus and shine immensely, a decisive look appearing thereafter as he spoke out gloriously!","\"I can make contact with the residual consciousness left behind and see what this is all about...\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1117,"title":"Chapter 1117: Chapter 1116 - Becoming An Antiquity Is Easy! II","paragraphs":["Within a vast space and time only accessible through the use of a Cosmic Treasure, Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone appeared seamlessly as he held on to a pulsating heart.","THUMP!","With every beat, the heart seemed to resonate with his Origin as the source of this Treasure was something he didn’t even know about a few minutes prior!","A Primordial Heart that was only condensed when a Primordial Beast was killed, these Beasts being things that actually devoured Universes and Cosmos to reach unshakable heights.","As Noah stared at such a thing, he couldn’t help but have his eyes flash, the ability of Eyes of Truth being utilized!","[Primordial Heart] :: The culmination of the essence of a Primordial Beast capable of Devouring entire Universes. Its absorption allows one to choose the rapid proliferation of normal Galaxies or the change of Normal Galaxies into Dao Galaxies. The extent of how many normal or Dao Galaxies are increased is dependent on the level of the absorber, as well as the rank of the Primordial Heart...","A few details were given to him as much of it coincided with what the unknown existence had told him, much more of the information being gibberish that he didn’t even bother to try and see if he could decipher!","But the main thing remained the same about this shocking treasure that fell on his lap due to the recent events...and it was the fact that Noah could now vastly expand the number of his Dao Galaxies within his Origin.","He didn’t know if it would be enough to achieve Antiquity...but he would see soon enough its capabilities!","Before he began though...he smiled devilishly as he spoke out to the Cosmic Treasure.","\"RUINATION, why don’t we use Duplication on this gorgeous little Treasure?\"","...!","[Yes, Master.]","Yes! One must not forget that among the many features of the Cosmic Treasure, one of them was Duplication!","Nearly everything could be duplicated with a few exceptions, and gathering from the reply of the Cosmic Treasure...this Primordial Heart was not an exception.","It meant that Noah could get his hands on two of such terrifying treasures as with this, Antiquity had to be guaranteed, right?","WAA!","A flash of crimson light flashed as the Primordial Heart was taken into the Cosmic Treasure within his Origin and <Duplication> was cast.","The crimson light melded into the surroundings of the Ruination Realm as even though it was shining with a shockingly bright luster, there was no difference in the surroundings! But it only took a few seconds as soon after...two glimmering multicolored objects were spat out from the Cosmic Treasure.","A seamless duplication had been carried out just like that!","[Woah. These things are ridiculous...]","The Cosmic Treasure uttered out after two Primordial Hearts were produced, and it was because to be capable of Duplicating anything, RUINATION had to analyze it and break it down before it could be reproducible.","Noah raised his brows as a second later, information flooded into his brain while he held on to two pristine Primordial Hearts.","\"...!\"","The information caused him alarm as it turned out among the treasures known as Primordial Hearts, they could be ranked based on which Primordial Beast they came from!","Young Primordial Beasts in the Universal Filament Realm had strength equivalent to powerful Antiquities as they produced Lesser Primordial Hearts.","Above them, more powerful Primordial Beasts could grant one Grand or even Cosmic Primordial Hearts as such Beasts needed powerful existences at the Cosmic Realm to take down!","And the Primordial Heart in Noah’s hands...was a Grand Primordial Heart.","\"Fucking hell...\"","He couldn’t help but let out an expletive as his eyes shone brightly, the boons he received this time around being too stupendous!","All of this from a single cast of Deus Ex Machina and the descent of an Antiquity that was behind it. It was such a surreal thing that he even wanted to thank both the Antiquity and unknown existence for making things so exemplary for him!","But his shining eyes focused as he gazed upon the two Primordial Hearts before him, his mind settling as in the vast and crimson Ruination Realm, he sat down while holding onto these Grand Primordial Hearts.","Treasures so profoundly and unique that he fully expected Antiquity to be in reach even with just one of them, much less two!","The focus of his Primordial Ruination Clone would be on this as his main body and clones had many more things to take care of.","One of these was the continued teleportation of existences from the remaining Universes that were affected by Amalgamation, Noah not wanting to put the situation of these Universes go to waste as he increased the quota he needed before he could upgrade the Universal Core!","There was also the need to see how things would play out in the Primordial Cosmos after such a terrifying set of events, as well as his newly established Vassal...the Oathkeeper who held a Cosmic Treasure.","Even aside from all of these things, Noah still had another thought that caused his eyes to shine with a glorious light for the future...and that was the thought of utilizing [Protagonist’s Bookmark] on either of the two beings that had appeared before him!","Either the Antiquity known as the Great Usurper, or the more likely selection being the unknown existence that came and left him with a Primordial Heart!","The cool down for the Protagonist’s Bookmark would finish in a few days as when the time came, he would make the choice then.","When he thought of carrying out the Bookmark on the terrifying unknown existence though, a sense of apprehension filled Noah’s mind as even though no beings were able to notice him before when his soul descended unto them, this existence had too many things he didn’t understand for him to apply these same standards to her!","But he would deal with this when the time came and as always...after he had discerned destiny and fate.","\"For now...\"","THRUM!","A gorgeous eruption of light suffused the surroundings in an intimate manner as Noah began to utilize a Primordial Heart for the first time."]},{"number":1118,"title":"Chapter 1118: Chapter 1117 - Becoming An Antiquity Is Easy! III","paragraphs":["A feeling of happiness unlike anything that he came across before.","This was what Noah felt when he began to absorb the Primordial Heart for the first time!","THUMP!","The thumping heart actually beat faster and faster as he began to absorb it, releasing a gorgeous glow of multiple colors that surrounded his body and sunk into his Origin.","His Origin currently had the full 100 Billion Galaxies as over half of them were Dao Galaxies, and this was all due to the hard work of personally making quintillions of beings into his Vassals through his Lesser Dao of Fealty!","Now as the glow of the Primordial Heart began to perfuse into his Origin, Noah could see that wherever its light passed...his normal galaxies vibrated intensely as they very soon changed their nature and colors, becoming Dao Galaxies right after.","Seamlessly!","Easily!","THUMP!","Wild bursts of essence erupted out as the moment that Noah got the hang of it, he began calling upon the Primordial Heart as its heartbeat increased even more!","The more its rate of beating increased, the more normal Galaxies became Dao Galaxies in Noah’s Origin as he could count the conversion of millions every single second.","In the Ruination Realm, a devilish smile could be seen on Noah’s face as while he did this, the nature of his main body that the Primordial Ruination Clone stemmed from was being changed at an even faster pace, the eruption of Dao Galaxies very soon surpassing 55 Billion as of this moment...Noah was on his way to Antiquity!","He kept the words of the unknown existence in his mind when she talked about the emergence of Antiquity being the thing that caused a Universe to have a light if it was dark before.","It was what could possibly draw in a Primordial Beast!","Since the Antiquity that had descended down into the Primordial Cosmos and the Apocryphal Antiquity that was the Blue Slime had already made their auras apparent, Noah would be the third Antiquity to rise even though his main body wasn’t within the Primordial Cosmos.","It also made him ponder about the lone Dark Universe that was currently floating not too far away from the Primordial Cosmos, and what chance there was for the terrifying Primordial Beasts to lay siege onto his Universe!","All of these were thoughts and calculations he was making while breaking into Antiquity getting ready for whatever was to come from here on out.","---","As the absorption of a Primordial Heart began in a hidden region, Noah’s clone was in the Abyssal Universe where one of the oldest beings of the Primordial Cosmos was imprisoned by his closest friend!","Oathkeeper glanced at the bound chains that melded together in a circular format around 12 Hegemonies as he sighed, his gaze landing on Noah as these beings now had a unique relationship.","One was a Vassal...and the other was their Emperor!","This was extremely unique as Oathkeeper had lived for millions of years, and Noah had barely been in his 20s! Yet he held the fealty of an expert that held a Cosmic Treasure, with the question being exactly what he would do at this juncture.","Noah’s clone had unmerged from the Blue Slime as he looked towards the Oathkeeper with a smile, about to begin speaking when all of a sudden...a voice thundered in his mind!","\"What are you?\"","RUMBLE!","The voice was very distinct, being one of authority and might as Noah recognized it and connected it to a certain being right after.","His expression hardened as the aura of the Apocryphal Antiquity beside him blazed up, but they could find nothing in their surroundings no matter how much they searched!","Noah’s actions caused Oathkeeper to also turn somber as he looked around them, finding nothing as he gazed towards Noah.","\"You won’t find me anywhere, that woman made sure of that. But she couldn’t prevent me from burning multiple Universes to leave an untraceable portion of my consciousness here...this consciousness being able to do nothing but observe and speak.\"","...!","Noah heard the words of the Antiquity that should have been decimated already, his eyes shining carefully as above his main body in the Dark Universe, his seas of fortune and Destiny began to churn!","Noah noticed this change begin as soon as this Antiquity’s voice descended down just now, his eyes shining a brilliant luster as he wondered just what could be in play at this moment.","\"For her to hand you a Primordial Heart...for someone of her caliber to even care enough to do such a thing...it means your Universal Fortune is vaster than any Antiquities, or you’re one of them.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah took in the words of the Antiquity silently as after seeing his Destiny and Fortune churn on his main body, he didn’t outright reject this being and think of ways to destroy whatever trace of him remained as he carefully spoke out.","\"One of them?\"","\"...\"","His question made the Antiquity pause for a few seconds, a reply only coming out moments after.","\"Yes, one of them. Beings that those existences pay attention to and occasionally interfere in the lives of...weapons that they forge for their own uses.\"","RUMBLE","\"What?!\"","Noah’s expression changed for the first time when he heard this, his eyes flashing coldly as he didn’t expect to be referred to as a tool for others!","\"You think they’d selflessly let go of a Primordial Heart out of the goodness of their soul? An excuse that you helped stop me? Rubbish! Those existences do not care about Universes or Cosmos...all they care about are their own lofty positions and maintaining them.\"","\"Her making a move and even going further to hand you a Treasure only leaves a few possibilities of your identity. Which begs the question...what is your name?\"","\"...\"","\"What does that have to do with all this?\"","Noah’s eyes were sharp as he asked quizzically, only for the Antiquity to reply coldly thereafter.","\"Names are important. If you can share this and some more information...I can share with you the secret that those existences hide, I can tell you their true nature and much more about Primordial Beasts!\"","...!","A unique phenomenon was occurring at this moment as it was one of the most important meetings and talks to take place.","None of the two sides knew this yet as at this moment...","The Antiquity was probing Noah, and Noah....was also probing the Antiquity!"]},{"number":1119,"title":"Chapter 1119: Chapter 1118 - Becoming An Antiquity Is Easy! IV","paragraphs":["Within the Abyssal Universe, Noah’s eyes were flashing with caution as his aura spread out around the clone, the bodies of the Blue Slime ready to move at any time as he probed the Antiquity.","\"You ask for my name and state all these claims about beings with vast Universal fortunes being Tools for others...even knowing secrets that nobody else knows. Mind you, you were the being that was just invading this Cosmos moments ago! Why should I be listening to anything you say?\"","WAA!","\"...\"","His question caused a period of silence as the Antiquity was seemingly pondering about something, taking half a minute before his voice rang out again.","\"I can speak about this with confidence and even share with you knowledge that is taboo across Cosmos and Dimensions...because I was one of the weapons they were forging.\"","...!","Like a clap of thunder, this shocking information was stated simply as Noah felt his heart beat quicken!","\"I found out about their true nature and broke away from them, losing something extremely important to me in the process...something that I’ve only just been able to begin recreating recently.\"","The invisible consciousness of the Antiquity voiced out strongly as Noah’s coldness reduced just a bit.","In the Dark Universe, he continued to watch the churning of his Destiny and Fortune as it was seemingly excited.","Just what was this? Why was destiny and fortune telling him that this sequence of actions would be extremely good for him and lead towards a fantastical direction?","He could only trust in his intuition as it had never failed him before!","\"Once more...your name. Is it Aegon? Ezekiel?...Noah?\"","RUMBLE!","The Antiquity had shared another explosion of information as when Noah heard it, even his Primordial Ruination Clone nearly stopped its absorption of the Primordial Heart in the Ruination Realm.","’What the fuck?!’","Noah’s eyes flashed sharply when he heard his name mentioned among three, his mind going on overdrive trying to figure out the extent of truth the words of this being were!","But when this being uttered his name among three, he couldn’t help but begin to lean more on his words being the truth as he began questioning himself on what the hell was going on!","---","Across Dimensions and time, the Antiquity’s eyes were flashing a brilliant blue as he used whatever remaining consciousness he left behind in the Primordial Cosmos to observe the figure of the Hegemony before him closely.","He wanted to see if there would be any reaction from this being when he uttered these names, he wanted to confirm if he was one of them...and hadn’t been entirely influenced or brought over to their side!","When he did utter the three names though, all he received was a sharp flash of light crossing the eyes of the unique Hegemony as from this, he started to formulate his own ideas!","’If he truly is one of them and he hasn’t yet fully fallen under their influence, then maybe...’","A thought crossed the Antiquity’s mind as he pondered, his eyes hardening with resolve soon after as he made a move!","---","As Noah’s mind was still buzzing from hearing his name coming from an Antiquity that came from Cosmos and Dimensions away, he spoke out calmly with curiosity.","\"What do those names signify? Upon the countless quintillions of beings that can populate Cosmos, there will be millions with the same names. What would make those names so special?\"","His thought process was extremely logical, but the Antiquity replied very quickly!","\"There should be many beings with those names, yes. But the probability of having existences with these very same names as the top most powerful forces of multiple Cosmos and Dimensions is very little. I have traversed many Dimensions and Cosmos...and found beings with these names to almost always be under the guidance or protection of those existences as they exhibit tremendous strength or unique capabilities.\"","\"As you seem to fall under this banner, I will tell you of the true nature of those existences...I will tell you of the secret they hold that very few existences within the vast Cosmos and Dimensions know!\"","RUMBLE!","The stage was set as Noah’s eyes flashed gloriously, seeing the manner of this being wanting to freely give information to mean that he wanted something from him!","As for what he could possibly want...Noah would see what this being had to offer as he spoke out languidly.","\"I’m not entirely sure of your claims, but I have some time to listen if you feel like talking!\"","\"...\"","Noah didn’t deny or admit anything as after a few seconds, the voice of the Antiquity rang out.","\"The existence you saw descend down and hand you a treasure do willingly...she is part of a group of beings known as Primordials!\"","WAA!","\"Existence wielding immense power and might as they had their influence stretching across a myriad of Cosmos. As you can guess, these Primordials have everything to do with the Primordial Beasts that ravage the Ruination Sea and devour Universes and Cosmos...and this is the secret they hold that very few know.\"","\"These terrifying Beasts that threaten the very structure of the Cosmos...were actually born from the actions of Primordials!\"","...!","Yes!","The terrifying race of Primordials were actually the reason for the appearance of Primordial Beasts that devoured Cosmos, and this was a closely guarded secret that very few knew!","As for what exactly they had done to cause these terrifying beasts to manifest?","\"In the past, even with all the power they had...the Primordials wanted more and more.\"","The Antiquity’s voice turned somber as he spoke, his words seemingly reminiscent as if he recalled something from a long time ago.","\"When they asked themselves what they could do to obtain more power, one of them naturally suggested that they just had to increase the number of Cosmos they influenced. That all they had to do was cause the expansion of the places their hands dipped into!\"","\"The actions they carried out to do such a thing were the cause for the eruption of Primordial Beasts...and also for the appearance of Dimensional Planes, the appearance of parallel planes that held an uncountable number of Cosmos for them to control as the years passed.\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1120,"title":"Chapter 1120: Chapter 1119 - Becoming An Antiquity Is Easy! V","paragraphs":["Dimensions different from one’s own!","Planes of existence that seemed to mirror one’s own, but they were also different!","\"In the past, there used to be an Original Timeline that continued forth endlessly, but the actions of the Primordials changed this. They caused infinite branches of time to separate from the Original, gaining access to an untold number of Cosmos.\"","\"Parallel worlds, Multiverses, Cosmos, Dimensions- call them what you wish! But these beings actually carried out actions that made it possible for them to gain access to all of this and traverse them as they wished.\"","The tone of the Antiquity had turned extremely somber as in the void of the Abyssal Universe, Noah’s eyes shone brightly as he took in this information!","\"But with such an unnatural action occurring and causing the birth of Multiverses, Cosmos, and Dimensions...something unnatural formed in response to it!\"","Yes!","For every action, there was an equal and opposite reaction!","The actions of the Primordials that caused the Original Timeline to fracture into countless ones also caused the birth of the Primordial Beasts- existences that moved for the sole purpose of Devouring Universes and Cosmos across different Dimensions.","\"This is the true nature of Primordial Beasts! They only came to be for the sole purpose of undoing what the Primordials did- to bring to a stop the unraveling of the Original Timeline as their goal is to devour all Parallel Dimensions and return things to how they once were.\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s mind shook as he listened to such shocking truths, his Destiny and Fortune churning as he assimilated it all in his mind!","Multiverses! Parallel timelines! Concepts of extreme depth descended unto him all at once as he organized it all neatly to the most important details.","\"The Primordial Beasts are actually a force of nature to return things to how they once were, but now the Primordials had to fight and eradicate them to keep the vast numbers of branching realities. But how could they win against such enemies?!\"","\"As long as branching realities and timelines existed, so would the Primordial Beasts! They could not be fully eradicated as all the Primordial could do was to maintain the current state of affairs and reduce the numbers of Primordial Beasts as much as possible.\"","\"It is something that has put all of us in a constant state of war, where vast numbers of timelines and realities could be eradicated as long as the Primordial Beasts swallowed all of its Cosmos!\"","A constant state of war!","War against forces of nature that just wanted to return things to how they were.","These were the Primordial Beasts.","This was the true nature of Primordials.","Noah had a somber expression as he listened to all this, raising his head thoughtfully as he tried to peer through the folds of space around him.","Vast numbers of realities apart from his own. Timelines he didn’t even know about!","When he got to such a point, he thought about the Dao of Chronos and Reincarnation that Chronos used, his eyes shining brightly as he spoke out for the first time in a while thereafter.","\"Your descent into the Primordial Cosmos was you reaching across into another reality...another Dimension!\"","\"...Yes. Through the unique Dao of Reincarnation that a Hegemony within this Cosmos utilized and my own unique capabilities, I am able to traverse across Dimensions and stretch my might into multiple Realities! I am capable of doing things that only Primordials are capable of doing!\"","...!","Noah revealed an awed expression as he couldn’t help but ask.","\"How...?\"","The question was so blatant and abrupt as in another dimension, the Antiquity shook his head incredulously as he replied simply.","\"Something from a Legacy I obtained some time ago. But you are missing the point right now!\"","RUMBLE!","\"All of this aside, everything goes back to the Primordials needed to reduce the number of Primordial Beasts...and that is where existences like you...and existences like me come in.\"","\"Tools. Weapons. Champions. Beings that they try to raise in every Dimensional reality to make sure that as few timelines as possible are destroyed and rejoin the Original Timeline. Existences with such power and might that exceed common sense. Existences like us.\"","\"...\"","Silence descended onto the surroundings after such a statement, Noah nor the Antiquity speaking as the atmosphere turned extremely oppressive.","Off to the side, Oathkeeper was watching Noah carefully, ready to reinforce him with whatever problem they were facing as this being simply waited!","It was only after a few seconds passed did the voice of the Antiquity enter Noah’s mind again.","\"Many of them share names or similarities as a few renowned and extremely powerful Primordials are incharge of this task, these beings having laughs as they influence things and have these tools named similar to themselves- the names like Aegon, Ezekiel, Noah, and a few more that I’ve come across in multiple Dimensions appearing.\"","...!","Shocking truth after shocking truth descended onto Noah’s mind as he was still working on what to make of it all!","Amidst all of this, the Antiquity was continuing to freely talk about more of such information as it made him extremely curious of this being.","\"What a cosmic joke. When I transmigrated, I was so extremely naive that I-\"","THRUM!","Amidst the soliloquy of the Antiquity, the clone of Noah currently surrounded by three Blue Slimes vibrated with a gorgeous array of light, his body becoming suffused with multicolored auras as on his chest, one could see a vibrant Universe filled to the brim with Dao Galaxies...as well as the formation of a second Universe that seemed to be just in its beginning stages!\"","...!","It was the sign of Antiquity!","100% conversion of a being’s Universe into Dao Galaxies, becoming capable of birthing a second Universe as one reached a stage of power others would only ever dream of!","At this moment, the intense aura of Antiquity began to emanate from Noah, this aura being something even normal Antiquities would not be able to release as it seemed somewhat special.","\"...\"","The consciousness of the Antiquity seemed flabbergasted at this moment as his voice rang out slowly.","\"Did you...did you really just break into Antiquity in the middle of all this?\"","An incredulous expression was on the Antiquity’s face across Dimensions as in the Abyssal Universe, Oathkeeper was also looking towards Noah’s clone in utter stupor!","But at this time, the clone raised his head while adjusting to the new aura, waving his hands nonchalantly as he spoke in a domineering tone.","\"It’s merely just breaking into the Universal Filament Realm and becoming an Antiquity, nothing much. Let’s continue...\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1121,"title":"Chapter 1121: Chapter 1120 - What Would You Do?! I","paragraphs":["In the Ruination Realm.","Vast essences of Ruination swirled around Noah’s body intensely, this man really just skipping through the Realms of Power as from just recently breaking into becoming a Hegemony, he had now jumped to become an Antiquity!","The single Grand Primordial Heart he was absorbing was only 75% absorbed as just this was enough to grant him the full 100 Billion Dao Galaxies, giving him the essence required to form another Universe and become an Antiquity.","From here on out, he would be using this remaining Primordial Heart and the 2nd one to form even more Galaxies and Universes!","When one absorbed these types of Treasures, they could choose to either change the nature of their current normal Galaxies into Dao Galaxies, or if they had stepped into the realm of Universal Filament...they could also cause the rapid birth of brand new Galaxies!","And this...was exactly what Noah had begun to do in the crimson Ruination Realm.","THRUM!","In his newly birthed second Universe, a glorious glow suffused all around it as Galaxies began to sprout endlessly.","His first Universe was complete as he held a Splendiferous Universe, and he now began building another one as for Noah...he was just starting on the path to Construct a myriad of Universes as he continued his ascent for power!","---","In the Abyssal Universe, Oathkeeper was glancing towards Noah’s direction in utter shock as his very own eyes and awareness couldn’t believe the aura stemming off of Noah’s clone.","But he had to believe it as he was a Vassal, and his Origin felt a brand new rush of power descending unto him as he felt his current strength explode a few times!","This...was just the 5% access be had from Noah’s strength as an Antiquity.","A minuscule amount of his pure power that all of Noah’s Vassals shared, where if they wanted to gain more strength in their lives, they were actually better off just trying to fully comprehend the Lesser Dao of Fealty and even fully assimilate it to gain an increase in the percentage of power they could access!","Oathkeeper wasn’t the only one to feel these changes as in the Dark Universe, Valentina raised her dark eyes incredulously towards Noah’s figure in the skies.","She could see him still holding onto the bubbly body of the Blue Slime, but his body was at this moment emanating a terrifying authority that far exceeded even her!","This being...that wasn’t even a Monarch or Paragon just some weeks ago!","\"...\"","She felt a feeling at this moment that Barbatos, Elena, Kazuhiko, the Emperor Penguin, and many others felt with Noah’s constant and rapid advancements that seemed to leave everyone and everything behind constantly.","A stifling feeling that they couldn’t really explain as apart from it, they also felt his stupendous strength coursing through their bodies, even if it was 5% of it!","The Oathkeeper also felt this firsthand as with his mentality and position, he still did not know how to feel about Noah’s existence.","A being that had come from nowhere and risen just as fast, his strength seemingly covering everything at this moment!","’Just what is he...’","As the Oathkeeper pondered such a question, so did the Antiquity whose consciousness was remaining and talking to Noah in the Abyssal Universe.","The consciousness of this being was in a stupor as he observed the nonchalant manner Noah had as he stepped into the stage of Antiquity, Noah’s voice being the one to come out soon after as he completely brushed off the fact of this advancement!","\"So, Primordials cause an eruption in multiple timelines and realities, Primordial Beasts are born from this as they try to devour Universes and Cosmos to erase these realities and turn everything to what it once was.\"","\"Primordials in turn use their power to create a few experts in the vast realities to help them maintain their dominion and power. All of that is understandable, but...\"","The clone of Noah had a calm expression as he flashed a smile, his body currently undulating with the unique authority of an Antiquity as he looked like a primal creature from ancient times!","\"What exactly do you want? Why have you made the Primordials into your enemies? And then telling me all of this, what is your purpose? A race of unkillable beings with extreme power and might...you’re not trying to get me into your club to do this right?\"","RUMBLE!","The moment Noah broke through into Antiquity, his tone became much more domineering as his words were like claps of thunder onto the mind of the Antiquity!","\"Especially after you tried to invade this Primordial Cosmos as well! Just what is it you want, O Great Usurper?\"","...!","A straightforward question, and one that had to be answered!","\"...\"","The Great Usurper played this question in his mind over and over again as he seemed to reminisce about a few things.","He took a few seconds before his reply came out.","\"Those under the shadows of Primordials are extremely unique, especially beings like you and me. All of the ones I’ve met are ridiculous existences in the Universal Filament and Cosmic Realms that are under the beck and call of Primordials, these existences being extremely troublesome to even come across!\"","\"But then...here you are.\"","RUMBLE!","\"You just made your first contact with a Primordial, with my destiny shining gold telling me there is a possibility of a pathway to bloom with an existence like you that hasn’t fallen under the wings of the Primordials yet.\"","\"...\"","Pervasive silence descended onto the surroundings as Noah’s face remained passive. His voice only rang out after a moment.","\"So...you are looking for someone to join your club. But this still doesn’t answer the question of what your purpose is.\"","Across Dimensions, the Antiquity heard Noah’s words as his blue eyes shone an iridescent glow.","His lips began to move soon after as his consciousness continued to speak in the far away Dimension.","\"I stand against the Primordials and the apathetic manner they do things and their methods. You know what they did when I said no to being their Puppet?\"","\"As a show of power...just to show me my smallness in their designs...they shattered the Dimension I was in with a blink of their eyes.\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1122,"title":"Chapter 1122: Chapter 1121 - What Would You Do?! II","paragraphs":["A destruction of a Dimension with a blink of their eyes!","Such an action gave a glimpse of the power of Primordials as when Noah heard it, his eyes flashed with intense light!","\"If I wasn’t careful enough, they would have decimated everything I held dear as if I didn’t have the tools that I have...the tools of the Great Usurper, even I wouldn’t have survived.\"","...!","The words of the Antiquity caused many thoughts to swirl in Noah’s mind as all he got from this was that this being was so much a cockroach that he survived against a killing strike of a Primordial.","Was it clones? Other bodies? Just what from this Great Usurper granted this being such capabilities?","But his questions would have to wait for later as the monologue of the Antiquity continued.","\" I am growing my power and stretching across Cosmos and Dimensions to become capable enough to take on these terrifying beings, to be able to stand up to them as those gaze of looking at everything as if they were mere ants...I want to erase those gazes from their faces.\"","WAA!","\"The Primordials took something else extremely important to me when I said no to them...they took the System they granted to me as months later, I’ve barely been able to re-establish a semblance of it!\"","’Hmm?’","Noah’s ears pricked up when he heard the mention of a System, but his words nonetheless came out calmly as he regularly checked his churning destiny and fortune.","\"This seems more like a you problem. I have no issues with the Primordials. In fact, they just handed me a free Primordial Heart just now!\"","His sharp words caused the Antiquity’s eyes to shine sharply as after a few seconds passed, he posed a certain question.","\"What System do you have? What made you who you are currently?\"","\"...\"","What System did Noah have? Unlike the original inhabitants of the Dark Universe and Primordial Cosmos, his world stemmed with a game like system that allowed them to change the nature of their defeated enemies into Cores and skill books!","It was just the changing of their Origins and what they accumulated into their lives into other quantifiable forms, and this came in the form of Cores, skill books, and even skill points.","But all of it was made possible from Noah’s homeworld utilizing the might of a Cosmic Treasure!","Even Noah’s Infinite Mana...it began as a Trait that wasn’t truly what its name said, with it being made possible through Noah drawing large amounts of Mana from the world he was connected to, and then later to the worlds and Galaxies he was connected to.","But thereafter...he actualized this Trait and made it something that didn’t rely on anything- just purely the Trait and what its name stated!","But even this was also done with the aid of a Cosmic Treasure.","As he went through this thought process, Noah pondered of any outside influence aside from the one he knew...and came to a certain conclusion!","\"I made me who I am, nothing else. All the tools I used, I only obtained through hard work and perseverance!\"","\"...so a pie didn’t just fall from the sky and land on your lap? An undeserved cheat or system that made you exceed all others?\"","\"...\"","The question of the Antiquity caused Noah to squint his eyes before he replied.","\"I worked to make my strength to the stage that it is. Even the descent of the Primordial that handed me a Primordial Heart- it was through my actions that she was called down!\"","\"As for where I get my source of strength...nobody can take that away from me. Not even the Primordials.\"","WAA!","His figure was unconsciously bathed with a golden glow as he spoke, the Antiquity’s consciousness sighing before it spoke out somberly.","\"They already have their eyes on you. If you haven’t become their tool, they will make you one. What will you do when they come to you exactly as they came to me? When they ask you to put your life on the line for them?\"","\"What would you do about the Primordial Beasts that want to devour Universes and Cosmos to return things to what they once were, or the Primordials that just want to expand their dominion and power across multiple realities?\"","...!","Yes!","This was an important question to be pondered, and one that didn’t have an easy answer!","Who should one side with?","There were the Primordial Beasts that were a force of nature, trying to unravel branching realities and return them to the Original one. But...this would mean the destruction of an uncountable number of Multiverses, Cosmos, and Dimensions as it was the deaths of beings numbers couldn’t even begin to put into picture.","But that...was the natural order.","Then there were the Primordials that caused all of these branching realities in the first place, and to keep them active without being destroyed- they were battling the Primordial Beasts and even spreading out their influence across many Dimensions to raise Champions to withstand their enemies.","These existences didn’t do this compassionately, but they did this to keep the ’lands’ they controlled alive and well as they continued to reap the rewards of their dominion across a myriad of realities.","Against all of this...what choice would one even make?","\"What I would do, huh? If that time ever comes...\"","His body was suffused with a golden glow as he looked extremely domineering, and he was letting out a tyrannical light that seemed to oppress the surroundings!","\"The Primordials that caused a myriad of branching realities, the Primordial Beasts that want to destroy these realities and bring things back to the natural order, and even the so called tools or Champions in between...no matter what is in play, all I have to do is put these existences under me.\"","RUMBLE!","\"Whether it be the Beasts, Champions, or Primordials...I will just dominate them and put them all under my feet. Then, I can be the one to decide how things will go. That will naturally solve all problems.\"","...!","Ah!"]},{"number":1123,"title":"Chapter 1123: Chapter 1122 - NOAH! I","paragraphs":["\"Whether it be the Beasts, Champions, or Primordials...I will just dominate them and put them all under my feet. Then, I can be the one to decide how things will go. That will naturally solve all problems.\"","...!","Ah!","As Noah said these words, his Primordial Ruination Clone in the Ruination Realm briefly stopped absorbing the Primordial Heart as he looked within himself at the Cosmic Treasure that was lying peacefully in his Origin.","Even though he loved to talk big, a portion of him still felt the words of the Antiquity had some truth in them. The Cosmic Treasure could be considered an undeserved cheat and a deserved one at the same time as he had obtained the first piece without doing anything, but had used his own power to collect the rest of the Tools of Ruination and complete it.","When he first awakened, his blank [Focus] was also a pie falling from the sky that others didn’t have, but even the World Core itself mentioned that this was all random occurrence!","That he wasn’t somehow chosen as if he were special.","But with the knowledge of beings sharing his name actually stemming from Primordials, was that truly the case?","We’re things being steered by destiny and fate even without the knowledge of the World Core and Noah?","\"Haaa...\"","Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone sighed deeply within the Ruination Realm as he focused on the Primordial Heart within his hands again.","Even though they were stupendous treasures, when Noah thought about the larger picture of undeserved things and Primordials, the glow of these treasures dimmed just a little!","’Arrogance and confidence is good, I guess I could learn to be just a bit more humble with all that I’ve gained...’","This thought crossed his mind as he continued to calculate a myriad of things, going back to absorbing the Primordial Heart as billions of galaxies were already filling his second Universe!","---","The Antiquity heard the domineering words from Noah as his cerulean blue eyes trembled, his gaze that was reaching across Cosmos shaking as he saw the unbridled confidence and belief in the eyes of this being!","As he saw such conviction, he couldn’t help but shake his head as he uttered out unconsciously.","\"Madman...\"","Yes!","Who else but a madman could say with belief that he could put Primordials that could cause the destruction of entire Dimensions with a blink of their eyes under their control?","Who could say they would put under their feet Primordial Beasts that devoured entire Universes and Comos?!","Or the tools of Primordials that held terrifying power and Systems that they reigned supreme in their Dimensions?","\"...\"","As this Antiquity thought about all this, his eyes couldn’t help but inexplicably land on Noah again.","\"I see...\"","At this moment, he felt something click in his mind as he realized that after his meeting with the Primordials and the shocking strength they could display, he had inadvertently looked towards them as if they were some insurmountable wall.","He had unconsciously put a block in his mind as even though he was rising in strength rapidly, he always felt like he was behind and still so extremely weak!","’But...only a few months have passed. I’ve been rushing too much. With my capabilities and restructured system...I can be just as confident to do what this being believes he can do!’","WAA!","’But this being...he is too unique!’","The eyes of the Antiquity still focused on Noah as he could still see the unique light of dominance and confidence, a domineering light that seemed to draw everything towards it.","Seeing such a thing, his voice from his consciousness in the Abyssal Universe couldn’t help but reach out.","\"Just...just who are you?\"","\"...\"","As his glowing eyes reigned in the glorious light of conquest and domination, Noah glanced forward calmly as he spoke out.","\"Noah. Noah Osmont.\"","RUMBLE!","\"Get the fuck out...what?\" The Antiquity was in a stupor as his voice rang out, the surprise in it evident as he couldn’t help but ask again!","\"Are you serious?\"","And the reply from Noah came as he looked in front of him as if he could actually see the expression of the Antiquity even though he was only a consciousness at this moment.","\"Yes...you’re not...\"","Across Dimensions, the Antiquity shook his head in an exasperated manner as he spoke out with utter incredulity.","\"Fucking ridiculous...I am Noah! Noah Eckert!\"","...!","A lull of silence descended at this moment as neither side spoke!","\"...\"","The figure of Noah paused at this time, incredulous at the situation around him as he spoke out unconsciously.","\"Before...you mentioned the words to be or not to be. You wouldn’t have happened to hear that from an English playwright...\"","WAA!","The consciousness of the Antiquity buzzed at Noah’s words as his reply came before Noah even finished!","\"...the poet from the UK that they focused too much on in school...\"","...!","\"...\"","Silence pervaded in the surroundings again.","No side spoke at this moment.","The reality of branching parallel timelines and concepts that the Antiquity had just been talking about finally fully delved into Noah’s mind at this moment as they became very real!","A whole minute passed as no side spoke, each one lost in their own thoughts!","\"Haaa...\"","Noah sighed again at this juncture as he looked up around him seconds later and had his voice stretch out calmly.","\"Ok. Alright. It’s something we can discuss later. Let’s get to the root of our current reality first. Destiny seems to say that there lies some stupendous benefits for me when it comes to associating with you, and it’s the only reason I even bothered to speak to you in the first place.\"","\"For you to be so proactive, I guess it’s the same on your side. Primordials and Primordial Beasts...and even the Champions that they control. When it comes to this...we can cooperate in some form!\"","WAA!","Noah’s voice was firm as he thought of many things, not entirely turning down this being that he ridiculously shared the same first name with as a thin and shaky connection began to form at this moment!"]},{"number":1124,"title":"Chapter 1124: Chapter 1123 - NOAH! II","paragraphs":["The reply from Noah caused an eruption of fortune both from him and a certain Antiquity that was located far across Dimensions, both of these beings monitoring this situation closely as the consciousness of the Antiquity spoke out.","\"We’ll need a way to communicate. This consciousness will fade away entirely soon, and I won’t be able to reach out into this Dimensions again unless there is a medium.\"","The voice seemed to be searching for something when it was speaking, changing entirely to a quizzical tone next.","\"The medium in the past was Chronos...where is that guy?\"","\"Oh?\" Noah raised his head towards the question of the Antiquity as he smiled lightly.","\"That guy? I locked him in a time prison since I have some plans for him later. For him to be a medium across Dimensions, did it have something to do with his Dao of Reincarnation?\"","...!","Noah hit the nail of the head as the Antiquity was surprised, shaking his head wryly with his real body as his consciousness in the Abyssal Universe looked pitifully as the Oathkeeeper and the 12 locked Hegemonies beside him.","\"These guys and Chronos were really fighting against a guy with a cheat-like system and didn’t know it...no wonder everything was such a mess.\"","The voice of the Antiquity was that of pity as when Noah picked it up, his brows perked up as he spoke out quizzically.","\"Don’t forget you were above them, it was your loss too.\"","...!","The Antiquity nearly choked from this as his rumbling voice shot back. \"Well...just a small setback for me as I lost a Subjugated Antiquity. But yes, if you can somehow obtain The Dao of Reincarnation, just enter a half dead state and you should be able to see your timeline.\"","\"My authority has spread into this Cosmos and timeline enough that I’ll be able to sense you with my unique abilities when you do, and we can discuss more things then.\"","Gradually the voice of the Antiquity was filled with conviction, this being having figured something out during their conversation!","Noah nodded to his words as he saw his Destiny and Fortune settling down, where he had already sown certain seeds as he would wait for them to bloom and see exactly what would come out.","\"Until then...I have some work to do.\"","His voice reached the Antiquity as their conversation came to an end, a possibility being planted at this moment as the consciousness of the being Noah shared a similar name to began to fade away.","\"I’ll be waiting to hear from you soon...Noah!\"","THRUM!","With a transparent flash of light, Noah felt a pressure be lifted as the consciousness of the Antiquity was now gone!","Far across Dimensions, the scene that this Antiquity could see also faded away, his eyes only seeing the expanse of white coldness around him as his cerulean blue eyes flashed beautifully.","The existence made of ice beside him saw he was done as she spoke with a smile.","\"How long will you be staying this time?\"","The voice seemed to be tinged with happiness and sadness, causing the Great Usurper to let out a light smile at this as he patted her head and replied.","\"I won’t be going anywhere for a while. We’ll take some time to reinforce our strength and plan. Maybe we won’t be alone in this battle....\"","With such words, the red haired woman made of particles of ice smiled brightly as she nodded.","\"Un!\"","---","In the Ruination Realm.","Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone had already finished absorbing the first Primordial Heart as he was halfway through the second one, and he came to a halt at this moment as he gazed within his Origin.","There, he could see 4 beautifully swirling Universes as one was a complete Splendiferous Universe, two being normal complete ones with 100 Billion Galaxies each, and the 4th one being a Universe that only had 10 Billion Galaxies within it!","The 25% remainder of the first Heart and 50% of the second one had actually been enough to grant Noah two complete normal Universes and begin on the fourth one! He could have continued at this moment as he forged another 2 or 3 Universes, but he actually came to a stop.","This was because he was thinking further ahead about a few things, his mind focused on the Primordial Cosmos and the task of the Quintillions of beings he had brought into the Dark Universe.","When it pertained to the Primordial Cosmos...he was thinking of his newly gained Vassal that was the strongest Hegemony within it...and also the being with a Cosmic Treasure!","He had been debating what to do with this being that had sworn Fealty to him...as well as his Cosmic Treasure. At this moment, he had made a decision as he entirely stopped the absorption of the Primordial Heart and put it into his [Expansive Space].","Thereafter, the figure of the Primordial Ruination Clone disappeared from the Ruination Realm as it instantly teleported into the Abyssal Universe!","The clone arrived right before the Oathkeeper as the figures of the Blue Slimes and the normal Clone in the surroundings faded away with a spatial light.","Noah stared at the old existence that had lived for millions of years as he spoke out with a light smile.","\"As the being helping maintain order in the Primordial Cosmos and affecting a vast number of quintillions...how many Dao Galaxies do you currently have, Oathkeeper?\"","His question was one that no expert would tell another, but the Oathkeeper actually gazed at Noah with placid golden eyes as he replied right after!","\"Over 60 Billion Dao Galaxies.\"","RUMBLE!","His voice was steady as Noah’s eyes flashed grandly when he heard it.","This being had not wasted his millions of years, especially so with the fact that he was one of the strongest beings in the Cosmos!","Even if he hadn’t been able to do something like Noah and create a Lesser Dao that allowed him to literally control and closely influence all the existences within Universes, Oathkeeper had still acted out a major role all these years.","As he affirmed this, Noah gave a brilliant smile while he waved his hands and caused the appearance of a glimmering Primordial Heart!","\"Based on recent events, we could have a terrifying Primordial Beast attack at any moment. The Primordial Cosmos needs powerful protectors...and I won’t strip you away from that position!\"","WAA!","Yes! Noah wouldn’t snatch the Primordial Disk in the hands of the Oathkeeper, instead planning on making this being and another one that were the best candidates closest to reaching Antiquity even more powerful! The other was, of course, the Blue Slime that was at 95 Billion Dao Galaxies and was even closer to Antiquity than nobody else!","Others would follow as he and the Blue Slime would just be the first.","The forces Noah was planning to raise to prominence were too stupendous and numerous, with his eyes already planning for a glorious future of these forces beginning to stretch their fingers across the Ruination Sea.","\"But first...\"","There was still the Primordial Cosmos! There were still many things to be done!"]},{"number":1125,"title":"Chapter 1125: Chapter 1124 - A Universe Aspiring To Become A Cosmos! I","paragraphs":["A uniquely shining Primordial Heart floated above Noah’s palm as the Oathkeeper’s gaze inadvertently locked onto it.","He wasn’t the only one as the Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos were watching these scenes from afar, none of these beings having even had the chance to help to contribute anything with how things had rapidly progressed!","Currently, the most astounding moment had come as the being that was a Paragon just moments ago had now become an Antiquity and had just appeared with the pulsating Heart he was given not too long ago, seemingly about to hand it to the Oathkeeper!","But at this moment, a miniaturized Blue Slime just a few inches in diameter appeared beside the valiant figure of the Oathkeeper, Noah giving a light smile at this guy as the Slime made sure to call dibs first on the remaining Primordial Heart before anyone else!","Noah nodded towards the true body of the Blue Slime as a blue tentacle shot from it, wrapping around the Primordial Heart as a resplendent glow erupted out from the process of absorption beginning.","The Blue Slime was already an Apocryphal Antiquity as he had begun to form a second Universe, but it seemed the true authority of an Antiquity was always given after one completed the first full Splendiferous Universe!","After the constant Devouring of the Universal Constructs with the authority of the...being that shared a similar name to Noah, the Slime now only had 5 Billion Galaxies to be changed into Dao Galaxies, the soft glow of the Primordial Heart flowing into him as this process ensued.","THRUM!","A cerulean glow flashed out as it drew the eyes of the Hegemonies from all around, the unique phenomenon of a being stepping into the ranks of Antiquity actually playing out right before their eyes as they couldn’t not pay attention!","The Origin of the Blue Slime shone with an iridescent glow in the next few seconds as a few billion Dao Galaxies bloomed, the Origin vibrating in resonance soon after as a full 100 Billion Dao Galaxies now flowed within it.","WAA!","The aura of the Blue Slime gradually changed as it became even more oppressive, but it’s cerulean eyes flashed with light as it didn’t get drunk on the feeling of absorption of the Primordial Heart, the tentacles it released letting this treasure go as it floated towards Noah.","Noah himself watched the scene of the birth of another genuine Antiquity with a smile, simply nodding towards the Oathkeeper to absorb the Primordial Heart next as after some slight hesitation...this ancient being hardened his resolve and went forward!","---","The vast numbers of Hegemonies were looking at the incredulous scenes occurring within the Abyssal Universe in shock as they didn’t even dare to approach at this moment!","The sequence of events just had too many shocking results as from an Antiquity descending because of Chronos and the Goliath along with many others Hegemonies seeking a method to achieve it themselves...all the way to this moment where these Hegemonies were missing or dead along with the Antiquity they called down.","Instead, the Apex Paragon that had shown shocking prowess was the one to inexplicably rise to Antiquity along with his Blue Slime, and now the aura of the Oathkeeper was changing as well as this being also went towards the same direction!","It was a truly ridiculous sight as the ones who were trying to prevent the descent of Antiquity were the ones to actually obtain Antiquity in the end, those searching for it like Chronos and The Goliath missing out...","The Great Old Nazzagath looked at this scene with eyes that flashed with intense light, recalling the words of the Apex Paragon that was now an Antiquity.","’Fealty...is that what Oathkeeper has now done? Just that and given the chance to advance to Antiquity?’","The thoughts of the Ancient Chthonian were his own as he and many others watched the scene before them in wonder!","They watched as the golden wings and aura around the Oathkeeper expanded rapidly after he began to absorb the Primordial Heart, his eyes shooting out majestically beams of light as he bellowed out like the primal ancient being that he was.","\"OOOOOH!\"","This bellow was followed by the continued rapid conversion of normal Galaxies into Dao Galaxies as every few seconds, billions would be added as this being put together the less than 40 billion that he needed for Antiquity.","The scene was one of utter wonder and awe as nobody could take their eyes off of it, even the Hegemonies counting the number of converged Galaxies as after a few minutes...they neared the complete 100 Billion just like the Blue Slime moments ago.","The surrounding space shook as a golden glow washed over the Oathkeeper, his entire body being covered seemingly with liquid gold when the 100th Billion Dao Galaxy was reached, rays of light stretching from him as if he was breaking out of a cocoon and becoming something else!","RUMBLE!","After the golden waves of power settled down, the figure of the Oathkeeper became visible again as the eyes of the Hegemonies trembled when they saw him.","He didn’t have the usual pair of wings, this existence currently having three pairs of shimmering golden wings behind him as he had grown to be nearly 4 meters, his body fully suffused with a golden glow as he looked like a primal creature gracing lower world’s with his presence!","Noah looked at such a scene and nodded as he sent multiple mental messages to the Oathkeeper, the figures of his Primordial Clone and the Blue Slime disappearing soon after.","All that was left behind...was the newly risen Antiquity and 12 white eggs that contained Hegemonies that worked with Chronos, the Oathkeeper glancing at these prisons made of Primordial Essence as he then glanced towards the Hegemonies that didn’t dare approach before.","\"Come. It is time for healing and restructuring!\"","THRUM!","His commanding voice reached the Hegemonies as it raised them out of their stupor, Great Old Nazzagath and the others moving into the Abyssal Universe at this moment!"]},{"number":1126,"title":"Chapter 1126: Chapter 1125 - A Universe Aspiring To Become A Cosmos! II","paragraphs":["In the Dark Universe.","Noah’s main body watched the appearance of his Primordial Ruination Clone along with the Blue Slime with calm eyes, a crimson object that was the Cosmic Treasure leaving the chest of his clone and landing onto his hands at this moment!","He held on tenderly to the Treasure as he spoke towards the bubbling figure of the Blue Slime that came and sat on his head.","\"What do you want to do with the rest of the Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos? If you want to devour them for their actions towards your Race...\"","\"...\"","The bubbly Blue Slime was actually silent when Noah asked, only speaking out moments later with a low tone.","\"What has occurred in the past can’t be changed. I know the being responsible and have devoured nearly all of those that worked with him...and I’ll also devour Chronos myself whenever you finish with him!\"","WAA!","\"Besides, even though I lost all of my race...I was able to find you and everyone else...so it’s ok.\"","...!","The Blue Slime said the last words as they could barely be heard by those around him, seemingly embarrassed as the bubbly body remained still and closed its eyes above Noah’s head!","\"You...\"","Noah smiled towards the slime atop him as he shook his head, his heart feeling a sense of warmth he wouldn’t have thought would come from an existence like this.","Seeing how the slime would budge no matter how much he poked, Noah left the embarrassed being alone and focused on what was on his hands.","He looked at the Cosmic Treasure with a sharp smile as his current essence of a being in the Universal Filament Realm flowed into it, the Cosmic Treasure buzzing with happiness as in a short period of time... its Master had broken through two Realms!","From Galactic Filament to Universal Realm, and now into the Universal Filament Realm as when Noah entered this level...the Cosmic Treasure could be utilized even more as its features were expanded and enhanced to another level.","First off was the stupendous clone before Noah, it’s strength being something he could hardly believe as it’s boosts just continued to become more and more immense!","[Primordial Ruination Clone] :: Out of the innumerable number of creatures in the vast Cosmos, there are a few whose bodies uniquely rise above all others. The Primordial Ruination Clone is a feature that only the Master of RUINATION can utilize, allowing them to forge a Primordial Ruination Clone from the very essence of Ruination. As a creature made from the very essence of a Cosmic Dao, it has a +300,000% Increase in the speed of progression through the Realms of Power, +300,000% Increase in the Comprehension and Assimilation of all Daos, can display 500% of the strength of the Master of Ruination, along with its power increased by 3000% when in the Ruination Sea. It can seamlessly utilize the abilities of [Miniature Ruination Rupture Generation], [Instantaneous","Universal Teleportation], [Ruination Essence Skill Conversion and Amplification], [Sword of Ruination], [Cosmic Chains of Ruination], and [Universal Budding], [@$%@#$%]...","It’s percentage boosts were further enhanced as along with this, Noah’s advancement into the Universal Filament Realm opened up another feature.","It was the feature that was termed [Universal Budding]!","[Universal Budding] :: With the sacrifice of a Universe from the Origin of the Master of Ruination, a genuine Universe under the control of the Master of Ruination will be born.","\"...\"","A fantastical ability.","The capability to sacrifice one’s own Universe for a genuine one, something that could only be made possible when Noah himself stepped into the Universal Filament Realm as it was only here when he could afford to sacrifice Universes!","What a fantastical treasure RUINATION was!","Noah had many thoughts when he first saw this ability, with an array of possibilities on how to utilize it. Many of these possibilities actually related more to his Universal Core!","There were a myriad of Treasures around Noah, as well as what one would consider his most prized possession, or what could be considered most unique.","When it came to this...it actually wasn’t the Cosmic Treasure RUINATION. It was definitely unique and overpowered by its own right, but there was another Cosmic Treasure at its level within this same Primordial Cosmos.","But one thing that Noah hadn’t found any others have and the thing that continued to uniquely advance without stopping...was the Universal Core of his Dark Universe!","The unique treasure that was once a floating Spiritual Land and had gone on to become a Spiritual World and Galaxy, with Noah even granting it the term [Infinite] next to it due it’s ceaseless possibilities of expansion.","Currently, this Unique Treasure was a Universe as after all this time...Noah wanted to be able to see it advance into a Filament of Universes as it went towards becoming a Cosmos!","This was because one may not consciously think about it...but this unique treasure was also one of Noah’s strongest weapons.","It still had the myriad of features of [Size Dilation], [Offensive Maneuvers], [World Integration], [Froze Barrier],[Assimilation]...and many more!","Due to extra caution and not really needing to, Noah had not been using the unique treasure as a weapon recently as if ever he did...the reality to play out would be a shocking one as even he didn’t know what would happen.","If he condensed the entire Dark Universe into an object that could fit into his hands with Size Regulation and then used Offensive Maneuvers to throw an entire Universe onto an enemy as a weapon, just what would happen?!","Furthermore, when he upgraded it to a Universal Filament or even a Cosmos....just who would be able to withstand having an entire Cosmos thrown at them?","Could a being handle such a ridiculous concept?!","There were so many things and possibilities associated with this treasure that Noah couldn’t wait to see how everything would play out, and he was making the moves to ensure he could see this future at this very moment.","One of the ways to upgrade the Universal Core was to introduce 100 Quintillion existences into it. The number had currently spilled over 60 Quintillion as Noah could go around the Primordial Cosmos to obtain the remaining amount whenever he wished, but there was also another way to go about this!","The first method was the [Universal Budding] that had just appeared from the Cosmic Treasure....and then there was the method that utilized the Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":1127,"title":"Chapter 1127: Chapter 1126 - A Universe Aspires To Become A Cosmos! III","paragraphs":["Multiple methods existed before Noah as he could choose any of them to achieve the goal of taking the Dark Universe and have it begin forming Universal Filaments!","The [Universal Budding] method would require him to sacrifice one of the newly made Universes within his Origin as he could do this...but why do such a thing when there was a perfectly situated Primordial Cosmos before him?","A Cosmos filled with Universes that were just affected by the Universal Amalgamation and were currently empty...a Cosmos that had a myriad of other Universes filled with countless Quintillions of creatures!","At this moment, Noah had turned his eyes towards this Cosmos as he had already begun the preparations.","For this, he of course talked to Oathkeeper that held the Primordial Disk and knew much more about the Primordial Cosmos than anyone else, with Noah letting this being wrap up the imprisoning of the Goliath and others before he would follow him to speak to a certain consciousness!","\"A Cosmos....\"","Noah couldn’t help but utter out such words as he looked around him, at his subordinates below that were gazing up at him and even further from them, the countless existences that he had brought from the Primordial Cosmos into this Universe.","Then there were the natives of this Dark Universe whose lives continued to be inexplicably changed everyday...the quality and way of living in the Dark Universe being something that others could only imagine!","---","In a small, nondescript corner of the Dark Universe.","A small world rotated slowly around a star system with a sun at its very center, creating a serene scene of the starry space.","But at this moment, one would be surprised to see the figure of a mischievous young boy that didn’t seem older than 8...actually fly out of the small world and into the starry space!","Yes! A young boy that was barely 10 as he was still wiping his snot from his nose, his eyes shining brilliantly as he left the layers of his world and entered space while gazing up towards a far away sun.","Around his body, a unique source of power circulated around him as it caused this child to ignore the rules of space, being able to survive in such an environment indefinitely as his mischievous eyes made up his mind, his small body beginning to shoot towards the sun.","But before this child could get too far...","\"Richard! How many times did I tell you to stay on the ground!\"","RUMBLE!","Behind him, a furious bellow reverberated out as a figure shot towards the child as a streak of light, coming up behind him and grabbing his hand as it caused the mischievous child to be utterly frightened!","\"Mom...\"","The young boy was looking with fearful eyes towards the other hand of his mom that was holding a sandal that was ready to smash onto him at any moment.","His mom looked at him with eyes of anger as she spoke out while pulling him back to their World.","\"What were you doing now?\"","The gaze of the mischievous child was downcast as if they were caught doing something they shouldn’t have, his voice coming out slowly.","\"I just...wanted to grab some more sunlight and bring it close to our garden. I thought the plants would be happier...\"","...!","\"You stupid little...!\"","With a flash of light, the figure of mother and child returned back to their world as routinely, one could see other figures leave the small world and fly about across the stars...this shocking reality only made possible by a single being!","All of these existences so freely flying about in space whether they were children or adults could only do so due to the fact that they held 5% of Noah’s current level of power!","This was one of the best ways to describe just how ridiculous this was, as at this level...this power had far surpassed the Void Rank that one needed to freely cross the void of space.","It made possible for shocking realities that only the inhabitants of the Dark Universe could experience!","The inhabitants of the Dark Universe obtained such stupendous power from Noah, his 5% making it easy for so many things that we could hardly cover the many variable consequences it held.","Noah understood this well as he used his role as the Emperor of his Vassals to instill in their souls that the stupendous power they obtained from him would not be used to harm one another maliciously in any way!","Under such commands...the Vassals could only follow.","There wouldn’t be scenes of children or problematic beings destroying cities or worlds, or anything of the sort as deep within their souls, any of such actions were prohibited before they were even carried out.","But these beings could use this power to spar with each other and delve into the wondrous Dungeons that were constantly still being produced across the Dark Universe, obtaining Cores and skill books to further elevate their ranks as a unique reality was formed in the Dark Universe.","It was a reality that one had to live and experience in order to fully understand it, and the newly brought in inhabitants of the Animus Universe, Automaton, Chthonian, Necrotic, and Euthenia Universes among a few were getting the chance to experience it first hand!","It was an inclusion of a myriad of Races, the 9 Supreme Bloodlines of the Animus Universe occupying a region of space by themselves due to their pride, but when they saw the power of every single being within this Universe and the game like System they could now also utilize...even these prideful beings began to come down and associate with the myriad of other Races within this Universe.","This could only be done in the period of the past day as all Races settled in and got to learn more about their new environment, where the future would fantastically have the friendly interactions of Robotic beings from the past Automaton Universe and the Abyssal Undead from the past Necrotic Universe!","This was just a single example as it would soon become common place to see the World Trees of the Euthenia Universe and the terrifying planetary sized Chthonians get to know each other, Noah inadvertently making an environment that even he himself didn’t know just what a shocking result it would display!","But aside from the inhabitants living with this Universe...there was the Universe itself.","It also had goals and aspirations as at this moment...this Universe aspired to become a Cosmos!"]},{"number":1128,"title":"Chapter 1128: Chapter 1127 - A Universe Aspires To Become A Cosmos! IV","paragraphs":["A Universe aspiring to become a Cosmos!","This was actually a reality playing out as after the fusion with Noah’s unique treasure, the Universe was much more autonomous as many things were done even without Noah’s input.","The use of the feature of [Architecture] to design new structures, worlds, and Galaxies that would uniquely suit the races from the Automaton, Animus...and all the other Universes.","Where to establish Universal Law Spaces and Dao Spaces that were filled with unique and bountiful concentrations of the essence of some Daos.","Even the features of [Frozen Barrier] for defense and [Offensive Maneuvers] for offense...the Universe could autonomously do it while borrowing from Noah’s unlimited mana reserves!","After all this time, this Universe aspired to achieve even greater stages as it let its thoughts be known to Noah.","Noah already had many things in play, putting away the wondrous Cosmic Treasure he was playing with as it sank into the chest of his main body, the Primordial Ruination Clone flashing away with a spatial light as only he and the Blue Slime were left behind in the skies.","\"Come on.\"","He had a light smile on his face as he glanced below him, his figure beginning to descend towards the figures of Valentina, Barbatos, Emperor Penguin, and many others.","---","\"Ready?\"","Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone reappeared in the Abyssal Universe, glancing at the many Hegemonies that were hauling away the imprisoned existences that followed Chronos and the Goliath.","The Oathkeeper nodded with a somber expression as his six wings vibrated powerfully, the Primordial Disk appearing within his hands as it pulsed with a pristine white essence.","BZZZT!","This essence built up at a rapid rate within his hands as after a few seconds, it released a ray of white light that shattered the very void near them, a white crack in space forming as it led to a special location!","Noah looked at this scene with shining eyes as the Oathkeeeper kept his somber expression, looking towards Noah with a myriad of thoughts as this being had only asked him of a single thing.","Noah had told the Oathkeeper that he wouldn’t ask too much of him in the future...with the main thing he wanted now being his help in locating the consciousness of...the Primordial Cosmos!","The place where the most Primordial Essence was congregated, and the location that only the existence with the Primordial Disk and Comprehension in the Primordial Dao could get to.","This was where the crack in space led to.","Noah had an impassive expression as he stepped into it, the figure of the Oathkeeper following closely behind as the moment they entered, the crack disappeared as only a few Hegemonies were left in the surroundings.","The moment that Noah stepped through this crack though, he felt an extremely suffocating and oppressive force descending onto him from all sides, the area he arrived in being filled with sea of the Primordial Essence!","If the cool down of his [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] had already finished, this would be the most wondrous place for him to quickly integrate the Primordial Dao just with the sheer amount of it in the surroundings.","The Oathkeeper was looking at Noah carefully at this moment as he knew he could survive due to understanding the Primordial Dao, but what about Noah?","His questions didn’t last long as in a moment, a red glow surrounded Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone as in the seas of whiteness, a beautiful crimson light appeared as the being releasing this light...spoke slowly.","\"I came to seek an audience with the consciousness of this Cosmos.\"","RUMBLE!","His voice was neither servile nor overbearing, Noah keeping an impassive expression as the Oathkeeper shook his head off to the side!","He had come here many times in the past, even more recently just within the last days to seek guidance on what he should do against the schemes of Chronos and the approaching Antiquity.","He had received no answers as this was one of the reasons he wasn’t averse to bringing Noah here when he asked!","If even the Holder of the Primordial Disk who comprehended the very essence that supported the Cosmos couldn’t get an answer, why would another being that seemed to have the Cosmic Dao directly opposed to it get an answer?","But...","<You came.>","WAA!","...!","The eyes of the Oathkeeper nearly popped out with incredulity as a monotone but ancient voice reverberated around them!","This...","He had gotten an answer the first time he came?!","Turbulent emotions flew around the Oathkeeper’s heart at such a scene, this ancient being keeping his face expressionless even though he was aggrieved inside.","Noah looked around the vast white Primordial Sea he was in as he spoke out slowly.","\"You speak as if you were expecting me?\"","The question was one that made Noah curious, especially after talking to another being with his name that spoke a great deal about puppets and existences moving on the palms of others!","<The existence that ultimately saved the Dark Universe from complete destruction. I could not sustain it any longer from such a distance, and I sensed and felt it when you changed the nature of the Universe into something else before the Ruination Sea ripped it apart.>","...!","Oathkeeper looked towards Noah in shock at such words, many things finally clicking into place within his mind as the voice continued to resound out.","<Your visit here has to do with the Dark Universe.>","The Ancient monotone voice reverberated out as it stated Noah’s possible purpose without question!","Noah scratched his head as he smiled lightly while voicing out.","\"Yes, this has everything to do with the Dark Universe. The Universe wants to rejoin with its Cosmos as the times are rapidly changing, with terrifying threats never faced before on the horizon as Primordial Beasts intent on erasing entire realities could arrive at any moment!\"","THRUM!","\"The process of rejoining the Cosmos though...will be something that requires the Dark Universe to assimilate the myriad of Universes within this Primordial Cosmos. For the purpose-\"","<There is no need for explanation or games.>","...!","Before Noah could even finish his words, he was actually interrupted by the Ancient monotone voice as it continued emotionlessly!","<The broken off Dark Universe still stemmed from me, with most of its memories being accessible. I know of the unique treasure and methods in your hands, so there is no need for games. It will be a great Undertaking that will take some time...so let’s get started right away.>","RUMBLE!","Noah felt his heart shaking as a moment later, a deep smile appeared on his face! He....truly liked how some of these consciousnesses went about doing things!"]},{"number":1129,"title":"Chapter 1129: Chapter 1128 - The Glorious Light Of Assimilation! I","paragraphs":["In a unique space filled with vast amounts of Primordial Essence.","The Oathkeeper was looking between Noah and the vast space around him as after holding himself back for so long, he spoke out.","\"I’m sorry...the Assimilation of this Cosmos with a single Universe?\"","His voice let his incredulity be known as Noah allowed the surprise from the words of the ancient voice to fade as he nodded toward the Oathkeeper.","\"If the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos already understands everything...then I will just get things started.\"","WAP!","Without so much an another explanation, Noah’s eyes gazed towards a faraway direction from the space he was it, his gaze seemingly capable of peering through the layers of space and gazing out from the Universes of the Primordial Cosmos all the way into the vast Ruination Sea roiling outside of it.","Within this Ruination Sea...there was a single Universe countless light-years wide that was floating peacefully.","At this moment...this Universe began to actually move, and it was moving at a high speed at that as it seemed like a rapidly mobile object more than a grand stellar structure!","It was making its way towards the Primordial Cosmos as since it was already close, the process would take a short period of time before the outer boundary of the Universe would come near the Cosmos.","Around this same time, Noah’s main body in the Dark Universe flew away from his subordinates as he went towards the core area of the Universal Core.","\"Wait, what exactly are you doing now?\"","Valentina couldn’t help but ask as Noah just flew up while saying he had to do something real quick, Noah only turning around to give a light smile as his reply came nonchalantly.","\"I’m just beginning the process of assimilating the Universes of the Primordial Cosmos into my Dark Universe. When all of it is done...a new Cosmos should be born.\"","RUMBLE!","In a nonchalant manner, Noah said this as his figure disappeared a second later!","Valentina looked towards the area he disappeared from in a stupor as this Hegemony had to repeat his words over and over again just to try and comprehend what he meant.","\"Did he just say...assimilate the Primordial Cosmos?\"","She spoke out in disbelief and near her, the vivacious figure of Barbatos glanced towards Valentina while shaking her head, her sonorous voice ringing out.","\"Just sit back and enjoy the show. I told you before...don’t try to understand what this guy is doing or how he does it, you’ll sleep much better at night!\"","...!","The figures of Adelaide, Kazuhiko, Steel Mikhail, Emperor Penguin...a myriad of beings familiar with Noah nodded their heads at Barbatos’s words in agreement as Valentina looked back and forth from them as if they were crazy.","This guy just said he was going to assimilate a Cosmos? Why was everyone taking it with such easy strides?! Such a thing shouldn’t even be possible!","But no matter the possibility of it or not...even as some of his own people were left flabbergasted, Noah proceeded forward as the figure of his main body with the Cosmic Treasure RUINATION appeared at the deepest parts of the Universal Core.","Here, dense amounts of Ruination Essence freely pulsed and undulated as this was the essence that kept this Universe together, being directly replenished by the Ruination Sea outside as it was a nigh endless source of energy!","Within this innermost area of the Universal Core, Noah sat down in a meditative position as his Cosmic Treasure began to pulse wondrously, resonating with the Universal Core as everything began to vibrate.","This was because at this moment, Noah was initializing the feature of [Assimilation] as the Dark Universe neared the boundary of the Primordial Cosmos!","He was accounting for many things to their utmost as with the Dark Universe already near the Cosmos, it reached its boundaries within seconds as the Universe closest to it...was the Microbial Universe.","If one could accurately portray what was occurring in the Ruination Sea, it would be akin to a single pulsating circular mass coming close to a coagulation of circular masses closely interconnected together and wrapped up by a single powerful circular barrier!","A single circle...approaching and about to come in contact with a myriad of circles enclosed in a single larger one that represented the boundaries of multiple Universes and the boundary that surrounded them that made up a Cosmos!","A hidden light of gold and blue mixed in with red began to shine out from the core of this single pulsating circular mass as Noah and the Universal Core were the origin of it, this being the light of the feature of Assimilation that could fuse things of similar nature to the Dark Universe.","To observe everything carefully and make sure that nothing was out of place, Noah had his main body with the Cosmic Treasure overseeing things from the end of the Dark Universe, and the Primordial Ruination Clone in the depths of the Primordial Cosmos that could only be entered with another Cosmic Treasure.","After all of this was in place...Noah’s eyes in the depths of the Universal Core breathed out calmly as he spoke out.","\"Let it begin then.\"","RUUMBLE!","The boundary of the Dark Universe came in contact with the thin transparent boundary of the Primordial Cosmos.","This boundary...did not repulse or stop the advancement of the Dark Universe as it actually allowed it to go through- and this was only because Noah had talked to the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos as it allowed for this!","This meant that the boundary of the Dark Universe came in contact with and smashed into the boundary of the Microbial Universe as at their point of impact...a glorious light suffused between them.","It was the light that held the colors of gold, blue, and red as it shone in a fantastical manner, this light having wrapped around the entirety of the Dark Universe as at this moment...it was spread to cover the boundary of the Microbial Universe as well!","It was the glorious light of Assimilation that meant the fusion of a myriad of Universes was now starting!","THRUM!"]},{"number":1130,"title":"Chapter 1130: Chapter 1129 - The Glorious Light Of Assimilation! II","paragraphs":["Noah observed all of this closely with all of his bodies as there was a terrifying thought in his mind as he was looking at the grand process about to begin.","As he looked at the Dark Universe begin to assimilate a portion of the Primordial Cosmos, Noah thought of the future.","He thought of this Primordial Cosmos before him, and the myriad of Cosmos within this branch of reality that lay out there in the Ruination Sea.","He was about to assimilate and bind the Primordial Cosmos to him as his thoughts actually also veered towards the other Cosmos within the vast Ruination Sea. He...actually began to have the grand designs of even possibly binding these Cosmos to him!","If he could assimilate the Cosmos across the vast Ruination Sea, every single one of them at that...would it be possible for him to bind this whole branching reality? This whole Dimension?!","RUMBLE!","The thought even caused his own heart to tremble at the sheer grandness of it, and it also expressed immense possible danger as if he did such a thing, it would mean he would be encroaching on the dominion of the Primordials as they were the ones that benefitted from spreading their influence across branching realities.","He would be making himself an enemy of existence that had live for who knew how many years and had so much power to even allow what was currently happening possible!","But the prospects of it...Noah couldn’t help but think of this over and over again.","Not just the myriad of Cosmos within this branching reality, but what of the innumerable number of realities out there? What of the Original reality that all of this stemmed from?!","’Bind this Primordial Cosmos, then the myriad of other Cosmos, then this branching reality, and then...the myriad of infinite realities out there...!’","THUMP!","His heart and origin released a terrifying beat as such a thought crossed his mind, Noah shaking himself out of his stupor as he breathed out slowly.","’Slow down. Slow down.’","Every breath caused his beating heart to settle, his eyes becoming sharp as he tucked away shocking thoughts into the back of his mind and focused on the task ahead of him.","His main body had the Cosmic Treasure spinning beautifully as the Universal Core was the one putting in all the work, Noah acting as a conduit as he provided any additionally needed mana to facilitate the process that had ensued in full!","After the light of Assimilation touched the Microbial Universe, its boundary began to fade away at a rapid pace as the gold, blue, and crimson light went on to serenely cover it and cause the layers of this Universe to merge with the Dark Universe.","The first step was always the hardest, but when it succeeded...","RUUMBLE!","Everything else would fall into place.","The Universal Core vibrated as it began to expand rapidly, its deepest corners that held dense amounts of Ruination Essence at this moment actually brightening up as within it...Primordial Essence began to flow out!","When Noah changed the nature of the Dark Universe, there was barely any Primordial Essence left as it was easy to change its source to Ruination Essence.","But the Universes of the Primordial Cosmos he wanted to absorb had dense amounts of Primordial Essence supporting and surrounding them as in the process of Assimilation...the Universal Core would be bathed with Primordial Essence!","A mixture of Ruination and Primordial Essence.","A mixture of something unknown as it wasn’t a process carried out before, even causing Noah to observe it closely as his Primordial Ruination Clone wanted to understand the true nature of the Primordial Essence that sustained the Primordial Cosmos and all of the Universes within it for all these years, this clone staring this question to the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos as they observed the nigh complete successful assimilation of the first Universe.","\"The Primordial Essence that sustains these Cosmos and its Universes...just where is it all coming from?\"","...!","A stupendous question that deserved an answer!","There was the vast and endless Ruination Sea that surrounded all the Cosmos, so one would wonder exactly how Cosmos could protect themselves indefinitely and sustain a myriad of Universes.","<All Cosmos have a unique access into the endless Primordial Sea hidden somewhere within our Reality. It is this sea that can cause the induction of new Cosmos...and it this that makes it possible for Cosmos to freely float within the Ruination Sea.>","The ancient consciousness replied in a monotone fashion as magisterial bundles of information were released.","Noah took in all of this information and added it to what he already knew as he still needed to know more!","\"The changed nature of a Universe to be sustained by Ruination Essence hasn’t appeared before, much less for this Universe to begin assimilating other Universes that are sustained by Primordial Essence. I’m currently observing the changes right now but, it seems like the two essences are...harmoniously swimming around each other!\"","RUMBLE!","<...>","His words talked of an impossible thing as even the ancient consciousness took a second before its words came out.","<There is no deviation to the process of Assimilation as of right now, the Microbial Universe should be fully fused.>","...","Yes! At this moment, the barrier separating the Microbial Universe from the Dark Universe entirely faded as it was akin to a big circle swallowing a smaller one, all of the contents within the smaller circle falling into the bigger one as the Dark Universe now contained the billions of Galaxies that were with the Microbial Universe!","Its core reflected this change as it was pulsating and shaking madly, expanding at a rapid pace as the more pressing thing was something that both Noah and the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos was paying attention to.","It was the flood of Primordial Essence that had begun to permeate throughout the Universal Core that was now supporting not a single Universe, and it could instead be considered a Universal Cluster!","Amidst the dense reserves of Ruination Essence that was supporting the past Dark Universe, pristine white Primordial Essence began to permeate throughout as it caused both Noah and the consciousness of the Primal Cosmos to pay attention to this!"]},{"number":1131,"title":"Chapter 1131: Chapter 1130 - A Cosmos Bound To Me! I","paragraphs":["Elements that were of opposition nature were now swimming together peacefully in the Universal Core.","It reminded Noah of the powerful Primordial that had descended down not too long ago, this being commanding Primordial and Ruination essence with ease as one would wonder if they had entirely comprehended or assimilated these two Cosmic Daos!","Noah was observing such a scene occurring with the Universal Core right now as after the successful assimilation with the Microbial Universe, its inner depth had the vast reserves of Primordial Essence that this Universe used to have.","This Microbial Universe was actually very crucial as it now held a connection between both Noah’s Universal Core and the Primordial Cosmos, making the next few steps extremely easy as it was like a chain reaction!","It was akin to dominoes falling as after the light of Assimilation covered the Microbial Universe and fused its boundaries with the Dark Universe completely, this light traveled at an even faster pace as it bathed the Necrotic and Euthenia Universes next.","THRUM!","Noah felt his Origin pulse with gorgeous light as more and more mana was drained from him to support the terrifying levels of expenditure currently taking place.","<It’s not a fusion of the two essences...but they are respecting and flowing amidst each other.>","The voice of the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos came out curiously as Noah also nodded, this being their verdict when they looked at the very center of the Universal Core where the two different types of essences were flowing together beautifully!","\"Their activity is actually enhanced every time they cross paths...it is a positive feedback effect!\"","But as the Master of the Universal Core, Noah was able to notice the minute differences within it as when he observed Ruination and Primordial Essence together, he saw that the two complimented each other as their opposing nature’s allowed the power of each of them to be enhanced as they fought for dominance.","All in all...it just meant that the currently changing Universal Core was becoming much stronger and vibrant as the Assimilation of the Universes continued!","After the light of Assimilation covered the Necrotic and Euthenia Universes, the boundaries of these Universes fell apart soon after as their contents became connected to the Dark Universe. The Light of Assimilation was relentless as it continued further on into the Animus and then Automaton Universe, the process actually becoming faster and faster!","It felt like a well-oiled machine working at a rapid pace as its processing only became more vibrant, with Noah being the one to feel the most changes intimately as he could count every Universe that was being assimilated.","These actions...also had their consequences as what was currently happening was under Noah’s instructions, with his authority actually being placed over multiple Universes every time that one was fully assimilated!","The ones that he already emptied out might not grant him a whole lot, but there were multiple other Universes within the Primordial Cosmos that Noah hadn’t even been to that were filled with countless quintillions of creatures.","The number of Marks of Antiquity he would receive when he assimilated the Universes of all of these beings and then the entire Primordial Cosmos, not to mention when he utilized his Dao of Fealty to have them even more closely interconnected with him...the rewards were bound to be bountiful as Noah would able to birth who knew how many more Splendiferous Universes!","---","As Noah carried out shocking actions in a corner of the Ruination Sea, many things were occurring elsewhere.","In a unique expanse of space that held vast clusters of swirling storms of Ruination and Primordial Essence.","The veiled figure of a certain existence that Noah and the others had seen not too long ago could actually be seen floating peacefully across such a dangerous region!","Her right hand was outstretched as one could actually see a fair palm coming out, this palm currently having an illusory figure of none other than Noah spinning on top of it!","\"I felt the shockwaves of your destiny ripple across the Ruination Sea as you actually obtained my attention...\"","WAA!","Her voice was extremely apathetic and as unemotional as it could be.","She was speaking to no particular being as this shocking Primordial moved across storms of Ruination and Primordial Essence, her voice continuing to ring out.","\"...the question is whether you can actually keep it, little thing.\"","...!","She spoke as Noah’s illusory figure continued to spin on top of her palm, her veiled figure gazing towards a certain direction as if she could peel the layers of space.","\"I thought this branching reality already had a nearly completed champion that could defend it against any Primordial Beasts that arose...but this is certainly interesting.\"","Interesting! This was the only reason why this being had given Noah the Primordial Heart- because she thought he was an interesting variable to appear within this branching reality!","Within this branching reality, he wasn’t even a champion as such a being had already been rising in a distant Cosmos, Noah’s existence piquing the interest of the Primordial in this manner.","\"The little Aegon of this reality is almost capable of completely withstanding against a Grand Primordial Beast...I should pay him another visit soon. As soon as he is completed, I can leave behind this reality and delve into the next one!\"","RUMBLE!","Her soliloquy contained shocking amounts of information, this Primordial waving her other hand as within it, the image of a valiant man with sharp eyes could be seen, this being the existence she referred to when she spoke about Aegon.","\"The Primordial and Ruination Seas hold countless secrets and unfathomable possibilities...so let us see what your limits will be, little thing.\"","...!","With these words, she seemed to have arrived at her destination as she waved her palm and caused both illusory figures to disappear, her gaze on a pulsing Rift that trembled with unstable Primordial and Ruination essence up ahead.","Without so much as a pause, her figure delved into it as she instantly disappeared!","So the tides of destiny continued to churn.","The vast and endless Sea of Ruination ebbed and flowed relentlessly as they held within them endless possibilities!"]},{"number":1132,"title":"Chapter 1132: Chapter 1131 - A Cosmos Bound To Me! II","paragraphs":["At the depths of the Universal Core, Noah had no knowledge of the movements of other beings as he was fully focused on the task at hand!","Currently, his main body was pulsing with immense light as he released droves of mana outwards, and there were clusters of millions of Marks of Antiquity that had begun to form around him as they descended endlessly.","The rewards of the Assimilation of Universes had already begun as the process was currently occurring at a rapid speed, a Universe becoming covered by the light of Assimilation every few seconds as they were dissociating their boundaries and becoming linked with the Dark Universe quickly!","The 9 Universes that were affected by the Universal Amalgamation were the first as after that, the light of Assimilation began to cover Universes that even Noah hadn’t had the chances to fully explore yet.","The Cerulean Universe where an old enemy came from.","The Light Universe, The Stone Universe...the dozens of Universes that could fill up the requirements and allow a cluster of Universes coming together to be called a Cosmos were all gradually becoming covered by the light of Assimilation as their nature was being changed, coming in contact with Ruination Essence as their centers were shifted to all join the Universal Core of the Dark Universe!","The effects of such actions were stupendous as the Hegemonies within all of these Universes looked at what was occurring in shock, but they didn’t have to wonder of what was going on for too long as from their Wings of Primordial Destiny, the somber voice of the Oathkeeper came out.","\"The Primordial Cosmos is undergoing a change currently. Do not try to interfere!\"","...!","A statement that seemed very overbearing, but the Hegemonies had seen Oathkeeper’s rise to Antiquity in the Abyssal Universe as they could only nod to his words.","In a short period of time, all of the Universes of the Primordial Cosmos were covered with the light of Assimilation as their boundaries fused with the Dark Universe, only a thin line remaining between each of the Universes to distinguish them as at this moment...the entire Primordial Cosmos was nearly connected to the Dark Universe.","There were 52 Universes within the Primordial Cosmos, this number actually being a fairly small one when one looked at a Cosmos!","Now, all of them were bound to the Dark Universe as one key factor remained.","That last remaining factor...was the very core of the Primordial Cosmos that supplied Primordial Essence to all Universes.","<It seems like it is time.>","An ancient voice reverberated out in the roiling Primordial Sea that Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone and Oathkeeper were in.","Noah nodded his head with shining eyes as even though the core of the Primordial Cosmos was hidden within layers of space in unreachable depths...he could sense its location at this moment as he made a move to allow another consciousness to go towards it!","RUMBLE","From the pristine white Primordial Essence around them, a point of red began to bloom and permeate outwards.","This blooming red Ruination Essense brought with it a terrifying consciousness, and it was the consciousness of the Universal Construct under Noah’s control!","The Universe that aspired to be a Cosmos was right now standing at the cusp of it as it just had to complete the final process and merge with the core of the Primordial Cosmos...completing its goals in an efficient and stupendous manner!","<For survival.>","The ancient consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos spoke out as it stated the main reason behind its actions and acceptance of what was currently occurring.","But the consciousness of the Universal Filament Core that was about to become a Cosmic Core said something entirely different.","<For power.>","WAA!","For power! The consciousness reflected its Master’s thoughts as its intent was made clear, the Ruination Sea blooming out vigorously to fill the space they were in as a grand light began to shine out!","It was the light of two consciousnesses merging, a light of Ruination and Primordial Essence coming together!","Even though they were entirely opposed, they swirled around each other in an interconnected manner as the result of it left Noah and the Oathkeeper with a sight they wouldn’t be able to forget for the rest of their lives.","As all of this occurred, Noah’s main body was almost overwhelmed by the vast amounts of Marks of Antiquity rushing onto him, the number having long since passed billions every second as the effect of coming under the control of 52 new Universes and being on the cusp of being under the control of a Cosmos were too stupendous!","The number of Marks of Antiquity had actually toppled 148 Billion at this moment as they were enough to birth another Splendiferous Universe, but they continued to come relentlessly.","Mind you...Noah hadn’t yet used his Dao of Fealty on the other Universes he had yet to visit!","His vast seas of fortune and destiny were churning crazily as the actions he had done were truly too significant, carrying a level of importance that even Noah did not fully comprehend.","Never before had a Cosmos come under the control of a being.","Never before had a Cosmos been turned into a movable unique treasure that could do a great deal of things!","Never before could a single existence like Noah close his eyes as at this moment...he could feel the over 50 Universes releasing powerful glows as they were all connected together towards a single core.","They held thin barriers to distinguish them as it was still a myriad of circles clustered together to form a Cosmos, but a shining light was bathing all of these Universes as they were prepared to become capable of carrying out the features of Noah’s unique treasure!","Noah was nearly overwhelmed with the boundless information coming in, but this was when he heard the voice he was used to hearing for many times in the past months reverberate in his mind.","<The merging with the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos was a success>","A voice akin to Noah’s Universal Core...but different.","<The Universal Core has been upgraded to a Cosmic Core as many features have been enhanced and unlocked>","A glorious new reality was born!","Not a Universe or Universal Filament....but a Cosmos!","THUMP!","Noah felt his heart beat as he couldn’t help but magisterially call out, his eyes releasing glorious rays of golden light.","\"My Cosmos...\""]},{"number":1133,"title":"Chapter 1133: Chapter 1132 - My Infinite Cosmos! I","paragraphs":["An array of golden Marks of Antiquity continued to rain down as they had long since surpassed 400 Billion, such a number seeming wild just a few days ago as Noah was struggling to accumulate even tens of billions for his Dao Galaxies.","Yet they now freely flowed unto him as the actions of turning an entire Primordial Cosmos into a treasure were that shocking, his actions inexplicably changing the lives of all existences living within it even though they had yet to pledge Fealty!","He didn’t know if the Marks of Antiquity would be reduced or stay at the same levels when he carried out mass calls for Fealty, but this was something that actually had to be pushed in the far reaches of his mind that was currently being overwhelmed with information.","Glorious information of the results of his actions as at this moment, Noah’s connection to the Cosmic Core allowed him to feel the smooth assimilation of all the 53 Universes within it as they melded together like pieces of a puzzle!","The feeling one would have when their consciousness could \"feel\" the vastness of multiple Universes- and entire Cosmos at that, such a feeling was hard to describe as even Noah couldn’t put the words for it at this moment.","What he could put words on though...were the constant and increasing bundles of information that he was receiving from the Cosmic Core.","The only word to describe them was...magisterial!","<All previous features are enhanced as the features of Universal Empowerment, and Universal Singularity are unlocked.>","These words were preceded by bundles of information for all the changes, Noah having to go through them one by one as his eyes landed on the skill that used to be known as Spiritual Land Management...but it was now termed Cosmic Core Management!","{Cosmic Core Management}","[Cosmic Core]","Beasts: F-XXX, E-XXX, D-XXX, C-XXX, B-XXX, A-XXX, S-XXX, EPIC-XXX, LEGENDARY-XXX, MYTHICAL-XXX, PHANTASMAL-XXX, TRANSCENDENT-XXX, SAINT- XXX, VOID- XXX, SOUL-XXX, DOMAIN- XXX, WORLD-XXX, STAR FORGING- XXX, NEBULA- XXX, BLACK HOLE- XXXX, QUASAR- XXXX, GALAXY-835,395,395,384, GALACTIC FILAMENT-89,075,958, UNIVERSE-169, UNIVERSAL FILAMENT- 3","Plants- Whitefall Trees, Snow Vine, Sacred Rye, Pigmy Melon, Ice-fire Persimmon, Ice Phoenix Fruits, Spirit of the Arctic, Frozen Angelica, Regal Flora, Qilin’s Cold Stone, Resonant Okra, Arctic Flora, King’s Collard, Athramire, Phantom Mulberry, Fire Starter, Frigid Apple, Fate’s Orchard, Chaotic Amaranth, Aether Infused Willow, Immemorial Dragon Fruits, Mythical Fruit of Life, Fruit of Destiny. Available for planting (Annihilatory Dorians, Tenebrous Tea Leaves, Seeds of Time...Primordial Apples, Strawberries of Ruination)","Features- Size Regulation(Unlocked), Movement(Unlocked), Anchor(Unlocked), Boost Surroundings(Unlocked), Architecture(Unlocked), Frozen Barrier(Unlocked), Offensive Maneuvers(Unlocked), Time Dilation(Unlocked), Treasure Hunter (Unlocked), Interstellar Travel(Unlocked), Law Space(Unlocked), Blacksmith’s Forge(Unlocked), Division(Unlocked), Alchemy Hall(Unlocked), Library(Unlocked), World Integration(Unlocked), Universe Gateway(Unlocked), Pocket Universe (Unlocked), Assimilation(Unlocked), Trait Blessing(Unlocked), Dao Birth(Unlocked), Universal Empowerment(Unlocked), Universal Singularity (Unlocked)...#^$%#(Locked)","[Upgrade Conditions- Unknown]","\"...\"","There were a great deal of things to unpack on the sheer possibilities that could unfold from the Cosmos that Noah had bound himself to at this moment.","He had to get through it in stages as first and foremost...were that he could now plant and harvest things like Seeds of Chronos, Primordial Apples, and Ruination Strawberries!","[Primordial Apples] :: A type of unique fruit elixir only capable of being planted in a Primordial Dao Space. Capable of infusing intestate Primordial Essence into the body as it acts as the ultimate elixir to cure all status effects and fully rejuvenates the mana and health of even a Universal Realm existence. Even though it is due to chance that infinitely nears 0%, when Primordial Apples are eaten and in large amounts, there lies a possibility of gaining Comprehension in the Primordial Dao. Those already comprehending the Dao gain increased Comprehension and Assimilation when Primordial Apples are eaten...","\"...\"","This was an example of the description that Noah read under these brand new plantable plants, this description also revealing the fact that Noah could now enact Primordial Dao Spaces and Ruination Dao Spaces within the Cosmos!","He could actually designate entire areas to be filled with the essence of these 2 supreme Cosmic Daos as only only them could he plant ridiculous fruits.","That wasn’t all as from the description, it also detailed that there lay a miniscule chance to gain Comprehension within the Cosmic Daos...and that one could gain increased Comprehension and Assimilation when they devoured these fruits! Noah was focusing on the Ruination Strawberries for this as he nearly laughed at the fact that he was given another method to increase the ridiculously slow pace of comprehending these Cosmic Daos.","He would make a grand campaign to plant all of these fruits and herbs that dealt with a myriad of the Daos he was working on as he made sure to comprehend and assimilate them at speeds that would even shock Antiquitys!","This was just the farming portion of the upgrades that almost wanted to make Noah live a different life and become a farmer that became crazily overpowered just from eating the things he planted and harvested...","The Size Regulation and Movement features were enhanced just like all the others, still allowing Noah to reduce or expand the size of the Cosmos somewhat and move with it, but he wouldn’t be able to reduce such an object that was who knew how many light years in diameter in terms of human prospects!","He might be able to compress and expand the Cosmos to a few light years or even possible millions of miles, where he would need to have his body grow larger than Galaxies for his dream of holding a Cosmos within his hands could be accomplished.","Can one imagine the sight? Being capable of moving across the vast Ruination Sea while holding an entire Cosmos in one’s hands?!","\"Ah...\"","It was a magisterial sight that Noah would do anything to bring to fruition, even if it was to just satisfy his heart!"]},{"number":1134,"title":"Chapter 1134: Chapter 1133 - My Infinite Cosmos! II","paragraphs":["Aside from the many other features, [Blacksmith’s Forge] and [Alchemy Hall] had many more terrifying weapons and concoctions they could make, with Dao Weapons filled with Ruination and Primordial Essence being a piece of cake to forge and pills or bombs from the same of such essence being capable of being formed in the Alchemy Hall!","But Noah’s eyes breezed past all of this as he arrived at [Dao Birth] ability that was one of the ones to change the most.","When Noah first had his Universal Core formed with the Dark Universe, the feature had the following description!","<Dao Birth> :: Dao Birth is normally an ability that only those in the Universal Realm can have a chance of utilizing. Such an ability holds the secrets on how to surpass the Universal Realm to reach the state of ●●●●● ●●●●●. After coming into control of a Universal Core, Noah Osmont can utilize this feature to Birth a limited number of Daos of his own making. Dao Spaces of already utilized Daos can also be established within the Universal Core. Currently possible Daos : 3 Lesser.","Now that the Universal Core had become a Cosmos, this feature had vastly different content!","<Dao Birth> :: Dao Birth is normally an ability that only those in the Universal Realm can have a chance of utilizing. Such an ability holds the secrets on how to surpass the Universal Realm to reach the state of Nirvanic Antiquity. After upgrading to a Cosmic Core, Noah Osmont can utilize this feature to Birth a limited number of Daos of his own making. Previously designed Daos can also be enhanced to higher levels. Currently possible Daos : 9 Lesser, 6 Grand, 3 Cosmic. The design of Cosmic Daos faces strict limitations and possibilities, be careful in its utilization.","Yes!","Cosmic Daos could now be designed!","Not just that, but the number of lesser daos he could design increased to 9 as he could also design 6 Grand Daos!","\"...!\"","Even Noah raised his eyes in alarm at such a thing as he had to know its limits.","\"The design of Cosmic Daos...\"","<Anything like the Cosmic Daos of Annihilation or even the slightly higher tier ones like Chronos and Extinction can be designed. Cosmic Daos at the level of Ruination or the Primordial Dao are not capable of being designed at this moment.>","The voice of the Cosmic Core that was a mix of his past Universal Core and the consciousness of the Primordial Cosmos rang out as Noah’s eyes shone with glorious light when he heard them!","He was particularly interested in three words as he had to repeat them.","\"At this moment?\"","<At this moment.>","RUMBLE!","A devilish smile couldn’t help but form on Noah’s face at this confirmation. He couldn’t do such a thing now, but there lay a possibility for him to later be capable of designing Daos that made for the very structure of the reality he was in!","\"But...\"","His eyes went back to the interface that showed the number of Daos he could design as he had to be content with what he could currently do.","3 Cosmic Daos and 6 Grand ones, along with 9 Lesser.","He could choose to bring any of his 3 Lesser Daos to the Cosmic Level, or simply advance them to the Grand level and design entirely new different Cosmic Daos!","The Lesser Daos of Subterfuge, Fealty, and Conquest each had their own strength, but Noah could definitively say that when it came to usage and importance currently, Fealty and Conquest were at the very top.","He was using Fealty to constantly expand and gorge connections with quintillions of beings at a very close level as it granted him an overabundance of Marks of Antiquity, and the Lesser Dao of Conquest effectively quadrupled his strength among other things within the Cosmos under him.","He saw himself definitely enhancing these two to the level of Grand Daos, but the question of enhancing or designing Cosmic Daos...that was something to give a whole lot more thought to!","This was something virtually no Hegemonies or Antiquities could do, with Noah possibly thinking that maybe someone at the Cosmic level could do such a thing, or even possibly the Primordials.","Now...he could do this too as the possibilities were too stupendous!","\"And then...\"","Then there were the two new features after the Universal Core was elevated past a Universal Filament Core to a Cosmic Core all at once.","Noah’s eyes gazed upon these two new features with an expression that seemed to already be imagining what their effects would be!","[Universal Singularity] :: It starts with a Singularity. A point of an unknown density and gravity as from it...a Universe can be born. This ability allows the Cosmic Core to use the vital Ruination and Primordial Essence of the Cosmos to cause the emergence of a new Universe. Since Primordial Essence has always been the main contributor for the emergence of Universes, any Universes designed through this feature will be under the dual Enhancement of Ruination and Primordial Essence.","[Universal Empowerment] :: Selected Universes can be empowered as their concentration of Atmospheric Essence, Dao and Law Essences, Golden Destiny, and Universal Fortune are increased by 10,000%. Existences living under such conditions will find themselves ascending through Realms of Power faster as the tides of fortune and destiny veer towards their direction.","Two brand new features!","The stupendous effects of Universal Empowerment aside, there was the feature of Universal Singularity.","A feature that allowed the Cosmos to use Vital Ruination and Primordial Essence to cause the emergence of an entirely new Universe!","\"Vital Essence?\"","Noah couldn’t help but find himself asking the enormous consciousness he was connected to.","<The purest form of Essence that a Cosmos builds up over time. The reserves that the Primordial Cosmos had over the years are large for the Primordial Essence, but the available vital Ruination Essence will only allow for the emergence of 1 or two Universes at most currently.>","Essence to allow for the emergence of more Universes!","As he got to this point, Noah’s eyes found that they couldn’t help but keep on staring at the feature of [Universal Singularity].","Just....just how glorious would such a scene be to witness?!"]},{"number":1135,"title":"Chapter 1135: Chapter 1134 - My Infinite Cosmos! III","paragraphs":["Since the merging of the old Primordial Cosmos and Noah’s Universal Construct had just occurred, the vital essence for both Ruination and Primordial Essence was extremely low. It was only enough for the emergence of one or two Universes.","When Noah got to this point in his thought process, he actually had to come to a stop for a second just to take in what it truly meant.","He had actually arrived at a stage in his life where he was actually looking at the prospects of using a unique treasure to watch the emergence of an entire Universe!","A treasure that was found on a small world in the Novus Galaxy. A treasure that stemmed from a floating landmass. From a mere Spiritual Land...now, it was a Cosmos capable of causing the emergence of Universes!","With all the new features that had just been opened up and the myriad of possibilities laying in front of Noah, he wanted to experience the emergence of a Universe among the first set of things. This included the design of new Cosmic and Grand daos, the mass spread of fealty across the Cosmos, restructuring and visiting the unseen Universes, farming fruits such as Ruination Strawberries and Primordial Apples...","He truly did have too many things to delve through, his main body alone being besieged on all sides by Marks of Antiquity that had now surpassed 500 Billion after the completion of the merging of the Cosmos! Currently, Noah had 2 normal Universes and a third one that barely had over 10 Billion Galaxies within it aside from his first Splendiferous Universe.","The number of Marks of Antiquity he held meant he could change the nature of his remaining normal Universes into a Splendiferous Universe as with nothing to stop him, he allowed the Marks to flow into his billions of Galaxies and change them into Dao Galaxies right away!","THRUM!","The glorious Origin that had begun establishing its universes trembled with might as the marks sank in with ease, billions of galaxies becoming changed every single second as in a short period of time, Noah’s second Universe glimmered with an array of rainbow colored lights- a second Splendiferous Universe being born.","A few moments later, the third universe also shone with an array of colors as it shone gorgeously, 200 Billion Marks of Antiquity being used in a matter of seconds as the fourth universe that held only 10 Billion Galaxies were also changed into Dao Galaxies!","So just hours into Noah becoming an Antiquity by stepping into the Universal Filament Realm, all of his Universes were Splendiferous Universes as he even had reserves of Marks of Antiquity he couldn’t utilize because of the fact that he didn’t have any galaxies to apply them to!","If other Antiquities knew this, they would bellow in anger and unfairness as it was good Noah didn’t brag, or one wouldn’t know what the Blue Slime and Oathkeeper would think when they realized just how much further ahead Noah had pulled himself in the short period of time.","\"Just ridiculous...\"","Deep within the Cosmic Core, Noah looked at his own hands and body after arriving at this stage, sensing the profound level of power as he could hardly believe it even now. He could quite literally wield the strength of multiple Universes as the might of this was enough to cause one’s brain to buzz in confusion if ever they tried to understand this concept of strength.","But for Noah...he just wanted to see how much further he could take it as he put everything else aside and gazed over a certain direction, his body beginning to bubble with essence as he disappeared into the folds of space!","He was currently utilizing the pure strength of his body alone, weaving into the folds of space of the Cosmic Core and the Universes around it as it was like opening wormholes in one area and appearing out of another.","This was the concept of entering the folds of space as depending on how fast one could move in these folded spaces, they could cover large distances in a short period of time! With Noah’s current strength, he stepped out of the Cosmic Core with one step as he entered the Liberated Universe.","With another step, his figure disappeared into the folds of space as he appeared in the Animus Universe! With another step, he was in the Microbial Universe as on the fourth step...he actually left the Primordial Cosmos!","\"...\"","Four steps, and he crossed a myriad of Universes and arrived into the Ruination Sea.","THRUM!","Such a level of speed and power caused Noah’s heart to shake in utter joy and excitement as he stepped into the Ruination Sea. His eyes couldn’t help but lock onto the outline of the Microbial Universe he just came out of, his figure beginning to expand in size as he flew further and further away from the Cosmos so he could see all of it with a single glance!","[Size Regulation].","WAA!","A glorious crimson and white glow instantly suffused the Cosmos, Noah beginning to shrink it in size as in the Ruination Sea, his body expanded to grow bigger and bigger as it very soon surpassed millions of miles, seconds later expanding to a few light years as with the usage of immense mana, Noah grew to become a gigantic titan in the Ruination Sea while the Cosmos before him continued to shrink.","\"Stop.\"","It only took a few seconds before he called out lightly, and this one because he had grown to an exaggerated amount in the Ruination Sea as his multicolored eyes could see a glimmering object before his eyes.","It was a collection of transparent circles that pulsed with powerful light, these circles coming together and attaching to each other with unbreakable bonds as they formed into a multicolored and glimmering Cosmos!","The sigh of an entire Cosmos and the Universes within it...Noah could actually see such a magnificent scene with his own eyes as his titanous hands that were light years in size reached out across the roiling Ruination Sea to try and hold on to the Cosmos before him in his very own hands.","As he did this, he uttered out shocking words that foretold his plans for the future!","\"My Infinite Cosmos...\"","...!"]},{"number":1136,"title":"Chapter 1136: Chapter 1135 - My Infinite Cosmos! IV","paragraphs":["Infinite Cosmos!","Such were the words Noah uttered out as gloriously, he took in a miniaturized Cosmos that was still light years in diameter in his very own hands. That was an uncountable trillions of miles...all fitting into his palm as he floated gloriously in the Ruination Sea.","It was an action that was enough to make a being think highly of themselves, an action that might make others think that they had exceeded some boundaries and become untouchable existences that others can only ever aspire to be!","But for Noah...","He only had a light smile while letting himself experience this scene, his thoughts being very different. This was because even as he had arrived at such a juncture, when he thought about the Primordials that controlled entire branches of realities that held who knew how many Cosmos, he knew he couldn’t be arrogant.","He wouldn’t deceive himself to think he had unbeatable power when he had just stepped into the Universal Filament Realm and had yet to explore the vast Ruination Sea.","When he thought of this, his titanous head turned around to look at the vast Ruination Sea around him. It was utterly silent without a single noise, only the constant and roiling essence of ruination flowing around endlessly! When he stared out into the crimson expanse of this sea, a deep sense of foreboding began to fill Noah’s heart as he knew out there within this Sea were terrifying Primordial Beasts as well as Cosmos that had their own terrifying beings!","Who knew when he would run into a Primordial Beast or what its level would be? Would he even be able to handle it if it was a Grand or Cosmic Primordial Beast?","When he arrived at such a thought, his careful eyes glistened with an array of colors as he called out slowly.","\"Save Point.\"","WAA!","A cascade of light glimmered from his body silently as Noah left a mark in the timeline of this reality, a mark that he could return to if anything ever happened in the future!","After this, Noah glanced at the Infinite Cosmos within his hands as he brought it close to his eyes, communicating with the Cosmic Core.","\"Let’s test the birth of new Universes with the utilization of Universal Singularity.\"","<Yes, Master. Initiating the usage of Universal Singularity.>","THRUM!","The glorious Cosmos before him vibrated intensely. It floated before Noah’s eyes as he could see everything clearly, noticing a white and crimson light wash over the 53 Universes within this Cosmos as this light came to coagulate at an empty spot past the Microbial Universe in the Ruination Sea!","This single spot...this point of Singularity, it took form at this moment as an area of infinite density and gravity bloomed, its source stemming from vital Ruination and Primordial Essence.","Noah’s heart shook as he found his eyes were actually nearly blinded when he stared at this point of Singularity. It wasn’t that it was bright, but it seemed to suck in everything around it endlessly!","This point of infinite density and gravity was where matter was compressed down to an infinitely tiny point, and the feature of [Universal Singularity] used precious vital essence to induce this point to release the infinitely compressed matter.","BZZZT!","The Ruination Sea churned as the crimson and white light from the Infinite Cosmos exploded out.","Noah’s eyes released beams of gold and red light as he didn’t even dare to blink, watching the magisterial essence of Ruination and Primordial wrap around the point of Singularity as a second later...this infinitely dense spot expanded out!","BOOOOOM!","An explosive sound akin to a clap of thunder reverberated across the Infinite Cosmos.","Before Noah’s eyes, as if everything was playing in slow motion- he was able to see the point of Singularity expand outwards at an instantaneous rate as he saw billions of unformed stellar bodies unfurl right before his very eyes.","Even though the process was instantaneous, he was able to see its expansion and how in an instant point of time, stellar bodies unfurled as blank stars clustered together in Galaxies appeared!","The blooming of billions of Galaxies as they drew in the Primordial and Ruination essence was a fantastical scene reflected in his eyes as after their formation, they shone with an Incandescence across the entire Universe.","\"...\"","Noah was speechless as he saw the newly formed Universe tightly hug the boundaries of the adjacent Microbial Universe and Omicron Universe, a brand new circular object being added onto the vast Cosmos as its Universes reached 54.","<A Universe was successfully induced to form from a point of Singularity. What shall be its name?>","The voice of the Cosmic Core rang out in his mind as Noah adopted a thoughtful expression.","It was the first Universe he had the chance to see the formation of, his gaze becoming reminiscent as he thought of the name of a certain place he came from.","\"As it is new, let it be termed Novus! The Novus Universe!\"","RUMBLE!","Novus meant new! Novus akin to the past Novus Galaxy that Noah stemmed from! At this moment, the blank Novus Universe was born in the Ruination Sea as it joined the Infinite Cosmos, Noah looking at such a scene with eyes that swirled with many thoughts.","His eyes shone with incandescent lights as his figure began to reduce in size, there still being many things he had to do as he prepared to advance forward and wander across the Ruination Sea!","----","[Noah Osmont(Tyrannical Emperor, Hegemony of Tyranny, Hegemony of Ruination)]","[Origin : UNIVERSAL FILAMENT- 4 Universes(3 Splendiferous Universes, 1 Normal)]","[Title(s): Infernal Lord(Variant), Controller(All Laws), Controller(Fealty, Conquest, Subterfuge...), Antiquity]","[Trait(s) : Infinite Mana & Protagonist]","[Dao(s) : Dao of Withering - 100%, Dao of Summoning - 100%, Dao of Vitality - 100%, Dao of Sword - 100%, Dao of Vastness - 100%, Dao of Space-Time-100%, Dao of Ruination-33%, Dao of Void-Space - 100%, Dao of Alacrity - 100%, Dao of Fortification - 100%, Dao of Devouring - 100%, Dao of Slaughter - 100%, Dao of Destiny - 100%, Dao of Fealty - 100%, Dao of Subterfuge- 100%, Dao of Conquest- 100%, Dao of Annihilation- 27%, Dao of Chronos- 3%]","[Law(s) : Life-100%, Death-100%, Aether- 100%, Karma-100%,Fate-100%,Chaos-100%, Light-100%, Dark-100%, Space-100%, Time-100%, Fire-100%, Water-100%, Earth-100%, Air-100%]","[Domain(s) : Vitality, Devouring, Conquest, Fealty, Subterfuge...Life, Death, Aether, Karma, Fate, Chaos, Light, Dark, Space, Time, Fire, Water, Earth, Air]","[Vitality: UNIVERSAL FILAMENT]","[Focus: ∞ ]","[Strength: UNIVERSAL FILAMENT]","[Authority(s) : Conquest Lord, Subterfuge Lord, Fealty Lord...Life Lord, Death Lord, Aether Lord, Fate Lord, Chaos Lord, Karma Lord, Space Lord, Time Lord, Light Lord, Dark Lord, Flame Lord, Water Lord, Earth Lord]","[Skill Tree(s) : Tyrannical Lich Emperor, Wielder of Chronos<<ENHANCED>>, Absolute Sin<<ENHANCED>>, Bearer of Annihilation, Terror of Aether, Terror of Blood, Ancient Terror, Astral Connector, Blood Lord, Blood Progenitor...]"]},{"number":1137,"title":"Chapter 1137: Chapter 1136 - Antiquity Of Mana! I","paragraphs":["In the vast Ruination Sea.","Far away from Noah observing his Infinite Cosmos, the prominent figure of a certain Primordial that he had come in contact with not too long ago could be seen!","She had crossed untold distances and deadly Ruination and Primordial storms to arrive at a certain location in the Ruination Sea, and she was currently hidden in the folds of the Ruination Sea as she watched a certain spectacle play out with interest.","Her figure was actually located a few trillion miles away, but her eyes crossed this shocking distance to gaze upon a battle that was taking place between two existences.","The battle was something that caused the vast Ruination Seas to churn and tumble as when the Primordial gazed upon it, one couldn’t find any awe or surprise on her veiled expression, but simply a sense of interest!","\"Little Aegon has truly grown up since I first met him. To be handling a Grand Primordial Beast like this...\"","...!","Yes! The Primordial was shockingly watching a battle between an existence that was set to be the champion of an actual reality against a Primordial Beast that could devour entire Cosmos!","RUMBLE!","The Ruination Sea trembled as the figures of the two existences became clear.","One was a valiant looking human, his figure being nothing as such as it towered many light years in size, being larger than any Galaxies based on his form alone! The eyes of this being shone with utter darkness as they seemed like black holes that could draw in all light, his eyes and jaws looking so sharp that they could cut apart those that looked too closely.","His hair was even darker as it draped over his shoulders, giving this being a wild look as this wasn’t the most impressive thing to look at on his body. The most shocking thing was that below the neck of this being...his entire body was glowing like a pristine and sculpted Cosmic Treasure, every single portion of his skin shining beautifully with a rainbow glow of light!","An innumerable number of lines and runic sigils seemed to be revolving on his skin constantly, his body rumbling with power as he even caused the surroundings Ruination Seas to vibrate due to his sheer power.","With his dark eyes and hair cascading down his shoulders and his body glowing with multicolored light, he was the brightest thing in the Ruination Sea for thousands of light years as the enemy he faced...was a Beast that was actually five times his size.","A Beast that eclipsed the sizes of multiple Galaxies as its eyes were filled with an adorned majesty and power, these eyes shimmering a beautiful gold as they reflected the colors of this Beast gloriously! Its entire body was filled with golden white fur that draped over it majestically, this Beast having 5 pairs of white and gold wings erupting on its back as it floated on four legs that glistened gloriously!","The head of this Beast was extremely unique, looking like a mixture of the most pristine dragons and phoenixes as paired with the 5 pairs of white and gold wings, it had an air of inviolable majesty that screamed sacredness and honor! As if this Beast could be the protector of some holy land that graced the lands with love and protection...but this was a Primordial Beast.","A Primordial Beast that devoured entire Universes and Cosmos as they had the goal of erasing all the Cosmos within a branching reality and returning it to the Original Reality!","This Primordial Beast was even termed a Grand one at that, thousands of Splendiferous Universes shining brilliantly on its chest as it stared fearlessly at the titanous human before it. The human stared back with even less fear as the multiple colors all over his body rotated even faster, and one would be able to notice something shocking sparkling on the chest of this being.","There, hidden amidst the brilliance of moving lines and runic circles on his skin, one would be able to see a grandly shimmering Cosmos.","A Cosmos!","Such a being was standing against a Grand Primordial Beast fearlessly, but the more profound thing was that the Primordial Beast didn’t fear him as well! The Beast being in the upper tier of the Universal Filament with thousands of Splendiferous Universes actually didn’t relent when facing against an existence in the Cosmic Realm, and this was due to a truth that very few beings knew that even allowed Grand Primordial Beasts to stand against regular existences in the Cosmic Realm.","It was the terrifying power that all Primordial Beasts were given at their birth that caused them to be so terrifying that normal Antiquities would only find themselves facing death if ever they came across one. It was...","\"Let’s see...this one has already entered its second stage in life as it has complete comprehension and assimilation of both the Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination. Should have already devoured a few cosmos...\"","RUMBLE!","The Primordial watching from afar spoke out with no emotions at the mention of this beast having already devoured a few Cosmos- that was an uncountable number of lives! But her apathetic words contained shocking information about the nature of Primordial Beasts.","At their birth, they either held complete comprehension and assimilation in the Dao of Ruination OR the Primordial Dao.","It was something that even the existences who were lucky enough to comprehend these Daos would struggle to achieve until the Universes within their Origins dried up and they died, and yet they had it at birth!","The complete assimilation of Daos such as these brought about profound strength that would almost make an existence unrivaled across myriad of Cosmos.","Yet this was the first stage of life of Primordial Beasts.","Their second Stage consisted of them gaining the complete assimilation of BOTH Ruination and the Primordial Dao, and this was when they were termed Grand Primordial Beasts.","The third stage of life was truly the most terrifying one, and it was these Primordial Beasts that more often than not accomplished their purposes of returning things to how they once were and destroyed entire branching realities.","The stage that allowed them to be termed Cosmic Primordial Beasts, the Enders of Realities!","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1138,"title":"Chapter 1138: Chapter 1137 - Antiquity Of Mana! II","paragraphs":["Cosmic Primordial Beasts!","Enders of Realities!","Existences that even those in the Cosmic Realm would be hard pressed to fight, existences that more often than not- Primordials had to take care of.","Primordials...or the special and unique champions that they raised across different realities.","The existence that the Primordial was watching wasn’t matching an Ender of Reality, just a Primordial Beast that was a level lower. But if anyone within dozens of Cosmos claimed they could do what this being was doing...they would be lying!","THRUM!","The innumerable colorful lines and runic circles rotating on the skin of the ones known as Aegon thrummed powerfully, his body shining like a treasure as he moved across the Ruination Sea fearlessly.","ROOOAAR!","The Grand Primordial Beast also bellowed out as the Ruination Sea around them fell under its control, its entire body suffused with Primordial and Ruination Essence as it seemed like it could change its entire nature into these very Daos at any second!","SHAA!","A glorious light flashed as the figure of Aegon and the Grand Primordial Beast passed each other.","BOOOM!","A sound akin to a Universe shattering exploded out, golden blood from the Grand Primordial Beast erupting out as two of its wings were actually ripped apart, the golden blood from them still freshly flowing from the hands of the dominantly colored Aegon.","The Ruination and Primordial Essence flowing through this creature couldn’t stop what had just occurred, as Aegon didn’t use any flashy moves and simply utilized his very own hands to somehow rip apart a pair of wings from the terrifying Primordial Beast!","...!","His eyes were without any enthusiasm or happiness as he looked at such a result in utter calm, the angered roars of the Beast not even being registered by him as he moved forward again, the many runic lines and circles moving colorfully across his body being the reason for his shocking power as he moved without any flashy skills to tear apart a Beast with thousands of Splendiferous Universes and completely assimilated Ruination and Primordial Daos.","Just what was the mystery behind his strength? How could he so easily bypass the stupendous might of fully assimilation Ruination and Primordial Daos?!","The mystery would remain unsolved as in the turbid Ruination Sea, golden blood overflowed.","The regal and sacred looking Grand Primordial Beast continued to release shocking power and awe, but it was still being ripped apart endlessly by this single being that had his body shining gloriously with an array of rainbow colored lights!","ROAR!","The cries became weaker and weaker as minutes passed, the Ruination Sea nearby becoming dyed gold as in a short period of time, the weakening roars ultimately ceased.","\"...\"","The majestic figure of the multicolored Aegon shone gloriously in the Ruination Sea, glancing at the lakes of golden blood around him as within his hands, a colorful heart thumped powerfully.","A Grand Primordial Heart pulsed with glorious power while still dripping golden blood, this existence doing something stupefying in the next moment as he opened his mouth and threw this heart into his mouth, golden blood spurting out amidst his chewing!","This Primordial Heart was nothing like the one Noah had received as it was light years in sheer size alone, the stupendous existence actually chewing this heart and devouring it raw as in this process, his sharp eyes gazed towards a certain direction.","A few trillions of miles away in the Ruination Sea, it was the spot where a certain Primordial was watching the events unfold, her veil shaking slightly as she raised her head, a hidden smile appearing that nobody could see as she tore through the Ruination Sea to appear out grandly!","---","As a meeting occurred after a grand battle countless light years away, another one formed in the Microbial Universe of the Infinite Cosmos.","It contained a majority if not all of the Hegemonies that spanned from the 54 Universes, all of them converging here amidst their shock as this was the place where from its boundary, they could see the thin veil of another Universe that had not been here for the millions of years that even the oldest of them had been living in the Primordial Cosmos!","They also gathered here for answers as after Oathkeeper had sent a message for them to not interfere when they sensed changes occurring across many universes, he also told all of them to gather in the Microbial Universe if they wished for answers.","And so they did.","These powerful beings were clustered around each other with somber expressions as they were very aware of what had been occurring the past few minutes, noticing the wondrous light of assimilation that passed through many Universes as well as the appearance of this new Universe.","As for the being responsible? All of them had an inkling of who it was as the Great Old Nazzagath was the first to turn his head from the direction of the newly formed Universe!","WAA!","From there, the figure of a devilishly handsome young man appeared, his brows sharp as his eyes glimmered with a golden and crimson light.","His body released the powerful aura of an Antiquity as Great Old Nazzagath and the other Hegemonies found their Origins shaking when they noticed the manifestation of 4 wondrous Universes, 3 of them being completed Splendiferous Universes that shone with a fantastical glow!","All of the powerhouses of the Infinite Cosmos gazed towards Noah’s figure with a myriad of thoughts as a white crack expanded above each of them soon after, Primordial Essence gushing out of it as the figures of Oathkeeper and Noah’s Primordial Ruination Clone that looked exactly the same as his main body that just stepped out of the newly formed Novus Universe.","Oathkeeper glanced at Noah’s main body and then back to the Primordial Ruination Clone that had been with him all this time in the unique Primordial Sea of the past Primordial Cosmos, this ancient being sighing out slowly as his gaze landed on the Hegemonies of the now Infinite Cosmos.","\"I guess now is a good time as any for introductions.\"","RUMBLE!","The voice of Oathkeeper reverberated out as it carried with it the unique aura of Antiquity, catching the eyes of all Hegemonies as they felt very familiar with Oathkeeper! He was someone they knew very closely as even though he had achieved a grand stage before them, they still saw him as their own.","They paid attention to him as he gazed and pointed towards Noah’s figure that just stepped out of the Novus Universe.","\"You knew him as the Apex Paragon just days ago. He achieved Hegemony in the past day as hours later...he achieved Antiquity.\"","...!","Even though they knew the sequence of events, the Hegemonies still had their Origins tremble in a stupor at this incredible reality being real as they also felt ashamed of themselves for having spent hundreds of thousands if not millions of years in the stage of Hegemonies!","But the Oathkeeper paid no attention to their emotions as this ancient being had already learned many lessons recently, thinking of how to introduce Noah now that he had achieved Antiquity.","He could base it off of the most unique Dao this being comprehended as he introduced him as the Antiquity of Ruination, but the golden eyes of the Oathkeeper shone as he truly thought about another unique feature that he had seen with this being over and over again since the appearance of the Universal Constructs and this whole ordeal!","The unique feature of this being that as a Vassal, he felt very closely at this moment as it had made him overly powerful.","It was the feature of mana!","\"I introduce to you all the being responsible for our current state of affairs, the Antiquity...of Mana!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1139,"title":"Chapter 1139: Chapter 1138 - Comprehending And Assimilating Cosmic Daos Is Easy! I","paragraphs":["Antiquity of Mana!","When the Hegemonies heard this title, they couldn’t help but nod when they recalled the actions of this being the past few days!","Thus, another title was conferred to Noah as the Hegemonies still looked towards him with somber expressions, a hint of carefulness and fear hiding deep within their hearts at this being’s power.","Achieving Antiquity just hours after becoming a Hegemony! What a concept this was to wrap one’s head around. The sheer meaning behind it caused the Hegemonies of the Infinite Cosmos to be extremely wary of his power!","But with this introduction, Noah smiled lightly as his main body disappeared, the Primordial Ruination Clone being left behind as the unique authority of an Antiquity emanated from him to address everyone here.","\"I’ve gone ahead and taken the liberties to expand my authority over the entire Cosmos...and you all should be able to see the changes that come with this as time passes.\"","THRUM!","Like a bolt of thunder, his words struck down into the hearts of these existences that had lived for hundreds of thousands and millions of years.","Yet he, an existence still in the middle of his 20s...stood above them and delivered such a message!","\"Along with my authority...comes possibilities for you all to achieve even more power, and it is through the method that the Oathkeeper himself has just taken.\"","Noah looked towards the direction of the Oathkeeper who held immeasurable sighs hidden in his ancient face, continuing lightly as he then locked eyes with dozens of Hegemonies.","\"Fealty.\"","RUMBLE","\"In this Infinite Universe...those that will pledge Fealty to me will be able to ascend ranks and obtain power in their wildest dreams! Consider this closely in the next few days as I spread my authority even more closely with the existences across this Cosmos.\"","...!","In a domineering tone, Noah addressed the masses of the most powerful beings of the Cosmos as they did not dare to talk back, his eyes gazing over each of them as he even gave a nod to Great Old Nazzagath whom he had given this same offer to before!","\"There is much to be done, so I’ll be taking my leave first.\"","SHAA!","With a flash of light, Noah disappeared before the eyes of the Hegemonies as they felt like they could somewhat breathe again, their gazes all locking towards Oathkeeper that had the same aura of an Antiquity as the being that just left, only his aura was a few notches lower!","\"Oathkeeper, this Antiquity of Mana...\"","The beings who knew him and his allies that he had been working with for millions of years came forward to take with him as busting discussions erupted about Noah.","Amidst all of this, the powerful aura of an Antiquity didn’t escape the minds of the Hegemonies as after some time, strong voices began to echo out.","\"What shall we now address Oathkeeper as? We cannot keep referring to you with a title from your birthed Dao after you achieve Antiquity...\"","\"Yes! Something to fit your current achievements...\"","THRUM!","As the talks were getting more and more robust, the star form of the Great Old Nazzagath shook as he grabbed the attention of everyone. This old being was nearly as old as Oathkeeper and the Goliath as he knew these beings from a long time ago, his voice echoing out powerfully at this moment.","\"Since Oathkeeper is the only one in our Cosmos to comprehend the Primordial Dao...we can just refer to him as the Primordial Antiquity!\"","...!","Another title was conferred!","The Hegemonies looked at each other as they nodded, their gazes then returning to the Antiquity above them as their eyes were filled with flames of wanting.","Wanting the same realms and power that this being had achieved!","It was this wanting and search for greater power that started off the next Era of the Infinite Cosmos, and also this wanting that caused all the Hegemonies to remember Noah’s words about Fealty!","----","The river of time ebbed ever so slowly forward.","Like this, a bit over a week passed as a great deal of things were accomplished in the Infinite Cosmos.","Grasping onto and accepting the changes was easy for the masses, with Noah going into the Cosmic Core on the first day as he carried out multiple grand actions!","The first was to elevate the Lesser Dao of Fealty to a Grand Dao, and he did this first as he would expand the essence of this Dao across the Cosmos to the uncountable number of Quintillions within it.","The changes were, as always- stupendous!","GRAND [Dao of Fealty] :: A Grand Dao birthed by the Cosmic Core of Noah Osmont. As the Dao Architect, Noah Osmont can comprehend and assimilate the Dao at 10 times the normal speed. The Dao of Fealty allows a being with extensive influence over others to boost their power, with those who swear Fealty and are considered as [Vassals] becoming applicable subordinates under the banner of an Emperor. [Vassals] can access 10% of the total power of their Emperor, with the amount of power they can access being limited by their comprehension and assimilation in the Dao of Fealty. Complete comprehension allows for 15% access, with full Assimilation granting 25% access. The unique abilities, qualities, laws, and Grand Daos of the Emperor can be utilized by the Vassals in a much lower form, with the possibilities Cosmic Daos being utilized by them only becoming a reality if the Dao of Fealty is elevated to the respective Cosmic level. Vassals with more than 50% Comprehension in the Dao of Fealty are given the titles of Barons, those with complete Comprehension being titled Earls, those over 50% Assimilation being titled Dukes, with Vassals standing at complete Assimilation being titled Kings as all of the Titled Vassals are under the banner of their Emperor...","With the advancement to a Grand Dao, the power that his Vassals could access was effectively doubled, and those with complete assimilation of the Dao Of Fealty could utilize 1/4th of his total power!","This...was just the elevation of a single lesser Dao to the Grand level!"]},{"number":1140,"title":"Chapter 1140: Chapter 1139 - Comprehending And Assimilating Cosmic Daos Is Easy! II","paragraphs":["A Grand Dao that would allow his Vassals to utilize 25% of his power when fully assimilated!","But...there were no Dao Crystals or any methods for others to ascend through the Comprehension and Assimilation of a Dao that Noah created not too many days ago, and even now there weren’t any beings that had surpassed the rank of Baron by having more than 50% Comprehension in Fealty.","Another point was that the increased percentage allowed Noah to influence his Vassals at an even deeper level, his vast fortune continuing to expand resplendently as when he released the Grand Dao Essence of Fealty to cover the Infinite Cosmos...","RUUMBLE!","The regal essence of the Emperor calling for Fealty suffused throughout powerfully, an unknown number of Quintillions of existences seeing the prompt that told them if they wished for power...to pay Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor, to the Antiquity of Mana!","The Dao Essence was filled with memories and scenes of Noah’s stupendous authority, most existences throughout the Infinite Cosmos answering the call as they read through the shocking memories within the essence as well as the idea of gaining power.","With the masses pledging their Fealty, Marks of Antiquity had coalesced like never before around Noah as on the first day of the birth of the Infinite Cosmos...it’s Core had released such dense golden light from the Marks of Antiquity converging towards Noah that these rays of gold light had even suffused out of the hidden folds of space and into the outside Universes!","This...was just the first day.","The majority of existences pledged Fealty as the rest would follow for the days and weeks to come, where at the end of it all, the number of Marks of Antiquity that Noah had obtained were a truly obscene amount.","The number..had actually spilled over a trillion as over 1000 Billion Marks of Antiquity were surpassed, the number stabilizing over 1580 Billion- or 1.58 Trillion Marks of Antiquity at the end of the day!","The golden rays of light had gone to wash over countless light years as by the end of it, Noah had enough Marks of Antiquity to bring to fruition over 16 Splendiferous Universes...with the only thing left to do being for him to produce them within his Origin.","Thereafter, Noah also elevated the levels of the Lesser Daos of Subterfuge and Conquest to Grand levels, these Daos gaining a significant boost as well.","GRAND [Dao of Conquest] :: A Grand Dao birthed by the Cosmic Core of Noah Osmont... Conquered lands will always allow the user to quadruple their power while fighting within them, while their strength will always be tripled when they are in the process of Conquest... Full Assimilation of Conquest grants the user the capability to Empower not just Absolute Skills, but any Lesser and Grand Daos they Comprehend, along with their power being quintupled in Conquered Lands and quadrupled while in the process of Conquest...","It was a stupendous enhancement of multiple levels as for Noah who had fully assimilated it, he would always have his power quadrupled under the path of Conquest while having it quintupled whenever he was within conquered lands like the Infinite Cosmos!","This wasn’t to mention the fact that he could now even Empower Grand and Lesser Daos from using the Light of Conquest which after conquering the entire Primordial Cosmos...this Light was burning so brightly within Noah’s Origin and the glorious Star of Conquest above him that it now caused his body to always release a regal white aura constantly.","The base effects and boosts this Dao provided to Noah were above and beyond even some Cosmic Daos like Annihilation, making Noah look at the Dao of Conquest as a possible Dao to turn into a Cosmic one!","If he did, he could then gain the capability to Empower even Cosmic Daos as such a thought made his calculative mind imagine a qualitative leap in strength, especially if he could Empower Daos such as Ruination.","But Noah held off on doing this as of now as the 3 spots for the Cosmic Daos was extremely precious, and only after more deliberation and guidance from his own Dao and Fortune would he go ahead and do this.","The elevation of the Dao of Subterfuge to the Grand level on the other hand didn’t provide as much ridiculous boosts as Fealty or Conquest, only enhancing the capabilities of Subterfuge being seen through as Noah could hide in front of or fool an existence a whole realm above him and have no chance to be discovered!","The elevation of all of the first 3 Daos Noah designed only boosted his strength to another level as he now directed his efforts to see what Cosmic Daos he should produce, and it was during this same period of days that he oversaw the Universes of the Infinite Cosmos while taking up his role as...a farmer.","A farmer! As grand as Noah was, his scale wasn’t small as he devised a plan for him to heavily elevate the Comprehension and Assimilation of his Daos, and this could now be done with ease when utilizing the newly unlocked plants and herbs of the Infinite Cosmos such as Ruination Strawberries and Primordial Apples!","For this, Noah spared no efforts as when he acted, he acted in a major way.","With the help of {Cosmic Core Management}, he could expertly select which areas he wanted to turn into farmlands that would be designated as Dao Spaces, these lands having increased concentrations of specific Dao Essences as Noah would plant their matching fruits and herbs here.","For the area that Noah designated as farmlands where he planted obscene amounts of Seeds of Time, Primordial Apples, Ruination Strawberries...it was an entire Universe.","The blank and newly formed Novus Universe...had all of its tens of billions of Galaxies with all of their stellar bodies turned into cultivation fields and Dao Spaces where he planted a shocking number of fruits that when consumed- they granted an increase in comprehensive and assimilation of their respective Daos!","An entire universe!","The extremely slow paced Cosmic Dao of Ruination and even the Primordial Dao that Noah had yet to learn....when he began eating up the treasured Ruination Strawberries and Primordial Apples, what could they do but submit to him and rise up crazily in proficiency?!"]},{"number":1141,"title":"Chapter 1141: Chapter 1140 - Comprehending And Assimilating Cosmic Daos Is Easy! III","paragraphs":["In the newly emerged Novus Universe.","The figures of multiple important personages could be seen floating in the void of space, all of them situated behind a single being that was surrounded by a few key figures!","The devilishly handsome appearance of Noah could be seen with clarity as he floated at the forefront, his figure suffused with golden and white lights from his overabundance of fortune and light of Conquest.","Around him, the calm and steady figure of the Ice Queen Adelaide could be seen, this Queen being clad in a white dress as she stood the closest to Noah!","Nearby, the figure of Valentina could be seen as she sported an unreadable expression, Barbatos floating beside her lazily as the figures of Anna, Elena, Athena, Kazuhiko, Morgana, the Sword Emperor...it was many of the core beings that stemmed from Noah’s world and Dark Universe.","They had the honor to stand beside the being that released terrifying waves of Authority as further behind them were the figures of Noah’s Summons, each of them showing shimmering Universes manifested within their Origins as with the passing of 7 days...Noah had truly been busy!","With his Realm being higher, Noah could seamlessly bring the Realm of his contracted Animus Summons to the same level through the [Animus Growth Empowerment] ability that if one remembers- it allowed his contracted summons to be brought to the same Realm as the Summoner.","But there was still a limitation to this as when one looked closely at the manifested Universes of Noah’s summons, they would be able to notice they were all normal Universes as they also released the aura of Apocryphal Antiquities!","This was because they didn’t enter the Universal Filament Realm through completing their first Splendiferous Universe, but through Noah breaking them through by force as they didn’t hold a sufficient amount of Marks of Antiquity to have enough Dao Galaxies.","But their life up was still terrifying for others to see as the hearts of the Hegemonies of the past Primordial Cosmos were the most shaken as they looked towards them from the back.","Many existences were currently present within this Novus Universe, with the Oathkeeper standing in front of multiple Hegemonies as they stared in wonder at the sight of Apocryphal Antiquities...and the scene that everyone here was glancing at in front of Noah.","It was the scene of countless Galaxies glimmering brightly, all of them lined up and arranged in neat rows as they covered their sight for innumerable light years all around!","Under the control of the Cosmic Core, the layout of the Novus Universe was changed as all of the Galaxies within it were put together in these neat rows, Noah using these Galaxies as farming fields as he designated all of them into Dao Spaces of different Daos to grow the unique treasure fruits and herbs of the Infinite Cosmos.","As always, the plants had a period of time they had to pass through before they could be harvested, and Noah had gone ahead and reduced tens of years of waiting for sacred fruits like Ruination Strawberries and Primordial Appless into a mere 7 days.","7 days!","Of course, this was only made possible through the skill tree of [Versatile Farmer], Noah utilizing the ability of [Master Farmer] within it and bathing the entire tens of billions of Galaxies within the Novus Universe with a verdant light that caused the planted seeds of a myriad of sacred Dao plants and herbs to quickly sprout and grow until they were now ready to be harvested!","This was why everyone was gathered here!","They were all staring in utter stupor at the sudden increase of Antiquities around Noah, but they also couldn’t hold their amazement at the countless Galaxies lined up around them that shimmered with different lights.","Some shone brightly red as Ruination Strawberries were planted on all the planetary bodies of this Galaxy. Others shone purple as Seeds of Time permeated throughout them, and other Galaxies shone a resplendent white as Primordial Apples filled their planetary bodies.","Their thick essence caused the entire Universe to be suffused with a wondrous glow and atmosphere, the life force of these plants even causing all the races of the Euthenia Universe that was largely plant based to want to live here!","But as everyone stared at the sight before them and at Noah in a stupor, this being at the center of it all spoke as he utilized [Automatic Planting and Harvesting] to pluck all the harvestable fruits of a single Galaxy.","THRUM!","The light of one pristinely white galaxy dimmed slightly as a second later, sparkling Incandescent white apples that shone like the most sacred treasures appeared before everyone in the trillions.","Sacred fruits capable of allowing one to gain increased Comprehension and Assimilation in the Primordial Dao...were actually harvested by the trillions from a single Galaxy!","\"...\"","As Noah looked at such a scene, even he thought he might have gone overboard by planting an entire Universe with such types of Dao Fruits, and he knew they would be nearly endless for him and his subordinates to use as they wished.","But the prerequisite for one to fully enjoy them was to have initial comprehension in the respective Dao!","Noah waved his hands as one of the Primordial Apples landed on his hands, the sacred fruit releasing rays of light as they seemed full of Primordial Essence.","He didn’t have any comprehension in the Primordial Dao...but it didn’t mean such a reality would remain for long as while he held on to the pristine harvested Primordial Apple and under the gazes of many beings, Noah’s devilish smile could be seen as he uttered out.","\"Shower me with Primordial Essence!\"","RUMBLE","He voiced out as it was akin to a command, the space above his figure splitting apart as the Cosmic Core heeded his command and began to release boundless waves of Primordial Essence unto Noah!","As for the reason why?","It was of course, for the skill of [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence] that in the period of 7 days, it had finished its cool down and was ready to be used.","The first time he used it, he obtained the Cosmic Dao of Chronos. Now, he was using it again to obtain the Primordial Dao that only a single other being was capable of comprehending in the whole of Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":1142,"title":"Chapter 1142: Chapter 1141 - Comprehending And Assimilating Cosmic Daos Is Easy! IV","paragraphs":["’This...’","The Great Old Nazzagath had his Chthonian figure shake as he observed the scene before his eyes, the other Hegemonies he knew for many years around him having similar expressions of utter stupor when they stared at a certain figure.","Even the calm and ancient face of Oathkeeper was filled with sharp lights of shock as all of them watched a crack open in space after his command, his body becoming showered by Primordial Essence as it began to absorb it all seamlessly and begin pulsating with a Resonant white light!","At such a scene, even someone as old as Great Old Nazzagath found himself staring dumbly.","’How is such a thing possible...’","Even an existence this old couldn’t wrap his mind around Noah’s means as he watched a flood of Primordial Essence rush into him, and a few seconds later...","RUUMBLE!","His figure pulsated with mad power as from it, the pristine white essence of the Primordial Dao stemmed from his body.","...!","The crack above him closed as Primordial Essence stopped raining down.","His fair hands lifted up a moment later as one could see him freely conjure the light of Primordial Essence.","Primordial Essence!","’Was comprehending such a pristine Dao so easy?!’","The slimy layers of flesh of the figure of the Great Old Nazzagath shook as he thought as such, this being not being the only one as the Oathkeeeper could only be seen with an incredulous expression at the fact that a being without the Primordial Disk had just so easily grasped the Primordial Dao.","But even with their surprise, what could they do but only accept and move on?!","THRUM!","Apart from the Primordial Essence, Noah also released the Ruination Essence within his body as when he used both of these Dao Essences at the same time...he felt a bubbling and overflowing Enhancement of both of them!","Similar to the Cosmic Core, the essences seemingly could not be merged and fused together as they only enhanced the power that the opposite essence could release.","As expressions of shock spread out from all around with gazes turning towards Noah, those around him seemed less surprised as Adelaide only had a light smile on her face while looking towards Noah with an expression full of love.","Valentina had a complicated expression that was gradually resolving itself, this powerful Hegemony finally coming to a decision at this moment as she and all others watched Noah wave his hands once more!","[Automatic Planting and Harvesting] was utilized yet again, this time on a crimson Galaxy that was designated as a Ruination Law Space and held an uncountable number of resplendent Ruination Strawberries.","SHAA!","These sacred treasures fruits appeared en masse on the left side of the trillions of Primordial Apples, Noah looking at this scene with a smile as he waved his hand to call forth a Ruination Strawberry.","This crimson fruit on his left hand, the pristine white Primordial Apple on the right hand! With the trillions more of such fruits before him, Noah breathed out heavily as a second later...he brought the fruits into his mouth and began to take big bites.","\"Ah...\"","The pure golden honey like fluid that erupted with every bite of the Primordial Apple, the sugary and blazing taste of the pulsating strawberry that trembled with Ruination...Noah was the first to taste the sacred fruits as while he ate them, his eyes were locked onto the percentage that showed the Comprehension of his Primordial and Ruination Daos!","THRUM!","Wild bouts of essence began to dance around him as dense particles of Ruination and Primordial Essence began to form, Noah seeing his percentage in these laws moving by an imperceptible decimal percentage of who knew how many zeroes, but it was still moving.","He could elevate his Comprehension and Assimilation with ease for all of his Cosmic Daos!","Such a thought caused his eyes to release radiant rays of golden light as they landed on the vast number of Primordial Apples and Ruination Strawberries floating before him.","Some would wonder, was he about to start chowing down on all these hundreds of billions of sacred fruits until he reached the pristine 100% in both of the Cosmic Daos?","Maybe if it was another being, that would be occurring. But this...was Noah Osmont!","Among the many cards he had to play, he had the Sin of Gluttony that he could utilize the abilities of, this Sin capable of Devouring things and putting them in the [Large Stomach] that acted akin to Noah’s own.","So right after getting a taste of the wondrous treasured fruits with Cosmic Dao Essence within them, Noah’s body erupted out with a dark and malevolent wave behind his back, this being the Sin of Gluttony as he cared out lightly.","[Devouring].","WAA!","The dark wave he released was like hungry black holes that devoured everything, expanding rapidly as it swallowed up thousands of Ruination Strawberries and Primordial Apples every single second.","These terrifying fruits entered Noah’s stomach as they were digested even faster with the abilities of Sin of Gluttony, Noah nearly letting out a laugh when he saw the percentage on both the Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination shoot up by a single percentage after one second!","The hard to raise proficiency of these Cosmic Daos...had actually begun to shoot up at this moment as Noah devoured truly ridiculous fruits that should in no way exist.","When Noah saw the recently learned Primordial Dao reach 5% after just 5 seconds, his eyes trembled with joy as he couldn’t help but scream out!","\"More! More!\"","RUMBLE!","The dense aura of the Sin of Gluttony erupted from him with even more fervor as it spread to cover hundreds of thousands of the Primordial Apples and Ruination Strawberries, the dense essence around Noah only exploding in a terrifying manner at this moment.","Oathkeeper and the other Hegemonies watched this scene with utter horror at the sheer impossibility of it, those among these aged beings that had hair nearly going bald from the sheer shock as Noah was only looking ahead of him with a maddened smile.","This was because as hundreds of thousands of the precious fruits were devoured, he saw the percentage of Comprehension for both the Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination cross the 50% Mark.","The Dao of Ruination was in the lead as a second later, it hit the 80% mark. Before Noah could even blink, the interface before his eyes seemed to have almost glitched as in the next second, he saw complete 100% Comprehension in the Cosmic Dao of Ruination as a moment later, this same number appeared next to the Primordial Dao!","\"...\"","Immense knowledge he didn’t at all work hard for filled his mind as he fully comprehended supreme Cosmic Daos in a matter of seconds.","Who said it was hard?!","Who said Cosmic Daos were things that were impossible to traverse and comprehend?!","Noah was doing it with such ease that he fully comprehended the Primordial Dao that he had just learned in a matter of seconds while fully comprehending 70% of the Dao of Ruination in even less time.","Cosmic Daos...fully comprehended in seconds!","Ah!","You can read the novel at <strong></strong> or <strong></strong>"]},{"number":1143,"title":"Chapter 1143: Chapter 1142 - You Get Assimilated! You Get Assimilated! You All Get Assimilated!!!","paragraphs":["The moment Noah achieved full Comprehension in the Primordial Dao and Ruination, he felt a unique blanket of authority descend unto him from these pristine Daos, but he didn’t even get a chance to revel in it as even greater authority continued to pour down.","This was because the mass of darkness she released that was the Sin of Gluttony continued to devour the Primordial Apples and Ruination Strawberries before him endlessly, the percentage that had changed to assimilation beginning to also be pushed up crazily as Noah felt these two Daos become closely attached to his soul!","The higher the percentage got, the more Noah understood Ruination and the Primordial Dao as when it reached the peak...Noah could even turn his own body into the very essence of these Daos!","The authority he would obtain from such an action was something unimaginable as if ever he faced enemies that couldn’t withstand these daos, victory would be his!","\"OOOOOH!\"","As the Assimilation rose crazily in seconds, Noah couldn’t help but release a primal bellow, those watching the scene from nearby feeling their Origins trembling as their eyes nearly popped out of their sockets.","They watched as from Noah’s bellow, his mouth wasn’t just releasing sound waves...but vibrant beams of red and white that represented the essence of two pristine Daos.","This scene....they would never be able to forget!","An Antiquity bellowing out as his mouth released beams of Ruination and Primordial Essence, the aura of his body only rising to greater and greater levels as they could only stare breathlessly!","Even Barbatos’s bored expression changed. Even Valentina felt her heart tremble at such a scene as when looking at the scene of her man doing such a thing, her heart strings shook as she thought of what a good choice she had made just weeks back!","The Oathkeeper was among the other powerhouses of the Infinite Cosmos just staring in a stupor at what was occurring, their eyes catching the sight when a fantastical peak was reached.","It was the sight of Noah’s figure becoming enclosed in Ruination and Primordial Essence as he...was actually completing his percentage in Assimilation within a matter of seconds.","As if he looked at the pristine Dao of Ruination and commanded it- you get assimilated!","THRUM!","As he then stared at the Primordial Dao and said you as well- get assimilated!","The void of space shook.","Crimson and white lights released so brightly from Noah’s body as they seemingly bisected his body in half, the phenomenon of the white light occupying the nearby few light years as the crimson light occupied the other half occurring.","A truly magisterial sight as when the show of colors dwindled down...Noah’s eyes opened like the brightest lanterns as he felt the shocking strength and authority coursing through him.","\"Authority...\"","He couldn’t help but speak out, his voice waking up all those around him out of their stupor as he focused his eyes on his status panel.","There, the authorities he was feeling were classified in full!","{Authority of the Assimilator of the Cosmic Dao of Ruination}: An authority that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated the Cosmic Dao of Ruination. It grants +100,000% Increased Ruination Damage,+100,000% Health and Mana Regeneration, +100,000% Cast and Attack speed, makes the user capable of displaying quintuple the power in the Ruination Sea, grants the user the capability to warp across set points across the Ruination Sea and turn into pure Ruination Essence, and opens up the pathway to the deconstruction of all Daos.","{Authority of the Assimilator of the Cosmic Primordial Dao}: An authority that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated the Cosmic Primordial Dao. It grants +100,000% Increased Primordial Damage, +100,000% Health and Mana Regeneration, +100,000% Cast and Attack speed, makes the user capable of displaying quintuple the power in the Primordial Sea and the capability to turn into pure Primordial Essence, and opens up the pathway to the reconstruction of all Daos.","...!","Noah was just reading over the new authorities of these two fantastical Daos with fervor when a second later, he felt the birth of something brand new within him as yet another prompt appeared before his eyes.","<With the complete assimilation of Ruination and the Primordial Daos, the pathway of deconstruction and reconstruction of Daos is now opened.>","RUMBLE","Like a strike of thunder, droves of information began entering Noah’s mind naturally- all of it being a consequence of not just assimilating Ruination- but also assimilating The Primordial Dao!","If he had only assimilated one, this pathway would not yet have opened!","<With a Splendiferous Universe as the fuel, the deconstruction of Daos with Ruination Essence will allow for any fully assimilated Dao to be turned into pure Runic Dao Lines as the reconstruction with Primordial Essence allows one to brand these Runic Dao Lines onto their body and soul, gaining a 100 fold enhancement in the current boosts of the selected Dao in exchange for losing all Comprehension and Assimilation of such Dao.>","...!","A brand new pathway opened up as Noah laid eyes upon it for the first time, his bright expression becoming ecstatic the more information he received about this pathway.","A pathway that was only initiated after the burning of a Splendiferous Universe!","A brand new path only unlocked by his recent actions, and one that would allow him to deconstruct and lose all Comprehension and assimilation of a certain Dao...only for him to have all of this restructured as Runic Dao Lines that were forever branded to his body and soul!","Ruination destroyed and Primordial recreated!","This new concept...this resplendent new path...Noah wanted to explore it fully as he dedicated all his attention into it, but he brought himself to a stop as he glanced at the existences around him that were there for a reason.","He calmed his excited heart as he glanced towards all of them with a devilish smile, his power and authority being vibrant for all to see as their stared back at him with awe, his figure clad in Ruination and Primordial Essence making him look like a primal existence from ancient times!"]},{"number":1144,"title":"Chapter 1144: Chapter 1143 - Runic Dao Lines! I","paragraphs":["The gazes of the most powerful existences glanced towards the radiant figure of Noah as while shimmering with white and crimson lights, they saw this being point behind him to the vast numbers of lined up Galaxies.","\"These Galaxies before us each contain specific sacred Dao Fruits and Herbs, where their consumption allows you to increase the Comprehension and Assimilation of all Daos as you have just seen.\"","RUMBLE!","The hearts of the Hegemonies of the former Primordial Cosmos shook at the confirmation of such a reality, the gaze of Oathkeeper being immeasurable as he scrutinized Noah even more closely!","He saw as this being smiled with a sharp light crossing his eyes, his voice ringing out as the Galaxies behind them began to shine with the light of harvest.","\"All those that are my Vassals...can partake and enjoy the trillions of sacred Dao Fruits and Herbs that will propel their respective Daos to the peak within a matter of hours, or just days if you are slow eaters!\"","WAA!","Along with his voice, the appearance of glimmering Dao Fruits and herbs suffused with glorious light appeared all around them- Seeds of Time, Withering Tea Leaves, Summoning Peaches...it was myriad of exquisite Fruits and Herbs capable of ridiculous features appearing en masse.","At such a scene and Noah’s grand and authoritative aura...the prideful Hegemonies that would have normally bowed to no one finally could bear it no longer.","The Great Old Nazzagath was the first as this Chthonian came forward with a myriad of emotions, his deep voice ringing out.","\"I’ve been trying to figure you out for the last few days...but you are still a mystery to me! Yet, your methods are undeniable as they are enough for this old man to bow and say...I pledge Fealty to the Antiquity of Mana!\"","THRUM!","The Chthonian bowed down as a second later, a grand light began to shine over him, the others watching this scene as their eyes flashed powerfully, nearly all of them calling out towards Noah at this moment.","\"I pledge Fealty to the Antiquity of Mana...!\"","Fealty by powerful existences Noah would have looked up to just weeks ago rained down, an overabundance of Marks of Antiquity in the tens of Billions descending down onto him due to the power and influence these beings held all being brought under him.","After this glorious process was done, Noah nodded as he gazed at his people first. Barbatos, Valentina, Kazuhiko...all of those in the front were the first to get the signal.","\"Go ahead and enjoy the vast numbers of Dao Fruits and Herbs. We have to get you guys to achieve Hegemony and Antiquity soon!\"","His words caused them to turn both happy and sad as they were reminded of the ever-expanding gap between them and Noah that never seemed to close, their figures eying the vast numbers of Dao Fruits and Herbs before them as they delved in!","With this taken care of, Noah gave them the time to get stronger as he himself...he had to go and explore the newly opened path with the full Assimilation of Ruination and Primordial Daos.","SHAA!","His figure disappeared seamlessly from the Novus Universe as his main body reappeared not within the Infinite Cosmos, but the Ruination Realm where his Primordial Ruination Clone had been staying these past few days to continue absorbing a myriad of Cores and the base Ruination Essence to forge more Universes.","With the 1000:1 Dilation, Noah was able to watch a new Universe fully form within his Origin every single day as currently...he held 12 Splendiferous Universes and 1 normal one!","His advancements weren’t small, especially with the 300,000% Increase in Realm Advancement that the Primordial Ruination Clone held. Now, his main body had also appeared here to properly look at what he could do to deconstruct and reconstruct Daos.","The test for now was...the completely assimilated Lesser Dao of Withering!","Like all fully assimilated Lesser Daos, this Dao granted 5,000% Increased Damage, with fully assimilated Grand Daos giving 10,000% Increased Damage on top of their own unique boosts, and as just seen with Ruination and Primordial- Cosmic Daos granted +100,000% in Increased Damage among other boosts.","As Noah looked at the shocking effects of forming the so called Runic Dao Lines from the deconstruction and reconstruction of Daos, he didn’t proceed in haste as before he began, he spoke lightly while looking at the overabundant light of Conquest overflowing through him.","\"Let the light of conquest flow through the Lesser Dao of Withering.\"","RUMBLE!","Before his words even finished, a portion of the vibrant Light of Conquest disappeared as one of the daos Noah assimilated was enhanced, his Origin feeling the changes as they were displayed before his eyes soon after!","{Aura of the Assimilator of Withering} <ENHANCED>:: A passive aura that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated the Lesser Dao of Withering. It grants +10,000% Extra Damage and allows the attacks of the Controller of Withering to contain a unique corrosive essence that deconstructs and reduces the attacks, mana, and life force of the target until they become empty husks. The user can now even corrode time itself as they can briefly slow the progression time in a certain area.","With the light of conquest, it had a double fold increase as Noah nodded with bright eyes, turning his gaze towards his Origin as without looking back...he began to burn one the few Splendiferous Universes he held!","THRUM!","As the fuel required for this process, Noah felt a tinge of pain when he did it, but that was all! This was because his heart was shaking from the fact that if he successfully deconstructed and reconstructed just this single Lesser Dao enhanced by Conquest, the 100 fold increase of this process meant 1,000,000% in increased Damage- and that was just from this Lesser Dao alone.","If he also enhanced the Grand Daos from a 10,000% Increase in Damage to 20,000% and then deconstructed these daos, it would be a 100 fold increase to 2,000,000%!","Cosmic Daos were even more shocking as the number was terrifying to just think about.","THUMP!","What a pathway! What a boost from fully assimilating Ruination and the Primordial Dao! Noah....he had to start this process right away!"]},{"number":1145,"title":"Chapter 1145: Chapter 1144 - Runic Dao Lines! II","paragraphs":["Noah could feel the very beat of his heart as he opened up such a ridiculous pathway to increase his strength, the burning Splendiferous Universe being used as fuel as he felt all the accumulations of the Dao of Withering be ripped from his Origin, his very eyes watching as his essence of Ruination caused the formation of broken down and ancient-looking Runic Lines that vibrated with power.","Runic Dao Lines that represented the Lesser Dao of Withering!","As Ruination deconstructed, Primordial Essence weaved in to reconstruct- this whole process only being made possible from the burning Splendiferous Universe within Noah’s Origin as this burning released a unique essence that wrapped around the Runic Dao Lines and weaved them together.","Noah watched as the resplendent Dao Galaxies of the Splendiferous Universe faded away, the entire Universe disappearing soon after as all this essence circled pristinely towards the unstable Runic Dao Lines!","Then the Primordial Essence wrapped around this instability as it weaved it all together into a wondrous construct.","Within seconds, the broken down Runic Dao Lines began to come together in a glorious manner as they shone with a myriad of colors, becoming tout and strong as they looked like multicolored lines of utter ancientness and regality!","Noah felt all the knowledge of Withering leaving his mind during this process as after he saw the glimmering Runic Dao Lines fully formed, he bellowed out powerfully.","\"Brand them onto me!\"","RUMBLE","A glorious light stretched out as for the first time, Runic Dao Lines were about to be branded onto Noah Osmont!","The multicolored lines flew towards him at a fast pace as they sank into his fist, the Runic Dao Lines rotating madly as they branded a glimmering crimson tattoo around his right fist that even went on to cover his palm.","The crimson tattoos shone with regality and authority, staying calmly over his skin as they made Noah look like an ancient tribal being! His eyes shone brightly as he sent essence into the tattoos instinctively, watching as they brightened up and began to revolve around his fist as they caused his body to release terrifying waves of power!","This was the +1,000,000% boost of the Dao of Withering- all condensed to a few unique Runic Dao Lines that Noah could activate as all his comprehensions about this Dao were gone.","At the same time, something new appeared within his Status Panel!","[Runic Dao Lines Integration :: Withering(+1,000,000% Increased Damage....)]","A new section that would classify all the Daos that Noah deconstructed and reconstructed had appeared, Noah’s elation only rising as he saw his fist that was currently glimmering with multiple colors as the activation of the tattoo that represented the Dao of Withering weaved over his skin colorfully as if it was alive.","The sense of strength he received was unbelievable as it made him want to deconstruct all of the Daos he had on him, but he knew that each one would cost him a Splendiferous Universe as the cost was very high!","\"But...it is worth it!\"","Yes! It was extremely worth it! As Noah thought of how to tackle the high cost of this stupendous process, he figured that he had to move his plans forward somewhat as he had to go searching for a method to grow his strength.","Truthfully, he was currently feeling ashamed at his rate of progress as 7 days had passed and he only had 14 Universes!","Well, there was one less Splendiferous Universe after he obtained the Withering Runic Dao Tattoo, and it made him feel a sense of urgency as he felt like he was stagnating in strength.","Of course if any Antiquities heard this, they would scream off in anger at such a thought as beings such as this spent hundreds of thousands of years if not millions to achieve the stage of Antiquity, even the pace of forming a Universe a day being something unbelievable as they would spend many years accumulating their power!","But Noah was different! He achieved Hegemony just days after he became a Monarch and Paragon, and he became an Antiquity just hours after he became a Hegemony.","His pace had been so fast that with him ’slowly’ accumulating Universes daily, it seemed as if he was getting nowhere. And now with the introduction of Runic Dao Lines that needed Splendiferous Universes to bring to life...","It caused Noah to advance his plans forward as he would have to step into the Ruination Sea faster!","Out there were a vast number of possibilities, places where he could find other Cosmos or even the terrifying Primordial Beasts that could locate his Infinite Cosmos faster than he even expected.","He would have to prepare a great deal as his priority of things would have to be reshuffled, one of these being the designing of a Cosmic Dao!","With the fact that the Grand Dao of Conquest could effectively bring the increase of values of Lesser Daos and double them from 5,000% to 10,000%, and take Grand Dao boosts to 20,000%...Noah wanted this option to be applicable to Cosmic Daos!","For him to do this, he had to elevate the Dao of Conquest to the Cosmic Level.","He could then Empower Cosmic Daos and elevate their strength even further...it was a path of strength that made him expectant whenever he stood against an enemy of the same rank as him on just how much he could dominate them!","Along with all this...he had to bring the rest of his Cosmic Daos to gull Assimilation.","He had devoured enough Primordial Apples and Ruination Strawberries as he was fully assimilated for these two Daos, and now he needed to consume the sacred Dao Fruits and Herbs of the Annihilation, Chronos, and any Daos he would soon be picking up either from [Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence].","For the Daos he would be picking up....there in lay choices as he wanted the Dao of Reincarnation from Chronos who was still locked in a Temporal Prison, and then there was the mysterious Primordial that had descended onto the Infinite Cosmos and handed him a Primordial Heart!"]},{"number":1146,"title":"Chapter 1146: Chapter 1145 - Deconstructing And Designing Daos! I","paragraphs":["Chronos in the Temporal Prison had the Dao of Reincarnation, but Noah might have to put this aside for now as he was looking more towards the Primordial and what would happen when he used [Protagonist’s Bookmark] on this existence!","The cool down had all but ended a day ago, and Noah was being extremely cautious as he was constantly trying to affirm things with Destiny and Fortune on whether he should even make this existence a target.","There were too many unknowns with them as Noah didn’t even know their full power or what they could do...and this made him apprehensive to descend onto a soul of such a being without being found out!","\"Well...you won’t know until you try, hmm? Let’s take things one by one. First is...\"","He let out a devilish smile as he craned his neck, his eyes still stuck on the vibrant Runic Dao Tattoo that would light up with multiple colors whenever essence sunk into it.","He breathed out as he sat down in a meditative position, looking over at his Primordial Ruination Clone that was in the same position and had a faint outline of the Runic Dao Tattoo also appear on his hands!","Then, in front of both of his bodies- countless Dao Fruits and Herbs of Annihilation, Slaughter, Chronos...any and all Daos whether it be Grand or Cosmic that Noah didn’t have full Assimilation of, their Dao Fruits appeared as The Sin of Gluttony was already ready to devour and grant Noah the Proficiency.","Under the Time Dilation, this would seem like it happened in no time as while doing this, Noah also gave the command to the Cosmic Core to do something drastic!","\"The first Cosmic Dao...shall be Conquest. Elevate it from Grand to Cosmic!\"","RUMBLE!","His thoughts reverberated into the Cosmic Core as it thrummed powerfully, Noah making his choice after much deliberation as the recent emergence of Runic Dao Lines and the shocking 100 fold increase in power they could provide being the decider to make this Dao into a Cosmic one.","\"Also...start the design of the Grand Dao of Archetypes.\"","WAA!","Yet another command rained down from him as he tackled a myriad of things at once, assimilating Daos, bringing forth a Cosmic Dao, and now even designing a Grand Dao!","As for the newly mentioned Grand Dao of Archetypes? It was something that Noah was designing not for himself per se, but for his subordinates that continued to look up towards him and lag in strength.","His commands were heeded by the Cosmic Core as a radiance of immense proportions vibrated from it, droves of unique essence being utilized by this unique treasure as the first artificial Cosmic Dao was born in the Infinite Universe!","Alongside this Cosmic Dao was a Grand one as they were both completed around the same time, Noah’s eyes flashing gloriously as he glanced at their details.","COSMIC [Dao of Conquest] :: A Cosmic Dao birthed by the Cosmic Core of Noah Osmont... Conquered lands will always allow the user to quintuple their power while fighting within them, while their strength will always be quadrupled when they are in the process of Conquest... Full Assimilation of Conquest grants the user the capability to Empower not just Absolute Skills, but any Lesser, Grand, and Cosmic Daos they Comprehend, along with their power being enhanced by ten times in Conquered Lands and enhanced by six times while in the process of Conquest...","Simple in its description, but ridiculous in its capabilities!","Tenfold increase in power in Conquered Lands! 6 times under the process of Conquest! But most of all, he could now Empower even Cosmic Daos.","He could do it...and so he found his testing target right away as he locked onto a particular Cosmic Dao that had just gotten assimilated seconds ago from him Devouring enormous amounts of its Dao Fruits- it was Annihilation!","The second Cosmic Dao he ever obtained, and his eyes now locked upon it as while he was carrying out multiple tasks at the same time, he voiced out lightly.","\"Let the light of Conquest shine on Annihilation.\"","RUUMBLE!","A magisterial white light stretched from him as it even lit up the surrounding crimson sea. His eyes were tightly closed as he immersed himself in the feeling of power, noticing nearly one fourth of his remaining Light of Conquest getting sucked away as the Authority of the Assimilator of Annihilation was enhanced!","Just seconds prior, Noah saw that the base damage increase for Annihilation was +50,000%, vastly above and beyond the normal 5,000% for Lesser Daos and 10,000% for Grand Daos, but far below the Ruination and Primordial Daos that were sitting at the very top with +100,000%.","But now after its Enhancement...","{Authority of the Assimilator of the Cosmic Dao of Annihilation}<ENHANCED>: An authority that only appears around those who have fully comprehended and assimilated Annihilation. It grants +100,000% Increased Annihilation Damage, +100,000% Increased AOE Damage, +100,000% Cast and Attack speed, and grants 50 Random Debuff Effects(Enfeeble, Slow, Impotent, Demoralized, Reduced Life Force....)","The Cosmic Dao that was a level lower than Ruination or Primordial Dao had actually been enhanced by Conquest that it actually reached the same level of boosts, and Noah wasted no time as he induced the movement of Ruination to actually start deconstructing this pristine Cosmic Dao, his eyes shining with a light of excitement as yet another Splendiferous Universe began to burn within his Origin!","He had already turned a Lesser Dao into a Runic Dao Tattoo, and wanted to see the stupendous effects of a Cosmic Dao going through the same thing.","THRUM!","His Origin trembled as the Assimilations of this Dao were pulled out, intense Runic Dao Lines beginning to form in front of him as they were much more pronounced and numerous than the ones for the Lesser Dao!","After the process of deconstruction, Primordial Essence came in as it put everything together, serene and majestic Dao Lines weaving before Noah’s eyes in a matter of seconds as yet another Splendiferous Universe faded.","\"Come!\"","But the result of it was Noah bellowing out to the Runic Dao Lines as they shot forth towards him and sank into his right arm, a shocking primal tattoo beginning to form all the way from his wrist up to his shoulder!","The Runic Dao Lines of Withering formed into a Tattoo that covered Noah’s fist and palm, but the numerous multicolored Dao Lines of Annihilation actually covered his entire arm as they pulsed with shocking power.","When he placed his vast essence into his arm now...","BZZZT!","It shone with glorious multicolored splendor as the Runic Dao Tattoos weaved magisterially, releasing shocking waves of power that even caused the surrounding ruination sea to tremble!"]},{"number":1147,"title":"Chapter 1147: Chapter 1146 - Deconstructing And Designing Daos! II","paragraphs":["In the Ruination Realm, a stupendous existence watched his right-hand glow magisterially with multiple colors, the Runic Dao Tattoos moving with purpose and power from the tip of his fingers all the way to his shoulders.","His gaze...was absent minded as he stared blankly in space at a set of words that quantified what the shimmering lines all over his hand meant.","[Runic Dao Lines Integration :: Withering (+1,000,000% Increased Damage....), Annihilation(+10,000,000% Increased Annihilation Damage, +10,000,000% Increased AOE Damage, +10,000,000% Cast and Attack speed, and grants 5000 Random Debuff Effects to enemies (Enfeeble, Slow, Impotent, Demoralized, Reduced Life Force....)]","\"...\"","Speechless!","Noah was genuinely speechless.","He stared at the numbers before him again and again, wanting to make sure that he wasn’t seeing something wrong and that this reality was actually true!","A Lesser Dao with the 100 fold increase granted a 1 million percent increase in Damage among other things, but a Cosmic Dao was a 10 Million percent increase as such a numerical value in relation to pure power was purely ludicrous.","This wasn’t to mention the fucking cast and Attack speed that were also enhanced by 10 million percent along with AOE Damage! If Noah cast [Fireball] right now, would it not be akin to him releasing the fastest bullets that had temperatures more immense than even the Cores of Galaxies?","The numbers of the boosts were just so immensely ridiculous that when Noah realistically and logically put things into account, he felt like it was a feasibility for him to stand against someone that had forged thousands of Universes...or even possibly a Cosmos!","At this moment though, this was all conjecture with no truth in it. If the enemy was like him and had completely assimilated Ruination and the Primordial Dao, then he fully expected them to be monsters that even he had to stay away from.","But if he met an existence at the Cosmic Level but they didn’t have the capability to form Runic Dao Lines...","It was a thought that caused Noah’s mind to buzz with activity as he reluctantly pulled his gaze away from his glimmering right hand that swirled with glorious ancient tattoos and the words on the Stat panel attached to it!","His gaze then went towards the other accomplishment he made while he was still Devouring Dao Fruits- the design of the Grand Dao of Archetypes.","This Dao was tailored more towards his subordinates and those closest to him in efforts to raise their power, with its effects being unique to say the least as it would change the power structure of the Infinite Cosmos!","What was the archetype? One could think of it like a prototype or a model, or a stereotype embodiment of a certain thing.","For Noah’s Grand Dao of Archetypes, it related more to the \"Classes\" or \"Roles\" that people could choose, Noah taking inferences from his time spent gaming in his homeworld to bring this Dao to fruition!","GRAND [Dao of Archetypes] :: A Grand Dao birthed by the Cosmic Core of Noah Osmont. As the Dao Architect, Noah Osmont can comprehend and assimilate the Dao at 10 times the normal speed. The Dao of Archetypes allows 500 Vassals of the Tyrannical Emperor to choose a Specific Archetype(Class or Role) that stems from one of the Skill Trees that the Emperor controls. The Selection of an Archetype is permanent as it cannot be changed, the existences that select their Archetype having it branded to their very Origins and soul as they cannot take any other path besides this. The power of the Archetype is dependent on what level the Skill Tree it stems from is, with Skill Trees at the Universal Filament Realm granting Vassals the strength of the Universal Realm. The power given will always be a level lower, where if the Skill Tree is advanced to the Cosmic Level, the Archetypes stemming from these Skill Trees will allow the display of power at the Universal Filament Realm. Full Assimilation of the Dao of Archetypes allows a Vassal to choose a second Archetype, and even one that stems from an Absolute Skill Tree of the Tyrannical Emperor. Currently available Archetypes to select: Necromancer( Arch Lich Ra’zan), Terror (Madness of Old, Cthulhu), Blood Ruler(Blood Lord), Ultimate Farmer( Versatile Farmer), Primal Tree (Primeval Tree of Old, Yggdrasil), Incandescent Guardian(Fate’s Guardian), Summoner(Animus Summoner Trainer), Temporal Lord(Wielder of Chronos), Annihilator(Bearer of Annihilation)....","...!","Noah stared at this expertly designed Grand Dao as beams of light shot forth from his eyes, nodding to himself on how he had just outdone himself on this one!","Those closest to him were always levels behind no matter what they did, but this could now be changed as with the Dao of Archetype, they could select a Class that stemmed from his Skill Trees that when he brought all of them up to the Universal Filament Realm, it would allow them all to display battle power at the Universal Realm!","Even though they were still a level behind, this was still a huge leap in power that other beings would normally not even be able to dream of.","To make this Dao actually possible at the level of a Grand one, Noah had to limit it to 500 beings, and they had to be Vassals under him that he could select himself to grant them the right to choose Classes.","If this Dao were to touch the level of a Cosmic Dao, the number of beings applicable could be expanded as the power the Archetypes would be able to display most likely would get enhanced, but Noah was entirely sure it wouldn’t be able to provide 100% power at the same level as the skill Trees...unless this Dao was elevated to the same ranks as Ruination and the Primordial Dao!","But with its creation, he effectively had 500 beings that he could now elevate to the Realm of Hegemonies.","More Hegemonies than even those that had been in the Primordial Cosmos!"]},{"number":1148,"title":"Chapter 1148: Chapter 1147 - Deconstructing And Designing Daos! III","paragraphs":["The Dao of Archetypes of arguable one of the most prized Daos Noah had made, the past Dao of Conquest that was already elevated to a Cosmic Dao being the only thing ranking higher at this moment based on usage and versatility, with Noah even tying this Dao to be on the same rank as Fealty that allowed him to amass Marks of Antiquity quickly.","Which expert could say they could effectively produce 500 Hegemonies with a wave of their hands?! Now, Noah was about to do just this as he finished devouring a myriad of Dao Fruits, his mind currently buzzing with droves of Information after he gained the full Assimilation of Chronos from Devouring countless [Seeds of Time].","All he had to do now was to pick up more Cosmic Daos through the Cosmic Dao Essence Integration and Emergence ability, or be lucky enough to pick up a Cosmic Dao from the millions of Dao Fruits he would consume in the near future!","He would then turn these Daos into Runic Dao Lines as all of his Assimilations about them would be permanently gone, with Noah not being able to comprehend or assimilate these Daos ever again.","\"Ah...\"","Noah rose up with a happy smile as he saw his vast advancements, a few more things remaining on his to do list before he began moving across the Ruination Seas.","His bright eyes glistened ever brighter as he sent a message to a few specific beings with the information on the Dao of Archetypes, and what the possibilities there were for them to choose from as at the same time, Noah was spending a myriad of Skill points to elevate any Skill Trees that were low leveled to the rank of Universal Filament!","This moment was the dawn of an Era in the Infinite Cosmos that would be defined by a few hundred specific Vassals that outshine the rest, these Vassals getting the chance to major in a specific Class that stemmed from a Skill Tree of the Antiquity of Mana!","---","\"He fucking didn’t...!\"","Kazuhiko couldn’t help but curse incredulously as to what seemed like just a minute or two having passed after Noah left the Novus Universe and they began to enjoy the Dao Fruits, he sent them a message about a newly birthed Dao of Archetypes.","The surprise was of course due to the time Dilation of the Ruination Realm, causing his subordinates to shake their heads at his efficiency as information of this Dao and all the choices they would have flowed into the mind of Kazuhiko and a few other selected beings.","\"He really made Classes...he wants to turn this already crazy reality into something akin to a game, haha!\"","Kazuhiko was shaking his head with a huge smile as he sifted through the boundless information flowing in, Valentina and others also having their faces changing at this newly appearing concept as they all found themselves focusing on it entirely.","\"Necromancer...\" Barbatos’s eyes shone as her blessed chest heaved, looking at the Archetype that stemmed from the Arch Lich Ra’zan that Noah had now raised to the Universal Filament Realm!","The latest mini skill tree to have been added that brought the Arch Lich skill tree to the Universal Filament Realm was titled [Universal Lich Lord], with it having another set of 4 abilities as always that were brand new, similar to the mini skill Trees of [Galactic Nether Emperor] and [Tyrannical Lich Emperor] that were contained in the Arch Lich Ra’zan skill tree.","If Barbatos were to select the Necromancer Archetype that stemmed from this Skill Tree, she would gain the ability to use all the skills contained within such as [Summon Lich Emperors] or [Necrotic Ring of Death], and all the way down to [Delay Death] and [No Man’s Land] that were one of the few skills from the first stages of the Arch Lich Ra’zan skill tree!","She would get all of this and be able to display battle power at the Universal Realm- as a Hegemony!","\"Haha!\"","Barbatos couldn’t help but let out a peal of chilling laughter as she felt like Noah deserved a little something extra later on tonight.","She then acted resolutely as she was the first existence to select the first ever Archetype within the Infinite Cosmos!","She didn’t bother to check the other Classes like the Temporal Lord or Terror or even Annihilator that many would be choosing, and she followed her heart as she was already bound to death, choosing the class of a Necromancer.","THRUM!","An oppressive black light shone with Barbatos at the center, her aura gradually changing as the dense black light condensed on her Origin, something becoming inexplicably branded onto her as along with this, a pristine mark of a skull appeared on her palm!","Barbatos gazed at this mark with shining eyes as she felt the flow of information of a myriad of new abilities she could use...as well as the power she currently released that was irrevocably at the realm of a Hegemony.","...!","The Great Old Nazzagath and other newly added Vassals looked at this scene in a stupor, Noah having only granted the right to choose an Archetype to the closest beings from his Original Universe first- so these Hegemonies from the Primordial Cosmos only saw as out of nowhere, a woman at the level of a Paragon began relaxing powerful waves of power that seemed stronger than most Hegemonies!","When they glanced at her chest, aside from its huge blessings, they could still see that her Origin had not formed into a Universe as it was still a manifested galactic filament.","So what...","RUMBLE","Before their thoughts even finished yet another aura extremely similar to this one rose up, this time stemming from the figure of Kazuhiko as he was laughing madly while the essence of Chronos swirled around him gloriously!","Those selecting the Archetypes that utilized Cosmic Daos didn’t mean they would be able to comprehend such Daos right away, and they were only granted access to unconsciously utilize it from the Tyrannical Emperor they pledged Fealty to.","So Kazuhiko had chosen the class of a Temporal Lord as his Archetype, and shocking auras similar to his began to rise from here on out as it only caused the Hegemonies of the Primordial Cosmos to nearly lose their minds at what was happening.","Not too far away from Kazuhiko, the cry of an Emperor of a race rang out clearly as the beak of a certain being rose towards the boundless space.","\"RAA! RAA! RAA!\"","The cry rang out loud three times, a golden glow being seen cascading down on the Emperor Penguin as this leading Spiritual Beast chose Incandescence Guardian for his Archetype, more than likely due to it causing him to shine an even greater luster of gold than anything else as the essence of Fate swirled around its body!","Such shocking scenes began to unfold fully as the man causing all of it was detached from it, currently still in the Ruination Realm as he finished his own preparation and was about to face an ordeal of sneaking into the soul of a Primordial!"]},{"number":1149,"title":"Chapter 1149: Chapter 1148 - Bookmark A Primordial!","paragraphs":["As Valentina saw the scenes of shocking auras of Hegemonies rising from all those around her, she couldn’t help but shake her head incredulously as from the information she received, she uttered out slowly in a disbelieving tone.","\"I...I choose the archetype of Summoner.\"","As the one to have created the Lesser Dao of Summoning, she had to choose this Class as she felt like she had begun a project with all her hard work, and yet someone else had taken the reigns and continued to work on it as she barely recognized all the things that could be done with this aspect of Summoning!","THRUM!","Essence rained down wildly again as the aura Valentina released expanded even further, those around her experiencing this same phenomenon as Elena had her curvaceous figure shaking after she chose the Archetype of Blood Ruler, Steel Mikahil’s body also shining nearby as he chose the archetype of Incandescent Guardian.","The birth of the Generals that would move under the command of the Antiquity of Mana gradually formed like this, with Noah finishing his selection of who the 500 would be as time passed until this cap was reached.","In the future...he could raise the limit of 500 if he ever made this Grand Dao into a Cosmic one as only time would tell!","The glorious lights continued to shine from the bodies of existences that were close to Noah as Oathkeeper and the original inhabitants of the Primordial Cosmos watched on in a stupor, our focus shifting from these beings and back to Noah who was about to attempt something somewhat dangerous.","He had taken care of many of the things he wanted to do with designing of daos and even exploring the Runic Dao Lines, stopping at deconstructing Annihilation for now as he didn’t want to entirely finish his Splendiferous Universes just yet.","What he wanted to do now was utilize Protagonist’s Bookmark on the terrifying Primordial that had descended and granted him a Primordial Heart.","In the Ruination Realm.","Noah was situated in a meditative position as he breathed out slowly, an iridescent golden glow crossing through his eyes as he confirmed the tides of destiny while listening to his fortune.","If he wasn’t somewhat confident after discerning Destiny and Fortune the past few days, he wouldn’t attempt what he was about to attempt! But after confirming multiple times, his eyes shine with a light of conviction as he voiced out.","\"[Protagonist’s Bookmark].\"","RUMBLE!","A unique essence erupted from deep within him and bloomed outwards. It focused on a portion of his soul as it took a chunk and began shooting away from his body, entering the folds of space of the Ruination Realm as this piece of soul instantly flashed into the Infinite Cosmos and then began to shoot out into the vast Ruination Sea right after!","At speeds even Noah wouldn’t normally be able to achieve, the small portion of his soul crossed the Ruination Sea as Noah had chosen his target to be a certain figure he met not too long ago.","The journey this time was vast as the target was a great distance away, the unique essence of the Protagonist Trait carrying Noah’s soul across the crimson shimmering Ruination Sea for the next few hours!","---","Across the vast Ruination Sea.","With the myriad of Cosmos dwelling within the crimson seas, there were a few that were more distinct than others, with some holding immense importance as they held the most unique beings within them!","One such being was an existence mentioned not too long ago- the existence that was ripping apart a Grand Primordial Beast barehanded as his body shone with a glimmer of multicolored Runic Dao Lines that formed into ancient tattoos all over him.","His entire body was etched throughout as he seemed to have no gaps left, this being more pronounced at this moment in time as his essence hands activated them to shine their rainbow colored lights.","The figure of this being with dark hair draping over his shoulders was currently floating in the Ruination Sea as he looked a few thousand light years below him, a wild and ancient look being perceived in his eyes as his exquisitely defined muscular body could be seen even from the robe he wore!","His gaze was glancing down towards a shocking scene...it was the scene of multiple Cosmos floating peacefully in the Ruination Sea.","\"It is an accomplishment you should be proud of, Little Aegon.\"","...!","To his side, a veiled figure dressed in full white spoke out as she also gazed at the vast number of Cosmos below them.","This was the target of Noah’s Protagonist’s Bookmark, and after crossing the vast Ruination Seas for the past hours, Noah’s soul coincidentally arrived above her veiled figure and sank into her head silently!","THRUM!","\"Hmm?\"","Towards this, something extremely shocking occurred as the veiled figure herself felt nothing, but the man beside her actually turned and began to look around with a sharp gaze!","Not the Primordial, but the existence at the Cosmic Realm beside her!","\"What’s wrong?\"","Seeing this change, the Primordial asked quizzically as the exquisitely defined handsome face of Aegon replied with a voice that dripped of majesty and regality soon after.","\"I felt like there was another presence near us for a second there.\"","\"Hmm? Near us? Little Aegon, who do you think would be bold enough to come in front of the most powerful existence across these vast seas....and when a Primordial is nearby as well? Take the compliment, you should be proud of the Empire you have created- this place being a bastion that no Primordial Beasts would be able to take down with you in the lead.\"","RUMBLE!","Their conversation resumed as it was while at the same time, Noah’s portion of soul and consciousness sank into the Primordial as he glanced towards the Dark-haired man in shock!","It wasn’t the Primordial that had sensed anything off, but it was instead this man whose body was filled with Runic Dao Tattoos- this being that should not be at the same level as a Primordial!","How was this possible?! Just who was this existence besides the Primordial?!"]},{"number":1150,"title":"Chapter 1150: Chapter 1149 - A ! I","paragraphs":["As much as Noah wanted to understand the full situation, he had very limited time of less than a minute to scour the Origin and soul of a Primordial and leave before anything drastic happened.","The portion of his soul had entered silently as Noah didn’t make any movements in the first second, only observing the things he might be able to pull from this existence as when he looked at what could be considered her Origin and Soul...he was gobsmacked at the sheer grandeur of it all as he saw an endless pristine white river!","A river that endlessly stretched forth in two directions, and Noah could see many glimmering lines and clusters of lights within it that represented Laws, Daos, Memories, and many more things.","It seemed oppressive to stare at it all at once as Noah could actually pick out the essence of Ruination from a crimson colored line, and he could see the essence of the Primordial Daos on a prominent white line right next to it.","But the more incredulous thing to see was that near these lines that represented Ruination and the Primordial Dao...there were multiple other lines and clusters of light that seemed to shine with just as much importance!","This caused Noah’s soul to tremble as he actually understood that there were things at the same level of Ruination and the Primordial Dao from the soul of this Primordial! What were they? And the more important question was...could he obtain them?!","THRUM!","His soul shone with a golden glimmer as he couldn’t find any information on what he was looking at, only being able to identify Primordial and Ruination Daos because he was familiar with them.","Uniquely...this particular Protagonist’s Bookmark was like he was blind and could only choose randomly from what he could see.","The Primordial was just that powerful that even now Noah could not obtain information from her!","For him to grasp anything from her...he had to choose one of the wondrously shimmering lines or clusters of light, and he had to be lucky enough that whatever he chose was something worth this great risk.","As a millisecond passed, Noah made his decision as he glanced from the lines that represented The Primordial and Ruination Daos, glancing at nearby lines that were just as vibrant or even more lustrous!","He chose a particularly vibrant and large glimmering line that seemed to stand out among all the others around, this line stretching along the endless pristine river that was this being’s soul. With his intention made, Noah’s soul moved less than a second after he entered as he grasped onto a stout line deep in the soul of a Primordial!","To understand what was about to happen next, one had to recall what exactly Protagonist’s Bookmark entailed.","[Protagonist’s Bookmark] ::...To those Bookmarked, the Protagonist can descend onto their body without their knowledge as he becomes able to assimilate into them for a period of 1 minute. In this period of time, the Protagonist can choose to focus on a specific area such as Experiences, Laws, Realm Progression, Daos...everything that the bookmarked character has accomplished as the Protagonist can rapidly raise their law progression or learn a new law, gains years of experience, enhance their understandings of Realms, enhance their understanding of a current Dao, or step on the path of a brand new Dao that the bookmarked character is adept on...","Experiences, Laws, Realm Progression, Daos...everything that the bookmarked character has accomplished. This was the crucial part!","What Noah had chosen to obtain...might not even be a Dao as it could have been memories or knowledge of faster Realm Progression, or maybe something else entirely!","Noah didn’t know what his soul had attached into before he did, but when he locked onto it as he began to suck in its knowledge....","BOOOOM!","He felt like an explosion had gone off deep in his mind.","It felt too high and sacred...like it was something he shouldn’t have been touching at all!","Droves of information rushed into his mind as he could barely pay attention to the conversation occurring outside, the voice of the Primordial continuing to ring out.","\"Across these vast Ruination Sea, as long as this bastion that you have created doesn’t fall...this reality will remain intact. All you have to do now is gain the battle power to seamlessly stand against Cosmic Primordial Beasts, and you will be set.\"","The words of the Primordial caused the devilishly handsome figure of Aegon to nod, his deep and dark eyes seemingly holding immeasurable weight within them as he spoke out while still glancing at the Cosmos below him.","\"I will not be alone. There are trusted existences below me that want the same thing...\"","The veiled Primordial nodded at his words as she was about to continue, when her expression below the veil changed to confusion at this moment as she felt something she couldn’t quite put her finger on!","At this same time, Noah’s main body in the far away Infinite Cosmos trembled as his seas of Fortune and Destiny churned, his mind being sent horrendous danger signals just 30 seconds after he had begun taking in whatever knowledge he had attached himself to in the soul of the Primordial.","These danger signals all told him to leave within the next few seconds, or Calamity of untold proportions would descend!","Noah trusted his instincts as with but a command, the portion of his soul that was used for Protagonist’s Bookmark unwillingly detached from the soul of the Primordial and began to run away at speeds even faster than when it had been searching for this existence.","Around this same time, the confusion on the hidden face of the Primordial changed as the Ruination Sea began to shake, a cold voice emanating from her that caused the very Ruination Seas to churn!","\"Who?!\"","RUMBLE!","The Primordial raised her head as she actually felt a consciousness around them, but it seemed the glorious and regal being beside her moved even faster as his hair danced wildly, his hand reaching out towards a certain direction as his face was stern.","This direction...was where Noah’s small portion of soul had begun to escape to!","Time was seemingly moving in slow motion at this moment, Noah’s soul trembling as he entrenched the expression of a majestic being whose body had begun to light up with numerous Runic Dao Lines, his hand outstretched as it was trying to clasp onto and break his soul.","Lucky for him...he had trusted his senses and left when he did as this outstretched hand barely missed him, his figure disappearing into the folds of Ruination as the task of returning his small portion of a soul to his main body was something that could be done in a blink!","\"Preposterous!\"","RUMBLE","Noah could only hear a wrathful bellow ring out as he was already gone, the heart on his main body beating wildly as he could already see what his soul had obtained within those mere 30 seconds.","It wasn’t a law or any type of Dao, nor was it knowledge or experience from the Primordial!","It was something so glorious that Noah could not contain himself when he received it, something that was termed....<Nomological Edict of Samsara >.","A Nomological Edict of Samsara!!!"]},{"number":1151,"title":"Chapter 1151: Chapter 1150 - A ! II","paragraphs":["\"Preposterous!\"","THRUM!","The bellow from Primordial caused everything in the nearby hundreds of thousands of light years to freeze, but the consciousness that had been snooping around was already gone as the glimmering body of Aegon could be seen where the culprit disappeared.","His hand was outstretched towards a certain direction as he voiced out slowly.","\"It is gone.\"","...!","A consciousness had actually been snooping near them without their knowledge, and it had been able to escape without being caught!","WAA!","The magisterial air around the Primordial only became more intense, the pressure even causing the body of Aegon to vibrate as his Runic Dao Lines all across his figure shone with increasing intensity.","\"It is gone.\"","He repeated again lightly as his long dark hair danced wildly, his sculpted figure looking extremely dominating as the heavy pressure in the surroundings reduced at this moment, the Primordial turning to glance towards him as she spoke coldly.","\"Nothing is ever gone. Whatever was bold enough to come here...whether it is the consciousness of a Primordial Beast or an existence within this reality- they can forget getting off lightly!\"","...!","The voice of the Primordial was filled with majesty and confidence, the veiled figure within continuing to speak as her body began to light up with a myriad of colors.","\"Even if they are gone at this moment, I can always go back to when they were here and grasp their traces...\"","As she finished these words, she seemed ready for something as she called out with utter regality in the next moment!","\"Nomological Edict of...\"","RUMBLE!","---","As a Primordial made a move in a far away location, Noah’s small portion of soul was called back at a nigh instantaneous speed as it very quickly sank back into his Origin, beginning to fully grant him everything it had obtained.","And the content it had obtained...was truly something top stupendous!","Not a law or Dao...but something that was actually a fusion of a myriad of laws and Daos- a Nomological Edict!","Such a thing caused Noah’s heart to beat wildly as he got a look at the tip of the iceberg of the strength of Primordials.","He didn’t see any Runic Dao Lines on her body, but he did see an overabundance of them on an existence that was near her!","From their conversation, he picked up the name Aegon as he was very quickly reminded of Eckert- the Antiquity that shared his name and mentioned the possibility of Champions being groomed by Primordials in the vast realities out there.","Noah Eckert- the Great Usurper, had actually told Noah he was likely to be a champion based on the treatment he had just begun to receive, but as Noah saw the magisterial figure of Aegon right beside the Primordial and with his body filled with countless Runic Dao Tattoos swirling all over his body, he thought that this being looked like much more of a champion!","The sense of power between these two beings alone was horrendous as Noah didn’t know if the current power he held was even a decimal percentage of theirs.","He had just seen the stupendous effects of Runic Dao Lines as the sheer percentages alone made him stupefied, but the being he saw had countless of such Dao Lines as it represented the Deconstruction and reconstruction of too many Daos!","And then...there was the Nomological Edict.","Samsara!","This was something even more sacred and ridiculous than the Deconstruction and reconstruction of Daos, and Noah could say this with confidence as he gained the knowledge his soul had obtained and changes began to occur within his very Origin.","Grand changes of laws and Daos...and even the eruption of new Daos he hadn’t comprehended before!","He was most regretful that he was only capable of using 30 seconds of the Protagonist’s Bookmark for this concept of a Nomological Edict, the full knowledge he now received telling him that due to this, he had only traversed 10% in this Nomological Edict.","But what did 10 entail? What did the Edict itself entail?!","The answer was right before Noah’s eyes as he saw a brand new set of words appear in his Stat panel and before his eyes.","<Nomological Edict of Samsara> :: A Nomological Edict is a form of undeniable truth and authority that is birthed from the combination of laws and Daos. A Nomological Edict cannot be circumvented or stopped by anything, with the only possibility of deniability lying with another Edict. The Nomological Edict of Samsara is born from the combination of the Cosmic Daos of Reincarnation, Chronos, and Extinction, along with the Grand Dao of Destiny and laws of Fate, Life, Death, and Chaos. The seamless mixture of all these laws and Daos makes it possible for Samsara to come to fruition. When these Daos and Laws are fully fused together into a single thing, one achieves the full Edict of Samsara. With this Edict, an existence becomes capable of binding their soul to their reality, capable of traversing its different time points as they wish without creating Miniature Branching Realities, even in the face of death. With very few exceptions dealing with the involvement of other Edicts- as long as their reality remains, their soul will never perish. The traversal of time can only be done backwards, with beings comprehending Samsara being capable of jumping forward to the time point they already experienced before, but not to a future time point they never experienced. Traversing to the past has a great cost in mana, and it covers the return to the future point that the Edict was initially used at as the return costs no mana. Along with this, any Nomological Edict grants its user a smoother pathway towards ●●●●●●●, granting them an increase in the speed of their Realm Progression by +1,000,000%, an increase of +10,000,000% to All Parameters, and increases the chances of Fusions of other Laws and Daos by 10% for the production of other Nomological Edicts. Current fusion of the laws and Daos for the Nomological Edict of Samsara : 10%","This was a Nomological Edict of Samsara! It was the combination of a myriad of Daos and Laws as there were two in particular that Noah had not even come in contact with before!","Yet at this moment...","THRUM!","The eruption of the essence of Reincarnation and Extinction bloomed from within his Origin.","They were contained in the Nomological Edict, and now that Noah obtained it....he also obtained all the Daos within it!"]},{"number":1152,"title":"Chapter 1152: Chapter 1151 - A ! III","paragraphs":["The Daos that Noah was seeking to obtain through [Cosmic Dao Integration and Emergence] and even through a later Protagonist’s Bookmark actually landed on his lap so simply as they were the Daos required to fuse to bring to light the Nomological Edict of Samsara.","WAA!","Their essence rotated gloriously within Noah’s Origin as he felt his Comprehension of these 2 new foreign Daos clearly, their majesty not one bit lower than Chronos as these Daos, Destiny, and a myriad of laws went together to birth Samsara!","A Nomological Edict that granted Noah a Ten million percent increase in All Parameters while he had only traversed it by 10%.","There was no such thing as comprehension and assimilation for Nomological Edicts, one only being able to traverse them and bring them to completion once they entirely fused the required Daos and Laws.","The 30 seconds of Bookmark has granted Noah a mere 10% as even this was shocking enough, granting Noah a myriad of ridiculous boosts that continued to propel his strength to crazy levels, His Origin currently shaking madly from the sheer pressure that he alone released!","But aside from any boosts that this Nomological Edict provided...there was the most important feature that made it a true Edict.","The undeniable truth of someone binding their soup to their reality as for them...death was extremely hard to come by! Only those with other Edicts could interfere against them, and even those Edicts had to be opposing to be able to match and dispel the effects of another!","This was the true and most stupendous boost that Noah had received as aside from his Origin erupting with the brand new essences of Reincarnation and Extinction, his soul had begun to brighten up magisterially as he experienced a shocking phenomenon.","As if he was in the dark, his eyes brightened up as his consciousness was brought to an entirely new location. He saw an ever expanding whiteness as his eyes came to finally focus on the sight in front of him...and it was an endless river!","A vast river that churned forward endlessly as it contained a myriad of colors, this river releasing a shocking sense of might and awe as Noah’s mind shook at the fact that the Primordial he had Bookmarked...had something similar to this.","Hers was vastly smaller, being even a few thousand times smaller...but!","He was shocked as from the knowledge he was currently receiving, this endless river before him represented the vast timeline of this reality, and it truly represented a Reality!","What he had seen within the Primordial’s soul...it couldn’t have been a stage of power that one could achieve, right?","...!","The thoughts caused Noah’s heart to shake as his surprises weren’t over, his consciousness watching as he was drawn closer to the vast and endless multicolored river, his soul sinking into it seamlessly as at this moment...he felt as if he had been anchored to something.","He felt a feeling of utter stability and confidence, the most important effect of the Nomological Edict of Samsara being achieved at this moment.","One’s soul being bound to a reality as death was hard for them to chase even if they wanted, and they could seamlessly traverse through the timeline of this reality without any repercussions!","Granted, one could not go forward to a time point they had yet to experience, but they could traverse to the past and back to the area they already reached seamlessly as such a thing made Noah’s mind abuzz with possibilities.","As he felt his soul bound tightly to the vast and endless river before him, Noah felt like he was a mere ant floating in the waves of an endless ocean, a grain of sand in an expansive desert!","Yet within this vastness...he could now see himself.","He could see a barely discernible line in this vast and endless river that represented his life- his timeline!","THRUM!","Essence weaved out of Noah’s Origin in large amounts, even larger than anything he had utilized it for in the past, even more abundant essence than when he had helped form the Infinite Cosmos.","It was the essence that beings far above his level required in order to utilize the unique powers of a Nomological Edict, and Noah was currently expanding his mana as he unconsciously activated the Nomological Edict of Samsara!","His consciousness brightened as while looking at the thin line traveling in the endless river that represented his timeline, Noah glanced at a time point of this line as his soul sank into it seamlessly.","Droves and droves of essence were expanded as the Nomological Edict of Samsara was activated by Noah for the first time, this activation actually causing him to jump back to a previous time point within his life seamlessly as the abundant mana was required now to guarantee that he could return to the future- the cost of the return being zero as mentioned in the definition within the Nomological Edict of Samsara seen before.","This was to prevent a scenario where a being returns back to a time when they had none or very little power, and they might find themselves stuck back in time tens or hundreds of years without being capable of returning to their original future time point through a jump in time!","Noah paid this price as he felt his consciousness seemingly go to sleep for a second, but a moment later, his sight brightened up as he opened his eyes and saw...","The image of the powerful figure of the Holy Emperor of the Expansive Dragon Cluster, the father of Anna’s mother from the Nexus Galaxy who was currently speaking to him in a domineering manner!","\"I want to provide you with the protection you need as you grow, as well as all the resources you can think of. All I want from you is your allegiance once you reach the rank of an Entity, as this will strengthen our Expansive Dragon Cluster even further.\"","Noah was in a stupor as he raised his arms to look at himself as he also sensed the QUASAR that made up his Origin!","Before Noah even replied with the domineering words he said to this being before, an invisible light shone over his soul as he experienced darkness again, this time the feeling being something he was used to as droves of mana were used yet again, his intentions being sent out to the Nomological Edict of Samsara as after what seemed like forever, Noah opened his eyes again.","Everything had changed again.","This scene before him was a despondent one, being that of an unkempt apartment room as he found himself in a scrawny body that was currently holding a skill book in his hands.","It was a Rank F [Fireball] Skill Book within his hands, Noah raising his head as his eyes shined with innumerable lights, coming back to a time right before he awakened!","This was the Nomological Edict of Samsara!","This was what one could possibly do with it!"]},{"number":1153,"title":"Chapter 1153: Chapter 1152 - Infinite Possibilities! I","paragraphs":["It was an extremely interesting sight for Noah to see himself when he was in the past, and even more interesting when he could think and move as he wished!","His thoughts moved as his intentions were felt by the skill book in his hand, a brilliant light spreading out as it disappeared into a flicker of light and entered his chest.","Awakened.","Noah had returned to the time when he first awakened as with curious eyes, he pulled up the Stat Panel to see the same thing he experienced before!","[Noah Osmont]","[Vitality: 10]","[Focus: - ]","[Strength: 10]","[Skill(s): Fireball]","\"Ah...\"","What a sight to see! This was the point in the journey where Noah had begun, with his life only reaching greater and greater heights from here on out. The biggest conundrum that Noah had when he obtained such a unique thing like the Nomological Edict of Samsara was just how he would utilize its aspect of allowing him to travel to different time points within his life.","Would he actively go back in time and change something? With the knowledge he now had, could he do something different or advance at an even faster pace? The possibilities when one thought about this were endless!","But for the current Noah...he didn’t see the need to re-live his entire life as the choices he had made during it got him to where he was today!","His journey was always one filled with excitement, and he had only ever gone back in time once during the battle with the Devilish Time Unveiler to relieve a brief period of his life. Could he progress through the Realms faster now that he knew of many things that would be considered secrets to him before? Possibly! But Noah already saw the strongest foundation of his current life right now as at this moment...he would not remain here to relive all of it.","\"Maybe another time...\"","He uttered out slowly with a smile as he gazed at his old dilapidated apartment, an anchor deep in his soul shimmering brightly at this moment as he sent his thoughts forward, his consciousness being pulled away once again!","THRUM!","A cacophony of light and regality later, his eyes opened once more as he found himself in the Ruination Realm.","His Cosmic Treasure was vibrating peacefully within his Origin as he felt the connection with the Cosmic Core and the Quintillions of existences within it, his heart utterly at peace as he had gained something that made him feel extremely safe and content!","With the Nomological Edict, Noah felt that his journey that was somewhat uncertain before had gained a sense of stability, and he could move forward with confidence with such stability as he wouldn’t look back- but only ceaselessly go forward!","If ever there was a need to relieve his life in the future? Maybe things would change then. But for now...his attention returned to his current events as he looked at everything that he was.","His body was still swirling intensely with the Cosmic Daos of Reincarnation and Extinction, the respective Dao Fruits of these Daos becoming available for him to plant at the moment that he gained comprehension in them. Then there was the grand feeling of the Nomological Edict of Samsara.","He felt as if this Edict was an illusory thing, where one wouldn’t even be able to check his Origin and Soul to find traces of such a thing!","The knowledge of Nomological Edicts and such things would be something that Noah planned to place a lot of focus on in the near future, along with the stupendous question of what was better between Nomological Edicts and Runic Dao Lines.","If he deconstructed and reconstructed Daos into Runic Lines, he permanently lost them in exchange for the stupendous power they provided, the Runic Dao Tattoos they formed being the thing that would release the essence of these Daos when he activated them.","But Nomological Edicts required the fusion of Daos and Laws as it seemed even more pristine, even the Primordial having such a thing with her! She didn’t seem to opt into the option of Runic Dao Lines as her focus lay in Nomological Edicts, while the Aegon that Noah saw with her was fully on the path of Runic Dao Lines- but Noah also couldn’t say if this being didn’t know Nomological Edicts!","It was something that Noah would have to put a lot of thought into for how exactly he wanted to proceed from here!","---","Across the vast Ruination Seas.","In the location where Noah’s portion of soul had escaped quickly, the cold voice of the Primordial stretched out.","\"Nomological Edict of Samsara.\"","THRUM!","Her figure released shocking amounts of light as beside her, Aegon’s figure seemed to fade away into nothingness! Under the use of the Edict of Samsara, the Primordial operated under shocking rules and authority as she weaved back in time, trying to see just who had been snooping on their conversation earlier!","\"Let’s see...it was around this time that little Aegon noticed it?\"","Her veiled eyes flickered with powerful light as she saw time being wound back and returned to half a minute ago. Yet...","No matter how she spread her senses, she wasn’t able to find what she was looking for! No consciousness, no other existence, nothing!","In the rewound time, She glanced towards the figure of Aegon who was actually looking towards her, his voice echoing out slowly.","\"You still cannot find what was here?\"","...!","With his eyes utterly black and devoid of emotions, Aegon voiced out as if he remembered exactly what occurred in the future! Even though the Primordial was the one to use the Edict of Samsara, Aegon still somehow remembered the events of a future he had yet to experience as even the Primordial looked towards him with a sharp gaze!","This existence...was truly powerful and unique!","Even the Primordial thought as much as her figure began to be covered with an intense light, her words ringing out.","\"Either a powerful Cosmic Primordial Beast has arisen or there is another existence playing tricks. I have to leave and check a few things.\"","Before her words even finished, her figure had already disappeared in a flash of Primordial and Ruination essence as the only being left behind was the wild and sharp looking Aegon!"]},{"number":1154,"title":"Chapter 1154: Chapter 1153 - Infinite Possibilities! II","paragraphs":["The Primordial had tried to locate whatever consciousness had been around them and failed, such an action being something extremely unique as it meant interferences or even more unsavory possibilities.","Thus, it had to be looked into right away as without waiting for too long, she disappeared with a flash of Ruination and Primordial Essence!","With his exquisitely defined and sculpted figure, Aegon stared at the position that the Primordial just left for a few more seconds before his eyes returned to the myriad of Cosmos below him some light years away.","A consciousness had arisen to snoop a conversation between him and another powerful existence, and yet they couldn’t catch or find traces of it no matter what the powerful Primordial did! Such a thought caused the eyes of this existence to flash with intense light, his figure beginning to light up with multicolored lights as the runic lines on his skin undulated powerfully!","He then tore through space as he returned to the manyCosmos below, this being carrying a myriad of mysteries and thoughts as the main thing remained centermost for him.","That was...authority and strength!","Thus...the trace of a certain someone wasn’t found, even with the horrendous power of a Primordial. But why was it so?","Of course, it was all due to the Edict of Samsara.","Noah obtaining the Nomological Edict of Samsara as the first thing from the Primordial was extremely important, and it was the thing that would make way for a stupendous future to become a reality!","If his soul had grabbed onto anything else, the Primordial would have easily been able to use her immense power to locate him throughout time as knowing their wrath- Noah would have been eradicated.","Even if he grabbed another Nomological Edict from the Primordial, escaping death would have been nigh impossible as his enemy could just go back to when he wasn’t even an F Rank Hunter to kill him!","But he grabbed the Nomological Edict of Samsara.","One of the few Edicts that masked a being from others capable of using Edicts- one of the few Edicts that made it very hard for one to find out any information about him as he had anchored himself onto a Reality!","This...would be a reason for a future that even Primordials would only be watching in utter shock and horror to come to fruition!","---","Within the Ruination Realm.","Noah saw the hard work of the Primordial Ruination Clone that was currently forging Galaxies within a universe at a visible speed, the boosts in advancing through Realms under the newly gained Nomological Edict of Samsara not being light ones!","Seeing the rate of progress, Noah calculated that he should now be capable of forging over ten Universes daily if not slightly more- and this was a change from him only being able to forge a single Universe in a day.","Such was the stupendous power of a Nomological Edict as Noah truly wondered how the Primordials were able to fuse a myriad of Daos and Laws to make them possible, with his mind also focusing on himself as he asked...how could he do it as well?!","WAA!","His eyes flashed brightly as the Runic Dao Lines within his right hand undulated with power, many things coming to his mind as for him, the first thing he could think of would be to either design a skill or a Dao that could help with such a thing!","But...would it really be possible to form things as high as Nomological Edicts in this manner? Only time would tell as he began to experiment.","---","Time ebbed and flowed.","In the Novus Universe that had properly lined Galaxies that acted as cultivation fields for Dao Fruits and Herbs, Noah’s figure reappeared grandly as it seemed he was only gone for a minute or two at most.","Yet when he returned...","RUMBLE!","The surrounding space shook and actually fractured as his right arm unconsciously released terrifying pressure, a pressure that even caused the existences that had just chosen Archetypes and were feeling high and mighty to have a great change in expressions!","Noah noticed this right away as this pressure disappeared soon after, the Runic Dao Tattos on his arm becoming much milder as he smiled apologetically while glancing at those closest to him that had chosen their Archetypes.","He could see Temporal Lords, Blood Lords, Annihilators, Summoners, and even Incandescence Guardians from the unique light that they now carried with them, all of these beings now wielding the power of Hegemonies even though their Origins had not yet formed a Universe.","It was a unique scenario to experience as these beings had to work hard to quickly have their Origins catch up to the level of power they could wield, otherwise they might not be able to handle the expenditure with their lower levels alone!","In the future, Noah imagined 500 existences with powerful Archetypes divided into multiple camps, where groups of beings with the classes of Temporal Lords could fight together, or existences choosing Summoners could bring entire armies of beasts by themselves!","If ever he upgraded the Grand Dao of Archetypes to the Cosmic Level, this number would be even higher as such were all possibilities.","If he brought all of such beings to the rank of Antiquity...the force he would wield would be something terrific as he looked forward to such a future.","With such thoughts in his mind, Noah spoke out grandly.","\"You all consolidate your strength and your new abilities...I will be forging ahead first and begin exploring the vast Ruination Seas for what else is out there. Be ready for anything and everything!\"","THRUM!","After just leaving for a few minutes, Noah returned with a new proclamation as many beings couldn’t even keep up, those that were closest to him smiling wryly as they watched his oppressive figure that had shattered space just from its mere appearance fade away.","The exploration of the vast seas of Ruination!","It was the finding of new lands and opportunities, with Noah expectant to see what he would find hidden across the crimson seas that very few could cross!"]},{"number":1155,"title":"Chapter 1155: Chapter 1154 - Exploring The Vast Seas Of Ruination! I","paragraphs":["The expansive and endless Ruination Sea that contained a myriad of hidden existences and Cosmos floating within!","Very few beings got a chance to explore such vastness, and such privilege was left against unique beings that comprehended the Dao Ruination or the Primordial Dao, and those with unique power that they could survive against the ravaging of Ruination in one piece for a long period of time.","Noah...had both the Primordial Dao and Ruination, as well as a Cosmic Treasure that stemmed from Ruination as his journey across the vast Ruination Sea could not have been any more comfortable.","While his subordinates chose their Archetypes and he wrapped up his preparations in the Primordial Cosmos, he had pulled out the Primordial Ruination Clone to be the one to traverse the Ruination Sea as his main body took its place in the Ruination Realm to continue forging new universes, with his clones moving throughout the Cosmos to complete any tasks needed of him as well as spend time with the people that he was gradually becoming very connected to!","The job of his main body wasn’t just to forge new universes as the task of theorizing about Nomological Edicts and the fusion of Daos and Laws and how he could seamlessly bring this about was being handled by him, as well as the design of the remaining slots for Cosmic and Grand Daos.","The design of Daos was something Noah didn’t want to rush as even the Cosmic Core didn’t know when the next time would be where it would gain the capability to forge more Cosmic Daos, or what conditions would have to be met for the Infinite Cosmos to achieve the next step and unlock a myriad of new possibilities!","Then there was the deconstruction of the reconstruction of Daos to form new Dao Lines. This method of power was extremely overbearing with the permanent erasure of the selected Dao, but the power obtained was stupendous as it could make one more powerful by multiple factors. But its cost reduced the possibility to form Nomologic Edicts! So even with this, Noah was tasked with a problem he had to solve.","Meanwhile, his Primordial Ruination Clone...","\"Ah...\"","Was relaxing on the back of the Colossal Helios Leviathan that was currently traversing across the Ruination Sea, a myriad of Extinction Grapefruits being dawned into his mouth as he held the face of contentment while traversing the red seas with the Leviathan.","The enormous creature had its entire body glistening in a crystalline fashion as it was galaxy colored, making it seem like a galaxy was moving through the crimson sea while a human surrounded by multiple other Animus Summons sat atop it!","The wobbly Blue Slime was bouncing happily on Noah’s head as beside them, Tiamat was looking at the terrifying Slime that was actually stronger than all of them with sharp eyes.","The black flash of light that was the rapidly moving Obsidian Panther could be seen constantly around them, with one occasionally hearing this summon voice out \"I’m fast as F***!\"","The magnificent Oculothorax shining in gold and emanating deadly rays of soul destroying light was floating nearby peacefully, the Galaxy Devouring Serpent coiled up like an old man as its eyes shone with a light of dominance!","A golden crown could be seen on the Calamity Bear and the Golden Crow as even the Draconic Serpent twins could be seen in their human forms nearby...all of Noah’s summons moving with him across the Ruination Sea as each of them had a thin layer of Ruination Protecting them that stemmed from nobody else but Noah.","Each of their bodies glimmered brightly with a myriad of Universes, these Summons being some of the luckiest existences in this time as they could have their power elevated to the level of their Master with a spam of a skill.","All of them had been traversing the Ruination Seas peacefully in the past few days, everything seeming brand new and fun during the first day but as time dragged on and everything they saw was just an expanse of red all around, it all seemed bland to them at this moment as they wished for something to happen!","\"What exactly are you looking for?\"","Tiamat grabbed the wobbly Blue Slime from Noah’s head as she placed it on her chest, the body of the slime struggling to get out of her grasp and return to Noah’s head as she posed a question.","Towards this, Noah only smiled lightly as he continued to throw more Extinction Grapefruits into his mouth, his voice coming out between the bites.","\"A wandering existence, a Cosmos...even a Primordial Beast would do at this point.\"","WAA!","He calmly stated out domineering words like meeting the terrifying Primordial Beasts as he continued.","\"Of course, we don’t have to worry. Destiny had told me a few days back that we wouldn’t be bored for too long, and it should be something exciting that we come across as I can already feel my Fortune churning.\"","Yes!","Even though they had been traveling across the expansive Ruination Seas for the past few days and found nothing, this was extremely normal! The Colossal Helios Leviathan had been moving faster than the speed of time as it tore across the red seas, but not once did they come by anything. But his fortune and destiny were already telling Noah that it would not be this way for too much longer.","Coincidentally enough or due to his Protagonist Trait that was always trying to affect reality in a certain direction, his words didn’t even fully settle for long before he raised his head as his eyes shone brightly.","\"Hmmm?\"","His eyes shone lustrously as he could see something that wasn’t an expansive red sea!","\"Slow down.\"","He patted the crystalline surface of the Colossal Helios Leviathan as the beast stopped tearing through the sea at light speed, the moving titan slowing down as the scene a few light years away from them gradually became clear!","It was that of a glimmering Cosmos....but a huge commotion seemed to be occurring as in front of this Cosmos, they could all see and feel the aura of a terrifying Beast!"]},{"number":1156,"title":"Chapter 1156: Chapter 1155 - Exploring The Vast Seas Of Ruination! II","paragraphs":["The scene before Noah was an astounding one, his eyes capturing the image of an expansive Cosmos right before their eyes, but he could also see that a portion of the boundary of this Cosmos was torn, a tear made through one of its Universes as a powerful Beast shining in a gorgeous array of colors could be seen sending out terrifying attacks into the torn Universal Layer as the aura of multiple Antiquities and Hegemonies could be felt within defending!","\"Beautiful...\"","Noah was in a stupor as this was the only way he could describe the sight of the beast and what it was currently doing. Its figure shone with an incandescence of colors, glimmering gold and white as he could see streaks of red on its lustrous fur, the Beast before his eyes only being described as something that was the combination of the most pristine dragons and phoenixes!","With glimmering pairs of three phoenix like wings and terrifying jaws with sharp teeth that were tearing apart the very layers of a Universe, Noah watched as this beast would send out a claw that released storms of Ruination Essence into the defenders of this Cosmos, and while these beings defended against that- it would open its wide jaws and suck in a portion of the nearby Universe.","The boundary of the universe continued to decrease as the Antiquities, Hegemonies, and a myriad of Paragons and Monarchs behind them only continued to be pushed back, none of them actually gaining the upper hand against this beautifully terrifying creature!","\"Primordial Beast...\"","Noah’s eyes glimmered with intense light as he gazed upon these existences for the first time. He saw how they shone brightly as if they were sacred creatures, but these were the very same beasts that devoured entire Universes and Cosmos to grow stronger.","He was seeing one right before his eyes at this moment as he could see hundreds of manifested Universes glimmering brightly on the chest of this creature, this Primordial Beast at most being a Lesser Primordial Beast that had yet to devour enough Universes or Cosmos to become a Grand or Cosmic Primordial Beast.","As he glanced upon this and the new Cosmos before his eyes, Noah rose from the Colossal Helios Leviathan as it began to slowly swim forward, his eyes releasing golden rays of light as the Star of Conquest shone brightly above his head!","---","\"Persevere!\"","RUMBLE!","A bellow came from an aged looking figure that had a pristine wizened face of an old man, and yet his body thrummed with immense power as hundreds of Universes shone brightly within this being’s Origin.","\"Father...we cannot take another minute of this! We have to pull back, otherwise the death toll will only increase. Let them stay behind to defend as we prepare an impenetrable wall in the Skylar Universe!\"","WAA!","Not too far from the Old Man releasing waves of power and trying to withstand the storms of Ruination barraging his way, his son- another existence releasing the aura of an Antiquity as his body shone with bright golden rays of light...this being spoke out in a cold tone while glancing at the millions of Hegemonies, Paragons, and Monarchs behind him.","He would rather sacrifice these beings and this Universe as they prepared their forces to fully withstand this beast in the adjacent Universe, seeing the torn barrier and storms of Ruination around them as this being considered this Universe as good as gone!","\"Alex...you!\"","The wizened Old Man had a trace of anger course through his eyes when he heard the words of his son, his eyes that were sharp like swords and the white hair from his head and beard dancing madly as his hands weaved out, miniaturized galaxies filled with unstable essence of Extinction being released as they smashed into the Ruination storms around them and slowly dissipated them.","\"We cannot let this Beast have even a single Universe, or it will grow too powerful and we cannot defend against it anymore. It would seal the fate of our Cosmos!\"","RUMBLE!","\"Hold strong...I have already sent word, help should soon arrive. Charles, Lexis, Viola...with me!\"","His aged voice contained countless wisdom as well as anger, his eyes gazing towards his son while dimming ever so slowly waves of disappointment flew out.","’What a son! What a future ruler! To be discarding his subjects and run to the next universe while not thinking of the consequences...ah’","BOOM!","His essence moved with even greater fervor as his son and the few other Antiquities he called upon continued to pour in all their strength to defend against this beast before them.","\"Yaa!\"","Battle cries could be heard throughout as they each used their own unique skills, their bodies shining with the essence of a myriad of Cosmic and Grand Daos as they tried their best to fend off a Primordial Beast that had attacked their Cosmos for the first time in history.","It was a race against time as they had already called for reinforcements, but they didn’t think they could hold on!","When it came to this Primordial Beast, they couldn’t even enter the Ruination Sea to battle it or deal any damage to it as none of them comprehended Ruination or the Primordial Dao, and the Beast was cunning enough to always remains in the Ruination Sea while beginning to swallow the Universe they were defending.","A light of intelligence crossed through its eyes as it continued to lay out attacks filled with Ruination on one side, and it then swallowed portions of the Universe on the other side.","\"AWOOO!\"","The magisterial creature let out a frightful bellow of excitement as the situation continued, knowing that a momentous chance had come upon its life as if it devoured the universe within this Cosmos before it...ah!","But...","There were expectations, then there was reality.","Reality...would not always play out as most expect it to!","THRUM!","At this moment, The Primordial Beast and the myriad of Antiquities, Hegemonies, Paragons, and even Monarchs that were trying to defend their Cosmos all turned towards a single direction in the crimson Ruination Sea.","Normally, nothing would be able to be seen there, but at this moment, they felt the oppressive aura of something bellow out and reach them, each of their eyes widening as they looked over and found a single man at the very forefront of an enormous Colossal Helios Leviathan, a few other auras situated beside him as this being....had a bright smile across his face as his eyes shone with beams of golden light!"]},{"number":1157,"title":"Chapter 1157: Chapter 1156 - A Primordial Beast! I","paragraphs":["BOOM!","The scene before Augustus was an abysmal one as even while his body released waves of Extinction, all he could do was merely hold back against the attacks of the terrifying Primordial Beast before him as even those he depended on were faring no better than him.","Time seemed to be moving in slow motion as his eyes captured the powerful crimson storms descending from the claws of the glimmering Primordial Beast before them, as well as the figures of Antiquities letting out waves of power only slightly below his!","His son Alex and daughter Lexis, as well as the Antiquities under him known as Charles and Viola. Then there was him. The ruler of this Indigo Cosmos, and the being that should be able to defend it against all the threats it ever faced.","Augustus Marcus Tiberius!","The King of the Indigo Cosmos who always sat upon a high throne, and yet his brilliant blue robe was currently looking dim under the attacks of the Primordial Beast as his heart was turning increasingly more somber and pained.","He only arrived at the position he was in due to the quintillions that supported him, and he truly didn’t want to let them down or sacrifice any of them to this beast! Not even a single universe! But...the options weren’t there.","He recalled his son’s words of sacrificing this Universe as anger flared up within him yet again, his body rumbling with power as he bellowed out!","\"PERSEVERE!\"","RUMBLE!","Extinction waved out madly as waves of pristine blue were carried with it, everyone moving with emotion when they saw King Augustus move with such fervor before them. Their universes burned brightly as all of them moved with a single belief- and that belief was that help was coming.","They had already sent word to the force they were connected to as they should be able to send someone to help them even with the terrifying beast before them. They were waiting...which was why it was an even more shocking thing for them to be surprised when they saw the appearance of multiple existences nearing their location from the crimson Ruination Seas!","King Augustus and the Primordial Beast were the first to see the arriving figures, their sheer aura causing a lull to appear in the battle as their figures alone demanded to be looked at as they stole all attention. Even the Primordial Beast had for some reason paused as its eyes flashed with a chilling light.","A figure with sharply shining golden eyes had his hair flying wildly, standing atop a Colossal Helios Leviathan as he actually looked at the scene below him with a smile!","Around him, a terrifying Serpent and a myriad of other Beasts could be seen as weirdly enough, even a slime was bouncing excitedly on his head.","When King Augustus saw this scene...he was actually slightly disappointed as it wasn’t the help he was expecting! But nonetheless...anything that wasn’t a Primordial Beast in the Ruination Seas was not an enemy, even more so when such a being could traverse the Ruination Seas! And even more so when it was a whole party of them, even if it looked like a man walking around with his beasts.","Anyone with such an ability meant they had comprehended Ruination or the Primordial Dao, and any of such beings were renowned Antiquities with great strength. So Augustus recovered first within this lull in battle as he bellowed out.","\"Friends! Aid us to hold this beast back just until aid arrives!\"","WAA!","A call for help!","The hearts of the other Antiquities lifted at such a scene, observing that all of the newly appearing existences before them had multiple glimmering Universes that represented multiple Antiquities. With this they should be able to hold on with ease or even possibly push this beast back, right?","WOOOO!","A unique cry was released from the Primordial Beast as it actually stopped attacking the universe of the Indigo Cosmos, its eyes fixed on Noah as this existence could instinctively sense something different about this newly appearing being!","It was first angered that an easy meal was interrupted, and even more angered that it could feel a threatening sensation against this being before it.","How dare for such a puny existence to deny the might of a magisterial galaxy-sized Primordial Beast?!","RUMBLE!","With a frightful bellow, King Augustus and others watched in shock as the Primordial Beast that had been focused on their Universe this whole time actually turned around and turned into a streak of light that tore through the Ruination Sea towards the newly appearing being.","Its bestial golden, white, and crimson furred body glistened gloriously as Ruination Essence weaved around it dangerously, intent on ripping apart the intruder before they even got a chance to make an introduction!","But...","WAP!","Before the Primordial Beast could even reach the enormous Colossal Helios Leviathan that the figure stood on, everyone heard a sound akin to glass shattering as they felt their hearts shake, the crimson seas in front of the Primordial Beast unstably breaking apart and leaving an expansive space filled with a void as in a nigh instantaneous manner, the figure standing on the leviathan had appeared right before the Primordial Beast.","...!","King Augustus watched this scene as his pupils began to dilate, watching as the small figure of the human that was a few thousand times smaller than the Primordial Beast actually appeared before it fearlessly and in such a fast manner that even the nearby crimson seas were pushed apart...this being stretching out his right hand as if he was merely punching!","RIIIP!","The exquisite robe that draped over his hand began to rip apart from his fist as it stretched up to his shoulders, wondrous tattoos beginning to weave beautifully and powerfully as a terrifying pressure descended in the near few hundred light years.","Glistening Runic Dao Lines weaved majestically as they caused the eyes of all those watching to light up with shock, every single being finding their eyes focused on this being and his multicolored right hand that thundered straightforwardly towards a Primordial Beast!","No tricks or skills! Just sheer unbelievable speed and power as even the eyes of the Primordial Beast constricted with its fur standing at high alarm, shields of Ruination beginning to form around it as the terrifying multicolored hand arrived at this moment.","\"...\"","The sound didn’t register at first.","It was the void of Ruination that first shattered as its terrifying explosive force only reverberated thereafter.","BOOOOM!"]},{"number":1158,"title":"Chapter 1158: Chapter 1157 - A Primordial Beast! II","paragraphs":["A sound even louder than the implosion of a universe.","A sound that stemmed from a single being gloriously appearing before a Primordial Beast as he pushed out his hand that was glowing a myriad of colorful lights and smashed into the oversized creature in a devastating fashion!","BOOM...CRACK!","With a shatter and a crack of the very void of ruination, it seemed as if Noah’s small figure had rammed into a think and impenetrable balloon as his fist that was reinforced by Runic Dao Lines from a Lesser and Cosmic Dao actually tore apart the myriad of shields of ruination that the creature had conjured, smashing into its body as the impact sent it shooting back a few thousand miles!","\"ROAAR!\"","A painful cry ruptured out of the body of the Primordial Beast, its majestic figure stabilizing after a few thousand more miles as its eyes turned to look towards Noah in shock.","The eyes of King Augustus and the Antiquities around him also trembled as they could see the area where the Primordial Beast had been hit...ruptured muscle could be seen as golden blood sprayed out gloriously.","\"...!\"","Silence!","There was utter silence of shock not just from the Primordial Beast, but also the watching Antiquities as the Beast they could barely defend against was actually pushed back by a single punch from this being!","When their eyes locked upon his right hand that glimmered with a myriad of Dao Lines, their eyes brightened up as King Augustus voiced out with a vibrant and majestic voice.","\"Daolord!\"","OOOOOH!","A terrifying title was released by the leading Antiquity of the Indigo Cosmos as currently, Noah’s figure was experiencing waves and waves of power coursing through him!","The feeling of the Runic Dao Lines swirling within his right hand was to the point of it being euphoric, making him want to put in more and more essence into his hands as the Runic Dao Lines would only swirl faster.","Nomological Edicts were unique...but the Runic Dao Lines had something with them that Noah couldn’t put a finger on, but its feeling of power alone was purely stupendous as Noah’s figure undulated with waves of light, his eyes and mouths releasing rays of golden light amidst his bellow as his figure turned into a streak of light that arrived in front of the Primordial Beast once more, another punch was thrown out!","BOOM!","It was a fight of brutality and pure strength as with the Runic Dao Lines of Annihilation and Withering giving stupendous boosts as well as the 10 million percent increase in All Parameters from the Nomological Edict of Samsara... Noah received the perfect opponent to test the extent of his current strength.","It was against a magisterial Primordial Beast that looked like a combination of phoenixes and dragons, its golden white fur shimmering brightly in the crimson seas as at this moment, its golden blood had begun to leak out with fervor!","BOOM!","\"ROAAR!\"","Its furious bellows could be heard as it swiped at empty stops where Noah used to be, this existence not being able to catch Noah’s figure on speed alone as its pristine skin continued to get mutilated while golden blood flowed out.","The eyes of the Primordial Beast flashed with wrath and madness at such a scene, its body undulating with Ruination essence as Noah’s figure continued to weave around out and releasing terrific punches that were unavoidable!","The Antiquities of the Indigo Cosmos watched this scene in a stupor as the beast that they would have considered the ender of their Cosmos was actually matched against a single being. But these beings were not the only ones in a stupor.","From the direction their gazes had left, the enormous figure of the Colossal Helios Leviathan was floating forward powerfully. Above it, the humanoid form of Tiamat began to pulse with power as her curvaceous figure stood at the forefront of all the Animus Summons.","\"We won’t just be here gawking...show your worth to Master and don’t be mere leeches!\"","RUMBLE!","At her words, Noah’s summons flew out like streaks of light fearlessly, her own figure letting out powerful waves as a ten-headed dragon very soon erupted from it, rushing towards the enormous golden Primordial Beast that Noah was powerfully facing!","ZIP!","The cerulean figures of the Blue Slimes and Obsidian Panther were at the very forefront, their eyes shining brilliantly as they joined a battle of brutality to test their worth at the stage of Antiquity for the first time.","Noah felt his summons joining the battle as his smile only became brighter, the beat of his heart becoming even more excited as he rose above the figure of the Primordial Beast that gazed up at him with wrath. It had been trying to grasp onto him unsuccessfully in the past few seconds, the body of the beast currently vibrating with dangerous waves of power as at this time...Noah would go ahead and give it another head-on collision!","WAA!","In a magisterial fashion, his figure rose like a majestic Phoenix before descending down head-on towards the terrifying Primordial Beast","---","Augustus Marcus Tiberius! this was his name and title as the King of the Indigo Cosmos, this being having seen a great deal of things throughout his life.","He had seen much, but the scene of this being before him would forever be etched into his mind!","\"Daolord...\"","He called out a title again as he and the allies around him could only call the vibrant being this name after seeing the pulsating Runic Dao Lines coursing through his hand.","Daolords! Existences that had fully assimilated the abstruse laws of Ruination and the Primordial Daos as they crossed the vast Ruination Seas and lay waste to Primordial Beast using the tremendous power they obtained from the deconstruction of Daos!","Such beings were few and rare to see, with King Augustus only knowing of them as they were the Champions of the force he had already called for help from.","He also knew how to identify those beings as the one before him...didn’t stem from that force!","’Just who is....’","The thought of this being’s identity crossed his mind as the surrounding situation changed at this moment, all of them watching as his figure rose above the Primordial Beast before descending towards it in a fervor.","What was different this time around was that he wasn’t descending down with his shimmering multicolored right hand outstretched alone, with there being a myriad of Dao Essences extending behind him as the most potent one was the Primordial Dao!","From his small figure, they could hear a set of words ringing in their ears clearly.","\"Primordial Wheel of Extinction.\"","THRUM!","The first ability of a specially designed skill tree for the Cosmic Primordial Dao made its first appearance at this moment!","A pristine white wheel larger than a galaxy bloomed in the Ruination Sea as the beautiful crimson in the surroundings began to be dyed utterly white!"]},{"number":1159,"title":"Chapter 1159: Chapter 1158 - A Glorious Introduction! I","paragraphs":["In the Infinite Cosmos floating silently in the Ruination Sea.","Within the Novus Universe, the Oathkeeper was standing on a planet within a Galaxy that was designated as one to cultivate Primordial Apples, this entire galaxy suffusing with Primordial Dao Essence throughout!","He was currently in the fields of this planet that held the tall trees shining gold and white and bearing these fruits, plucking them one by one as he passed the field of golden white trees and came towards a clearing where two figures could be seen.","One was the miniaturized form of the Great Old Nazzagath that was normally far larger than a planet, this Chthonian currently floating off the earth silently in his form of a star as beside him...the imprisoned figure of the Goliath of the Primordial Cosmos could be seen!","Only half of his body had been released from the circular prison of Primordial Essence that the Oathkeeper initially put him in, his gaze silently on Oathkeeper as he came beside them with a handful of Primordial apples.","The look on the golden winged Antiquity was full of emotion as he looked at the two other oldest beings of the Primordial Cosmos, his voice stretching out slowly!","\"Choices...we all make bad ones every now and then, I just never thought someone as experienced as you would do what you did.\"","His voice was melancholic as he bit down on the Dao Fruits before him, the Great Old Nazzagath sighing as he partook in the Fruits as well- the oldest beings within the Cosmos being together as they looked for the direction of their lives!","Oathkeeper had a faraway look as he gazed upwards and looked towards the Ruination Sea outside, thinking of the being traversing it as he spoke out slowly.","\"The Antiquity of Mana actually left me with all the leeway on what happens to you, you know? He even said that without the actions that you and Chronos took, he wouldn’t be where he was today. He wanted me to pass along the thanks.\"","RUMBLE!","The body of the Goliath shook at such words as a period of silence descended.","It wasn’t until a minute later that this existence opened his mouth for the first time since his imprisonment!","\"Yes. Choices will always unfold paths none of us thought possible. I don’t know where this path will lead for me...but I am curious on what path that existence is going towards.\"","...!","The black hole on this being’s head swirled magnificently as he also gazed out into the vast Ruination Sea, wondering what Noah’s path had brought him to now!","The answer to this thought was complex and simple at the same time, Noah having found another Cosmos and actually battling a Primordial Beast at this time in a shocking fashion.","In the middle of this battle, the appearance of a shocking wheel filled with ancientness and majesty caused a milky white layer to appear in the crimson seas!","It swirled behind Noah majestically, this wheel seemingly made up of innumerable primordial runes that weaved together and turned like the gears on a clock. As Noah’s figure was descending down with his right hand shining with gorgeous colors, this wheel behind him...began to spin.","BZZZT!","The moment that the wheel began to spin, the Primordial Beast felt a stifling sensation lock onto it as razor-sharp Primordial Essence wrapped around its skin and began to constrict!","But it wasn’t just Primordial Essence.","Hidden within it all was another awe-inspiring Cosmic Dao...Extinction acting to support Primordial Essence as they created for a fantastical phenomenon.","\"ROAAR!\"","A shocked loud bellow was released when it felt the opposing Primordial Essence crush the ruination essence protecting it, and even more so as when the wheel continued to turn...the sense of constriction and suffocation the beast received from the Primordial Dao only became more and more terrifying.","This was the single skill termed [Primordial Wheel of Extinction] that Noah had designed among others when he was floating for days in the Ruination Sea and had nothing but time in his hands. A skill stemming from the skill tree that Noah ridiculously termed...[Cosmic Dao Integrations and Combinations]!","A skill tree he designed as a preliminary test for the future, one that would allow him to test the possibilities of combining and fusing daos to see if he could sense how to put them all together to form a Nomological Edict!","Since he hadn’t been able to do such a thing this whole time, he was beginning slowly with Daos to see what the effects of it would be. The result...was stupendous.","[Cosmic Dao Integrations and Combinations] :: A mere testing skill tree that observes the effects of combinations of different Dao Essences. Whether the combinations work or not, the effects are bound to be destructive. Abilities include [Universe of Turbidity](5/5), [Primordial Wheel of Extinction](5/5), [Endless Rays of Time](5/5), and [Compatibility](5/5). Cost of Skill Creation: 300 Billion Skill Points.","[Universe of Turbidity](5/5) :: The daos mixed within are too many, giving birth to a turbid and unstable compressed Universe. Within this Turbid Universe are the unstable essences of Ruination, Primordial, Conquest, Extinction, Chronos, and Reincarnation. The combination of daos is too unstable as once cast, one should run far, far away. Only the caster is exempted from the deleterious effects of this ability. To cast this skill, the sacrifice of a normal Universe from one’s Origin is required.","[Primordial Wheel of Extinction](5/5) :: An ability that conjures a runic wheel that utilizes the Primordial Essence and the essence of Extinction. The wheel will continue to turn as long as it is not broken, its selected target being constantly compressed and suffocated by the essence of the two Daos until death.","[Endless Rays of Time](5/5) :: An area of effect ability that utilizes the Dao essence of Chronos, Reincarnation, Space-time, and Vitality, along with the laws of Life and Death to bring to fruition scorching rays that tear apart time itself wherever they cross. Enemies hit by the Rays of Time experience Body and Soul Degradation, Instantaneous Necrosis, -100,000% Movement and Attack Speed, and -100,000% Reduction to Physical, Daos, and Laws Resistance. Once the ability activates, it continues to rain down the rays of time until it is deactivated.","[Compatibility](5/5) :: A Passive ability that allows for the successful combination casts of different daos without negative feedback on the caster’s origin, along with the ability to feel the compatibility of utilized Daos.","A stellar skill tree that Noah made to take the first steps towards Nomological Edicts was made!"]},{"number":1160,"title":"Chapter 1160: Chapter 1159 - A Glorious Introduction! II","paragraphs":["The skill tree of [Cosmic Dao Integrations and Combinations] was one of the things Noah had been working on in the past few days!","A Skill tree that tried to combine and put together a myriad of Daos, with the results varying to a shocking level for each of them. The [Primordial Wheel of Extinction] was actually the most stable as a terrifying wheel that would grind down the enemy until their death was produced, and there was also something like the [Universe of Turbidity] that held a combination of too many Daos as just to cast it required the sacrifice of a universe, with its effects being horrendous as it was more deadly than even the implosion of a Universe.","The ability of [Endless Rays of Time] even more compatible, Noah using the daos he already saw worked well together from the Nomological Edict of Samsara as the main base and adding other Daos to see what was possible.","It was actually with this combination that Noah saw the most possibility when it came to any future of him possibly making a Nomological Edict!","Lastly, there was the [Compatibility] passive that made the birth of this whole skill tree viable.","THRUM!","The Primordial Wheel of Extinction released an oppressive air that even caused the far away Antiquities to tremble as one could only imagine one the target of its attack would be feeling. Under the oppressive pressure of the Primordial Essence and Extinction grinding its body down, the Primordial Beast actually had its golden white fur becoming torn apart!","As its defenses tried to fight off this terrifying attack, there was an even more monstrous one coming as right before it, Noah’s figure was like an outstretched arrow with his pulsing right hand leading the way, descending down in a magisterial fashion as it seemed like the weight of an entire Cosmos lay behind him.","THUMP!","The powerful heart of the Primordial Beast churned and released waves of power as for the first time in its life, this terrifying beast actually felt fear!","A wave of savageness crossed through its eyes, its draconian phoenix-like jaws opening towards Noah’s descending figure and the Primordial Wheel of Extinction behind him as this terrifying beast began to spit out one of the unique attacks of Primordial Beasts.","CAA! ROAAR!","The cry of dragons and phoenixes resounded as a [Primordial Breath] was released from the Primordial Beast.","A glorious crimson pillar of Ruination blasted out from its jaws, this pillar of light moving faster than the speed of light as it instantly devoured Noah’s figure and the Primordial Wheel of Extinction behind him!","But...!","WAA!","When King Augustus and the other Antiquities squinted their eyes, they could still see that within the pillar of ruination snaking out from the Primordial Beast, Noah’s figure was still crossing through it as he neared the jaws of the beast.","Like a glimmer of light cutting through the red, the expansive white wheel behind him looking even more pristine as the Primordial Breath bounced off of it!","Even the Animus Summons coming to aid Noah found their eyes glimmering at the beautiful and fantastical scene, Noah withstanding the Primordial Breath of Ruination as a Cosmic Treasure rotated brightly on his chest and sucked in all the destructive blasts around him, his figure reaching the beast an instant later.","\"...\"","The surroundings turned utterly quiet as his pulsing right hand shimmering with a myriad of Runic Dao Lines tore into the jaws of the Primordial Beast and actually stretched towards in exposed throat, Noah’s figure sinking into its muscles as he disappeared into the body of the Primordial Beast!","...!","BZZZZT!","The Primordial Wheel of Extinction continued to turn as the eyes of the Beast were filled with even more savagery, its internal state beginning to heat up when it heard a set of words that would come to spell doom for many of its kind.","\"[Universe of Turbidity].\"","Quiet words stretched out as from within Noah’s Origin that now held dozens of Universes, with a majority of them being Splendiferous Universes- a normal one burnt and disappeared.","With its disappearance, the essence of a Ruination, Primordial, Conquest, Extinction, Chronos, and Reincarnation ran wild as from within the body of the Primordial Beast, a Universe was born!","An unstable and shockingly potent universe filled with the most destructive forms of Cosmic Dao Essences, Noah watching with his own eyes as the compressed universe began to shake unstably before in the next moment...it shattered.","...!","BOOOOM!","Those watching were stupefied at the scene playing out as the moment Noah’s glistening figure had disappeared into the body of the Primordial Beast, its eyes and muscles began to contort and expand as it there was something ballooning inside it that it could not bear...and this majestic golden furred beast had its tough bones and muscles ruptured and exploded out in the next moment as golden chunks of flesh and blood sprayed out gloriously!","WAA!","Along with this was a terrifying wave of force that even pushed away Noah’s Animus Summons that were coming to help, this wave of force even stretching out towards the figures of Antiquities from the Indigo Universe as it washed over them and caused them to spurt out bulbs of blood.","...!","A shocking attack that ended the life of a Primordial Beast!","When they all recovered, they refocused their eyes at the scene before them as all they saw was gold amidst the crimson red of the Ruination Sea.","River of golden blood had sprayed out as a terrifying beast had actually exploded from within, the cost of it being a forged Universe from one’s origin!","To Noah, this was only the cost of a few hours’ worth of hard work as he could forge a few Universes within a single day after he obtained the stupendous boosts from the Nomological Edict of Samsara.","His figure floated alone where the center of the beast used to be, with his body being entirely bathed in gold as his eyes still held a trace of might and battle intent!","But his focus had now turned above him, where he could see a pulsating Primordial Heart shimmering gold and white, drawing in the pristine golden rivers of blood around it as a supreme treasure was being forged.","It wasn’t the small heart that Noah was given by the Primordial, but a genuine and full Primordial Heart that was a few thousand miles in size!"]},{"number":1161,"title":"Chapter 1161: Chapter 1160 - Indigo Cosmos! I","paragraphs":["A Primordial Heart a few thousand miles in size!","Such a thing caused Noah’s heart to beat faster as he approached it, sensing its overabundance of essence as it drew in all the surroundings golden rivers of blood.","It glistened gold and white all over as other colors soon began to occupy it, Noah going forward as his luminescent right hand grabbed onto this Heart and pulled out a chunk from it thoughtfully!","THUMP!","It released waves of power as the chunk that he pulled out vibrated powerfully, very quickly condensing and turning into a smaller looking heart the size of his thumb.","\"Hmm?\"","His eyes flashed with light as he waved off his hands again, cutting off a huge chunk of the heart that was a few tens of miles, watching this fleshly mass also wriggle powerfully before it formed into a heart the size of his head!","The Treasure that was the Primordial Heart seemed like an extremely unique one, and this instance allowed Noah to know that the Primordial had only given him a small section of a Primordial Heart before! Granted, it was from a Grand Primordial Beast, but he now held a genuine Primordial Heart that was a few thousand miles long.","Imagine how many universes and Marks of Antiquity such a treasure would give! Even more so when he Duplicated it with the Cosmic Treasure of Ruination...","THUMP!","The enormous heart continued to release waves of power rhythmically, its enticing light washing over all the beings nearby as some Antiquities from the Indigo Universe had unknown lights sharply cross through their eyes.","The Primordial Heart before them represented many things, just some of them being a vast advancement in one’s level of power and might!","With it, one could also produce multiple Antiquities, and this was exactly what a certain being that stood above a myriad of Cosmos had done!","But for now, they could only stare at it all from afar.","SHAA!","The figures of the Blue Slime and Obsidian Panther arrived beside Noah as they also looked with hungry eyes towards the heart, the Blue Slime even going as far as to form a mouth and salivate while glancing at the thumping multicolored heart!","Tiamat in her draconic form also came over along with the rest of the summons, her voice grumbling out her discontent.","\"You could at least give us a chance to be useful...\"","The booming voice turned into a pouting one as she returned to her human form and came in front of Noah, a light laugh being released from him as he patted her head while waving his other hand and causing the enormous Primordial Heart to disappear.","The luminescence around them dimmed a little as the Ruination Sea calmed, only golden chunks of flesh remaining in the surroundings, and even these chunks were pulsating with power and awe!","Noah also collected these largest chunks of this beast as he wanted to see just how the taste of a Primordial Beast would be under his skills as a chef, the Ruination Sea gradually becoming cleared of any evidence that a Primordial Beast was here as only wisps of golden blood remained.","After the defeat of the Primordial Beast, Noah turned his eyes towards the direction of a torn Universe, his gaze being met with the eyes of multiple Antiquities that stayed behind the repairing barrier of the Universe and Cosmos.","The few of them had differing expressions as the one and only King Augustus came forward with a light smile- as if the shocking events that had just occurred had no bearing whatsoever as he called out.","\"Friend! We are a bit restricted with our own power and cannot come out to give you our thanks. Please, come into our Cosmos so we can host the one to get us out of this predicament today!\"","WAA!","The air of regality spread out from this being as he recovered faster than anybody else, pacifying the unique atmosphere as he straight away clarified their position while inviting Noah!","With a light smile, Noah returned atop the body of the Colossal Helios Leviathan as his Animus Summons did the same, all of them becoming smaller as they went towards the boundary of the Indigo Cosmos.","Before them were 5 Antiquities that were followed behind by millions of beings from the stages of Hegemonies until Monarchs, the one at the very forefront being the sharp King Augustus that was currently smiling warmly as he watched Noah and his summons near the boundary of the current universe and step in.","\"Seeing that you don’t have the unique attire of the Primordial Empire, is it best to assume that Friend stems from another location from the vast Seas of Ruination?\"","Noah observed the Antiquities before him and their varying expressions and power, picking up a great deal of details as he returned to focus on the wizened old man before him that had the aura of a powerful ruler!","\"Primordial Empire?\" Noah heard this term as he stepped before these beings with his summons, questioning in a light tone as his words caused the eyes of King Augustus to brighten up as he floated before Noah without an ounce of fear.","\"A surprise to have a Daolord like yourself not stem from the Primordial Empire around here! Please, allow us to express our thanks as we can share some knowledge between us as we go. We can call Young Friend Daolord...\"","King Augustus spoke questioningly as Noah heard the term Daolord once more, looking towards this Antiquity with curiosity as he voiced out lightly.","\"Osmont.\"","THRUM!","Noah uttered his name as uniquely, this alone caused a glorious air to suffuse out as Augustus nodded and began to point towards those behind him.","\"Daorlord Osmont, this is my son Alexus Marcus Tiberius, my daughter Lexis Marcus Tiberius, and our close compatriots Charles of the Blue Seas and Viola of the Vast Plains! I myself am Augustus Marcus Tiberius...and I welcome you to our little Indigo Cosmos!\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1162,"title":"Chapter 1162: Chapter 1161 - Indigo Cosmos! II","paragraphs":["An introduction was made as Noah laid his eyes on those mentioned. The two siblings- Alexus and Lexis, all had prominent glimmering white hair, this being even more prominent on Lexis that had this white hair cascading down her shoulders and even being long enough to cover her bountiful chest.","Her expression was one filled with an intelligent light as her eyes were gazing thoughtfully at Noah and all those around him!","Alexus had a careful expression as he looked forward with an impassive expression, this being looking like a suave middle aged man as his black robe covered expertly built muscles underneath it.","But as he looked at Noah who seemed even younger than him and the sense of power he wielded, a myriad of emotions passed through this being as he kept them hidden underneath!","The ones that King Augustus termed compatriots were powerful Antiquities that similar to Augustus and his children, had dozens of Universes glimmering brightly within their Origins.","The two of them gave polite bows to Noah as they expressed their thanks, Augustus waving invitingly towards Noah as he spoke to the Antiquities behind them.","\"You all take care of everything here as I welcome Daolord Osmont. Lexis, come and help get things ready!\"","His eyes gave many commands as he spoke, motioning for his son, Charles, and Viola to oversee the boundaries and areas of the destroyed Universe as well as the army behind them while he took in Noah and his party further into the Indigo Cosmos.","Noah was looking and feeling the atmosphere of the Universe and Cosmos around him as it truly felt uniquely different from the one he knew, this current universe he was in actually being filled with wisps of blue as he could actually see vast sparkling cerulean rivers stretching out across the void of space!","Bodies of water...snaking across the void of space!","Each of them glimmered brightly as unique lifeforms at the level of the Void Rank and above could be seen within.","King Augustus saw the scene of Noah marveling at the surroundings as he was about to speak, but his daughter beat him to it as with eyes flashing with a thoughtful light, she spoke.","\"Seeing as you must be a visitor from a faraway Cosmos, we can introduce somethings to Daolord Osmont. We’re currently in the Bluefield Universe, one of the many universes within the Indigo Cosmos that shared the unique feature of vast bodies of water stretching out across the void and within its Galaxies...\"","With an elegant demeanor, Lexis Marcus Tiberius began to introduce the new land before Noah as behind them, the figure of Alexus looked at this scene closely as he began to give orders, he and the other 2 Antiquities beginning to move busily!","Noah was listening carefully to the introduction he was being given, nodding here and there as soon enough, he posed his own question as they floated past the boundary of the Bluefield Universe and entered another.","\"You mentioned the Primordial Empire?\"","His question was directed to the King in front of him as he smiled lightly, an unknown light crossing through his eyes as he actually sighed before he spoke.","\"Yes. The Primordial Empire. The force that oversees a myriad of Cosmos- this one included, and the ones we sent word for help when the Primordial Beast first appeared. In exchange for our...allegiance, the Daolords and Antiquities of the Primordial Empire will come to our aid whenever they are called upon!\"","His eyes carried a myriad of emotions when he said this, a light of anger crossing through his and his daughter’s eyes at the fact that even now, these beings they sent word to help had not appeared!","Augustus had a thoughtful look as he floated forward, his aged eyes thinking of many things before they turned decisive, turning around and facing Noah as he spoke.","\"For the account of saving us from making any sacrifices against the Primordial Beast, I can share some knowledge with Daolord Osmont...as I know that is what you want the most!\"","WAA!","Noah’s eyes flashed as he reevaluated the old man before him once more, nodding his head as he saw the daughter of this King Augustus begin to emanate waves of power that released an Isolation Field around all of them.","This was a unique power of hers that allowed them to disappear into multiple layers of folded space, none of them being able to be perceived or seen in the outside space as whatever they talked about would be that of utter secrecy!","In this space, King Augustus breathed out as if a heavy weight was on his shoulders, glancing at Noah with a serious tone as he asked.","\"Daolord...if I were to ask you on what you think the most precious resource in a Cosmos is, what would you say?\"","The most precious resource in a Cosmos!","Noah had not expected such a question as he thought deeply, evaluating what he had experienced himself in the Primordial Cosmos as Tiamat voiced out an answer behind him that caused King Augustus to smile in an apologetic manner.","\"Of course, it is the Hegemonies and Antiquities that can defend the Cosmos in times like today!\"","\"Ah...I’m afraid not, my Lady!\"","The reply from Augustus caused Tiamat to raise her brows, turning towards Noah as she saw him reply with a smile.","\"It is the uncountable Quintillions of existences within it.\"","RUMBLE!","Yes!","For the many instances, the most precious resource within a Cosmos was not not its experts or a unique treasure that was found within it, but it was actually the myriad of beings that littered the Cosmos in large numbers!","\"Yes.\" The gaze of King Augustus had turned serious as he spoke. \"The existences within a Cosmos are the most important...and this is because all Hegemonies and Antiquities need them to achieve greater Realms of Power.\"","The eyes of Tiamat and the other summons shone sharply as a lesson began to be given by the king of another Cosmos.","For one to achieve Antiquity, they had to step into the Universal Filament Realm that could only be done after they transformed their Origin fully with 100 Billion Marks of Antiquity.","Everytime they wanted to increase their strength thereafter, they had to utilize another 100 Billion Marks of Antiquity to create Splendiferous Universes, their path to power always being limited by the number of Marks of Antiquity!","If one could obtain a precious treasure like a Primordial Heart, such an ordeal would be surpassed as they could forge multiple Splendiferous Universes with it, but those who could freely obtain such treasures already had thousands of Universes or were already in the Cosmic Realm!","So for the vast majority of existences...they had to obtain their strength from amassing Marks of Antiquities, and the most direct and efficient way to do this was to oversee and influence quintillions of beings across a myriad of Universes...or even Cosmos.","\"Ruling over and influencing countless quintillions of existences gives a huge boost in the Marks of Antiquity in the beginning, and the Marks continue to form over the years as one would just accumulate strength as time passes.\"","King Augustus spoke as he stared out across the hidden folds of space they were in and spoke shocking words.","\"This truth is what brings about our current situation...this truth is the reason behind everything that occurs in the Primordial Empire, in the Empire that Aegon the Conqueror forged!\"","...!"]},{"number":1163,"title":"Chapter 1163: Chapter 1162 - Indigo Cosmos! III","paragraphs":["For Antiquities to advance, they needed the common people!","The quintillions of existences across Universes were the resource they depended on to obtain their Marks of Antiquity, as very few had the ability to traverse the Ruination Seas to search for, much less win against a Primordial Beast.","\"Antiquities fight over the influence of their Universes and Cosmos, and Emperor Aegon revolutionized this as he created a vast Primordial Emperor with a myriad of Cosmos under his influence, all others working under him to oversee these Cosmos as it caused the rise of Kings below the single Emperor.\"","King Augustus spoke as if it was ancient history, Noah listening to his words carefully as he picked up on the name Aegon once more!","This was more than likely the terrifying figure he saw with the Primordial, many things fitting into place as Noah was gradually outing the pieces of the puzzle together.","\"Along with all this...there are the guidelines of newly discovered Cosmos that come under the banner of the Primordial Empire...\"","When new Cosmos were discovered by the Primordial Empire, they were placed under their protection as its Antiquities were given a method to contact the forces of the Primordial Empire if any problems ever arose- with these problems almost always referring to an attack from a Primordial Beast!","\"Herein lies another truth that very few know...the fact that once a Cosmos had been found an attacked by a Primordial Beast, it will inevitably continue to attract such terrifying creatures as if it has been branded- making it easy for it to face subsequent attacks whether it is a few days or thousands of years later!\"","...!","This new information caused Noah’s eyes to change as King Augustus continued.","\"This key truth is also something that Emperor Aegon used to his advantage as he...would gather close all the Universes that have survived the attacks of Primordial Beasts into his Primordial Empire, making it so that he and those below him would face these terrifying beasts whenever they come as their power...is something none of us can fathom!\"","WAA!","It was a stupendous action that guaranteed the safety of a Cosmos, but it had its own disadvantages as along with this...","\"Such an action means many things, but the most important thing is that when a Cosmos fully becomes a part of the Primordial Empire, they fall under its rules. The most important rule under Emperor Aegon states that...power goes to the strong.\"","...!","The gaze of this old King turned somber at this time as he stared at his daughter, Lexis seemingly urging him on as she nodded, this being sighing and continuing.","\"Power goes to the strong...so all newly joining Cosmos more than always have their ruling forces deposed and put under the influence of one of three most powerful forces within the Primordial Empire!\"","\"All so that the precious resource of quintillions of existences within a Cosmos falls under those who are truly strong, and it is not divided into weak kings that cannot contribute in the battle against the Primordial Beast. Emperor Aegon has established many rules on this process, but the core of it remains that the stronger will get even stronger...while the weaker will perish under the vicissitudes of time.\"","The strong get stronger while the weak only get weaker!","It was an ideology that Noah couldn’t argue with, the more he heard about this Emperor Aegon- the more he became impressed with this being!","Just who could drag a Cosmos across the Ruination Sea and place it as part of their empire?","Well, Noah could if he wanted- but he wondered of what means an existence like Aegon was using to transfer an entire Cosmos across the Ruination Sea.","This was a Cosmos!","Something countless light years in diameter that the numbers were something we couldn’t truly comprehend, and yet an existence could actually cause a Cosmos to change locations within the Ruination Sea.","This was the power of Aegon the Conqueror!","—","As Noah was introduced to something huge in the Indigo Cosmos, his main body in the Infinite Cosmos opened its eyes in the Ruination Realm as he stared into his Expansive Space.","There, an enormous pulsating heart could be seen as the parts he had cut off had rejoined the original one, the heart that was the size of a Large World pulsating beautifully as he took it out of the Expansive Space.","WAA!","An air of majesty and power emanated from this fantastic treasure, Noah looking at it with shining eyes as the Cosmic Treasure within his Primordial Ruination Clone was quickly transferred into his Origin, the pulsing RUINATION appeared beside him as he voiced out calmly.","\"You can duplicate it even if it is this big right?\"","<Size doesn’t matter to me, Master!>","THRUM!","The moment its words finished, a crimson light shone from RUINATION as it bathed the multicolored heart that was still majorly gold and white, this crimson light wrapping around it entirely as the enormous heart was somehow quickly pulled into the small Cosmic Treasure!","BZZT!","Waves of intense power undulated over the treasure for the next few seconds, the seconds becoming minutes as the process took some more time, but time was nothing for Noah. In another few minutes, rays of red light emerged from RUINATION as along with these lights, two world sized hearts emerged from it.","It was the seamless duplication of a genuine Primordial Heart, one that even Noah didn’t know how many Universes and Marks of Antiquities it would help him forge!","\"Well, let’s find out!\"","WAA!","With his multicolored hair flying around madly, Noah’s hand landed on the world sized Primordial Heart as he felt as if he connected onto a vast entity, surging energy oppressively shaking within it as its energy began to come in waves into his Origin.","It could be transformed into essence to forge Galaxies and Universes, or what could change the nature of their normal Daos into Dao Galaxies as they forged Splendiferous Universes. For Noah, he was going to do it all as he would turn all his remaining universes into Splendiferous ones and also forge even more, wanting to breach past the barrier of just dozens of Universes to go above a hundred!"]},{"number":1164,"title":"Chapter 1164: Chapter 1163 - We Are The Protectors! I","paragraphs":["WAA!","Vast droves of essence swirled around Noah as his hair waved madly, his Origin accepting the unique essence of the Primordial Heart as he focused on just one at this moment. As he saw millions upon millions of Dao Galaxies being forged, he was also making plans for sharing this wondrous treasure with his people as with it, he could effectively raise multiple antiquities and elevate the power of those with specific Archetypes to a greater level.","All of this...stemmed just from killing a single Primordial Beast as the importance one could place on such existences was not little.","And even though Noah was placing great importance on the type of treasure that was a Primordial Heart, he was actually still majorly off on its importance- as it was even higher than he could have imagined!","With the Primordial Hearts, things that were insurmountable and unimaginable one day could only be seen as an inevitability the next day!","—","The strong get stronger while the weaker get weaker!","These words rang out clearly in the minds of those listening to King Augustus, the face of this powerful antiquity returning to utter calm as he voiced out.","\"The Indigo Cosmos will soon be pulled into the vast Primordial Empire as with the terrifying Antiquities and Daolords there, even though the subjects I have been overseeing for millions of years within this Cosmos might be safe, the fate of all of us will fall into the hands of whatever power in the Primordial Empire deposes my family!\"","...!","The eyes of this Antiquity and his daughter flashed powerfully at this, their eyes focusing on Noah at this moment as King Augustus spoke hesitatingly.","\"But...getting the chance to meet Daolord Osmont might open up another path tha-\"","THRUM!","Right at this crucial moment, a robust voice reverberated out from a shimmering medallion that was attached to the robe of the white haired King Augustus!","\"Father, the Antiquities of the Primordial Empire have arrived!\"","...!","The voice of Alexus Marcus Tiberius rang out as an unhappy expression covered Augustus, looking at the buzzing medallion as he sighed and then spoke apologetically towards Noah.","\"I’ll have to cut it short for now and go see the Envoys of the Primordial Empire.\"","Augustus nodded to his daughter as she waved her hands to return them to the visible folds of space, Noah’s eyes lighting up at the coming information as he spoke out with a light of interest.","\"Antiquities of the Primordial Empire? I’m curious to see them myself...we shall follow!\"","Tides of destiny churned as the King of the Indigo Cosmos nodded with wise eyes, their figures returning to the Bluefield Universe where other guests had arrived!","---","\"Are you joking? A single being took out a Lesser Primordial Beast? Someone not from the Primordial Empire?\"","RUMBLE","A booming voice filled with power and pride dominated out towards Alexus and the other 2 Antiquities left behind, this voice stemming from a powerful Antiquity that was releasing waves of Primordial Essence!","He was surrounded by 4 other Antiquities that either had Primordial or Ruination Essence surrounding them- these existences being the Envoys that came after hearing the call for reinforcements from the Indigo Cosmos.","Alexus glanced at their robes that had a golden insignia of a mythical sword, his eyes lighting up as he replied with a smile.","\"Respected Envoys, the one to take care of the Primordial Beast alone was a Daolord...\"","...!","The words caused the eyes of the 5 Envoys from the Primordial Empire to constrict, looking at everything more closely as they looked at the chunks of glimmering meat and blood that could still be seen floating in the Ruination Sea!","A Daolord! One that didn’t stem from the Primordial Empire as he came from an unknown location. And this being had not only defeated the Primordial Beast but...","The eyes of the leading Antiquity raised up as he spoke out domineeringly.","\"And the Primordial Heart?\"","Yes! The treasured Primordial Heart that could open up doorways of possibilities- the thing that if any of them obtained, they could advance their might greatly! Getting the chance to even find a Primordial Beast was rare, and the Indigo Cosmos fell under the jurisdiction of their family but...someone else had snatched it right under their nose.","Seeing the expressions of Alexus and the other two Antiquities, the Envoys from the Primordial Empire could infer all they needed to know as the leading figure harrumphed and spoke out powerfully!","\"And where is this so-called Daolord right now?\"","The voice was that of power and full of unblemished pride, where even though it was talking about a being that had more power than them, they seemingly weren’t afraid as these Envoys dared to talk like this!","\"Oh, are you looking for me?\"","THRUM!","From the boundary of the Bluefield Universe, a voice stretched out to reverberate in their ears calmly, a figure materializing before them as he was followed by a myriad of summons and the stout image of King Augustus and Lexis.","Augustus looked towards his son Alexus with a stern face that was utterly filled with disappointment for him giving such information freely, looking towards the Envoys of the Primordial Empire as their eyes were not even focused on him.","Their 5 pairs of eyes were focused on Noah alone as he carried himself with a unique air, the two sides locking gazes with each other as Noah laid his eyes on the beings from the lands that Aegon the Conqueror ruled!","Each of them was adorned with a white robe that had the symbol of a golden sword, this golden sword being further distinct as it had a green flower blooming from its hilt.","The golden sword represented the Primordial Empire, and the blooming green flower represented the power within this Empire that these beings stemmed from!","Their very bodies screamed regality and majesty as they weren’t just nobodies- they were existences from the Primordial Empire! These were beings that had lived for millions of years in a prosperous environment, one that had powerful families in the lead as they enjoyed a certain treatment throughout.","Pride and arrogance were ingrained in their bones, and they knew this in their hearts as they didn’t bother to correct it! After all, they were the ones stemming from the Bastion of Reality, the place where Aegon the Conqueror ruled with an iron fist...the Primordial Empire!","So even against a foreign Daolord, these beings were fearless!","\"We were. Daolord Osmont, is it?\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1165,"title":"Chapter 1165: Chapter 1164 - We Are The Protectors! II","paragraphs":["5 white robed Antiquities that screamed of power and majesty, all of them looking at Noah without an ounce of fear!","Noah found this extremely unique as he stepped forward, looking at them curiously as he wondered just what such beings would do. Two were drop dead gorgeous women that looked to be in their 30s, aging gracefully as they looked like beings that were in the wet dreams of many men! The other three were men that seemed to be in their 40s, their gazes filled with power and knowledgeable light that distinguished them from others.","The one at the very forefront and the four behind him had shimmering verdant green hair that made them extremely unique, their bodies pulsing with power as they gazed at Noah carefully before a voice rang out again.","\"You must be from an undiscovered Cosmos, having bided your time well until you could reach such a realm of power...I commend you for that!\"","...!","Words said with a tone that one wouldn’t think it was a lesser ranked being speaking to a higher ranked one!","Even though the 5 Envoys from the Primordial Empire were only at the level of Antiquity as they comprehended either the Cosmic Daos of Ruination or the Primordial Dao, they actually talked towards Noah as if he was on the same level as them if not lower.","Noah’s eyes turned sharp at this as his body floated forward, leaving the boundary of the Bluefield Universe as he stepped into the Ruination Sea where these beings floated serenely. His body began to emulate waves of power as he floated forward, but this seemingly wasn’t put in the eyes of the 5 Envoys as they continued.","\"Since you come from the wilderness and do not know the rules...we will not penalize you as we will simply teach them to you.\"","RUMBLE!","\"The Primordial Beast you hunted and took the Primordial Heart of...you did so in the territory of our Springforge Domain. Whatever Primordial Beast falls in our domain...its spoils are ours for the taking.\"","...!","In a straightforward manner and without even blinking, the frontmost Antiquity said this to Noah fearlessly, Noah almost looking at these beings as if they were utterly stupid to be talking the way they were! They must be over a million years old if not more, right? Why would such beings be carrying themselves in such a manner when talking to someone obviously stronger than them?!","Noah’s eyes turned sharp as he floated a few feet away from them, looking at these beings closely as he voiced out calmly.","\"Are you...are you actually telling me that you want the Primordial Heart of a Beast you never defeated because it fell in a region you say is your own?\"","WAA!","His words were calm but filled with power, causing the brows of the Antiquities to become stern as their verdant hair glimmered with even more light.","Yet neither of them backed down as instead of answering Noah’s question, they glanced at Noah with even more coldness!","\"Titus, what are we?\"","The leading Envoy from the Primordial Empire spoke out calmly without even turning around, calling upon someone behind him as an Antiquity stepped out and locked his eyes with Noah.","His eyes glanced at the right hand of Noah that held striking Runic Dao Lines that still gave off a wave of power, this being floating forward to actually stand just a few inches away from Noah’s face.","His gaze was somber as his eyes were serene, his hand going forward on his robe to touch the insignia of a golden sword and blooming green flower on its hilt as he spoke out mesmerizingly!","\"We are the Chosen. The Protectors of the Bastion of Reality. We are the embers that will burn bright even in death, with our legends becoming myth across the River of Time.\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking set of words that seemed to hold boundless power erupted out, the very air becoming more oppressive as even Noah’s gaze turned cold!","The Chosen! The Protectors of the Bastion of Reality that was the Primordial Empire!","\"From the House of Springforge, we oversee these lands as ordained by the Emperor of the Bastion of Reality...by Aegon the Conqueror himself! Do you dare blemish his name and deny his authority?\"","WAA!","An Antiquity that had a glimmering manifested Origin of a few hundred Universes stood before Noah, this being having a tremendous amount of power, but it wasn’t his own that he was using! He actually used the name of someone else that had such immense and overwhelming influence that others could do nothing but kneel before it!","These Antiquities from the House of Springforge were actually using the name and Authority of Aegon the Conqueror as they wanted to extort the Primordial Heart that Noah had obtained all on his own.","A treasure of such immense significance that these beings couldn’t just let it fall into the hands of just anyone when the beast appeared within their Springforge Domain, with these beings standing up against Noah as if he was nothing!","And truly...in the larger grand scheme of things in the perspective of the existences of the Primordial Empire that knew themselves as the very defenders of Reality, as the last line of defense against terrible yet fantastical beasts that roamed the vast Ruination Seas...to them, Noah was nothing.","Just a mere Daolord! How could he compare to the Daolords within the Primordial Empire? How could he compare to the Protector of Reality himself, the Emperor that stood over the Bastion of Reality!?","BZZZT!","An overpowering sense of power began to fly out at this moment as Noah’s gaze turned utterly cold.","His essence moved as his right hand began to shimmer brightly, a myriad of Runic Dao Lines beginning to snake throughout it as a terrifying air erupted out!","The Antiquity that was mere inches from him still had a somber face full of majesty as he withstood this pressure, his Universal Filament filled with hundreds of Universes shining gloriously as he didn’t budge.","The other 4 behind him were the same manner as their bodies began to undulate with power, a fight seemingly about to break off at any time!"]},{"number":1166,"title":"Chapter 1166: Chapter 1165 - Remember My Name! I","paragraphs":["Two sides facing off as it seemed like a battle could break off at any moment, Noah’s right hand beginning to shine with a glorious array of colors as the pressure of Runic Dao Lines caused waves of power to undulate from him!","The five verdant haired beings had their origins shimmering brightly as they seemed ready to go, their eyes calm as if they still didn’t think Noah would make a move against them.","At such a crucial juncture, the wizened voice of an old man began to stretch out of the barrier of the Bluefield Universe.","\"Envoys of the Primordial Empire, I’m sure there is no need for any of this.\"","WAA!","The aged voice of King Augustus stretched out, the bated eyes of many beings that were watching the show at the edge of their seats all turning to look towards him as they found this powerful Antiquity to actually be stepping out from the vast boundary of the Bluefield Universe!","\"Father!\"","Lexis called out in shock as she and all the others knew all too well that he had not comprehended the Primordial Dao or the Dao of Ruination. He could use his own power to ward off the Ruination Essence outside, but he wouldn’t be able to do it for long as it could overwhelm him at any moment!","Yet he stepped out slowly as his while his body looked old and decrypt, his eyes glimmered with an intense light as a strong barrier of all the Dao Essences he controlled wrapped around his body tightly. His white hair shimmered in the crimson sea that was trying to devour him alive, his figure floating forward as he came to stand beside Noah and speaking out in a somber tone.","\"A hundred thousand years ago, the Indigo Cosmos was found by the Envoys of the Springforge Household from the Primordial Empire, coming under their domain and protection. I understand very well the rules that whatever falls in the Springforge Domain is under your jurisdiction...but I also know that you do not take from your own people!\"","RUMBLE!","The eyes of Augustus shone with innumerable lights as his gaze seemed to contain countless galaxies, his voice continuing to flow out.","\"We are also a part of the Springforge Domain, and we have rights as such we can keep the spoils of battles to ourselves. This Daolord before you...is part of our Indigo Cosmos as his spoils are our spoils. The rules of the Primordial Empire are clear...with the Great Conqueror stating that the spoils that others worked hard to obtain cannot be deprived from them by pure force, and there are proper methods for this. I am sure that the renowned Envoys will not be open to stealing from your own people?\"","...!","The eyes of the Antiquities that had called themselves the Protectors of the Bastion of Reality shone brightly at the words of King Augustus, Noah also gazing at this being and reevaluating this old man over and over again as he saw his stout essence continue to try and fight off the raging Ruination Sea around them, but the protection could fall at any moment as the Ruination Sea was too deadly!","His expression was impassive as if his essence wasn’t being drained out of him at this very moment, where death could come at any moment...but he was placing his trust on Noah as he avoided conflict with existences that had Daolords, existences that stemmed from the Primordial Empire!","Noah’s eyes flashed brightly as he placed his hand on the figure of Augustus, Ruination Essence beginning to wrap around him protectively as the seas that were trying to devour him became calm. Noah then gazed towards the Envoys of the Primordial Empire that continued to speak out coldly.","\"Your son’s words made it seem like this was a foreign existence that just happened to appear here. Are you sure you want to swear the future of your Cosmos for him?\"","THRUM!","The air was palpating with power as Augustus’s eyes dimmed at these words, turning towards his son as the light of disappointment flashed again as he spoke out slowly.","\"My son is not privy to the secrets of the Indigo Cosmos, with the one groomed to be the next Ruler being my daughter. Of course, the knowledge of Daolord Osmont was not shared with him. But he has been with us all this time as he is a resident of the Indigo Cosmos that will soon be officially becoming a part of the Primordial Empire! The rules of the Great Conqueror have to be followed...I am sure the Envoys do not dare wish to blemish his name and authority.\"","WAA!","The words of the old man wire tight nit as no gaps could be seen, Alexus looking towards him in shock as his figure began to tremble, while the Envoys turned utterly silent at having the same exact words used against them at this time!","Many beings were brought to a stupor from the actions of the old King, the glimmering white hair on this being’s head fluttering in the Ruination Sea as he effectively avoided conflict against powerhouses of the Springforge Household of the Primordial Empire.","Under the rules of Aegon the Conqueror, the possession of others could not be taken blatantly as there had to be proper methods taken between different powers and families for all those in the Empire! If Noah was a part of the Indigo Cosmos that was about to be fully tied to the Empire, they couldn’t use their influence to simply take the Primordial Heart from him!","\"...\"","The surroundings were eerily quiet as no side spoke.","Noah kept his gaze locked with the 5 Envoys as they seemed indecisive, but their brows quickly raised in happiness as they looked towards a certain direction. Noah also looked in this direction even faster than them as his eyes constricted, seeing a flash of light coming before them as its voice stretched out before the figure even fully formed!","\"Haha, what a good King Augustus! You’re as wily as when I first discovered your Cosmos. You must be very blessed to produce a Daolord in just over a hundred thousand years.\"","RUMBLE!","Instantaneously, a terrifying new aura appeared before everyone, forming into the shape of...a kid that couldn’t be any older than 13 or 14!","This existence looked like a mere boy, but half of his entire body was filled with glimmering Runic Dao Lines as he released waves and waves of pressure.. A simple white and green robe covered him as the insignia of the golden sword and blooming green flower could be seen, his eyes shining with an iridescent glow. His verdant hair danced wildly above his head as he gave a cheeky smile towards King Augustus, his eyes locking with Noah as the Ruination Sea began to churn!"]},{"number":1167,"title":"Chapter 1167: Chapter 1166 - Remember My Name! II","paragraphs":["A Daolord!","An existence that had assimilated Ruination and the Primordial Dao, and then had then begun to deconstruct and reconstruct daos to brand them to their bodies and soul!","A Daolord from the Primordial Empire had actually arrived, his face full of smiles as nobody took his stature as a mere kid seriously.","The five that were standing before Noah actually bowed towards this being as they called out reverently.","\"Daolord Azazel.\"","The five Antiquities treated this existence with much respect as he nodded lightly, looking towards Noah and King Augustus as he spoke with a beaming smile.","\"So, are we sticking with the story that this Daolord here is someone from your Indigo Cosmos? All of this is for a Primordial Heart mind you, something that even stronger Daolords than me covet- something that even my Family Head would want to get his hands on. Are you all sure you can keep it after your Cosmos joins the Primordial Empire with the regulations you will fall under?\"","THRUM!","His face was all smiles, but his words were full of threats and terrifying pressure, Noah’s eyes gazing at this being coldly as [Eyes of Truth] only granted his name. The Runic Dao Lines running across half of his body showed off immense power, making Noah calculate how a battle with such a being would play out.","But against his battle intent, he would learn more about the terrifying Bastion of Reality that this Aegon had built before he began conflicts. After he learned everything about them...he wouldn’t mind giving them a good beating and wiping the arrogant smiles off their faces!","\"Daolord Osmont has the Indigo Cosmos as his home as much as I do. If there is nothing else, we will be preparing for the movement of our Cosmos as we won’t delay Daolord Azazel any longer.\"","The strong voice of King Augustus replied calmly even at this time, the vibrant light on Noah’s hands dying down as his stern expression was wiped away and replaced by a smile. The opposing Daolord matched his eyes as he nodded with shining eyes, his voice stretching out as he came to float a few inches from Noah.","\"Daolord...Osmont, is it?\" With eyes full of childish mocking and ridicule, Azazel came before Noah with his power flaring out madly, Noah nodding towards him as he replied with a smile.","\"Osmont. It is a name that I promise you will remember!\"","RUMBLE!","As if thunder had smashed down, the bright smile on the face of Azazel slowly faded as he nodded, waving his hand to the 5 Antiquities behind him as they began to turn into streaks of light and fade away. Azazel himself began to flicker with light as he spoke out.","\"We eagerly await your entrance into the Primordial Empire, Osmont. The Great Conqueror has already been notified of this Cosmos as it should be taken away in the next day or two. Be ready.\"","WAA!","With these words, this being disappeared as the terrifying pressure in the surroundings faded away! King Augustus stared at the scene with a somber gaze as he then turned his eyes towards the vast Cosmos behind him, as well as the innumerable faces that depended on him!","—","Across the vast sea of Ruination, 6 figures were shooting forward to a certain location with cold faces. Daolord Azazel was in the lead as one of the 5 Antiquities behind him spoke out slowly.","\"Daolord...we have always made moves in the dark before, why don’t we hiddenly return to that Indigo Cosmos and rip apart their rulers, taking the Primordial Heart even before they join the Empire?\"","...!","A cruel set of words reverberated out as the childish face of Azazel merely shook, his reply coming after!","\"Anything that our Great Emperor will touch in a few days, we don’t take any actions towards it. After they become part of the Empire and things settle down, it won’t be a problem to call for Writ of Challenge against them as they will lose the rights to their Cosmos and all the treasures they have. Even moving in the dark...we can think of it then.\"","His words were extremely commanding as the Antiquity that just spoke nodded, a sharp light crossing the eyes of Daolord Azazel as he continued to think about the one known as Daolord Osmont. When he thought of this being...he had a prickly feeling that told him not to make a move just now!","Even though the being seemed to have fewer Runic Dao Lines than him, there was something that made him not take any risk and silence everyone in the surroundings for a Primordial Heart.","He didn’t know what it was, but as someone that had lived for millions of years, his senses were very sharp!","’I’ll have to let the Family Head know. A Primordial Heart is too precious to be left in the hands of bumpkins...’","SHAA!","Their figures tore through the void of Ruination as they made their way back to a grand location in the vast Primordial Seas. As they did this, they had no knowledge that a fight light years away from them, a set of red eyes were watching them calmly.","These eyes were as large as Galaxies, making one wonder just what terrifying size the existence holding the eyes boasted! Such a presence was actually looking at the figures of a Daolord and Antiquities coldly without making a move, none of them being the wiser that they were being watched!","In this vast Ruination Sea, there wasn’t just the Primordial Empire that boasted to be the Bastion of Reality...there were also other forces that very few knew about! Existences far more horrifying than what most believed, existences that would terrify Hegemonies and Antiquities alike if they ever came to light.","The existence currently watching in the darkness was one of them! Its titanic eyes turned its gaze from the figures of Daolord Azazel as it looked towards the Indigo Cosmos, locking onto the figure of Noah that was talking with King Augustus, as well as the Cosmos behind them.","Its eyes flashed coldly as this existence remained still, merely continuing to watch in the folds of the Ruination Sea silently!"]},{"number":1168,"title":"Chapter 1168: Chapter 1167 - An Emperor Shifts A Cosmos! I","paragraphs":["\"I didn’t want you to have a conflict because of saving us, especially against a force connected with an existence capable of forming an Empire within these vast and chaotic seas!\"","The figures of Augustus and Noah were floating in the Ruination Sea as they watched the direction that Daolord Azazel and his party left in.","Noah had a smile on his face as he spoke lightly while turning to face the old King.","\"You want to bind me to your Cosmos?\"","RUMBLE!","Noah didn’t beat around the bush or play any games, getting to the heart of the issue of what this wily old King had done to prevent a conflict just now!","He made it so that Noah stemmed from the Indigo Cosmos, and so the existences from the Primordial Empire had to treat him as such.","They couldn’t fight him or bully him, the only thing they could do being possible after the Indigo Cosmos joined the Primordial Cosmos fully in the coming future!","\"Partly!\" The gaze of King Augustus was starry as he turned to focus his eyes on Noah. His aged face seemed to have seen the vicissitudes of time as if he had seen it all, his voice continuing out.","\"Becoming enemies with even a party of beings from the Springforge Household means becoming enemies with the whole Primordial Empire...with Aegon the Conqueror himself!\"","WAA!","\"But once you are part of the Empire, you can fight them as much as you want and they can fight you as well- all in the battle for supremacy as there will be no consequences.\"","...!","\"Oh?\" Noah’s interest was perked up as he stared at the old man that continued with a somber tone.","\"A Writ of Challenge. The Kings of Cosmos can issue such Writs to other Kings under the regulations of Aegon the Conqueror, where the one that comes out to be the strongest in this publicly displayed battle will be the Victors and take everything from the one that loses!\"","\"The quintillions of existences within their Cosmos that they depended on for the continued source of Marks of Antiquity, those in their families...and all the treasures they have goes to the Victors.\"","\"There is absolute order in the Primordial Empire, with these Challenges being allowed as the Great Conqueror believes the strong should rule...but they have to prove their strength clearly in the open without any underhanded means.\"","What an Emperor!","What a Ruler!","King Augustus spoke more of such an Emperor and the Bastion of Reality he made, their two figures receding from the Ruination Sea and returning to the boundary of the Bluefield Universe.","\"My actions might not have been without other motives, but I hope Daolord Osmont can be with my Indigo Cosmos as you get a chance to see the Primordial Empire. As long as you don’t have obligations that need you from your home, I hope you can be with us as the one to lead us against the Writs of Challenges that will be issued to us soon enough!\"","\"The benefits are all yours...I just wish to keep those within my Cosmos safe as they don’t fall under the banner of the Households of the Primordial Empire, becoming mere pawns that get handed off from one king to the next. I wish to keep my family safe so that others cannot claim them to do whatever they wish with them!\"","King Augustus was gazing towards his daughter as he said this, their two figures arriving past the boundary and entering the Bluefield Universe as the Antiquities within came forward with worried faces filled with shock.","This was even more so for Alexus Marcus Tiberius, who could barely form his words as he looked at his father with a mix of emotions!","\"Father...I...you...!\"","This powerful Antiquity was still incredulous at the fact that his father had stripped him of his future kingship and given it to his sister so fast, even inviting an outsider that was stronger than them to sit above them.","He...was unwilling to accept this!","Augustus turned his gaze towards his son as it was filled with disappointment, his voice ringing out.","\"Over the last tens of thousands of years...I’ve seen you increasingly make bad choices throughout! Your actions today made me realize you will not change, wanting to sacrifice your own people and even freely giving information to your enemies as if they were your best friends. Bad judgment through and through...your sister will be more than enough to replace you!\"","RUMBLE!","A grand proclamation was made as the Antiquity felt like multiple attacks pierced deep into his heart, looking betrayed and shaken all at once as he stared at the cold face of his father until he could take it no longer, not being able to withstand all the gazes as he turned into a streak of light and sunk deeper into the Indigo Cosmos in indignation.","Noah looked at this soap opera as he nearly laughed, speaking out with a smile towards King Augustus.","\"We all can see how this will play out, right? A son who should’ve obtained everything being stripped of it as his little sister takes it all and even someone like me coming into the picture...I’m pretty sure your son will become a spy or betray you soon enough to whatever wolves lie in wait in the Primordial Empire.\"","...!","His words were ones that weren’t normally said, causing the Antiquities nearby to glance at each other as Augustus’s aged face obtained a few more wrinkles while he sighed and replied.","\"I’ll take care of that, Daolord. Please, get yourself acquainted with our Cosmos. Lexis will inform you of a few more things and show you our Universes, choose any that you wish to take as your abode. We will discuss some more soon enough.\"","Augustus seemed to have aged a few more years with this encounter, giving commands to the Antiquities Viola and Charles as everything became busy, leaving Noah and his party to glance towards the woman that was just crowned to be the future Queen of the Indigo Cosmos!","Lexis Marcus Tiberius glanced towards Noah with a dazzling smile as her white hair cascaded down gracefully. Her eyes carried a hint of grace, maturity, and confidence that was rarely seen in a woman.","She was currently adorned in a light blue robe with white embroidery that made it extremely unique, matching her glimmering white hair beautifully as her sonorous words rang out as if what just happened didn’t concern her at all.","\"Daolord Osmont, please. I can continue the tour and tell Daolord all we know about the Primordial Empire...\"","Her smile and words caused Tiamat to let out a harrumph as she glanced at Lexis closely, Noah giving a light nod as he and his summons followed this Antiquity into the Indigo Cosmos once more!","As all of this occurred, far across the folds of space, in the Ruination Realm.","Noah’s main body was laughing madly as he saw a vibrant number of Splendiferous Universes that now surpassed 100, his eyes letting out beams of light as he spoke out gloriously.","\"Good! Good! With this...why don’t we burn some Universes and form more Runic Dao Lines?!\"","RUMBLE","Ceaselessly and without stop, Noah continued to look for the path forward as he prepared to elevate his strength even further!"]},{"number":1169,"title":"Chapter 1169: Chapter 1168 - An Emperor Shifts A Cosmos! II","paragraphs":["At this moment, Noah’s main body was floating in the Ruination Realm as his figure let out an aura of majesty. His top was bare as his fair skin glistened like crystalline jade, his eight packs looking sculpted to the point of them being fake as he only had thin black pants that billowed in the winds of the Ruination Realm.","On his chest, one could see the illusory manifestation of a Universal Filament, but it didn’t just have 30 something Universes as currently...over 100 Splendiferous Universes could be seen!","Each of them having been forged with over 100 Billion Dao Galaxies from the essence of the pulsing Primordial Heart before Noah as it had shrunk by a few hundred miles. There was still a vast amount of it left as it was akin to a world, Noah expecting to produce hundreds of Splendiferous Universes from this treasure when he devoured all of it, and this still didn’t put into account the second one that he had duplicated through his Cosmic Treasure.","\"But now...\"","He uttered under his breath as he stopped absorbing the essence of the Primordial Heart briefly, looking at the Splendiferous Universes within him as he wanted to further elevate his power after he came in contact with Daolord Azazel, if just a little.","Even though he knew with the boosts of the Nomological Edict of Samsara, he could take on a being with a level of power like him- he still wanted to be able to dominate in the battles he fought, not just be capable of matching others in power!","So he turned towards his fully assimilated Lesser Daos as the light of Conquest began to shine brightly, the star above him glimmering in the light as he spoke out.","\"Let the light of Conquest shine on the Daos of Alacrity and Void-Space.\"","Just two Lesser Daos, ones that would be enhanced from their 5,000% boost to 10,000% after their enhancement with the Cosmic Dao of Conquest! Noah could only afford to spare Lesser Daos like these as he didn’t plan to touch any other Grand or Cosmis Daos until he found a solution on the issue of Nomological Edicts and Runic Dao Lines.","Noah adopted a serious expression as he began to burn two Splendiferous Universes, the assimilated essence of Ruination coursing through his body as it began to burn the 2 Daos and deconstruct them while using the burning essence of the universes as fuel.","This was the price of power! The price that Noah wanted to overcome as after these daos were deconstructed, he didn’t have their comprehensions nor could he comprehend them again! It was a barrier he wanted to overcome so that he could have a vast array of Daos to work with when he tried to fuse them to possibly create an Edict!","This was also the reason why he was taking the deconstruction and reconstruction of Daos slowly, waiting for a solution to this issue. There were already a few possibilities that Noah was looking at, with the design of a new Cosmic Dao being a solution...or the possibility of a third Trait!","A Cosmic Dao or a third Trait aside from Infinite Mana and the Protagonist might show him the way...this was what his vast destiny and fortune told him!","But he currently watched as the two daos were broken down into primordial Runic Dao Lines, the Primordial Essence weaving in as it put them together expertly and caused the lines to shine with a glorious allure.","They then snaked into Noah’s body as the Runic Dao Tattoos on his right arm began to swirl like snakes, the new Runic Dao Lines weaving across them as they began to populate across Noah’s shoulder and cover his right chest!","They magisterially went over his right side as they began to brand themselves further down, wrapping across his right thigh and stopping at his knee. Now, the right side of his body was covered with primal looking ancient tattoos almost completely, giving him a wild look as they pulsed with power.","When he activated them, he saw the space around him breaking and tearing apart as he smiled lightly, stopping his supply of essence as the area around him calmed down. He breathed out slowly at this shocking sense of power as he then turned towards the glimmering Primordial Heart before him, his right hand raising as he struck down and released blades of light that went on to cut a few miles of the heart before him into multiple sections!","The cut up sections vibrated gloriously before they formed into their own hearts of varying sizes, Noah calling them to him as he released more sharp lights to cut off sections of the enormous Primordial Heart and form smaller ones. He couldn’t just advance in power alone, and there was an entire Cosmos before him with existences he could elevate to become powerful Antiquities!","—","Lexis Marcus Tiberius.","This was the name her mother had given her, and the name that she wanted to ring out across the Cosmos!","She had grand ambitions, but she was limited with her meager talent to cultivate, only being able to achieve where she was at right now by putting in twice the work others had to put in...and by relying on the help from her father.","By ruling over the Universes of the Indigo Cosmos under her father, she had achieved Antiquity. Even though her brother was an unchangeable fool that her Father had only chosen to admit after hundreds of thousands of years, he was still the one that was in line to lead as she wasn’t the first choice!","With the appearance of a Primordial Beast and the inevitable joining of their Cosmos to the Primordial Empire, even with her Father’s strong protective feelings of his family...she half expected having to make the choice of joining the House of Springforge as a Concubine of their arrogant Antiquities or Daolords.","As a Ruler of the Indigo Cosmos and bearing the responsibility of ensuring the safety of all those within it, it was a sacrifice she was prepared to make! This was because the terror of Primordial Beasts was much more terrifying, so they had to instead face the challenges of the Primordial Empire.","But now...she saw a different path glimmering brightly before her, a path of possibility that lay in the appearance of the unique Daolord that had appeared quite literally from nowhere- and it was a being that could easily rebuff Primordial Beasts.","Her eyes lingered on his figure alone as she spoke about all the information they had gathered on the Primordial Empire through the Envoys that passed by over the years, ignoring the looks she was receiving from the dragoness Tiamat.","\"Apart from the House of Springforge, the other two prominent forces in the Primordial Empire are-\"","...!","Her words trailed off before she could finish as while gazing at Daolord Osmont’s figure, she saw and felt a wild wave of power erupting from him as brand new Runic Dao Lines could be seen coalescing beneath his robe and covering the right side of his body, his expression smiling apologetically as they calmed down a second later and looked towards her while speaking lightly.","\"You were talking of the forces within the Primordial Cosmos?\"","....!","Nonchalantly! Magisterially! Daolord Osmont simply carried on with such an attitude as he added terrifying Runic Tattoos on his body!"]},{"number":1170,"title":"Chapter 1170: Chapter 1169 - An Emperor Shifts A Cosmos! III","paragraphs":["Lexis recovered from her stupor as her brilliant eyes shone, finding her voice once more.","\"Hmm? Ah...yes. Aside from the House of Springforge...\"","Even as she spoke, her mind was buzzing with shock as she just saw this Daolord casually increase the number of his Runic Dao Lines while he was being given a tour of a Cosmos!","What a level of power! What a being!","At this juncture, Lexis fully decided that after her Father’s push of tying this being to their Cosmos, she would do all she could to change their fate and bind him even closer to them, no matter the price. A being like this was worth more than any of the arrogant Daolords populating the Primordial Cosmos and thinking of themselves better than all others as the Protectors of the Bastion of Reality.","’Daolord Osmont...’","She repeated his name in her mind as her eyes flashed sharply, revealing all the information she could before things began to drastically change and they were pulled into the Primordial Empire!","—","The information that Noah gained from the future ruler of the Indigo Cosmos was vast, increasing his knowledge of the Bastion of Reality that Aegon the Conqueror had made greatly!","Within this vast Primordial Empire, there were three forces that were the most prominent. The one that Noah had just met the Antiquities and Daolord of were known as the House of Springforge.","The second faction was known as the House of Stormdust, and the third was the House of Havenbreaker!","Three powerful factions that all stood strongly under Aegon the Conqueror.","This was much of the information that the Antiquities of the Indigo Cosmos could find from coming across the forces of the House of Springforge in the last tens of thousands of years, with the hierarchy of these factions still being in the dark, as well as the knowledge of just how many Daolords and Antiquities being hidden.","But this was something that Noah could slowly find out for himself in the future to come, a few hours passing as they visited the myriad of Universes within the Indigo Cosmos under the lead of its future ruler- Lexis Marcus Tiberius!","Noah followed the lead of this woman closely as he could see the light of ambition in her eyes, merely laughing at such a light inside his heart as if anyone thought they could use him to achieve their aims...they would more than likely find themselves beneath his feet without even knowing what had happened.","Everyone had their own goals and aims in these vast Cosmos. King Augustus and his daughter had their goals, and they knew that Noah had his own. Even though they wanted to tie him to their Indigo Cosmos for the sake of keeping their rulership and safety in a dangerous new Empire, they knew this had to come at a price...Noah just didn’t think they knew the price they would have to pay!","That price...was fealty!","King August had said that he wanted Noah to lead the Indigo Cosmos against the Writs of Challenges that would come after this Cosmos joined the Primordial Empire, and that the benefits of winning these Challenges would all fall upon him. This was already a stupendous price to pay as they effectively barred themselves from future advancements, and they would have to rely on Noah to make any achievements.","Of course, if they fully came under Noah without any ulterior motives, the achievements they could make would be out of their wildest dreams!","\"What are you thinking about, Daolord?\" Lexis Marcus Tiberius saw that Noah’s gaze was far as he was thinking of something, their figures stopping in the void of one of the central Universes in the Indigo Cosmos as this future Ruler asked with a smile.","Noah’s bright eyes locked onto her as he spoke sharply.","\"I’m thinking of the Writs of Challenges, and all that I could obtain.\" His words were straightforward as they caused the heart of the Antiquity to tremble, but her smile was as bright as ever as she replied gracefully.","\"Unimaginable prizes. If crowned Victor, Daolord Osmont can obtain an entire Cosmos to influence, powerful weapons and unique treasures...anything that th-\"","THRUM!","Her words never finished.","The gazes of all those around changed as they suddenly felt an overpowering pressure descend over everything, their hearts feeling constricted and fearful as if they were the smallest ants, and an enormous boot was about to step over them!","It wasn’t just the Universe that they were in, but all the existences within the myriad of Universes within the Indigo Cosmos felt this overpowering wave of essence cover them as they couldn’t move a single muscle.","Their very origins were frozen as those that could move were nearly zero.","Nearly!","Among the myriad of beings within the Indigo Cosmos, there was currently Noah. His origin also felt this overpowering force descend and limit his movements to nothing, but he felt as if he could burn some of his Universes in addition to activating his Runic Dao Lines...he could move!","He could also pull upon the Nomological Edict of Samsara as this...would also allow him to move!","But he did not do so. He did not need to. The overpowering that had arrived wasn’t for him, but it was for the whole Indigo Cosmos. The promised transfer of the Cosmos from its current location and into the Primordial Empire did not happen in the next day or two as Daolord Azazel had said, and it instead occurred in a matter of hours.","A terrifying presence had wrapped up the Indigo Cosmos at this moment!","—","If one were to be capable enough to observe the shocking scene in its full scope, they would be able to lay their eyes on a vast Cosmos countless light years in size. Yet below this Cosmos, there was an existence a few million light years in size currently hoisting this Cosmos on his back, his arms placed below its thick boundary as if he was pushing up a heavy rock.","Even though this being was a few million light years in size, he still seemed like a speck of dust in the span of the Cosmos that was an unknown billions of light years in diameter...but this being still caused the position of this Cosmos to shift as he pushed up!","With his figure scintillating beautifully with colorful lights, an existence carried an entire Cosmos on his back!"]},{"number":1171,"title":"Chapter 1171: Chapter 1170 - Stellar Bridges Secure A Cosmos!","paragraphs":["Thereafter, waves of unique essence released from him as they went on to cover the entirety of this Cosmos, the body of this being shining a glorious array of colors as vast droves of essence rushed from him and traveled billions of light years instantly, covering the entire Cosmos instantly as it made it seem like a glimmering crystalline ball of light was floating in the vast Ruination Seas.","If anyone were to be watching this scene, they would find themselves to be utterly shocked as interestingly enough...there was actually an existence watching all this from afar! With red eyes the size of Galaxies, this existence was watching the figure hoisting the Cosmos with eyes flashing with hatred, but its Origin trembled a moment later as shockingly, the being below the Cosmos that was shining with an array of lights seemingly turned his head towards its direction.","Towards the hidden folds of space it should have been hidden in, a place that nobody should have found!","RUMBLE!","The hidden existences felt like eyes of utter calm and dominance locked onto it, a magisterial power being carried with this gaze as one of its eyes instantly ruptured!","The space around it began to fold and twist amidst its terror as this creature quickly left, leaving behind nothing in the surroundings except its utter horror and shock.","The colorfully glimmering existence that had turned its gaze towards that direction harrumphed coldly, his arms pushing up the Cosmos above him ever higher as even more droves of essence erupted out, causing an overpowering light to shine from the vast Cosmos as a second later...this entire Cosmos flashed away.","Disappeared!","The space it left behind was soon filled up by a churning Ruination Sea as with a matter of minutes, everything regained its calm.","No Cosmos, no hidden watchers, nothing.","Just the vast Ruination Sea and the vast secrets that lay within it!","—","After the awe inspiring aura covered the entirety of the Indigo Cosmos, it only permeated throughout for less than a minute at most before it disappeared.","Disappeared as if it was never there!","Every single being regained the ability to move as a moment later, the figures of King Augustus and the other two Antiquities Charles and Viola soon flashed beside Noah and his party, their faces grim as Augustus’s ancient voice rang out.","\"That should have been the aura of the Great Conqueror, which means our Cosmos has already been transported to the vicinity of the Primordial Empire!\"","RUMBLE!","The reality settled into everyone’s faces as they prepared.","Noah, on the other hand, could feel his destiny and fortune churning as he felt like he had arrived into a huge playing field of unlimited possibilities, his gaze shooting from the current Universe they were in as he peered past its boundaries to observe the outside environment.","The sight to see outside of the Indigo Cosmos...was one that could cause the jaws of even the most powerful and aged beings to drop just at its sheer grandeur and fantasy!","Outside of the Indigo Cosmos, Noah could see the vast outline of another Cosmos when he gazed in one direction, and he could see another Cosmos when he turned his head to another direction...all around them, everywhere that one could turn except a single direction- the boundaries of other Cosmos could be seen shining in a stellar fashion!","The powerful existence that had caused everything to come to a pause in the Indigo Cosmos had actually teleported this vast Cosmos from one location to another as it was now situated like a single circle in the outer ring of an extensively and unbelievably large circle...a circle that represented a ridiculous number of Cosmos.","To properly understand the scope of all this, we have to first talk numbers!","A mere world was a few thousand miles in diameter, and a galaxy was over 50,000 Light years in diameter. Keep in mind the conversion of a single light year being 6 Trillion miles! Now from a galaxy, we delve into a Universe. A single universe was on average 100 Billion light years in diameter or 33 Gigaparsecs!","A single gigaparsec equated to 3 billion Light years...and this is the scope of numbers that we are currently working with.","Now, with there being dozens of universes within a single Cosmos, one could estimate that the diameter of a single Cosmos with just 50 Universes was...1650 Gigaparsecs! That was trillions in light years! Such was the vast grandeur and fantasy that Noah was laying his eyes on.","His 2 meter human size was so infinitely small in the scope of it all as it was enough to make someone feel insignificant when he gazed at just the boundaries of Cosmos as wide as trillions of light years. It was enough to cause weak beings to shake as their souls broke from the sheer size of everything!","But Noah took it in slowly as he noticed something unique occurring at this moment around the barrier of the three nearby Cosmos that shared borders with them.","He saw...a vast rainbow colored cylindrical light that was billions of light years in size stretched past the boundaries of these Cosmos as they came towards the indigo Cosmos, these vast cylindrical lights having a flat rainbow colored surface at the bottom as they looked like...bridges!","Pristine multicolored stellar bridges stretching out from three Cosmos as they snake out across the Ruination Sea to smash into the barrier of the Indigo Cosmos as they tore through it and spilled into one its universes!","THRUM!","Coincidentally or not, one of these stellar bridges tore the cosmic layer of the Indigo Cosmos and the universal layer of the Cosmos that all of its Antiquities were currently in, the eyes of Noah and all the others turning upwards as far above them, they saw the appearance of a vast tunnel that shone with glorious light and splendor.","...!","A tunnel...a bridge that tore through one cosmos to another that existences could use to easily move across these Cosmos as they wished without having to traverse the Ruination Sea!","It was the appearance of the Primordial Scaffolding that connected the vast number of Cosmos in the Primordial Empire!"]},{"number":1172,"title":"Chapter 1172: Chapter 1171 - Roll The Fuck Out! I","paragraphs":["The scene was such of pure wonder and fantasy as it even caused Noah to marvel at it, the bridge spanning billions of light years actually occupying a tenth of the boundary of the current Universe they were in, and there were three of these bridges that now connected into the Indigo Cosmos!","Going across this bridge alone was akin to passing through a tenth of a universe, the ends of it releasing an incandescent multicolored light that permeated the surroundings and caused an influx of atmospheric essence to rush into their current universe.","As if the other end of this bridge was connected to a Cosmos that had far better quality and quantity of essence, and how could it not be so when it was a Cosmos that was already connected to a vast number of other Cosmos in the Primordial Empire?","All of the Antiquities were still marveling at this scene before them as it was only now that things seemingly came to a level of calmness.","But this calmness didn’t last lost as from the three connected glimmering bridges, the auras of powerful beings could be felt crossing it and coming to enter their Cosmos!","Augustus turned towards Noah at such a juncture as he sent a mental message.","\"Daolord Osmont...this is where I entrust the honor and lives of the quintillions of existences in the Indigo Cosmos to you.\"","WAA!","A brilliant golden light erupted out as Noah only smiled lightly, his head nodding briefly as he had his own thoughts, his gaze and the gazes of everyone here stuck on the enormous rainbow bridge before their eyes as the figures tearing through the folds of space faster than light soon arrived at the entrance of their current universe!","A party of twelve beings made their appearance, all of them clothed in white robes with green inscriptions, a golden blade with a verdant green flower blooming from its hilt being present on the right side of their chest as all of these beings had bright verdant hair that made them stand out.","It was the existences stemming from the House of Springforge, two Daolords coming before their eyes as 10 Antiquities floated behind them!","The smiling figure of Daolord Azazel could be seen as his face was filled with a smirk, the other Daolord being an expressionless woman who looked towards them with unbounded arrogance and pride, her head raised so high that it seemed her chin was raised too much!","But these weren’t the only shocking beings to make their appearance as from the other two rainbow colored bridges, the auras of beings no less than them entered the Indigo Cosmos as they all congregated into this Universe where the auras of all Antiquities and Daolords were clustered in.","In a matter of seconds, Noah and the others were able to see another group aside from the House of Spring Forge, two groups of beings appearing to their right and left as the level of strength was no less than what Azazel and his group released.","12 powerful existences in each group similar to the House of Springforge, but they were all dressed in their unique attire as the group to their left sported pristinely gold clothing, the men adorned in gold-laden suits that looked extremely sleek while the women were adorned on gorgeous golden dresses that all fashion icons would scream for!","They also held the insignia of a golden sword on their chest, but this golden sword was surrounded by three gold halos as it gave it a sacred feel, this entire group of existences looking unapproachable as their two Daolords were a man and a woman that looked extremely alike as if they were twins, their hair also glimmering a mixture of white and gold.","From the descriptions Noah had received beforehand...this was the group from the House of Havenbreaker!","Unapproachable and lofty, looking over everything below them with extremely disdain as their name alone was enough to stand for itself.","Havenbreaker!","But the third and last group could not be outdone, 2 Daolords and 10 Antiquities coming forward as these beings were adorned with engraved red and black robes, their heads sporting similar dark red hair for the men and women alike as their eyes were filled with a light of power.","These were the existences from the last and third force within the Primordial Empire, the House of Stormdust!","RUMBLE!","All of them arrived in a stellar fashion as the Daolord at the front of these groups looked closely at Noah’s group, ignoring most of the Antiquities as their eyes landed on Noah and Augustus beside him.","The voice of Azazel was the first to ring out.","\"Daolord Osmont and old Augustus...it is the honor of our House of Springforge to be the welcoming committee of your Cosmos into the Primordial Empire.\"","With a childish mocking tone, Azazel spoke with a bright smile as the other Daolords glanced in his direction distastefully. The two Daolords with vibrant black and red robes from the House of Stormdust came forward with sharp eyes, glancing at Noah carefully as the woman spoke out commandingly while waving her hand to release a glimmering crystal.","\"We welcome the new champions from across the sea into the Primordial Empire. This Primal Crystal contains base information on the regulations and laws of the Empire, as well as your rights and the rights of the three Houses that oversee everything!\"","WAA!","As the Daolord spoke, her commanding voice reverberated throughout as it drew distaste from other Daolord, but she continued regardless as her eyes focused on Noah.","\"The most important piece of knowledge will be about the Writ of Challenges that determine the flow of power in the Primordial Empire...and the fact that your Indigo Cosmos will have a one week grace period before you have to choose to accept a Writ of Challenge from one of the three Houses! We hope fellow Daolord and the Antiquities around you will choose wisely when the time comes...as such an action will decide just which House you will fall under!\"","...!","Domineering! Powerful! Her eyes flickered with red light as the Daolord spoke, Runic Dao Lines swirling powerfully beneath her robe as she spoke of the Writ of Challenges where victors would have everything while the losers lost everything.","The way that she talked...she made it seem like it was an inevitability that when this Writ of Challenge was issued, those fighting for the Indigo Cosmos would lose as the only choice that mattered for them was who they chose to accept the Writ of Challenge from!","The mere possibility that the forces of the Indigo Cosmos could win the Writ of Challenge didn’t even appear in the minds of these beings, their power and arrogance being put on full display as this was the first impression that Noah had of the powerful forces moving within the Primordial Empire!"]},{"number":1173,"title":"Chapter 1173: Chapter 1172 - Roll The Fuck Out! II","paragraphs":["\"Hmph, Daolord Ilyad...why would they bother accepting a Writ of Challenge of a lesser House?\"","The two Daolord that looked like twins from the House of Havenbreaker floated forward as their auras vibrantly matched those from the House of Stormdust, the female Daolord turning and locking his gaze towards Noah’s direction as he spoke out with a ridiculous amount of pride.","\"Little Daolord, if you wish for an easy life and a future of great prospects...accept the Writ of Challenge from the House of Havenbreaker. We’ll be able to change even aboriginals like you into those worthy of being Protectors of the Bastion of Reality.\"","...!","When these powerful existences said these words, they genuinely thought them to be of help and mercy as they didn’t notice the heavy insults they came with, the hearts of Augustus and others shaking in anger as Noah only had a smile on his face as he waved his hands to pull in it Primal Crystal holding information on the Primordial Empire.","\"Then I’ll thank Daolords for your stupendous hospitality.\"","Noah had a light smile as the Daolords from the House of Stormdust and Havenbreaker nodded approvingly, seeing this as the perfect demeanor that bumpkins like him should have when meeting with such graceful and powerful existences like themselves!","Under the weight of the powerful forces inhabiting the Primordial Empire, what could new entrants do but bend the knee and grovel at their feet for resources and influence?","Azazel looked at the scene occurring with sharp eyes as he didn’t expect the Daolord he was careful of to actually have no backbone, but the situation rapidly changed in the next moment as the voice of this Daolord continued to ring out.","\"Since the kind Daolords have made the trip over to our Indigo Cosmos and acted their part as the welcoming committee...why don’t you all roll the fuck out of this Cosmos for now?\"","...!","RUMBLE!","The surrounding void began to tremble the moment Noah’s words finished, the Daolords that heard them not sure if they had heard correctly!","But they registered very clearly as all of their gazes changed and turned utterly frosty, their Runic Dao Lines swirling majestically as they locked their gazes onto Noah that was playing with the Primal Crystal containing the information of the Primordial Empire on his palm, his voice continuing to echo out!","\"We have a week grace period before we have to accept the challenge, yes? No moves can be made against this Cosmos and the existences within it before then, so I suggest the great Daolords and the little Antiquities they came with to fuck off for now until that time. I’ll give you all the answer then.\"","THRUM!","His words became more and more domineering as time passed, the smile on his face gradually wiped away as it became one of utter coldness!","Tiamat looked at this scene from her master as the heart of this dragoness fluttered.","She wasn’t the only one as even the ambitious Lexis Marcus Tiberius saw herself turning towards Noah in shock and awe as her body felt lightning course through her!","King Augusts was the one most shocked as he never expected this side from what Noah had shown before, but the Daolords and Antiquities from the Primordial Empire were even more in a stupor as they never expected a being they considered lesser to ever talk to them in such a way.","\"IMPUDENT!\"","WAA!","The twins from the House of Havenbreaker released the word in synchrony as their eyes blazed out rays of golden light, ancient Runic Dao Lines beginning to swirl on their bodies as the pristine suits and golden dresses hugged them tightly!","\"A little thing like you dares?!\"","The Daolords and Antiquities from the House of Stormdust merely blinked as the void above them changed color, turning into a metallic red tinge that threatened to devour and overwhelm every single thing right then and there.","\"Haha...haha!","Meanwhile, Azazel had begun to laugh in a raucous manner after seeing Noah’s reply, his side being the only ones that seemed to be simmering in anger amidst the laughter.","They were the prestigious existences of the Primordial Empire! The Protectors of the Bastion of Reality! They were existences that had lived for a very long time and knew very well of their qualities of arrogance and pride...but they deserved to be so based on what they had accomplished!","Who was this being before them to disparage that and talk to them in such a manner?","RUMBLE!","The surroundings quaked and tumbled as if everything could shatter into nothingness at any moment, but Noah simply continued to play with the Primal Crystal within his hands as his now cold voices continued to echo out.","\"Under the rules of the Great Conqueror, no harm or moves shall be made against any existences of a newly joining Cosmos for the period of 1 week. I want to ask the Daolords before me...are you all planning to reject the rules of the Great Conqueror? Are you all planning to rebel against the guidelines of the Emperor?\"","His voice was cold and steady, perfusing into the minds of all those in the surroundings as their wild and flaring power came to a halt as they looked at this being incredulously.","Was he...was he actually using the rules of the Primordial Empire against them? After barely arriving here for a few minutes?","The void froze at such a development as the smiles were wiped off from the faces of the Daolord Azazel and others from the House of Springforge. The beams of golden light shooting from the twin like existences from the House of Havenbreaker calmed down as they stared coldly, while those from the House of Stormdust gazed on coldly as the tinge of metallic red disappeared from the skies.","Noah domineeringly raised his head to meet all of them as he continued to speak out.","\"You cannot move a muscle against me, and you cannot remain within this Cosmos at this time. Thus, you can just scurry back along the same rainbow bridges you came from.\"","WAA!"]},{"number":1174,"title":"Chapter 1174: Chapter 1173 - A Mere Nobody!","paragraphs":["The area was utterly cold and palpating with battle intent as the auras of multiple Daolords spread out, but Noah’s voice continued to ring out.","\"If you wish to step onto this Cosmos again, just win the Writ of Challenge in a week, and you can choose to do whatever you wish to me and this Cosmos. The only question that remains is whether the party I choose can even win.\"","...!","His eyes seemed to be filled with ridicule as he gazed upon the angered and arrogant faces of the Daolord of the three Houses, his figure looking extremely domineering at this moment!","His hair danced wildly as his eyes released wondrous rays of light, locking his gaze with every single one of the Daolords from the Three Houses as he said the next words with utter clarity.","\"Seeing the poor quality of Daolords before my eyes right now...the competition seems abysmal so far.\"","THRUM!","His last words were the nail in the coffin as the glimmering golden suits on the powerful Antiquities and Daolords of the House of Havenbreaker glistened dangerously, their eyes letting out palpable beams of light as the twin Daolord nodded vigorously, their voices resounding out a second later!","\"Good! Good!\"","With the utterance of the same word twice, the twins gave a signal as the domineering party of the House of Havenbreaker was actually the first to leave! They could do nothing by staying here unless they wanted to break the rules of the Great Conqueror, so they would rather not listen to another word that a mere nobody before them continued to utter due to his unique protection.","After them, the crimson black dressed powerhouses from the House of Stormdust gave Noah deadly gazes that could kill a few times over, the one female Daolord gazing towards Noah with deadly malice as she spoke out and enunciated every word slowly.","\"You will find this to be the deadliest mistake you made since the beginning of your existence, little thing.\"","RUMBLE!","With her words cold and decisive, her face was raised high arrogantly as she continued coldly.","\"When we strip you of your rulership and influence, I’ll make extra sure to humiliate the men and women you are connected to first before I do anything to you. You mark my words.\"","With such hateful words, the powerful Daolords and Antiquities of the House of Stormdust turned into streaks of light that returned to their own magnificent rainbow colored Bridge!","This left behind only the figures of Daolord Azazel and the female Daolord beside him along with the party behind them.","Even though the female Daolord beside Azazel seemed about to speak, Azazel raised a hand to stop her as their party only stared coldly towards Noah.","Their white-green robes fluttered majestically in space as Azazel’s voice flowed out calmly, his childish smile still present even now!","\"Until next time then...Daolord Osmont!\"","WAA!","With that, they returned to the glimmering rainbow colored Bridge above this Universe as their figures quickly disappeared, only leaving behind the stupefied Antiquities of the Indigo Cosmos and Noah.","---","As she saw the Daolords and Antiquities of the Primordial Empire turn into lights that left into the rainbow colored bridges they came from, Lexis felt her mind still buzzing in shock and stupor as her eyes locked onto Noah.","Hid recent words and demeanor while facing the horrendously powerful forces of the Primordial Empire played on her mind over and over again as she couldn’t erase it even if she tried.","What guts! What power! What a man!","Her face unconsciously became flushed as when she gathered her bearings, she was shocked to find that on a certain private place on her body, it was somewhat damp purely from the thrill of watching Daolord Osmont control the situation and tell off multiple powerful Daolords from the behemoth that was the Primordial Empire!","\"Ah...\"","She could hardly believe that an Antiquity like her could actually have such a thing occur, using her aura to wipe away any evidence as if those around her could somehow see.","But her eyes and the eyes of all others locked towards Noah at this moment as if they could still hardly believe what had occurred, King Augustus not even knowing where to begin!","When King Augustus first laid eyes over Noah and judged his temperament, never did he expect it would be boisterous! So domineering!","The face of the old King was twitching constantly as he wondered what he had actually connected himself to...","But you then had the figures of Noah’s summons, with the Blue Slime seeming gleeful as it bounced on Noah’s head with happiness, Tiamat seen pulling herself even closer towards her master as her eyes flashed with powerful pride and reverence.","The other Animus Summons felt their hearts ignite with passion and power as they wanted to be capable of doing such a thing as their Master one day!","Such a feeling of power...was extremely enticing!","—","In such a manner, the welcoming parties of Daolords returned to the Cosmos they came from, each of them with their own thoughts as one thing remained the same- their thoughts swirled on a single Daolord Osmont.","In the Cosmos adjacent to Indigo Cosmos that was known as the Shimmering Cosmos.","Daolord Azazel led his party as the female Daolord beside him looked towards him carefully, her voice ringing out.","\"Azazel, this Osmont...\"","\"He...is someone we have to be careful of! I know the others are seeing him as a mere bumpkin with an overinflated ego, but I felt something from him even before you met him just now...something that I can’t put a finger on!\" Azazel actually moved with care, his childish face becoming extremely somber as he replied to the Daolord beside him and continued.","\"I’ll write a report and send it to the Family Head just in case, but this Daolord Osmont...I don’t like him or how he operates. We’ll need to watch closely how the Writ of Challenge he faces in a week will turn out.\"","RUMBLE!"]},{"number":1175,"title":"Chapter 1175: Chapter 1174 - Writ Of Challenge!","paragraphs":["A new Cosmos had joined the Primordial Empire, and its entrance caused small waves to emanate out as the welcoming parties were actually rebuffed with utter disrespect!","Within one of the myriad of Cosmos under the jurisdiction of the House of Havenbreaker.","The two twin-like Daolords that just came from the Indigo Cosmos were bowing towards a figure of shocking prestige and power, a Daolord that had numerous Runic Dao Lines inscribed throughout her whole body as she emanated a notorious charm!","She was adorned in a golden dress that had unique inscriptions of white, her eyes cold as she glanced at the two Daolords below that spoke respectfully.","\"Ancestor...the forces of this small Cosmos are actually so daring as to insult the prestige of all the Daolords of the Primordial Empire! They put nothing in their eyes as even if the Family Head was before them...they would probably be just as impetuous!\"","WAA!","Their faces were utterly cold as they reported, but the gaze of the Daolord they termed Ancestor only nodded with a sharp light crossing her eyes as she spoke out lightly.","\"I know you two are up next to manage another Cosmos and increase your pace in the collection of Marks of Antiquity, so I nominated you two to handle the Writ of Challenge for this Cosmos. But...\"","The gaze of the powerful Daolord turned sharp as she continued.","\"...this Cosmos has a Lesser Primordial Heart in their hands! Something that can produce multiple Antiquities and help one advance by hundreds of Universes. Many are eyeing such a treasure as you two are some of those that will uniquely be capable of sending a Writ of Challenge to them. You...cannot fail in this!\"","...!","Her words were extremely commanding as the Daolords nodded, the two of them knowing full well the restrictions of the Writ of Challenge that a certain someone was learning about right now from a Primal Crystal.","\"We don’t know which Writ of Challenge this Daolord will choose, but be ready when the time comes...\"","The carefully designed machinations of powerful existences began to weave wondrously, all of them targeting a single new Cosmos that apart from the Quintillions of existences within it...it had a Primordial Heart!","The inhabitants of this Cosmos were just now learning more of the Primordial Empire and the most important Writ of Challenge.","Within the Indigo Cosmos, Noah held the Primal Crystal as a fantastical light cascaded from it, knowledge flooding into his mind as his focus currently revolved around the Writ of Challenges!","What exactly were they?","They were a system established by the Great Conqueror to allow those with power to shine and rule over others!","The strong should lead, and the weak will remain so.","This was the system of power in the Primordial Empire!","But it had to be done in a proper way, and this was what Aegon established as the Writ of Challenges worked in a manner that would allow similarly powerful entities to fight and vie for supremacy. This is where the core of the Writ of Challenges lay- beings of similar power!","And the determinant of power in the Primordial Empire...was how many Cosmos an existence controlled.","’Kings’ ruling and influencing a single Cosmos would be able to challenge other existences that rule over another Cosmos. Only the forces of these Cosmos would fight as the victor would take everything from the loser!","This system was designed with the knowledge that the most powerful Daolords would have multiple Cosmos they were overseeing, and weaker Daolords and Antiquities would only have a Cosmo or two that they looked over.","To prevent schemes of corruption where a tremendously powerful Daolord that controlled dozens of Cosmos momentarily relinquished control of them to only control 1 and then use his might to slowly win over lesser Daolords with Writs of Challenges, there was a time limit of them having to be influencing their cosmos for the past 100 years!","To be counted as a King overseeing a single cosmos, they had to have been doing this for 100 years before they could issue a Writ of Challenge to others who only controlled one Cosmos. After they won such a battle, they would right away be elevated to controlling two Cosmos as utilizing this method would grant nothing substantial in the end, so all powerful Daolords opted to increase the number of Cosmos under them as they amassed billions upon billions of Marks of Antiquity over the years.","This system will be explored more closely in the future for the sake of clarity, but all one had to know was that it was very hard to cheat this system of power!","But of course, the powerful Houses of the Primordial Empire always found ways to play things to their favor.","An example was the current Writ of Challenges that Noah could choose from the ’Kings’ that stemmed from the three Houses, these beings each being in control of a single Cosmos just like him. Each of the Writs was from existences influencing a single Cosmos, and yet the forces of this single Cosmos included two or three Daolords!","Winning a battle against them would be nigh impossible for newly joining Cosmos that operated under different regulations than already established ones. But...that was only for other average Cosmos under average beings.","The Indigo Cosmos had Noah!","He absorbed the knowledge of the Primal Crystal as he made himself more and more clear of the Writs of Challenges and the other prominent things dealing with the Primordial Empire as the Antiquities around him looked towards him with worry.","\"Daolord Osmont...was that wise to do?\"","King Augustus spoke carefully as he looked towards the direction that the forces of the House of Stormdust had left in, these beings actually promising to not just take everything they had, but also to humiliate the forces under him as such distasteful words were not things that Augustus expected to hear from prestigious Daolords!","\"Hmm?","Noah glanced at this old ruler that was filled with worry as he let out a light laugh, looking towards the rainbow colored bridges that he now knew were called Primordial Rainbow Bridges and sometimes Primordial Scaffoldings as his voice stretched out powerfully.","\"Against those filled with arrogance, you can only reply to them with arrogance! Otherwise, you will just be rolled over for the foreseeable future.\"","His eyes shone with power as he said so, those around him not being able to help but focus on his figure as he spoke. He looked as if he was larger than they perceived him, his back being extremely wide and dependable as he seemed capable of shouldering everything by himself!"]},{"number":1176,"title":"Chapter 1176: Chapter 1175 - Making Antiquities Is Easy! I","paragraphs":["Within the vast Primordial Empire.","In a Cosmos deep in the cluster of Cosmos within this Empire, an existence that was floating in a unique environment filled with the Primordial Essence and the Essence of Ruination opened her eyes.","Her verdant green hair washed over her shoulders as this existence looked extremely pristine, not a single layer of clothing on her as the glorious blessings were open, but there was nobody there to see!","All her proportions were so pristine that she was more than fully worthy of titles such as Miss Universe, if not Miss Cosmos!","Ruination and Primordial Essence wrapped around her tightly as her languid eyes gazed towards a certain direction, her hand raising as her fingers tapped the air and allowed the entrance of multiple Primal Crystals that contained bouts of information.","Much of it were things she expected and knew, the situation of the shifts of power within the Primordial Empire and which House was able to expand their influence across other Cosmos displayed before her. But her eyes raised as she came across a Primal Crystal from Daolord Azazel- one that included a certain scene of a new Cosmos being welcomed into the Primordial Empire!","\"Oh?\"","Her green eyes shimmered in the wondrous environment of the calm Primordial and Ruination Essence as her eyes locked onto the domineering figure of Noah on the scene playing out. The report Azazel sent along with the scene playing out only caused ripples to cross through the eyes of this being, but it was nothing more than that as she only gave it a bit more attention.","\"Is there actually something there, or is it just some hot air?\"","Her voice was like bells ringing throughout as she spoke with a smile, her hands waving the Primal Crystal containing this information and scene away as she moved on to other issues that pertained to someone like her!","Someone who was a king above many kings, someone that was the head of the House of Springforge!","In the unique space, her pristine body could be seen as it was utterly spotless, not a single Runic Dao Line in sight being seen on her body as it seemed to ring with another source of power.","Someone who oversaw the myriad of Kings within her House and controlled the expansion of their power into the territories of other Cosmos through the Writs of Challenges...she was a truly powerful individual, and it was a wonder as to why she didn’t have a single Runic Dao Line inscribed on her stark naked body!","But her glimmering green eyes continued to move from one Primal Crystal to another as she sifted through droves of information, her fingers tapping the air every now and then as strings of commands were released.","—","In the Infinite Cosmos.","Noah was lying down on a field of lush golden grasses, a small picnic blanket beside him where the figure of Adelaide could be seen sitting regally with glistening foods all around her.","In her hands though, one could see a pulsating multicolored heart that released waves of potent essence that even caused the surroundings to take on a hue of multiple colors!","The two of them were currently in the Dark Universe of the Infinite Cosmos, in the land that used to be Noah’s home as all around them were fields of glimmering golden grasslands with just the two of them having a picnic, a Primordial Heart in the hands of Adelaide as she looked towards Noah while shaking her head with a hint of shyness.","\"Why would you give this to me first? I don’t delve into any of the battles like everyone else...just let everyone else have these. I don’t need to reach Antiquity so soon.\"","The Ice Queen loved the present she received profoundly, but she couldn’t bring herself to absorb it as she thought about Kazuhiko and all the others who always fought on the front lines and could benefit from treasures like this much more!","\"Hmm?\"","But she only saw the man she was completely enamored with rising up and look at her with teasing eyes, his voice dancing in her ears.","\"Oh, then who should I take it to? Barbatos? She’d get too excited from getting such a gift as I don’t know what she’ll do...Valentina? She’s wanted to reach Antiquity the most over the years...\"","His teasing eyes seemed to be thinking of many things as Adelaide harrumphed while she pouted at him mentioning other women during their time, her hand pulling the Primordial Heart back as she spoke in a sulking manner.","\"Fine...I’ll absorb it later. Or can we mix it with the food and eat it cooked?\"","RUMBLE!","Dangerous words were mentioned from her mouth as she spoke of a prized treasure that even Daolords sought for as an ingredient for a meal, Noah smiling at such a scene as his eyes remained locked on her clear eyes. Clear eyes that he felt like he could get lost in and freeze in time as any worries faded away.","He shook himself out of his reverie as he spoke out lightly.","\"Don’t worry, the others will receive Primordial Hearts just like this to advance forward.\"","\"Oh?\" Adelaide raised her brows at this as her sonorous voice continued to echo out. \"Just like this?\"","\"Well, yours was the first. You’ll always be the first!\" Noah was quick on his feet as he replied, causing a dazzling smile to appear on Adelaide as she nodded happily while putting glistening food on two plates.","\"Come on, tell me what’s happening in the Indigo Cosmos...\"","Her fair fingers moved towards the food around them as she prepared a plate for Noah, his figure teleporting beside her on the picnic blanket as his eyes shone with light while his mouth moved, a smile still persistent throughout!","He had already begun to distribute the cut up Primordial Hearts to his people as at this very moment, they would soon be forging Billions of galaxies to set up their universes and then proceed to connect them.","Because they could amass Marks of Antiquity with the Primordial Hearts, they would be able to become Hegemonies and then Antiquities within the same day!","Noah was setting up his forces for a stupendous rise in strength as given their capability to borrow a percentage of his power and the boosts from their chosen Archetypes- it was bound to be a fantastical reality when he brought all of them into the Indigo Cosmos and fought against the forces within the Primordial Empire!"]},{"number":1177,"title":"Chapter 1177: Chapter 1176 - Making Antiquities Is Easy! II","paragraphs":["Author note 12/24/2021- We should have a mass release today with chapters releasing on 5 minute intervals from 11:00 am EST to 11:25 am ^.^","---","In the Infinite Cosmos, grand changes were occurring throughout in its upper echelons of power, the myriad of existences within experiencing spurts of growth they never would have believed possible!","Noah had only left for a few days, yet his clones came and passed out the stupendous Primordial Hearts from an existence that none of them could currently face.","Within the Novus Universe.","Waves of essence were undulating in a region of space as one could see the figures of multiple existences floating near each other, all of them clenching a Primordial Heart in their hands as they absorbed its stupendous essence to forge millions of Galaxies every second!","The figure of the glimmering golden Emperor Penguin could be seen floating majestically, his Galaxies already reaching 100 Billion as he was currently changing them into Dao Galaxies and connecting them, wanting to achieve the stupendous feat of having all 100 Billion be Dao Galaxies as they could connect them all to form their Universe...and then be capable of stepping into Universal Filament right away to become Antiquities!","It was a ridiculous reality that only those having access to treasures like a Primordial Heart could accomplish, and many of Noah’s subordinates were taking this route.","Kazuhiko and Steel Mikhail could also be seen floating in the region of space near the Emperor Penguin and a few hundred other beings, their bodies undulating with power in this same manner as they had almost completely finished forging their Dao Galaxies. It meant that within a matter of seconds, multiple Antiquities would be born from these Existences that already had the Classes of Temporal Lords, Blood Rulers, Summoners, Annihilators, and much more!","The Oathkeeper was watching such a scene with disbelief as beside him, the body of the Goliath had become completely unshackled, his figure shaking as he saw the treasures before his eyes that would birth hundreds of Antiquities soon.","Something that he chased for countless years to achieve...and yet others would be achieving it so simply because of a single being! The heart of this aged unique existence shook as his figure trembled in the shimmering space, his ancient voice stretching out soon after.","\"I pledge Fealty to the Tyrannical Emperor.\"","RUMBLE!","His voice echoed out in waves as a glorious light shined upon him, his body feeling the stupendous power coursing through him as he sighed with unknown emotions!","Oathkeeper saw such a scene as he nodded, his hand flashing as a pulsing Primordial Heart appeared. A heart that Noah had to cut miles of the primary one to form, the Oathkeeper sending this towards the Goliath as he spoke.","\"Yours and Chronos’s actions went forward to causing the quick rise of the Antiquity of Mana and contributed in making what we have now possible. If you fully wish to redeem yourself, achieve what you always sought to and be ready to fight for him.\"","The Goliath’s body shook at such words, his hands grasping onto the pulsating heart as he could hear the whispers of something he sought for too many years.","Antiquity!","It was not being made possible in a way he never imagined, the black hole on this being’s body shaking emotionally as he gazed towards the region above the few hundred beings that were absorbing Primordial Hearts just like these.","It was a clone of Noah’s that was observing everything, the Goliath looking at this being as this oldest living being of the past Primordial Cosmos...kneeled towards Noah’s figure while he began to absorb the Primordial Heart!","THRUM!","A stupendous show of Fealty from someone that had lived for millions of years to an existence that had barely lived over 20s!","It was a fantastical reality as while the Goliath began to absorb the Primordial Heart, the first set of Antiquities began to be born, Noah’s clone observing all of them from above as bouts of power began to weave out.","RAA! RAA! RAA!","A fearsome bellow echoed out from a golden beaked existence, its flippers glistening with glorious power as its Origin showed a Splendiferous Universe and the initial few billions of Galaxies for a second Universe.","It was a Universal Filament as this first Spiritual Beast became a Hegemony and then an Antiquity a few seconds after!","BOOM!","The auras of other beings also began to explode as in another direction, the figure of Valentina could be seen shaking her head incredulously as she looked at the two glimmering Universes within her Origin. She had been seeking this greater level of power for so many years, yet a single man came into her life as he gave it to her in mere days.","Her eyes gazed towards the figure of Noah’s clone with a light of fondness shining within it, her heart settling down as even a being like her felt her heart settle down, her very Origin settling down as she told herself she could put her everything on this single man’s shoulders.","THRUM!","Such a realization caused the light of infatuation within her eyes to increase even more, her gaze remaining locked on Noah as she didn’t take her eyes off of him after she became an Antiquity!","Near her, Barbatos, Elena, Anna, and even the War Princess Athena were shining with fantastical lights as their figures caused their surroundings to tremble as the levels of power they released.","YAA!","Vibrant bellows released from these women as they felt the birth of a second Universe within them, their gazes also turning towards the being that made all of this possible!","Meanwhile, Noah was overseeing all of this with a smile as while Antiquities continued to pop up with ease below him, he actually found himself to have a shocking thought that others would strangle him for if they heard it.","’Ah...so making Antiquities was this easy!’","RUMBLE!","A domineering thought as over his main body, countless Marks of Antiquity continued to rain down not just from the many beings that had pledged their Fealty to him and provided him a slow constant farming of these Marks, but also from the fact that he was responsible for the birth of hundreds of Antiquities.","The golden seas of Destiny and Fortune above him only continued to expand outwards, foretelling of an imperious future that even he didn’t know where it would lead!"]},{"number":1178,"title":"Chapter 1178: Chapter 1177 - Just Who Is More Domineering?!","paragraphs":["As Antiquities arose in the Infinite Cosmos, Noah’s main body was still in the Ruination Realm as he tried to tackle a particular issue he faced, and he had the time to tackle this issue at this moment as he had a week before the wonders of the Primordial Empire began to churn in full swing.","After a week, he would have to accept a Writ of Challenge from the members of one of the three Houses of this Empire, his influence beginning to expand as if he won...another Cosmos would fall under his lap!","And for as long as he continued to win these Writs of Challenges and prove himself to be the strongest, he could take the myriad of Cosmos that Daolords and Antiquities were controlling as he would make himself an enemy of all the established powers within the Primordial Empire.","He had to be careful, but most of all...he had to be powerful!","So he was tackling the issue of Nomological Edicts and Runic Dao Lines as he was currently talking with the consciousness of his Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Core of the Infinite Cosmos.","It was the question of the feasibility of another Trait or the design of a Cosmic Dao to possibly solve this issue, and exactly how to go about it!","<The addition of the trait of Protagonist was only possible due to my influence that overcame the universal rules, and you had to split your soul to achieve it before. The same thing would have to occur again as I don’t recommend this route.>","The voice of RUINATION echoed out carefully in Noah’s mind, the subject currently being on what made it possible for multiple Traits to arise!","With the split of a soul, Noah acted as if he was an entirely different existence being reborn in another Galaxy, his body being capable of birthing another trait. It wasn’t something that he could do endlessly, as the splitting of one’s soul was an extremely dangerous and arduous procedure that only succeeded based on the help from a Cosmic Treasure and the consciousness of a Galaxy Core.","<You could at most split your soul one or two more times to grant yourself a Trait, but it becomes exceedingly dangerous, especially with the high level you achieved. But a Cosmic Dao won’t cost you anything, you can design one that can record all previously learned Daos or something along these lines.>","RUINATION was cautioning when it came to the splitting of one’s soul and Traits, but the ancient voice of the Cosmic Core rumbled out around them a second later in a domineering tone!","<<It is just the splitting of a soul. He did before with a Galaxy Core, and I am currently a Cosmic Core. There would be very little risk of danger doing it this way.>>","RUMBLE!","<<Something you are also overseeing is that the body of the new soul doesn’t have to be human, where we can design something more in tune with laws and Daos, possibly bringing forth something even more powerful than his main body or the Primordial Ruination Clone. I’ve already been running simulations of something like a Sacred Dao Physique or a Universal Race. A split of the soul also means three different entities that can use skills independently, increasing the number of Clones from abilities like Blood Clones by another 5. We must follow this method.>>","...!","The Cosmic Core was adamant on Noah splitting his soul and forming the third trait, even going as far as to propose this third one didn’t have to be human!","It could be something like the Goliath’s body that was born in a Black Hole and took this quality, with Noah’s being something that would be even more stupendous depending on what they did, which from the words of the Cosmic Core might be something like a Race based off of a Universe.","\"...\"","Noah listened to the discussion between the Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Core as he weighed his options carefully, liking the idea of another Trait immensely as just Infinite Mana and the Protagonist Trait had brought him so far!","Between his thoughts, the voice of RUINATION echoed out.","<So long as there isn’t a disproportionate risk to reward ratio and we are confident in doing it, I am not entirely against the third splitting of the soul. But we’ve also seen what could be made possible with the design of Daos. A Cosmic Dao based on allowing one to be capable of stepping on the path of Runic Dao Lines and Nomological Edicts would be something incredible, and it would also be usable by others apart from Noah, benefitting his own people.>","A Cosmic Dao capable of allowing one to traverse on both the path of Runic Dao Lines and Nomological Edicts!","It was a stupendous possibility as Noah also saw this as the path to true power, where he didn’t leave behind Runic Dao Lines or Nomological Edicts, but gained the boosts of both.","But the words of the Cosmic Core were ruthless as they stretched out in the next second.","<<A Trait capable of recording or permanently keeping Daos even when they are deconstructed and reconstructed into Dao Lines would allow him to traverse both paths with ease. As for a Cosmic Dao being usable to others within this Cosmos? A single truly strong being is better than a few average ones. The Trait will make this possibility come to reality. Even now, a single Noah is worth more than all of the existences within this Cosmos.>>","RUMBLE!","Domineering and ruthless words erupted out as it seemed the two entities- Cosmic Treasure and Cosmic Core, were about to come to blows!","\"...\"","Noah’s eyes shone brightly at such a juncture as his consciousness fully stepped into the picture, his voice echoing out.","\"A trait and the dangers it brings and the design of a Cosmic Dao and the limited slots it uses...both are great possibilities, but you all are forgetting one thing!\"","The voices of RUINATION and the Cosmic Core could be domineering, but he was even more so as he captured both of their attention with his words.","Noah’s eyes began to glimmer with intense light as beams of light gradually began to shoot from them, his voice echoing out magisterially.","\"A Trait or Cosmic Dao...it is not as if it has to be one or the other.\"","THRUM!","\"We could design both a Trait that allows me to retain previously reconstructed Daos and a Cosmic Dao that allows for me to be capable of fusing Daos into Nomological Edicts..or the other way around. Both. I want them both!\"","WAA!","His voice gloriously echoed out as the consciousnesses of RUINATION and the Cosmic Core could only stare at his body suffused by an imperious glow!"]},{"number":1179,"title":"Chapter 1179: Chapter 1178 - The Third Trait! A New Race! I","paragraphs":["Both a Trait and a Cosmic Dao!","The two consciousnesses of RUINATION and the Cosmic Core could not deny it, thereafter looking at possibilities of what exactly they could design.","The Cosmic Core was the first one to speak.","<<When it comes to the Trait, I’ve been exploring the possibilities of what body you could transmigrate into. We could have the new soul not in a traditional race like a human or dragon...I want to explore the possibility of your soul entering a Universe. During the process of me utilizing Universal Singularity, I want to attach your soul to its core and procure the Universal Race for you. This will be where we will be capable of granting a powerful Trait and have it successfully be entrenched in your soul.>>","RUMBLE!","Words akin to a madman speaking came out, everything the Cosmic Core said sounding ridiculous to the extreme as it wanted Noah’s new body to be a Universe!","The Vital Essence of the Cosmos would be utilized as [Universal Singularity] would be cast, and Noah’s split soul would enter the core of this Universe as he obtained a race he didn’t know was even a possibility in the vast different Realities.","THUMP!","His heart was beating immensely with excitement even now, his thoughts not finding anything better at this time as he nodded.","\"The Universal Race...\"","A Universe as his race! What boosts would come? How would it all even work?!","There were too many questions swirling in his mind when it came to this, but he would only know when it actually happened, so he breathed out and spoke with a resolute expression.","\"Let’s do it. We can get the hardest part out of the way and split the soul for this rebirth into a new race with its own Trait.\"","RUMBLE!","His words resounded in the consciousnesses of the Cosmic Treasure and Core, these entities shining brightly to show their agreement as Noah’s figure was teleported into the Cosmic Core, his body becoming suffused in the Primordial Essence and the Essence of Ruination within this vast space.","His chest was laid bare as only jet black pants covered him, the dense essence of two Cosmic Daos making him feel as if he was swimming in a vast river. A moment later, he felt these two essences wrap around his body as the voice of the Cosmic Core resounded out.","<<With the capability to utilize Ruination and Primordial Essence along with the capabilities of a Cosmic Core and a Cosmic Treasure, the dangers of splitting the soul are greatly reduced as the Trait that can be born from this is something that others can only ever dream of.>>","As the archaic monotone voice of the Cosmic Core stretched out, Noah’s Cosmic Treasure within his chest began to pulse with intense red light as a second later...his body jolted up as if he was struck by trillions of bolts of lightning, his forehead seemingly beginning to split apart as even in the Ruination and Primordial Sea...Noah couldn’t help but let out a frightening bellow!","\"OOOOOH!\"","Pain! Immense and unadulterated pain coursed through him as for the second time in his life, his soul was split apart!","WAA!","The glows of Primordial and Ruination essence sunk into his origin and soul as they seemingly tried to make it better, but they only caused even more bouts of pain to course through him.","The stronger one’s soul was, the more terrifying the pain there would be when one did an action as drastic as splitting it apart. Noah was only able to do it and come out unscathed because he had a literal Cosmic Core carrying out the procedure, and the might of a Cosmic Treasure capable of going against universal and cosmic rules was aiding him in doing everything!","Amidst the glow of resplendent colors and Noah screaming out bellows filled with pain, his head that had split apart had a chunk of his soul pulled out, a glimmering ball of incandescent light filled with power and mysteries ripped out of him as his main body became pale and weak.","His eyes were still brimming with light as he observed the chunk of his soul glimmering brightly before him, this scene not lasting lost as this soul began to shoot out towards a certain direction!","The direction was of course...the place where a new Universe was about to be born.","<<Universal Singularity.>>","With a somber tone, the Cosmic Core called out as immense droves of Vital Cosmic Essence were used. The first time they were utilized after Noah obtained this Infinite Cosmos gave way to the Novus Universe, and now...it was being utilized for the second time to give birth to a Universe that he would use as his body.","A body that was on average 100 Billion light years in diameter or 33 Gigaparsecs!","RUMBLE!","Near the boundary of the Novus Universe, an extremely dense Singularity of a myriad of colors began to form.","From the Cosmic Core, a significant portion of Noah’s soul shot out as it moved faster than the speed of light to quickly rush forward, its target being the barely formed Universal Singularity as the moment it formed, Noah sank into it!","...!","Silence.","Half of his soul sunk into the Universal Singularity as everything seemed utterly quiet. But it was only the calm before a storm began to rage.","It was only a lull before something exceedingly unbelievable came to fruition!","<<Soul has successfully fused with the Universal Singularity. Beginning the granting of the Trait Samsara Universal Dao Origin.>>","RUMBLE!","The feature of Trait Bestowal of the Cosmic Core was utilized in a shocking fashion as the Cosmos recognized the newly born Universe not as a true Universe, but a mere body of one of its existences!","A mere body that would be the birth of a being from the Universal Race within the Infinite Cosmos.","As always, it was Noah forging the way forward....his new soul fully sinking into the Universal Singularity that had begun to buzz with utter fantastical activity, the Trait that was only known as the Samsara Universal Dao Origin being born at this time!"]},{"number":1180,"title":"Chapter 1180: Chapter 1179 - The Third Trait! A New Race! II","paragraphs":["A soul entered a Universal Singularity as before a genuine Universe could be formed, the light of a Cosmic Core and the influence of a Cosmic Treasure went forward to mold this Singularity into something it wasn’t!","First was the acceptance of the soul into the Singularity, and then it was the bestowal of a Trait that was a feature of the Infinite Cosmos.","The moment the Trait Bestowal landed on the fusing Universal Singularity and half of Noah’s soul...it sealed the deal as the conflagration of Universe and Soul became recognized as one entity.","THRUM!","Once this recognition occurred, the extremely dense Universal Singularity then began to expand outwards countless billions of light years, with the goal being to reach 100 Billion Light years or exceed it!","It was at this time that Noah could ’feel’ something from the connection of his soul, the expansion of the Universe into billions of light years feeling like the beating of a heart.","THUMP! THUMP! THUMP!","It was rapid and magisterial as with every thump, dozens of billions of miles were added as Noah’s consciousness began to wake up fully, the heart of his main body beginning to shake incredulously as he felt the awe inspiring and simply fantastical sense of power of a Universe as a body!","With one final thump...","OOOOOOOOH!","A Universe bellowed out.","WAA!","A glorious array of colors suffused all around as near the newly designed Novus Universe, another one even more stupendous and gloriously shining made its appearance.","It towered over 144 Billion Light Years in diameter, its boundaries trembling with fantastical wonders of light as from deep within its core, one could still hear a resounding bellow echo from it!","Within this Universe, Noah’s consciousness fully awoke.","\"...\"","He...truly didn’t know how to even describe it. He actually had no words as for one to comprehend what it meant for an existence to have a Universe for a body, they must experience the feeling first hand as the words to describe it would not be entirely accurate!","All of the 144 Billion Light Years of his body...Noah could feel them all. Naturally, he could also move his body as he wished, the newly forged Universe plucking off from the Cosmos smoothly as it stood alone in the Chaotic Ruination Sea.","<<How do you feel?>>","The ancient voice of the Cosmic Core rang in his ears as Noah’s bellowing voice stretched out slowly.","\"I feel...\"","RUMBLE!","Along with his words, the 144 Billion light years Universe began to shine with rainbow colored light, beginning to reduce in size at such a rapid rate as it became a Billion light years in the next second, a single light year after that, then a mile...and then 2 meters in the second that followed!","The entire Universe condensed down into 2 meters as it took on a humanoid form, Noah raising his hands and glancing at them as he didn’t see skin, but the reflection of countless Galaxies flowing calmly over his hands.","When one looked at him, they would only see a humanoid figure whose entire body was filled with the stellar light of Galaxies and stars, his very own eyes being a cluster of millions of miniaturized galaxies as it was extremely shocking to gaze into them!","His hair stretched on his head gloriously, every single strand also filled with glimmering Galaxies as he looked like an ancient entity that existed in the Primordial Times!","His voice only finished coming out at this time as when he spoke, his mouth unconsciously released an Incandescent galactic light.","\"...good. I feel good!\"","His entire body glimmered with stellar light as when one even gazed at his manhood, they would notice a well-endowed spear that glistened with billions of Galaxies.","Everything about him was a genuine Universe as he took a few minutes to take it all in, but he eventually raised his head as he glanced towards a Status Panel before his eyes that showed many things!","The voice of the Cosmic Core echoed out, a hint of emotion actually being present in it this time.","<<You have successfully gained a body whose race is a Universe, such a thing having its own perks as our main objective of inscribing the third Trait within this body’s soul has succeeded. This...is the Trait known as the Samsara Universal Dao Origin.>>","THRUM!","Magisterial light suffused over Noah’s eyes as the Status Panel zoomed in on a particularly grand addition.","[Samsara Universal Dao Origin] :: Among all the traits granted by the Infinite Cosmos, it is nigh impossible to even replicate something such as this as the only possibility lies in the Progeny of the holder of the Samsara Universal Dao Origin. It is a Trait that requires the Origin of a Universe to come to fruition, and one that allows for the inscription of Any Daos and Nomological Edicts onto the Samsara Universal Dao Origin, the accumulations of these Daos and Nomological Edicts never being lost...even in time. The Trait contains the Absolute Skills of <Dao Inscription>, <Nomological Edict Inscription>, <Dao Child>, <Traverser of Edicts>, and <Universal Origin>.","\"Well damn...\"","Noah stared at the description of the Trait in a stupor, his heart continuing to shake from what he read as it was at this moment that he noticed something odd.","He had been taken in by the grandeur of it all that he just now noticed that he didn’t truly feel an Origin in his body!","When his eyes landed on the Absolute Skills under the Samsara Universal Dao Origin Trait, he began to fathom just what had happened as before anything else, he looked at a particular skill first.","<Universal Origin> :: Your body is your Origin. When you advance through Realms, your body advances forward as from a Universe, you can become a Universal Filament or even a Cosmos...or something even grander.","\"...\"","Speechless.","Noah was truly speechless as he didn’t even have the words for what he was currently experiencing!"]},{"number":1181,"title":"Chapter 1181: Chapter 1180 - Samsara Universal Dao Origin! I","paragraphs":["At the birth of his new body...it was actually already at the Universal Realm!","The first time that Noah split his soul, he had to elevate the Realm of Alexander all the way to his main body’s current one, such a thing being easy as the body just used the essence of the main Realm to quickly rise, and this only worked because it was in the lower Realms of power.","But the second time that Noah split his soul, the race of his new body was at the Universal Realm at birth as this being itself...was a Universe! But the more stupendous thing was that this body didn’t have an Origin.","The body itself was an Origin as when Noah advanced it in power...the possibilities were just fantastical to think about!","The beating heart of his main body calmed as the physiology of his Universal Body was too unique, even its heart being filled and made up with billions of Galaxies as just its heartbeats came in low Ancient thumps.","Noah’s eyes that were filled with the light of billions of Galaxies then turned their attention to the other absolute skills in the Samsara Universal Dao Origin Trait.","<Dao Inscription> :: Allows one to inscribe any previously learned Daos onto the Samsara Universal Dao Origin. Inscribed Daos cannot be lost as they remain with the user throughout time.","<Nomological Edict Inscription> :: Allows one to inscribe Nomological Edicts on the Samsara Universal Dao Origin. Inscribed Edicts cannot be lost as they remain with the user throughout time.","<Dao Child> :: With the Samsara Universal Dao Origin, one gains the moniker of a Dao Child as they become capable of comprehending and assimilating all Daos at +10,000,000% speed, the Parameters of all comprehended Daos are enhanced by +1,000,000%, and utilizing the essence of any Dao reduces the cost of mana by 99%.","<Traverser of Edicts> :: The task of fusing Daos and Laws to design an Edict is one that is tackled by Primordials. This ability allows its user to gain an enhanced understanding of the versatility and Compatibility of Laws and Daos to increase the chance of designing a Nomological Edict by 1%.","\"...\"","Noah’s Galaxy glimmering eyes took in these stupendous skills silently as he understood all of them in a second, but they required a few more seconds for him to accept them!","Dao Inscription and Nomological Edict Inscription were easy ones to read about, but Dao Child and the Traverser of Edicts were just ridiculous- Dao Child even more so as its perks were things others only ever dreamt of.","The Traverser of Edicts was a unique one as the subject of Nomological Edicts was extremely hard that it was mainly the terrifying Primordials that were learning them. For Noah to gain the capability to understand and feel out the compatibility of laws and daos, and even gain a 1% of designing an Edict successfully...this was a huge deal!","Even though 1% may seem small...even Primordials didn’t innately have that 1% chance increase when it came to designing Edicts.","<<But you do. Along with it, your new race also has its own perks that are somewhat interesting. I’ve gone ahead and compiled the data here.>>","The ancient voice of the Cosmic Core entered his mind as the screen before his eyes faded from the Trait and into the description of...his race!","[Samsara Universal Race] :: A blessed race that has the life force of a Universe, with such existences being able to live upto 20 Billion Years. Unless every molecule of their body is destroyed, death for such a race is extremely hard to achieve as the only efficient way is through the ravages of time. The Samsara Universal Dao Origin Race has the inborn of perks of being able to regenerate 25% of their maximum Mana and Health every minute, have the innate +1,000,000% increase to All Parameters, capable of absorbing 50% of all Incoming Damage, hold +1,000,000% Increased Resistance to all Law and Dao attacks, and are naturally able to produce Primordial and Ruination Essence within their body as they can survive in the Ruination Sea with ease.","...!","His new race was a bit too...overpowered, to say the least.","Its inborn abilities were simply too much as this wasn’t the most surprising thing. The most surprising thing was the fact that his body could naturally produce Primordial and Ruination Essence!","RUMBLE!","He was forged with such essences when the universe was born, and his body had this capability as when he closed his eyes...he could deeply and closely feel the essences of Primordial and Ruination Daos coursing through his billions of Galaxies and countless number of Universal cells that made him, and he was feeling these Dao Essences in such a close was that he didn’t even get when he fully assimilated them.","Even when fully assimilated...they didn’t feel as close as he felt them now!","WAA!","His Universal Body unconsciously shone an array of incandescent light as many thoughts flowed into his mind, one of the main ones being the fact that he could now also inscribe the Daos of Ruination and the Primordial Dao onto him, which meant that these Daos that were required to carry out the deconstruction and Reconstruction of other Daos to form Runic Dao Lines...could actually now be broken down themselves.","After he inscribed them, he could form them into Dao Lines as they wouldn’t be lost, and he could continue carrying out more deconstruction of Daos while also having the perks of Runic Dao Lines from such supreme Daos!","What a wonder it was just to think about what power one could gain from becoming capable of deconstructing and reconstructing something that was normally not even capable of being deconstructed.","But more than that...with Noah being capable of producing his own Primordial and Ruination essence, he gained a unique and instinctive feeling as he felt these Dao Essences course through him.","He gained the unique feeling that these two Daos...there was a pathway to fuse them he didn’t even see before as even though they were diametrically opposed and didn’t mix, he felt like their fusion should be possible!","WAA!"]},{"number":1182,"title":"Chapter 1182: Chapter 1181 - Samsara Universal Dao Origin! II","paragraphs":["<Death and Destruction, Life and Creation...there is a link with all these. The task of putting them all together is insurmountably hard as I don’t know when you will be able to do it.>","The voice of RUINATION now echoed in Noah’s mind as he gave a light of recognition.","When the Cosmic Treasure spoke, it didn’t say that Noah might or might not even be able to do it, but the Cosmic Treasure said ’when’!","To this treasure, the Cosmic Core, and to Noah himself...it was a matter of when!","When a fusion of Ruination and the Primordial Dao occurred, just what Nomological Edict would it produce? Would they be alone or accompanied by other Daos and Laws? Would...","The questions and possibilities were too many as even Noah couldn’t sift through all of them at this time!","\"Hoo...\"","Noah breathed out slowly on the Ruination Sea as he felt his new body closely, going through every single point of unknown as the awe of having his entire humanoid figure glimmering like a Universe was something even he would need a few hours to get used to.","He began as a human not too long ago and achieved the Vampyre Progenitor Bloodline thereafter, now he had added to himself not Bloodline, but an entirely different race of a Universe as it caused him to think of many things!","As he read over the details of this Race, he truly wondered whether his Progeny would be capable of being born in this manner, and the intricacies of it all with how they were conceived! There were a myriad of unknown factors as one had to ask themselves...how would a child of the Universal Race be birthed? Would it be something dangerous or life threatening for the woman who conceived his progeny? There were many questions, but no answers!","As he couldn’t find them right now and he had no plans for bringing forth terrifying little things of his own blood, he put this thought aside for now and focused on his current situation.","He looked at this stark naked body as he waved his hands and caused the appearance of simple Obsidian pants to cover up below so he wouldn’t scare everything alive, his figure disappearing from the Ruination Sea as he teleported away, his voice echoing out at the same time.","\"Continue running the simulations on the Cosmic Dao and get ready for its design soon.\"","These words were meant for the Cosmic Treasure and Cosmic Core as similar to how the Trait had been born, it only came from the accumulations of ideas from the Cosmic Core that it brought to light!","Now, RUINATION and the Cosmic Core were completing going through the possibilities of Cosmic Daos to complement Noah’s new Trait and grant him the capability to easily begin peering into the stage of forming Nomological Edicts.","While this occurred, Noah’s Universal Body reappeared in the golden grasslands where his clone was with Adelaide, his appearance coinciding with his normal clone teleporting away as Adelaide saw one Noah leave and another one appear before her!","But the one to appear before her eyes was just...","...!","She rose in alarm as she saw the existence that looked like an incandescent stellar being, his bare chest and head covered by a Galactic light as miniaturized Galaxies by the billions made what should have been his skin.","His body glimmered like a beautiful universe...this was Adelaide’s thoughts, and she wasn’t too far off!","\"Fuck me...\" Adelaide was in a stupor as she didn’t even know how to put out her words, a profanity escaping her mouth as she gazed on Noah’s body with utter shock!","\"Well, I’ll do that later, but how do you like the new body?\" Noah’s voice echoed out in a mesmerizing fashion as he raised his arms that were filled with the glimmer of billions of Galaxies.","\"I...this...what did you do?\"","The icy exterior of the Ice Queen couldn’t keep up as she walked up to Noah’s body and laid her hands on it.","The feeling was truly unique as it felt like she was touching skin and yet not at the same time! She was holding onto Noah’s arms that literally seemed to be made up of billions of galaxies- and they were, as she felt like she was holding onto something sacred that she normally shouldn’t be able to touch.","\"I went for a third Trait and split my soul into a newly forming Universe, gaining a Universal Body...\"","Noah spoke out as every word that came from his mouth seemed like the words of sages and ancient beings. Adelaide heard search a thing as she looked into his Galactic eyes in shock, still seeing the light of the man she knew but also being faced with a sense of majesty and awe that she never thought possible.","When she ran her fingers over Noah’s arms, she felt like she was actually holding onto a sacred being that someone like her should touch, and yet it felt normal to her as if she uniquely had such a right when it came to Noah.","\"Ridiculous...\"","She couldn’t help but utter such words as she tried to get a grasp on the scene before her!","Noah only smiled lightly as he wrapped his arms on her waist, their figures disappearing as Noah transferred them to the Novus Universe where his people were breaking into the Realm of Universal Filament at this moment.","Amidst the birth of new Antiquities, Noah and Adelaide appeared above them in the stellar void as no matter how in tune they were to absorbing the Primordial Hearts they received, they all unconsciously turned their eyes towards their direction!","RUMBLE!","Gazes that fluctuated from shock to disbelief erupted out, everything brought into utter silence as they all laid eyes to Noah’s body that glimmered like a Universe.","The aura he released, the majesty, the awe...they all felt it closely as they couldn’t even find the words to speak! Kazuhiko was the only one who was capable of opening his mouth, but even he...","\"What the hell....\"","Speechless!","All speechless!"]},{"number":1183,"title":"Chapter 1183: Chapter 1182 - Designing The Second Cosmic Dao! I","paragraphs":["Newly born Antiquities were looking towards the existence of the Universal Race with awe as he only smiled lightly at them as if it wasn’t a big deal!","Barbatos looked at the scene before her as her small figure flew towards him and began touching his chest and head, turning him side to side as she asked while in shock.","\"Little Fish, what did you do?!\"","WAA!","What did he do! Towards such a question, Noah only smiled towards everyone as his body emanated shocking regality, his voice ringing out!","\"One of my bodies just obtained the Universal Race and looks like this. It is a momentous event and calls for a celebration!\"","THRUM!","His words caused the surroundings to shake as spatial waves emanated out, Noah bringing out the torn up pieces of the body of the Primordial Beast as enormous chunks of glimmering golden muscles and bones the size of worlds began to appear all around gloriously.","\"This...\"","The Emperor Penguin and others had barely finished with their initial shock when their bodies trembled, glancing towards the chunks of meat that still gave off a terrifying aura of a beast that seemed above them in level and could wipe them if it was still alive!","Yet it was only its meat floating in the void of space, its meat making everything nearby glow gold as Noah’s voice echoed out.","\"The meat of a Primordial Beast. These are the terrifying existences that devour universes and Cosmos...and the ones you all will face in the future!\"","WAA!","\"But before you face them, you get to enjoy their meat. Come!\"","Noah spoke grandly as his body glimmered with power, a light stemming from him as it formed into a clone of the Universal Body that glimmered in the same shocking light, an apron appearing on the chest of this clone that glimmered with billions of galaxies as the main body of the Universal Clone teleported away from this location.","Noah would let his clones be with his people as he let them know of the larger Cosmos out there and have them understand much of the things that were happening under the guise of this celebration, while the main Universal Body was teleported off into the Ruination Realm as Noah was about to begin a fantastical training session there!","His Universal clone that remained behind took in all the gazes from Barbatos and others, his hands waving up he looked towards a certain galaxy and tapped his fingers towards it, its boundary shaking and then bursting as a stellar body was quickly pulled out of it. It was a blazing hot sun that could scorch everything...and yet Noah brought it over their heads as this would be the heat source he would use to grill meat from a Primordial Beast.","Using a genuine sun...to barbecue the meat of a Beat capable of devouring Universes and Cosmos. Ah, what a life!","As this celebration began within the void of space of the Novus Universe, Noah’s main Universal Body appeared in the Ruination Realm as he stared at the pulsating Primordial Heart that was reduced to more than half, going towards it and placing his hands on this wondrous treasure as waves of essence began to emulate out.","His body was born as a Universe and he had this Realm, never even experiencing the ranks of F Rank or crossing through to Star Forging or Quasar or even Galaxy...just purely at the Universal Realm. Now, he would elevate this body to a higher realm as from a Universe, he would make it into a Universal Filament!","THRUM","Droves of pristine and unique essence washed over Noah’s Universal Body, his whole figure lighting up brilliantly as the billions of Galaxies within it began to be filled with Marks of Antiquity. His body was already brilliantly glowing from the incandescence of galaxies, but as they changed to become Dao Galaxies...they became even more vibrant as waves of light undulated from him.","10 Billion, 50 Billion...100 Billion! In a short period of time, 100 Billions marks of Antiquities were used up as Noah’s body shone brightly- as his Universe shone with an incandescent brightness. Thereafter, his Billions of Galaxies seemingly condensed as they were enclosed in his upper body, becoming surrounded by a barrier as his lower body also formed another barrier that began to be filled with Galaxies!","It was the formation of another universe inside of him, these universes causing his figure to shine with an even more splendorous luster as the forging of Galaxies continued.","This was actually something unique with Noah and his bodies as when he split his soul the first time with the figure of Alexander, the second body was very quickly able to be elevated to the same rank as his first body through using its already higher origin.","An even more simple clarification is to look at Noah like a cup that was filled to the brim with water, with this water being his cultivation! His second and third bodies were the other two cups connected to the first one, with them also becoming filled to the brim relatively quickly when in the lower stages of the Realms.","But now there was the Universal Realm that for one to advance forward...they had to brand Marks of Antiquity and change the nature of their Galaxies into Dao Galaxies! So for Noah to elevate his other bodies to the stages past the Universal Realm that required the birth of Splendiferous Universes, they all required their own set of Marks of Antiquity to proceed forward- Noah couldn’t just replicate the Dao Galaxies in his other bodies!","So the different bodies were connected as they could depend on the one with the highest realm for support, but for proceeding to higher stages of power...they had to walk the path of obtaining Marks of Antiquity separately.","But this...was not an issue for Noah as he still had half of a genuine Primordial Heart remaining and a full duplicated one he hadn’t used! His advancement from now on would focus on his Universal Body whose might that could be displayed was just...ah!"]},{"number":1184,"title":"Chapter 1184: Chapter 1183 - Designing The Second Cosmic Dao! II","paragraphs":["The issue of three connected bodies that were also separate was a unique one to tackle, and one must also bring into account the Primordial Ruination Clone and how it could always display more power than Noah’s main body.","The description of the Primordial Ruination Clone that was one of the features of his Cosmic Treasure was inscribed in his stat panel as such: [...As a creature made from the very essence of a Cosmic Dao, it has a +200,000% Increase in the speed of progression through the Realms of Power, +200,000% Increase in the Comprehension and Assimilation of all Daos, can display 400% of the strength of the Master of Ruination, along with its power increased by 2000% when in the Ruination Sea...]","The key within these words was that it could display 400% of the strength of the Master of Ruination. It meant that whichever of Noah’s bodies was the strongest...this was the power that the Primordial Ruination Close could display 400% of!","You then of course had the Cosmic Dao of Conquest that allowed his Parameters to be increased by 6 times while in the process of Conquest and 10 times in Conquered Lands which further exacerbated his power...it was so many boosts and multipliers that one would have a headache trying to keep track of them all!","THRUM!","His Universal Body continued to bathe in the essence of the Primordial Heart as a second Splendiferous Universe was completed within Noah, his body seemingly dividing in half by two beautifully glimmering universes as a third one already began to form.","Around this same time, the voice of RUINATION and the Cosmic Core stretched into his mind at the same time.","<<A Cosmic Dao that matches our requirements is ready for its design.>>","As if they couldn’t be outdone, they both spoke in unison as Noah nodded lightly, his eyes that glimmered with billions of galaxies shining as he spoke out light while reading over the information that the two consciousnesses were sending him.","\"Then...let us design the Cosmic Dao of Fusion.\"","RUMBLE!","Simple in name but grandiose in function!","Noah gave the go ahead as the second Cosmic Dao was designed at this very moment, the Cosmic Core releasing a glorious array of colors that after a few minutes coalesced to form into a runic word that said...FUSION!","BZZT!","This regal symbol then vibrated intensely before it thundered towards the Architect that was Noah, whose first body was still floating in the wondrous Primordial and Ruination Sea within the Cosmic Core itself. This Dao then branded itself to him as it etched itself deep into his soul, bouts of information flying before his eyes as they all coalesced to form into the description of a Cosmic Dao.","COSMIC [Dao of Fusion] :: A Cosmic Dao birthed by the Cosmic Core of Noah Osmont. As the Dao Architect, Noah Osmont can comprehend and assimilate the Dao at 10 times the normal speed. The Cosmic Dao of Fusion is geared more towards laws and daos, with its sole purpose being to comprehend and understand the myriad of ways to link together Daos and Laws for the possible design of Nomological Edicts. Due to its nature, the Cosmic Dao of Fusion has the prerequisites of only being initiated with the assimilated Dao Essences of the Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination. Aside from the possible fusion of laws and Daos, unique materials, entities, and treasures have a chance of undergoing successful fusion under the essence of this Cosmic Dao. Under the Dao of Fusion, the unique abilities of {Understanding}, {Compatibility}, {Extrapolation}, and {Nomological Inquisitor} are granted to its Architect and the first 10 Existences to achieve full assimilation of the Dao. Full assimilation of the Dao grants an increase of 10% chance for all fused targets.","Once more...simple, but wondrous in its effects!","Noah read over it as his galactic mouth curved upwards slightly, wanting to gaze upon the secrets of this Dao, but it wasn’t fully opened to him yet until he assimilated it! And so...he went on to do just that as his Universal Body in the Ruination Realm stopped its absorption of the Primordial Heart briefly and sat in a meditative position to comprehend and assimilate this Dao.","There were so many uncountable number of boosts when it came to his Dao Comprehension and Assimilation, along with the fact that he could traverse his own designed Daos at ten times speed! And now...there were also the boosts of the Samsara Universal Dao Origin Trait that gave him through the Absolute Ability of <Dao Child>.","<Dao Child> :: With the Samsara Universal Dao Origin, one gains the moniker of a Dao Child as they become capable of comprehending and assimilating all Daos at +10,000,000% speed, the Parameters of all comprehended Daos are enhanced by +1,000,000%, and utilizing the essence of any Dao reduces the cost of mana by 99%.","With such types of boosts in the picture and others not even mentioned, the moment Noah began comprehending this Cosmic Dao...he achieved 100% comprehension a second later.","\"...\"","His heart stirred as another second passed, a magisterial glow of rainbow colored light suffusing from his body- this rainbow colored light representing the essence of the Dao of Fusion itself as it bathed over him...and he achieved full assimilation!","A second for comprehension, and then a second for the assimilation of a Cosmic Dao.","Not under accelerated time or anything, this was just the passage of 2 seconds in the Ruination Realm itself!","\"Ah...\"","Even Noah couldn’t help but sigh at such a scene, reminding himself over and over again not to let his ego overinflate because he could do such unbelievable things! But he still couldn’t stop a smile from stretching out as his universal body pulsed with glorious light, his eyes honing on the four unique abilities that he obtained as the Architect of the Cosmic Dao of Fusion that he could now view with clarity.","{Understanding} :: The mysteries of many things are laid bare with the usage of Primordial and Ruination Essence to paint the essence of Fusion over one’s mind. With the conjunction of these three essences, one can glance upon Daos, Laws, or a myriad of other natural entities to gain understanding of their nature and working.","{Compatibility} :: The compatibility of Daos and Laws are seen under the essence of fusion, its user becoming capable of sifting through those with match and those that will cause destruction.","{Extrapolation} :: The user can place the essence of a myriad of Daos and Laws into a Splendiferous Universe as with its sacrifice, the possibilities of the fusion of selected Daos and Laws can be extrapolated. If more Splendiferous Universes are sacrificed, the higher the chance of success becomes.","{Nomological Inquisitor} :: As one that forges towards the stage of Nomological Edicts, you begin to touch upon the utmost mysteries that very few will ever experience. The passive ability of Nomological Inquisitor grants its holder a 10% increased chance of success in the fusions they carry out.","...!","The glorious tools for Noah to begin his path towards forging Nomological Edicts were displayed right before his eyes!"]},{"number":1185,"title":"Chapter 1185: Chapter 1184 - Inscribing Daos And Edicts Is Easy! I","paragraphs":["The abilities that came with the Cosmic Dao of Fusion were unique in name and function, Noah’s eyes honing on them as he wanted to be practical and test them right away.","To even activate the Dao of Fusion, one had to utilize the assimilated essence of Ruination and the Primordial Daos, Noah’s body providing this requirement as he called upon the skills of this Cosmic Dao!","First, there was the unique skill of {Understanding}.","WAA!","A unique multicolored essence bloomed out as it moved to focus on Noah’s eyes, the innumerable Galaxies within his eyes becoming glazed over with a rainbow color as he felt like...he could overcome the very veils of space with just his eyes!","Pierce through them and understand all their secrets as with {Understanding}, everything would be made bare. It was an ability that Noah found to be very similar to Eyes of Truth under the Protagonist Trait, but {Understanding} felt far above it in usage.","\"Let’s look at...Ruination.\"","RUMBLE!","His eyes seemingly became capable of gazing at the essence of Ruination all around him in a new sense, wisps of knowledge flowing into him about this Dao that he never expected as one would think full Assimilation granted them everything!","It’s hidden nature, how it could best be regulated in one’s origin, how to...","A myriad of new possibilities and understanding of this unique Cosmic Dao appeared before Noah’s eyes as if he was rediscovering it for the first time.","It was hard to quantify what change such understanding would bring, and we can only grasp it in the sense that all of this understanding could be used when the time came to form a Nomological Edict that involved Ruination!","As a counterpart to this ability, there was {Compatibility} that allowed Noah to test different Daos, and this went hand in hand with {Extrapolation} which would allow Noah to actively burn Splendiferous Universes in order to perceive the possibilities of Dao and Law fusion.","Lastly, there was the passive skill of the Nomological Inquisitor that vastly increased the chances of successfully designing a Edict in the future!","Like this, a Trait and a Cosmic Dao were created as they effectively solved Noah’s biggest stumbling blocks, only leaving behind countless possibilities that Noah would navigate as time passed.","\"Good. Let’s start by understanding all Daos and Laws more closely, and then we will see what it takes to form a Nomological Edict!\"","RUMBLE!","Noah’s gaze glimmered with the light of Galaxies as he spoke, mobilizing the vast consciousnesses of his bodies to work on multiple sets of tasks while the task of his Universal Body...was to achieve the purpose it was built for.","The Samsara Universal Dao Origin would now be used to inscribe all of the Daos and Laws that Noah had assimilated as only after that would he be able to form Runic Lines again!","Everything was following a fantastical order as while Noah used the abilities under the Cosmic Dao of Fusion to understand and extrapolate possibilities of fusion, another body would inscribe the Laws and daos that would be used for deconstruction and reconstruction in the near future.","When it came to the Inscription of Daos themselves onto Noah’s Origin under the Trait of Samsara Universal Dao Origin, the process was relatively simple as Noah called out lightly.","\"Dao Inscription.\"","Noah called out lightly as a rainbow colored essence surged within him, this light looking for a target as Noah directed it to the Grand Dao of Ruination!","THRUM!","The string of this Dao that had been within his Origin was locked onto by this absolute essence that stemmed from the Trait of Samsara Universal Dao Origin, this string being yanked out as Noah felt a searing pain, but he then came across extreme pleasure as this very same Dao was inscribed onto his Universal Dao Origin.","Not simply inscribed within the Samsara Universal Dao Body, but inscribed across time as if Noah went back in time again before he even awakened- he would find that he had the full Assimilation of the Dao of Ruination!","If he went back to when he was even a baby...the same thing would occur as he would find he had the complete assimilation of this Grand Dao.","That was what it truly meant under the description of the Samsara Universal Dao Origin Trait...that the inscribed Daos and Edicts would never be lost, even in time.","It was a truly stupendous possibility as it would allow a being to move in a myriad of ways, but Noah kept his gaze forward as he continued to speak out lightly.","\"Inscribe the rest of the Daos and Laws...and even the Nomological Edict of Samsara.\"","RUMBLE","His figure began to undulate with a glorious array of colors as his Universal Body did its job, the passage of time churning as days passed while Noah fully lost himself in inscribing Daos, understanding them, and then extrapolating them along the way!","---","In the Primordial Empire, Indigo Cosmos.","King Augustus was staring at three grand proclamations that floated in front of the Primordial Scaffoldings that connected to the other Cosmos of the Primordial Empire.","These grand proclamations looked like galaxy sized paper scrolls, each of them carrying the insignias of the three forces within the Primordial Empire as these scrolls represented the Writs of Challenges that the Indigo Cosmos received!","In a matter of days, they would have to choose which forces they faced and from what faction...this deciding the direction of their Cosmos from here on out.","\"Hmmm...\"","Augustus had a pondering expression as he looked at these Writs of Challenges, his gaze going towards the figure of Noah that was also staring towards them with interest.","\"Which House would Daolord Osmont choose to match the Daolords of? I can’t seem to pinpoint a better choice between the three!\"","The voice of the old ruler echoed out as Noah smiled lightly, his mind having long since been made up on which Daolords he wanted to face in the days to come.","It would be his official entrance into the Primordial Empire, and the time when a spotlight would shine on him as after this....he would be out in the open!"]},{"number":1186,"title":"Chapter 1186: Chapter 1185 - Inscribing Daos And Edicts Is Easy! II","paragraphs":["The content of the Writs of Challenges were fairly simple.","They were written in official terms with quite a decent amount of information added in, but the most important portions were the ones that Noah focused on the most.","For example- the Writ of Challenge from the House of Springforge stated that the Indigo Cosmos would face the Rulers of the Shimmering Cosmos that was under the influence of Daolord Azazel and Daolord Rosanna!","If they accepted the challenge, their Cosmos would be facing the power of these two Daolords and all those they chose to participate, having to trump over the upper echelons of this Cosmos and come out on top as if they succeed...Noah would be able to spread his influence onto the Cosmos and even decide the fates of Azazel and Daolord Rosanna.","But Noah wasn’t planning on choosing to fight the two Daolords, and he was actually looking at the 2 that stemmed from the House of Stormdust!","The ones that had spoken and said they would humiliate him and all those around him after they won the Writ of Challenge- the female Daolord Ilyad and Daolord Ray that were adorned with crimson black robes and sporting fiery red-black hair.","His destiny and fortune shone a little brighter when he looked at the Writ of Challenge from these beings, his voice echoing out towards King Augustus whose face was filled with worries.","\"The ones we will face will be those from the House of Stormdust, with the first target being the Anthracite Cosmos!\"","WAA!","The first target was decided as King Augustus heard the words of confidence and nodded, not helping but speak in a questioning tone once more as his heart truly wasn’t yet settled against the terrifying beings that had appeared before them once.","\"What will Daolord Osmont require of us? Even though we won’t be able to make up much of the numbers, we will be right there with you defending our Cosmos!\"","His voice was filled with strength as it resonated in Noah’s mind, his reply quick as he thought about his people that had been training hard in the past day to consolidate their newly risen strength.","\"We won’t have to worry about the numbers. I actually have to introduce you guys to a few beings, and now is as good a time as any...\"","Noah moved as he spoke, rising above the void within the Indigo Cosmos as his eyes focused on a certain point in space, his fingers tapping forward as he used the feature of Universal Gateway of the Cosmic Core to form a gateway from the Novus Universe and into the current Universe within the Indigo Cosmos!","THRUM","Gloriously red and gold in color, a gate spanning 1 mile formed before their eyes as it pulsed with colorful light, King Augustus’s eyes twitching as he felt the auras of multiple Antiquities begin to step out of this Gateway.","Uniquely, the beings coming out were seemingly grouped up together by color, Augustus landing his eyes on a set of beings that glistened purple and black coming out together, and other beings glistening gold and white stepping into the Indigo Cosmos together!","What he was seeing was actually the different divisions Noah had made based on the Archetypes that his people had chosen, with those who had chosen Temporal Lords being grouped up together as Kazuhiko and Steel Mikhail were leading this group, and those who chose the Necromancy Archetype were following behind Barbatos with shining eyes as their bodies were adorned with black robes that held cackling skulls.","There was of course, the Emperor Penguin that was leading the Archetypes of Incandescent Guardian, its body glinting gold as the entire region behind him was bathed in this color, Athena also seen standing beside the Emperor Penguin valiantly as her golden spear shone dangerously!","There was Valentina leading those that had chosen the Archetype of Summoner, and Elena was the lead for those that had chosen the Archetypes of Blood Rulers...","All of Noah’s people were divided beautifully into their camps as there was one thing unique about all of them- and it was the fact that they held multiple glimmering Universes!","They were all beings that had achieved the Universal Filament Realm and were currently Antiquities, King Augustus looking at such a scene in a stupor as he turned his head towards Noah and then back to this group of beings multiple times.","\"Haha! Come and get yourselves acquainted. In just two days, we will be making an introduction into the Primordial Empire!\"","The Primordial Empire!","A vast and nigh endless cluster of Cosmos that a single being ruled over, establishing set rules and guidelines that all beings had to live under.","Such was the place that Noah had stepped in, and also the location that he had brought his own people to play around in as they had already achieved a stage of power similar to his.","Aside from the fact that they had yet to begin comprehending and assimilating the Cosmic Dao of Ruination and the Primordial Dao making them a step away from deconstructing and reconstructing Daos to become Daolords...they were all genuine Antiquities that could shake entire Universes!","Their eyes hungrily wandered around their new environment as the local Antiquities of this Cosmos began to appear, Lexis Marcus Tiberius along with Antiquities Charles and Viola also arriving in their stupor to welcome the new beings.","Noah looked at such a scene carefully as his eyes foresaw of a glorious future, his bodies and mind still moving with haste as he prepared himself in many ways for this future!","---","The House of Stormdust was one that controlled an expansive Cluster of Cosmos within the Primordial Empire, it’s connections as vast as the seas as the powerhouses within this faction were just as frightening.","The Antiquities and Daolords within were many, but the ones with particular focus at this moment were the two that had been among the welcome party that came to receive the Indigo Cosmos!","\"Interesting...\"","Deep within the Anthracite Cosmos, in a Universe that was bathed in a crimson hue as droves of magma could be seen floating seamlessly within its void of space...a voice echoed out.","It echoed out from an expansive world that was over a million light years in Diameter, a world that wasn’t truly a world as it let out waves of heat that would make one assume it was a star!","Cylindrical snaking clusters of magma could be seen moving over the top of this enormous world as at the center of this unique location, there were two Daolords looking at each other with sharp lights in their eyes.","The male Daolord had sharp eyes and sword like brows as he continued his thoughts slowly.","\"It seems as if he plans to choose us, Daolord Ilyad.\"","RUMBLE","With a voice so deep the surrounding magma shook, the Daolord spoke out of something Noah had just decided to do seconds ago!"]},{"number":1187,"title":"Chapter 1187: Chapter 1186 - Utilizing Ones Power To The Fullest! I","paragraphs":["Deep within a world that was over a million light years in diameter in a Universe within the Anthracite Cosmos, two Daolords were discussing something they shouldn’t have had knowledge of at the deepest corners of this star!","Daolord Ilyad was the female Daolord that had glimmering crimson hair, her dress matching this as it was a mix of black and red.","Her eyes were currently shining with an excited light as battle intent was practically leaking out of her, her voice stretching towards Daolord Ray before her.","\"Did the Head...\" She questioned in an excited tone as Ray replied with a nod and a smile right after.","\"Yes. Forefather Julius just sent word that the Family Head has seen the newly joining Cosmos accepting our Writ of Challenge.\"","RUMBLE!","A shocking sentence escaped the lips of Daolord Ray, Ilyad nodding with a fervent expression in front of him as she replied with a sigh and a voice of wonder!","\"To this day I can’t fathom the strength of Family Head and Forefather Julius. To be capable of perceiving things such as this...\"","The amazement and pride in her eyes weren’t hidden as Ray agreed with such an expression, but his voice became stern soon after as he continued.","\"This wasn’t all that Forefather Julius told me. He also said that along with the challenge...we have to be careful!\"","...!","\"What? Careful? Against the single Daolord and the few Antiquities behind him?\"","Ilyad spoke in a disbelieving tone as Ray touched his bearded red chin in a pondering tone as he replied.","\"Forefather Julius would never tell us something worthless, it means that the task before us is more of a challenge than we expected! After all, the Daolord was capable of taking a Lesser Primordial Beast down by himself, something that I and you would have to work hard together to accomplish...\"","The expression of this aged Daolord was filled with care, Ilyad wiping away her disbelief as she also nodded.","They were beings that had lived for millions of years and been able to comprehend and even assimilate the Cosmic Dao of Ruination and the Primordial Dao, their foresight and intelligence not being low as they knew when to be arrogant and when to be careful!","\"Then...how should we move?\" Ilyad asked with eyes that shimmered with the light of caution.","At such a question, Daolord Ray smiled as he spoke out with a cruel light glimmering within his eyes.","\"A newly joining Cosmos with beings that have yet to experience the glory of being the Protectors of the Bastion of Reality...even if the strength of their Daolord is on par or slightly stronger than us, we can still move in many different ways!\"","WAA!","\"We’ll do what Daolord Vizer and his group did when they fought against the new forces of the Pygmalion Cosmos...\" The light of cruelty within Rays’s eye only intensified as Daolord Ilyad nodded with a glint of brilliance.","\"Target those they are trying to protect and break their convictions right before their eyes...\" She uttered as her eyes became brighter and brighter, Ray nodding with erupting battle intent as he smiled brightly and added on.","\"Once you break a man’s conviction...their women and all those they wish to protect, everything else becomes easy.\"","RUMBLE!","The battle intent and light of cruelty only intensified in the surroundings as the two Daolords looked at each other and formulated plans and schemes.","After all...they would be the stars of a glorious upcoming show of a Writ of Challenge!","---","As the tides of destiny churned and many beings moved with their own ideals, Noah continued on his path as while waiting for the Writ of Challenge to begin, he was able to do something that he had held off on doing for quite some time.","This was, of course, the deconstruction and reconstruction of his Daos that he had now inscribed onto the Samsara Universal Dao Origin, gaining the capability of doing so without losing them in the process!","This was what his Samsara Universal Dao Origin Trait allowed him to do!","But...there was the issue of a Cosmic Dao pf Annihilation and the Lesser Daos of Withering, Voidspace, and Alacrity being Daos that Noah had already deconstructed and forever lost.","He couldn’t regain these...or he shouldn’t have been able to regain these!","Gloriously for Noah, he had the Nomological Edict of Samsara.","He also had the Trait of Samsara Universal Dao Origin that inscribed Daos and Edicts unto him as they...would not even be lost through time!","This was the stupendous combination Noah had forged, and now he was about to use it fully as he did something that would have otherwise been impossible.","\"Nomological Edict of Samsara.\"","His Universal Body that was in the Ruination Realm called out lightly as Noah’s eyes unconsciously closed, his Origin and soul tapping onto a vast and endless river as within it, Noah’s thoughts tapped on a certain point as his consciousness shifted and he descended onto another time point!","His eyes opened as he saw he was releasing resplendent beams of Ruination and Primordial Essence from his mouth and eyes, coming back to when he had just devoured Primordial Apples and Ruination Strawberries, fully assimilating these Daos as it was here that he proceeded to first deconstruct the Lesser Dao of Withering and then the Cosmic Dao of Annihilation.","He was floating above the void of space of the Novus Universe with his subordinates below him, very few of them having achieved Antiquity as they were gazing towards his advancement in awe.","The uniquely stacked Galaxies where he planted a myriad of Dao Herbs and Fruits could be seen as the next actions Noah would take at this time point was to explore the path of a Daolord!","But this time around...he wasn’t planning on carrying out such actions first as he looked within his Origin!","There, he could see not just the assimilated Primordial and Ruination Daos...but also the Nomological Edict of Samsara that he would only get sometime later after he bookmarked the Primordial!","He returned to a point a few days back as he would stupendously take actions that would ensure an even smoother path for the future..."]},{"number":1188,"title":"Chapter 1188: Chapter 1187 - Utilizing Ones Power To The Fullest! II","paragraphs":["Along with the Nomological Edict of Samsara, he also felt the stupendous power of the Trait of Samsara Universal Dao Origin...this Trait that was capable of inscribing Daos and Edicts and keeping them across time of course being with Noah’s body even now.","A Trait he had yet to be granted was carried with him across time...it was a mind-bending phenomenon as the Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Core were the first to sense the changes, their consciousnesses swarming towards Noah with questions as he pacified their hunger for knowledge within minutes!","Thereafter, Noah utilized the Samsara Universal Dao Origin that he carried through time to inscribe the Daos of Annihilation, Withering, Voidspace, and Alacrity as none of the daos he had would ever be lost to him!","To others, everything was proceeding normally as only the Cosmic Treasure and the Cosmic Core knew of the changes, even Noah not making too many changes thereafter as when he finished the inscriptions of these Daos, he let events and time flow as it originally did, where he began by first inscribing the Lesser Dao of Withering and then Annihilation, not changing too many things thereafter.","I’m the near future of this time point, he would have bookmarked the Primordial as his soul almost got caught by the terrifying Aegon and the Primordial herself, but he didn’t have to do it this time as he already had the Edict that he would never lose!","The only question was to ponder on whether to Bookmark the Primordial a second time and increase his percentage with this Edict to 20% or even higher, but his vast golden seas of destiny became clouded black the moment that such a thought even appeared in his mind.","It was a sign for him to not even think about doing such a thing! He had already poked the nest of the Primordial once as he alerted her to something, this existence having the Nomological Edict of Samsara and who knew what else as he couldn’t predict what she could do.","If he could traverse in time and keep his memories, so could she. If he tried to Bookmark her again for the second time, this terrifying being would more than likely be waiting for him as after that...the future was unknown!","So Noah only fixed his mistakes as he inscribed Daos before he deconstructed them and let everything play its course as it should have thereafter, opting not to Bookmark the Primordial for a second time unless he wanted to lose his little life.","The only other change he made was for him to use Cosmic Dao Integration and Emergence along with Protagonist’s Bookmark to obtain the Cosmic Daos of Phantasm and Tenebrosity that the Blue Slime had obtained from Devouring Dark Shadow and the other Hegemonies, Noah using this as a window to amass even more Daos under his feet!","Him exploring the vast seas of Ruination, coming in contact with the Primordial Beast and Indigo Cosmos, seeing the formed Primordial Scaffoldings as the Indigo Cosmos was connected to the Primordial Empire!","His Universal Body being designed along with the Cosmic Dao of Fusion...he went through all of it without altering how things went originally as with the unique essence of the Nomological Edict of Samsara undulating over his Universal Body, Noah opened his eyes again in the Ruination Realm.","\"...\"","As if barely a second had passed!","As if he had just closed his eyes and woken up, but when he checked his Origin...he could sense and freely utilize the Cosmic Dao of Annihilation and the Lesser Daos that were forever lost to him before.","\"Haha!\"","What a glorious reality! What wondrous possibilities!","This was something unique that only Noah could do, and he had done it in a stellar fashion as he could now enjoy the wonders of Nomological Edicts and Runic Dao Lines without losing anything on one side or another.","\"Now...\"","With everything in place and still only 4 Daos turned into Runic Dao Lines, Noah had nothing holding him back from deconstructing and reconstructing other Daos, and his next focus was just that!","The only problem was....the Light of Conquest!","There was a limited amount of the Light of Conquest as in more than a week, Noah hadn’t done any conquering while he continued to use this light freely to enhance Skills and Daos.","Enhanced Lesser Daos gave boosts from 5,000% to 10,000% due to the Light of Conquest, and with the 100 fold increase when they were turned to Runic Dao Lines, this boost became 1,000,000%!","Even more gloriously, normal Cosmic Daos granted a 50,000% boost to specific parameters that became 100,000% once enhanced by Conquest, this number becoming 10 million percent when such a Dao was turned into Runic Dao Lines.","So before Noah ever deconstructed a Dao to make it into Runic Dao Lines, he always wanted to enhance them and pull out the most strength from them, this only continuing to be made a possibility if he continued to amass more of the Light of Conquest!","And beautifully enough, a Writ of Challenge was issued as he would be able to compete against powerful Daolords and have the chance to Conquer another Cosmos.","\"I love when it all comes together...\"","Noah couldn’t help his lips from curving into a smile as his eyes flashed with a dangerous light!","Currently, he had enough of the Light of Conquest to enhance three normal Cosmic Daos. If he wished to enhance Ruination or the Primordial Daos...he would need twice the amount of Light of Conquest to do so, so he began by doing what he could at this moment and started with the three normal Cosmic Daos he voiced out powerfully.","\"Let the Light of Conquest shine on Extinction, Chronos, and Reincarnation.\"","RUMBLE!","He held no chance of losing them while deconstructing them would only hand him a stupid level of strength...and so he proceeded to do just that as after these Daos were enhanced by the Light of Conquest, the vibrant essences of the Primordial Dao and the Dao of Ruination began to wrap around them for the purpose of blooming brand new Runic Dao Lines.","All together, the three Cosmic Dao would grant a myriad of boosts as just based on the pure damage of these three Daos alone, the modifier would be no less than 30,000,000%!","A number like this made one realize just how terrifying a level of power existences that had begun inscribing Daos held, but even this was just the tip of the iceberg for Noah.","And while he did all this and continued to ceaselessly improve himself....the time for the Writ of Challenge was fast approaching as it would be carried out within mere hours!"]},{"number":1189,"title":"Chapter 1189: Chapter 1188 - The Cosmic Battlefield! I","paragraphs":["The time for a new Writ of Challenge to take place was fast approaching, and it dealt with a newly joining Cosmos as the possible contenders from the Primordial Empire were renowned Daolords who oversaw single Cosmos for the past 100 years.","They didn’t oversee these single Cosmos because they didn’t have the ability to amass more, but they followed the wills of their Houses as carrying out their influence this way meant they were guaranteed to win over newly joining Cosmos and bring them under the control of their houses!","Those who oversaw single Cosmos also frequently carried out Writs of Challenges against other houses to try and expand the influence of their factions on a small scale, Daolords such as this being were promised to oversee multiple Cosmos and would be handed treasures for their services- such treasures being something like Primordial Hearts that allowed them to elevate their strength crazily.","Having Writs of Challenges where the Heads of the Houses challenged each other for all of the expansive clusters of Cosmos had never occurred in history, but there had been instances of powerful Daolords from the factions coming to blows and staking dozens of Cosmos under them to carry out terrifying battles.","So even though the soon to be occurring Challenge was interesting, it generated small waves as the attention given to it was simply a few Daolords from the three Houses expectant to see which House would be chosen by the Indigo Cosmos as this would be the one to obtain a new Cosmos under them!","The chance of the forces of the newly joining Cosmos winning was entertained in the minds of these powerful Daolords and Antiquities, but it was something unlikely to happen as it was only looked at as a mere small percentage.","\"They have to choose soon, right?\"","The female Daolord besides Azazel spoke out with sharp eyes as she gazed at the three galaxy sized scrolls that represented Writs of Challenges. Those accepting the challenge had to rip apart one of these scrolls to show their stance, where after that...a portal would be formed that would teleport the Antiquities and Daolord within each of the battling Cosmos onto a grand battlefield!","A battlefield that was so vast and fantastical that it was the size of a Cosmos, this being the area where most of the Writs of Challenges took place with little exceptions.","Those teleported would only ever be Antiquities and Daolords as the measure of the Cosmos’s strength, everything lower in rank being seen as a non contributing factor!","Daolord Azazel and many others knew this as they waited patiently within their Cosmos, ready for battle at any point.","\"Any second now...though I do have an inkling that I won’t be able to face this Daolord Osmont just yet!\"","The voice of Azazel stretched out to the surroundings as his verdant green hair waved in the wind, his childish expression being overshadowed by the immense experience hidden within his eyes!","---","\"You’re all ready?\"","Noah voiced out loudly as his voice reached the edges of the Indigo Cosmos and rage onto the minds of all Antiquities within it.","RAA! RAA!","The fearsome cry of more prominent existences rang out with palpable excitement, a glorious glow of gold stretching out behind a certain Emperor Penguin as he led those with the Incandescent Guardian Archetypes!","The planetary-sized figures of Cthulhu and the other Terrors could be seen, along with the manifested Seven Deadly Sins that took up their own region while shining with unbridled might!","Barbatos led those that released waves of deathly light under the Necromancy Archetype, groups like these being one of the many that stood behind Noah.","King Augustus and his forces watched all of this with hopeful gazes, their eyes going towards Noah who was floating towards the three glimmering Writs of Challenges that were the size of Galaxies.","Under the gazes of everyone, Noah went ahead and neared a Writ that stood to the left, his eyes releasing bright rays of light as he waved his right hand and caused a crescent blade of Ruination to erupt out and strike on the scroll the size of a Galaxy, tearing this fantastical scroll apart with utter ease as a moment later, a spatial storm erupted out!","The scroll he ruptured was crimson black in color, the insignia of a crimson fist illustriously seen at the very center as Noah naturally selected the challenge from the House of Stormdust.","The moment this happened...","\"Hmmm...\" The figure of Azazel was notified of them missing the selection as his eyes hid their thoughts deeply.","Far from Azazel in the Cosmos under the House of Havenbreaker.","\"Cowards!\" The twin Daolord pair that was adorned with gold spoke out simultaneously, their hearts frustrated after missing the chance to easily obtain a new Cosmos!","But what occurred couldn’t be changed as the male Daolord spoke with a sharp golden light.","\"Well, we could at least go see what type of fight they will put up. Given how that little Daolord talked do big and the fact that he can take down a Lesser Primordial Beast, I expect him to give some challenge to those brats from Stormdust.\"","\"Well, this should have some audience as it’s been some time since the last Writ of Challenge. Let’s go measure what the skills of Ilyad and Ray have amounted to...we’ll have to face them soon enough in the future!\"","With such an exchange, the figures of the twin Daolords disappeared as they tunneled across the folds of space towards another Cosmos!","As for where they were going, it was naturally the location that most of the battles from Writs of Challenges took place- the fantastical arena that was known as the Cosmic Battlefield!","When Noah ruptured the Writ of Challenge from the House of Stormdust, the spatial storm that erupted out from it wrapped around all the Antiquities and Daolord nearby as all of them were shuttled from this Cosmos and into another one deep into the heart of the Primordial Empire.","THRUM!","At the same time, the challengers from the Anthracite Cosmos under the House of Stormdust were also teleported to the Cosmic Battlefield, this point in time being when many players stepped onto a grand stage!"]},{"number":1190,"title":"Chapter 1190: Chapter 1189 - The Cosmic Battlefield! II","paragraphs":["When one imagined a Cosmic Battlefield, what exactly came to mind?","Such a question was answered in a single glance before Noah’s eyes as after the spatial storm from the Writ of Challenge wrapped around him, he found himself shuttled across multiple boundaries of Cosmos, crossing through the folds of space and being placed at the very center of a unique one.","When his awareness spread around to observe this new location, he saw that he and his subordinates were floating in a glimmering void of space as all around them and stretching out for millions of light years were...shattered Galaxies and planetary bodies!","One could see the shattered boundaries of a dozen Universes that pulsed with light, the remnants of destroyed stellar bodies and Galaxies stretched out as far as the eyes could see, giving a unique aesthetic of destruction and beauty as some glimmering stellar bodies caused the apocalyptic scene to be filled with cascading glimmering glory.","Such a scene occupied nearly 80% of the Cosmic Battlefield as the other 20%...was a vast and exquisite circle of magisterial floating seats that spread all over the region near the Cosmic Boundary!","Seats adorned gold and white, all of them facing the destroyed universal barriers and countless Galaxies that filled up the region of over 1000 Gigaparsecs.","Although they were displayed along the boundary of the Cosmos, these coliseum like seats had unique colors on their bases as they identified the specific houses.","One third of all seats held a blooming green flower, another third held a crimson fist that seemed to be dripping with blood, and the remaining third held a golden tree that seemed to be sprouting from a galaxy!","They represented the areas where the existences from the Houses of Springforge, Stormdust, and Havenbreaker would be situated, and there was a particular area that held a singular golden seat that was the size of a Galaxy- this death looking like a grandiose throne that only the Great Conqueror could sit on.","At this moment, this enormous seat was empty as among the areas that could seat quintillions of beings from the different houses, only a few million of them were filled as they looked towards the figures of existences who would be battling in today’s Writ of Challenge.","Daolord Azazel along with a few other Daolords and Antiquities from the House of Springforge could be seen situated lavishly in their spots, existences from other houses doing something similar as there was a bustle of discussions while they all gazed below.","Only a few million beings from the faction of all three Houses were gathered as it was an abysmal number, but this showed the deep history and complex structure that had yet to be explored of the Primordial Empire, and how even a Writ of Challenge like this was considered a mere nonconsequential blip in a vast history!","The gazes of these beings that knew themselves as the Protectors of the Bastion of Reality were locked onto the center of the Universal and galactic devastation of this Cosmic Battlefield where a crimson barrier that differentiated two sides could be seen.","This barrier was something that could not be destroyed even by the most powerful Daolords, and it was one that always divided the forces before a Writ of Challenge.","One side held the domineering and crimson colored Daolords and Antiquities overseeing the Anthracite Cosmos- it was Daolord Ilyad and Daolord Ray that appeared with over 300 Antiquities, this being a norm of power for a Cosmos within the Primordial Empire to have!","But what was interesting was that when it came to the number of Antiquities, the newly joining forces of the Indigo Cosmos actually had over 500 Antiquities behind a single Daolord!","This raised some eyes as from the magisterially floating golden green seats of the House of Springforge, Azazel had a disappointed expression as he spoke out.","\"For him to produce 500 Antiquities that quickly...he must have already consumed a significant portion of the Primordial Heart. I never thought he would be a wasteful existence...nor make a choice to not even strengthen himself, but produce Antiquities that are not the decisive force against important battles!\"","Azazel’s voice was filled with disappointment and displeasure, not expecting the being he thought highly and was cautious of to actually do such a thing.","So what if he produced 500 Antiquities?","At the end of the day, it was Daolords that decided who won and who lost!","But what Azazel and many others were wrong about was that the 500 beings they saw as Antiquities...were not even Antiquities to begin with as the vast majority of them were still merely in the Universal Realm in power.","This was because it was the 500 chosen to be capable of selecting Archetypes, the power they could display being that of Hegemonies as on top of the 5% of Noah’s power that they could borrow...it was actually enough to allow them to give off the shocking aura of an Antiquity!","Among the 500, only a few like Barbatos, the Oathkeeper, the Goliath, Elena, the Emperor Penguin, Valentina, Kazuhiko, and a few others that Noah granted the Primordial Hearts to...only they were true Antiquities.","But the myriad of powerful experts saw this scene and gained hints of displeasure at what they considered to be a pure waste of a Primordial Heart, the ones that had been keen to obtain it being the first ones to move as Daolord Ilyad’s crimson hair nearly burst into flames as she spoke coldly towards Noah behind the erected veil.","\"You wasteful little bumpkin...you really used the Primordial Heart to mass produce Antiquities? What’s the logic behind that?\"","Her words we filled with ridicule as Noah stopped gazing at the fantastical landscape of shattered Universes and Galaxies around them, his shining eyes glancing towards this being as he paid her no heed, but instead focused on the few billions of beings situated at the edges of the Cosmos that were watching everything playing out.","Her words didn’t bother him as he didn’t do what she misunderstood him to have done, where he still had a full Primordial Heart and 25% of a second one after he absorbed a vast majority of it and given an insignificant portion to a few of his most powerful subordinates to make them Antiquities!","So he didn’t even bother to reply to this Daolord as he gazed upon the quintillions of seats floating at the edges of this Cosmic Battlefield, as well as the central one that was the size of a Galaxy that was currently empty.","This seat...","THUMP!","Noah could feel his heart beat faster as his vast seas of Destiny churned, feeling as if this enormous golden throne was calling out to him...as if he had to get his hands on this seat and occupy it himself!","It was the first rebellious thought against the Great Conqueror that no beings even dared to think!"]},{"number":1191,"title":"Chapter 1191: Chapter 1190 - Dumb Bitches Die First!","paragraphs":["A grand golden throne the size of a Galaxy that was meant for only a single being, yet Noah’s gaze was stuck on it the longest before he shook his head and looked at the beings before his eyes.","\"Are you so tongue-tied that you cannot even reply, little thing?\"","Ilyad’s taunting voice continued to ring out as her body undulated with powerful levels of power, her Runic Dao Lines swirling atop her scene as she looked like a valiant queen of war!","Daolord Ray was beside her with eyes that flashed with a light of cruelty, his gaze seemingly only waiting for the veil between them to be torn down.","At the constant taunting, Noah didn’t even have to reply as not too far from his, Barbatos who was adorned with a dress inscribed with cackling black skulls spoke out with a domineering tone.","\"Can a bitch like you shut up for a second? We can’t even take in the sights with your constant yapping.\"","...!","RUMBLE!","It wasn’t the powerful Daolord that replied, but a mere Antiquity behind him as her voice stretched into the ears of Ilyad and the millions of powerful beings from the three factions watching this Writ of Challenge at the edges of the Cosmic Battlefield!","\"...\"","BZZZT","Daolord Ilyad’s body began to burn with an obscene amount of power at such a juncture, her eyes becoming locked onto the small yet curvaceous figure of Barbatos who was still staring towards her with a sneer that could topple kingdoms.","A Daolord insulting her was already demeaning and unbelievable enough, but now even an Antiquity did the same?!","A lesson! These new bumpkins that didn’t know the rules and honor of Daolords that had to be respected in the Primordial Empire that even Antiquities thought they could talk back to someone like her.","She gritted her teeth as it sounded like multiple worlds exploding, her voice resounding out.","\"Ray...start the challenge. I’ll rip apart that little bitch first before anyone else\"","WAA!","She called for the Writ of Challenge to be started right away as beside her, Daolord Ray raised his hand and called out majestically.","\"I put the Anthracite Cosmos and every existence within it on the line for this Writ of Challenge!\"","RUMBLE!","The moment his words finished, a bundle of white light shot forth from him and rose to the very top of the Cosmic Battlefield, this light signifying the authority that would be relinquished if he lost the battle of this Writ of Challenge.","Noah’s figure also shone at this moment as he felt a pull, uniquely feeling a type of essence wrap around the far away Indigo Cosmos and connecting itself to him, this essence becoming clustered in a bundle of light that was bubbling with his body as he also smiled whole calling out lightly.","\"I put the Indigo Cosmos and every existence within it on the line for this Writ of Challenge.\"","...!","THRUM!","A single sentence.","Yet it was all that was required to initiate the first ever Writ of Challenge Noah would face as the bubbling white light within his body also shot out, coming opposite to the one that Daolord Ray shot out as when these lights intermingled...the crimson barrier that was holding all of them back instantly disappeared!","WAP!","The two sides became utterly exposed to each other amidst the apocalyptic destruction of entire Galaxies.","ZAP!","Amidst this lull, the angered eyes of a particular Daolord moved first, Ilyad’s fiery figure tearing through the folds of space as she didn’t go for the Daolord of the opposing side, and she instead went to the small curvaceous figure of Barbatos that had insulted her!","Runic Dao Lines rotated throughout her right hand and shoulder as they covered a majority of her body, her figure appeared before Barbatos in but a blink of an eye as her hand that palpated with enough strength to shatter a Universe thundered forward.","It went forward to completely disintegrate the figure of this curvaceous woman, and it went forward to give a lesson of how the authority of a Daolord could not be denied!","Yet before it could arrive and achieve its intended purpose...","RUMBLE!","The space between Daolord Ilyad and Barbatos seemingly shook as a figure materialized right in front of her, her eyes unconsciously being sucked into this beings gaze as she felt alarm bells ringing crazily in her mind!","PAH!","In her daze, she barely noticed as her fist that was filled with enough might to shatter a Universe was stopped by the palm of a hand, the force behind it becoming dissolved into nothingness as the figure before her eyes seemingly covered all her sight, becoming larger than anything she had ever seen.","\"OOOOOH!\"","A bellow erupted from the mouth of this being that had lived for millions of years, her figure breaking into cold sweat as she shook herself out of her unconscious fear and gazed towards the figure of nobody other than Daolord Osmont beside her in utter somberness, feeling like there was danger from all around her!","His eyes seemed to glimmer with the light of billions of Galaxies, staring like at her like she wasn’t even worth more than a fly.","Amidst this intense situation, the figure of a curvaceous Necromancer came forward.","Barbaros peered from behind the broad shoulders of her man as with an enticing and provocative expression, he spoke out.","\"Dumb bitches like you always die first because you don’t know who you should and should not provoke.\"","RUMBLE!","Ilyad’s eyes trembled out of pure rage, fear, and wrath as she heard such a tone directed towards her, but she couldn’t keep her attention from the Daolord that had stopped her punch so calmly!","But she was actually told she was someone that didn’t know who she should and should not provoke.","She didn’t know this, but who was she to threaten one of Noah’s women? Who was she to even make a move against her?!","Her actions may have seemed small, but they had grand consequences!"]},{"number":1192,"title":"Chapter 1192: Chapter 1191 - Just Seconds Are Enough!","paragraphs":["Those that Noah Osmont lay claim to...could not be touched!","This was an unwritten rule that everybody knew and followed in the Infinite Cosmos, but there were outside of it that didn’t know.","Far from Primordial Empire where a shocking battle was beginning for Noah’s first Writ of Challenge, in the Novus Universe of the Infinite Cosmos.","Noah’s Universal Body was floating in space as he gazed at the glimmering Galaxies before him and a huge illusory screen, a woman lying beside him and gazing at this same scene!","Before them was an enormous illusory screen the size of a world that showed all of the events currently occurring in the Cosmic Battlefield, the woman beside Noah intently staring at everything occurring.","Her skin was a dark cream and glistening resplendently in the starry space, her smooth flowing dark hair falling even on Noah’s chest that was filled with billions of Galaxies as her hands were currently tracing the pectoral muscles of this Universal Body as she spoke.","\"I haven’t seen you get that angry for me yet.\" Her voice came out in a pouting manner as shockingly, the Inquisitor Athena, the War Princess that was the future weapon of the Celestials in Noah’s past Novus Galaxy...this young woman was actually pouting before Noah!","It was, of course, her main body and not the clones that she and all the others had sent to experience new lands and fight in the Primordial Empire.","At such a scene, even Noah could not help but smile as he traced his galaxy colored fingers over her hair and spoke out mesmerizingly.","\"Senior Sister, not many have been able to get the jump on you with your {Precognition}. And we only just got back weeks ago after all that mess.\"","Noah’s voice seemed to be reminiscing as when the events of the Celestials concluded, he and Athena had become estranged as he didn’t know how to proceed with her who had been an enemy before, but she was someone that he had made his!","After months passed and from the push of Barbatos, Noah worked on his relationships as his and Athena’s was one of the first to fix, forgoing what occurred in the past and focusing on who they were now as they returned to their relationship of Junior Brother and Senior Sister.","\"Mmm, I’ll see if I can draw attention to myself more like Sis Barbatos so I can be the damsel in distress next time.\" Athena spoke with a light smile as she gazed into Noah’s galactic eyes and continued. \"How does the strength of this Daolord and the one that is about to move measure up?\"","The eyes of the War Princess flashed with intense light as under her {Precognition} ability, she already saw Daolord Ray moving even before Noah and the others did!","At such a question, Noah’s eyes became sharp as he answered lightly.","\"Maybe it would have taken me a few minutes to take care of them if it was the me of just a few days ago. But now? Even a few seconds are enough!\"","RUMBLE!","His voice rang out in a domineering fashion as Athena had a bright smile appear on her face, the happiness not being capable of being hidden as this War Princess had long since returned to her King!","---","Back in the Cosmic Battlefields where the fist of Daolord Ilyad was stopped by Noah’s single palm.","Because of her actions of targeting a woman that was claimed by Noah, this Daolord was about to learn a painful lesson!","BZZZT!","Ruination and Primordial Essence vibrated intensely in the surroundings, Runic Tattoos lighting up on Noah’s right hand as they shone with a gorgeous multicolored glow.","Noah’s palm closed in on the fist he held as his expression flashed with a trace of coldness and brutality, immensely powerful barriers of a Daolord being broken as an instant later, the cracking of bones resounded as Daolord Ilyad stared at her hand in shock and disbelief.","Her finger bones were gradually becoming disfigured as she actually stared at them in shock, the voice of Daolord Ray resounding in her ears as he very quickly appeared beside them!","\"Ilyad!\"","THRUM!","His figure tore through the veil as he appeared right above Noah, a fist pulsating with rapidly rotating Runic Dao Tattoos thundering towards Noah’s head as it wished to pulverize it into a mass of brain matter!","Yet...","Noah raised his other hand above him as his palm released a shocking force that absorbed the strike of the Daolord, his palm enclosing on the fist of Daolord Ray as well as his arms moved to bring both of these beings before his eyes.","...!","Silence!","Silence pervaded the surroundings after such a scene as when a second passed, people truly began to comprehend the fact that Daolord Osmont had seamlessly not just stopped the strike of a single Daolord, but two of them and at the same time as he didn’t even look like he broke a sweat!","\"This...\"","Azazel felt a chill in his heart as he recalled what he felt when he faced this being initially, his senses having saved him as his power was on par with Ilyad and Ray, and yet they were being matched in a terrifying fashion right now!","Far away from him on the seats where Daolords and Antiquities from the House of Stormdust were sitting in, the bodies of nearly all of them rose in somberness as they stared closely at the scenes within the Cosmic Battlefield.","Only a single being remained seated, and it was a being that nobody would expect to actually attend a Writ of Challenge such as this that held the low stakes of a single Cosmos.","It was someone known throughout all the factions of the Primordial Empire, someone that had the title of Forefather as they were just below the Family Heads in ranking!","It was Forefather Julius that had passed on the message from the Family Head that Ray and Ilyad would be ones that Daolord Osmont would choose, and also the one that had told them to be careful.","He had warned them and wanted them to take the warning seriously, and of course he took this warning even more seriously himself as someone of his stature actually came to watch whatever unfolded at today’s stage!","A being that deserved a word of caution from the Family Head was someone that Forefather Julius had to pay attention to, and his thoughts were affirmed as he watched the shocking scene playing out before him.","It was the shocking start of the first Writ of Challenge in recent years!"]},{"number":1193,"title":"Chapter 1193: Chapter 1192: All Eyes on Him! I","paragraphs":["Amidst the scene of desolate and shattered Universal and Galactic boundaries, two sides were clashing as they consisted of Daolords and Antiquities, but everything had come to a halt at this moment!","This was because on this Cosmic Battlefield, the single Daolord on the side of the Indigo Cosmos was currently withstanding the strikes of both of the Daolords from the Anthracite Cosmos of the House of Stormdust.","Withstanding them with ease as his expression was akin to an adult looking at children, as if an Emperor was gazing at lowly peasants!","The expressions of Ilyad and Daolord Ray were somber as they felt like their fists were clasped on an unmovable mountain- on something that could stand strong for eons before any of them could even stand a chance of destroying it.","But they were Daolords from the House of Stormdust.","Pride and honor were ingrained in their very Origins, their minds having lived through millions of years of trials and tribulations.","The being before their eyes...would merely be another obstacle that they had to overcome!","\"OOOOOH!\"","They both bellowed out gloriously as half of their bodies glimmered brightly with Runic Dao Tattoos, their strength being enhanced by countless times from the unique boosts of their deconstructed and reconstructed Daos as mixed within their cries, the regal essence of Ruination and Primordial Essence rushed out!","Even though they were withstanding what seemed like an unmovable mountain, these beings knew that they should not for even a second pull back.","Pulling back and retreating against such a force meant they had lost!","So their stopped fists advanced forward as they were backed with the essence of the assimilated Primordial and Ruination Daos, their bellows shaking through the apocalyptic boundaries of destroyed Galaxies and Universes as they shot all they had towards Daolord Osmont.","RUMBLE!","Forces strong enough to overwhelm Universes raged as in response to all this, Noah's eyes only flashed with a wondrous golden light.","His body felt the coming and raging strength of the two Daolords before him as when he put into account the boosts of his Nomological Edict of Samsara and the myriad of Daos he had recently reconstructed into Runic Dao Lines...he could effectively feel that he had more than enough strength within his body to overpower both of them!","He felt as if the beings before him were...","\"Not enough.\"","BZZZT!","The surroundings between the three of them trembled and shattered.","All of the force that the two Daolords were throwing towards him raged in the surroundings as it was only able to travel across Noah's arms and upper body, the light black tight-fitting shirt he wore becoming ripped off as only his obsidian pants remained, his bare chest and back being made bare for all to see as it drew in gasps from all those watching!","\"That's...\"","Out in the open, everyone could see exquisite Runic Dao Lines with an enticingly crimson hue fully covering every portion of his chest and back, his ridiculously sculpted abs and back muscles showing fantastical tattoos that screamed of ancientness and Antiquity!","They seemed different from everyone else's Dao Lines as they shone with an even greater luster, but how could they not be different when they were enhanced by the Light of Conquest and granted double the effectiveness of all others?!","A single Reconstructed Cosmic Dao from him granted 10 mill percent in boosts- that was the boosts of twenty Lesser Daos for anybody else.","And in the past days...he had deconstructed three Cosmic Daos and turned them into these ancient-looking Dao Lines!","How could he not shine brighter? How could he not exceed them in the regality and beauty they released?!","In the middle of the Cosmic Battlefield, his chest was laid bare as all eyes were on him and how even at this point, he hadn't moved a single inch.","His eyes released gorgeous beams of light as he spoke out once more, his voice and actions being perceived as a battlecry as thereafter, the Antiquities behind him would begin to move.","\"You all...are too weak!\"","THRUM!","The moment his words finished, his two hands that were holding onto the fists of Daolords swung down!","His Runic Dao Lines that stretched gloriously on his hands and upper body lit up magisterially as they carried with them a terrifying force that Daolord Ilyad and Ray could not deny, this force traveling down as a shocking sound of muscles, bones, and ligaments being ruptured erupted out!","RIIP!","Crimson blood flew out amidst the Shattered boundaries of Galaxies and Universes!","...!","Those watching from the expansive coliseum like seats found their eyes constricting heavily, the figure of daolord Azazel and Rosanna from the House of Springforge standing up along with most of the Antiquities and Daolords that were lucky enough to actually attend this 'minor' Writ of Challenge.","In the Seats that were meant for the House of Stormdust, the hidden figure of Forefather Julius also stood up as his eyes flashed coldly, a myriad of unknown thoughts crossing his mind as he looked at the scene of the blood of Daolords from his house being spilled with such utter ease.","\"Unbelievable...\"","The air around the Cosmic Battlefield turned somber as time seemed to resume, the figure of a lone Daolord Osmont holding the ruptured limbs of two powerful Daolords from the House of Stormdust etching itself onto everyone's minds!","\"OOOOOH!\"","At this same time, a battle cry rang out from the ranks of Antiquities behind the Daolord Osmont, as if his actions had caused their hearts to become aflame with battle intent!","RAA! RAA!","Waves of power stretched out as the figures of Antiquities began to move, their bodies lighting up with light in forms of clusters as dozens of them seemingly used the same abilities- and it was simply just them utilizing their Archetypes to the fullest.","But the air of the Cosmic Battlefield had turned somber as all those watching now understood one thing.","Everyone here had come before to watch a show of forces from the House of Stormdust defeating a showy new Daolord that had to be taught the rules of the Primordial Empire, but they instead found they were in for a fantastical show of one of the lands of one of the three powerful factions of the Primordial Empire...possibly falling into the hands of a small and newly appearing being!","From the overwhelming power currently displayed by the Daolord Osmont as he faced Ilyad and Daolord Ray...there lay a very real possibility that the House of Stormdust could lose a Cosmos.","This...was a shocking event whose effects had yet to be fully known at this moment!"]},{"number":1194,"title":"Chapter 1194: Chapter 1193: All Eyes on Him! II","paragraphs":["Never in history had a new Cosmos ever won a Writ of Challenge against the locals of the Primordial Empire.","This thought rang in the minds of Daolord Ilyad and Ray resoundingly as crimson light washed over them, both of their eyes looking at their torn limbs hanging from his hands as blood still freshly leaked from them!","Something that hadn't happened in history...they wouldn't be the first ones to allow it.","THRUM!","With limbs missing and utterly humiliated, the expressions of Ilyad and Ray were utterly cold as they moved like streaks of light the moment they were free from Noah's grasp.","They moved with fervor as if they hadn't just suffered a major injury, their eyes flashing with a deadly light as they went on the offensive once more!","This was the pride and honor of an Antiquity!","But shockingly, they weren't going towards Noah's domineering figure that held two bloody dripping hands- they were instead making a beeline towards the Antiquities behind Noah that were blazing with battle power and had begun to move.","They knew their enemy was stronger, so they could only find gaps in his strength!","That gap was something they had seen him defend fervently in the last few seconds...the Antiquities he protected!","If they could massacre a few of them or hold some hostage, they might be able to find a gap against the being before them.","With such a thought, they moved forward as their bodies lit up with crimson lights of destruction, their voices coming out in synchrony.","\"Through the Storms of Extinction.\"","WAA!","\"Through the Eternal Dust.\"","RUMBLE!","\"<Storm of the Everfading Dust>.\"","!!!","The Cosmic Battlefield quieted.","Time seemingly moved to a lull as behind their two figures, the formation of a heart rending and Origin shaking illusory figure formed instantly!","Hair bright red and an expression that seemed to disdain everything formed, the figure towering to be larger than a Galaxy as its eyes filled with arrogance merely blinked.","A mere blink, but this single blink allowed for terrifying clusters of unknown essence to bloom towards the Antiquities, this essence eating up the surrounding void itself as all it left behind was Annihilation and dust!","It was the Storm of Everfading Dust, a skill unique to those from the House of Stormdust as they called upon the illusory figure of their most powerful combatant to lay down judgment.","When this skill was cast, a storm would always descend on the targeted area as after it passed, everything would turn to dust!","Such a skill was cast in conjunction with two Daolords as they targeted not someone of their own level, but existences of lower strength than them.","It was the only way they saw to disrupt the dominance and coldness the Daolord Osmont had already begun to express!","But little did they know that this choice of theirs was one that marked them for something no Daolord in the House of Stormdust had faced in the last few million years.","RUMBLE!","As the raging storm that even turned the void to dust raged towards mere Antiquities, the eyes of Ilyad and Ray lit up as they saw Daolord Osmont's figure materializing before this storm, and they could see he was intent on protecting all of the Antiquities behind him!","'Good!'","Their eyes showed elation in confirming this as to them, it meant they knew what to target and put this being in a disadvantageous position until they wore him down.","After all, the essence of two Daolord was always better than one.","Even with greater strength, they could take this Daolord Osmont down in time as they ground down his essence and mana!","In their elation, they watched as the eyes of Daolord Osmont turned an octave colder, his voice echoing out all around.","\"Endless Rays of Time.\"","THRUM!","The void tore apart.","From its torn areas, cascading Rays of Grey light shone out brightly, these Rays covering everything as they went on to shine on the deadly storm of essence that was turning everything to dust...and the shocking scene of these rays erasing everything played out!","One must recall what this skill from the [Cosmic Dao Integration and Combinations] did to get a better understanding of what was actually occurring!","[Endless Rays of Time](5/5) :: An area of effect ability that utilizes the Dao essence of Chronos, Reincarnation, Space-time, and Vitality, along with the laws of Life and Death to bring to fruition scorching rays that tear apart time itself wherever they cross. Enemies hit by the Rays of Time experience Body and Soul Degradation, Instantaneous Necrosis, -100,000% Movement and Attack Speed, and -100,000% Reduction to Physical, Daos, and Laws Resistance. Once the ability activates, it continues to rain down the rays of time until it is deactivated.","The coalescing of laws and daos came together as they birthed something glorious, this scene causing the figure of Forefather Julius to rise and float from his seat in shock as he uttered out unconsciously.","\"A Glimpse of Edicts...!\"","WAA!","A Glimpse of Edicts! A stage of shocking power and grandeur that very few in the Primordial Empire could even claim to have achieved!","Only the true core powers of the Three Houses boasted such a capability, and such powerhouses were few and far in between.","\"How could this...\"","So how could a being appear outside of the Primordial Empire and achieve such a thing? Such a shocking question buzzed in Forefather Julius's mind as when he looked closely at the Daolord Osmont, he saw that this being only had his manifested Universes number a but over 200!","Such a number was still considered a fledgling under someone like Forefather Julius who had already forged thousands of Universes.","Yet such a young fledgling that had barely stepped onto the path of Universal Filament had somehow been capable of taking a glimpse of Edicts and began playing with the combination and fusion of Daos through his attacks...all the while also having destroyed his foundation of Daos by turning them into Runic Dao Lines!","There were too many incongruencies and mysteries surrounding such a figure as Forefather Julius truly understood now why the Family Head had motioned for them to be cautious.","But the word of caution seemed like it would not be able to truly reach Daolord Ilyad and Ray.","Their bodies blazed with essence as their Runic Dao Tattoos shone a myriad of colors, their eyes looking towards the endlessly cascading rays of light that erased an attack that could even turn the void into dust with shock!","They utilized The Primordial and Ruination Daos to defend themselves, seeing some effectiveness in this manner as their Origins churned to sustain them.","But amidst all of these fast paced movements, they heard the voice of Daolord Osmont as after their second try to attack and wipe out the Antiquities behind him, his voice seemed to have turned entirely chilly!","\"Death it is then.\"","RUMBLE","Before his voice even echoed out, his figure had disappeared.","\"Be ready!\" Daolord Ray bellowed out as he felt his Origin ring alarm bells all around, knowing the counterattack they were about to face would be heavy after failing to find even a simple gap in the enemy's strength.","\"Back to back, withstand him until his strength is exhausted...\" He continued to speak towards Daolord Ilyad beside him as when he turned his eyes towards her after not hearing her reply, his eyes trembled as his Origin shook fearfully for the first time in many years!","There, just a few inches from his own figure...he could see the shocked expression of Daolord Ilyad as her pristine red haired head...had a fair white runic tattooed hand stretching through it.","\"...\"","BZZZT!","Space shook and quaked as the scene fully registered, Blood and gore leaking out as horrifically...a genuine multicolored hand had gone from the back and through the front of the head of a Daolord at a speed that very few could keep up with, this hand beginning to burn brightly with Ruination and a myriad of other essences as the voice of the terrifying existence echoed out!","\"Universe of Turbidity.\"","WAA!","An unstable Universe bloomed from the very center of consciousness of a powerful Daolord as the results of this action would pave way for a road of no return.","A road of Conquest and glory that would etch itself into the annals of history!"]},{"number":1195,"title":"Chapter 1195: Chapter 1194: Daolords Fall Under my Hands! I","paragraphs":["A scene that could quite literally stop the breaths of all those watching.","This was exactly what was occurring at this moment in time, the glorious scene of a bare-chested Daolord Osmont shining with a myriad of Runic Dao Tattoos unbelievably appearing behind and piercing his hand through the skull of Daolord Ilyad playing out!","But this wasn't all as while Daolord Ray watcher the glimmering red hair of Ilyad gain a deeper red shade, a terrifying sentence was released from the mouth of the being that was currently brimming with coldness and brutality!","\"Universe of Turbidity.\"","RUMBLE!","A Universe was burned within an Origin.","All that others could see was a barely discernible flicker of light shining brightly before it died out on Daolord Osmont's chest, and thereafter...a Singularity bloomed at the very center of Daolord Ilyad's fair face.","An Unstable Universe that was filled with a mixture of terrifying Daos at its base, one of the deadliest abilities that Noah had designed to date!","[Universe of Turbidity](5/5) :: The daos mixed within are too many, giving birth to a turbid and unstable compressed Universe. Within this Turbid Universe are the unstable essences of Ruination, Primordial, Conquest, Extinction, Chronos, and Reincarnation. The combination of daos is too unstable as once cast, one should run far, far away. Only the caster is exempted from the deleterious effects of this ability. To cast this skill, the sacrifice of a normal Universe from one's Origin is required.","Ruination! Primordial! Conquest! Extinction! Chronos! Reincarnation!","All 6 Cosmic Daos in their most unstable forms bloomed beautifully from the skull of a living being.","The eyes of Ilyad still had their consciousness alive and well when she felt Noah's hand seamlessly course through her skull, but these eyes were actually stuck on one thing during their last few seconds of life!","Her eyes were looking forward as far in the distance, she could see the eyes of a sneering curvaceous looking Necromancer that seemed to be staring at her with scorn and repeating something she had said not too long ago!","\"Dumb bitches always die first...\"","This was the last scene that fluttered through the mind of this Daolord that had lived for millions of years.","Then, an unstable Universe bloomed.","BOOOOOOM!!!","...!","It felt like a bright light had bloomed as it covered everyone's sight, this light causing the eyes of Forefather Julius to turn utterly somber!","This light blazed only for what seemed like a few seconds, but it seemed like an entire eon to Forefather Julius based on what it represented.","He saw the unstable clusters of different Cosmic Essences leaking out unstably from this blooming universe as he once again was convinced of what he saw before.","\"A Glimpse of Edicts...\"","Something that took the very pillars of the Primordial Empire a myriad of tens of millions of years to even touch upon, and it was even harder for those that had already deconstructed too many of their Daos to turn them into Runic Dao Lines.","After all, if you didn't have any Daos to try and experiment fusing, what chance did you have to even think about Edicts?!","But this was what made the scene before Forefather Julius even more shocking as this being that didn't stem from the Primordial Empire somehow had reached such a stage!","As he watched the blooming Universe that spelled the death of one of his own Daolords, his eyes glazed over with a crimson light as an unseen connection stretched from him and into an unknown location.","His voice then began to echo out silently while he watched the blazing light begin to die down.","\"Head, the new Daolord from the Indigo Cosmos had achieved \"A Glimpse of Edicts\". We will be losing authority over the Anthracite Cosmos in the next few minutes. Our House should be the first to know about this...how do we play it?\"","He spoke with utter coldness and clarity as his eyes seemed to gaze countless years into the future, waiting for a reply that would decide the fate of many things!","As he waited, the light from the blooming universe entirely faded away as it became clear for all to see, and what people saw...ah!","Desolate remains of broken space and stellar objects, the center point of the explosion only having a single being floating majestically as his bare chest and abs glistened in the stellar darkness.","His right hand was unreliable holding a glimmering Origin that seemed small and yet vast- an origin that shimmered with the light of multiple Universes.","It was a Universal Filament Origin of a dead Daolord as Ilyad's body was nowhere to be found!","Along with this Universal Filament Core, there were multicolored crimson lines that seemed like endless rivers stretching from his palm, Noah being the only one nearby to see a wondrous set of words pop over them.","[Runic Dao Line Enhancers]","A set of words that caused his eyes filled with brutality to shine brightly, but there were too many things to be done as he didn't peer into their details yet, waving his hand and putting all of them away as he gazed towards a certain direction.","There, an image of a distraught figure with dimming Dao Tattoos could be seen, Daolord Ray looking towards Noah with red eyes as half of his body was currently missing!","A wriggling mass of flesh and bones seemed to be coagulating together trying to piece itself back, but something was preventing it from doing so!","It was a fantastical scene to watch as the Antiquities that were behind Daolord Ray and the now gone Ilyad felt a cold sweat break out as their scalps tingled, not moving a single step forward as they found themselves not able to do so.","Far from the ruin of shattered Galaxies and Universes, in the seats that covered the boundary of the Cosmic Battlefield...there wasn't a single being sitting.","Daolords, Antiquities, and even the Hegemonies and Paragons that made up the vast number of millions that made up the current watchers were all standing and watching the scene before them in a stupor!","But this wasn't all! Even though there were millions watching when this Writ of Challenge began, countless flashes of light began to appear soon after as billions of existences began to pour into the shimmering golden seats as the edge of the Cosmos!"]},{"number":1196,"title":"Chapter 1196: Chapter 1195: Daolords Fall Under My Hands! II","paragraphs":["A Writ of Challenge against a single newly entering Cosmos with 1 Daolord being pitted against 2 that stemmed from the Primordial Empire was nothing too special.","The show was expected to be short as the turnout was in the millions, and it mostly made up the powerful Daolords, Antiquities, and the Hegemonies and Paragons that had previously sent the Writs of Challenges to the Indigo Cosmos!","But now, this had drastically changed as the moment Daolord Osmont withstood the strikes of two Daolord simultaneously, word was quickly spread among the ranks of three Houses as it immediately caused the influx of existences to appear in the Cosmic Battlefield.","When word spread of a Daolord being utterly obliterated under the hands of the newly appeared acceptor of the Writ of Challenge...this caused an even greater influx of existences as it was a shocking action!","A Protector of the Bastion of Reality...had died!","THRUM!","Billions of lights flashed every second as the number was quickly approaching trillions, and the word spread- this would only get faster and faster as the empty golden coliseum-like seats floating in the edges of the Cosmic Battlefield were gradually becoming filled.","They were becoming filled as all of their gazes were on the scene in the center of the Cosmic Battlefield where space was still healing after it was ruptured from deadly attacks!","The figure of Daolord Osmont occupied everyone's gazes Azazel's childish face was extremely somber at this moment.","He had received warning bells about this being since he first met him, but he didn't expect him to be this dangerous!","Multiple Daolords and Antiquities began to appear around him and Daolord Rosanna as they began sending them many mental messages- and this was because the two of them were actually the first to come across Osmont and it was under the direction where the influence of the House of Springforge stretched out to.","Daolord Azazel rebuffed as many of the messages as possible as he tried to focus on the scene continuing to play out, but he couldn't do it any longer as in the next second, he felt an old hand land on his shoulder, his small figure sinking down as if a heavy mountain was leaning on him!","His gaze drastically changed as he turned around and broke into cold sweat while calling out respectfully.","\"Forefather Isaac!\"","His childish face lost all of its majesty and arrogance when he looked towards the old man before him, the face of this being old and wizened as he wore a verdant robe that even extended to cover his head, an extensive long beard and hair being evident on his features as he spoke out with a light smile of his face.","\"Tell me everything that happened when you all came across this Daolord Osmont.\"","WAA!","Azazel's expression turned somber as he began to recite everything that occurred to the utmost accuracy, even though he could see the Primal Crystal that recorded the scenes he had experienced when he went to the Indigo Cosmos that he had sent towards the Family Head currently being twirled in the fingers of the Forefather!","From the House of Stormdust, a hidden Forefather had been there since the very beginning as now, a Forefather of the House of Springforge also made his entrance.","Forefather Isaac's eyes were swarming with lights as he listened to Azazel's words, his gaze actually also going towards the hidden figure of Forefather Julius as many hidden thoughts crossed his mind.","Even though many figures were now arriving and watching the ongoing play, it never stopped as amidst the shattered Galaxies and Universes, Daolord Ray's somber figure saw Noah's figure glistening gloriously amidst the destroyed space, his red eyes looking at the few hundred Antiquities from his side that were standing shaken as he began to turn into a streak of light towards them!","Even if he had to use shields, he had to survive.","His bloodied eyes shone with brightness as at the same time, multiple Splendiferous Universes began to burn in his Origin as he used them as fuel to try and heal his body that was being ravaged by terrifying and unstable collection of Cosmic Daos from Noah's [Universe of Turbidity]!","WAA!","Muscles and bones began to churn and heal at visible speeds, Daolord Ray's eyes seeing the Antiquities right before his eyes as he began to call out orders.","\"Group around me! Burn your Universes and be ready to lay your life on the line for Stormd-\"","THUCK!","His words never finished.","Right as he was about to reach the group of hundreds of Antiquities, his figure that was blazing with essence came to a sudden halt as shocking, a hand appeared out of nowhere and grasped forcefully on his face!","WAA!","The hand glistened with Runic Dao Lines as the figure of Noah was revealed grasping tightly onto Ray's face, essence gushing from his hands as it covered the Daolord's face and made it so he couldn't pull away.","Thereafter, essence undulated over Noah's majestic body as while holding on to the face of a Daolord in one hand, he began to shoot up towards the direction of crimson gold seats of the House of Stormdust!","With a Daolord in hand, he shot towards his faction gloriously like a shooting star as Ray bellowed out while struggling within his hands.","\"OOOOH!\"","This terrifying being that had achieved Antiquity and then assimilated Ruination and the Primordial Dao to begin forming Dao Lines bellowed out, burning multiple Universes as he wanted to give himself more strength to break out from Noah's grasp, but it was all worthless!","His eyes looked between the gaps of the fingers that wrapped around his face like metal clamps as he stared into the cold eyes of the terrifying being holding onto him, the fear he was trying to push down bubbling up as he saw this being actually had his eyes on him, his lips moving as words resounded in his ear even as they tore through the void of space.","\"What an utter disappointment you two were as Daolords.\"","RUMBLE","The words only caused a fear that Daolord Ray hands felt for many years continue to rise, his heart only now fully realizing from the brutal eyes of this being that he had marked him for death!","He couldn't escape it! No schemes, no strength, no matter how many Universes he burned...he could not stop it.","\"Ah...\"","In his last moments, this Daolord let out a cry as their figures that were shooting towards the direction of the House of Stormdust came to stop just a few light years away from the crimson gold seats.","Right before the eyes of now more than a few tens of trillions of beings from this faction!","Before the eyes of the hidden Forefather Julius!","Noah held another struggling Daolord within his hands as while gazing at the powerful existences from the House of Stormdust, he called out once more.","\"Universe of Turbidity.\"","\"OOOOOOOO-\" Daolord Ray cried out a last bellow along with Noah's words, but this bellow was cut short in the next second as a Singularity bloomed...and white light covered everyone's eyes.","\"...\"","One must know...not even a minute had passed!","Ah!"]},{"number":1197,"title":"Chapter 1197: Chapter 1196: First in History! I","paragraphs":["A scene of wonder and utter fantasy played out as a being utterly dominated others in strength, forcefully holding onto an existence of the same level of strength as they couldn't even falter out of the way!","He held them as he approached the House this being stemmed from, looking at them straight in the eyes as an unstable Universe filled with mixtures of daos bloomed to take away another life.","\"...\"","When the white light died down and the ravages of unstable cosmic essence settled, his figure was the only one seen floating majestically with his bare chest glistening gloriously...all eyes settling on him as he seemed to be staring defiantly at trillions of existences on the crimson gold seats of the House of Stormdust.","Defiant as he would be winning this Writ of Challenge and taking a Cosmos that was under their Authority!","But before this scene settled...","RAA! RAA!","The resounding cry of an Emperor Penguin rang out as its figure could be seen tearing across the folds of space towards the few hundreds of Antiquities from the side of the House of Stormdust, Kazuhiko beside this Penguin as his voice also stretched out while filled with battle intent.","\"Let us fight! The battle may have ended with the strongest, but we can still battle!\"","WAA!","His body was releasing waves of Cosmic essence as his Archetype caused him to shine with a purple luster, looking forward to having a battle against other Antiquities even though Noah had finished the two strongest combatants already.","But...","THRUM!","Waves of essence released from the group of shaken Antiquities that just watched the two Daolords on their side get dismembered and blown up, all of them bowing down in defeat as they didn't even wait for the figures of enemy Antiquities to arrive!","\"No...!\"","Kazuhiko saw their surrender as he called out, making one think it was their side that had lost as his figure and the Emperor Penguin came to a halt a few miles away while watching the Antiquities from the Anthracite Cosmos call out defeat.","\"Haaa...\"","The faces of Noah's subordinates were unresigned as even though it was the first battle they would experience, they didn't even get the chance to battle enemies of their own level as Noah's actions alone against those he fought against broke their wills to fight against them!","They turned towards him as with the defeat of the other side of the Writ of Challenge, the brilliant circles of light that had shot forth from Noah and Daolord Ray and brought down the veil for them to fight...these lights coagulated and combined together as they shot towards Noah faster than light.","THUMP!","Sinking into his body and Origin, they afforded Noah a sense of Authority and power as beside the unique feeling of the Indigo Cosmos, he was able to 'feel' the Anthracite Cosmos that was adjacent to it!","Noah cast [Eyes of Truth] and [Understanding] towards this unique white light as he got a better sense of exactly what it was.","[Osmont's Primordial Light of Authority] :: A Light of Authority granted to the Overseer of a Cosmos, and it allows for the influence one exerts to be easily quantified and extrapolated in the form of Marks of Antiquity. Whoever holds the Light of Authority for a Cosmos will be designated as its main influencer, gradually accumulating the Marks of Antiquity that come with it. It is also needed to issue out and accept Writs of Challenges as it contains the authority of the domain one looks over. With it, one can willingly pass over their Authority to others, gain more authority over other Cosmos through Writs of Challenges, or lose their authority in a similar manner. Current Cosmos under Osmont's Primordial Light of Authority: Indigo, Anthracite.","Something unique to the Primordial Empire that better quantified and made simple the transfer of authority, making it so that the one holding it would begin to benefit from the accumulation of Marks of Antiquity as soon as they came to oversee a Cosmos!","Noah also felt these changes as aside from the many Marks of Antiquity he was obtaining passively every second from his influence stretching over the Infinite Cosmos and the small amount of influence he had on the Indigo Cosmos, he felt a jump in the number of Marks of Antiquities he was receiving after he obtained the Anthracite Cosmos under him as well.","But of course, the major source of his Marks of Antiquity came from the Infinite Cosmos where he was closely interconnected with the inhabitants through the Dao of Fealty, and he would be doing this for the Indigo Cosmos and Anthracite Cosmos as well in the near future as he obtained an even larger amount of Marks of Antiquity.","But the Primordial Light of Authority shone brightly on his body as it was a significant event in history!","It was the granting of spoils from losers to victors, Noah extending his authority over the Cosmos next to the Indigo Cosmos that was attached with the vast Primordial Scaffolding. All of the Antiquities and existences that stemmed from this Cosmos, whatever unique treasures...all of it was going to come under Noah as he had done something unbelievable.","BOOM!","A second later, at the very top of where the veil used to be before the battle started, glimmering lights akin to fireworks exploded out as they announced the official end of the Writ of Challenge, and this end came with its own consequences as from the crimson gold, green gold, and entirely gold seats that represented the Houses of Stormdust, Springforge, and Havenbreaker...the auras of trillions of powerful beings spread out wildly as they could now all be felt in the Cosmic Battlefield!","With the end of the Writ of Challenge, others were free to enter the vast and nigh endless battlefield.","The myriad of Daolords, Antiquities, Hegemonies, Paragons...the countless number of beings that now filled the coliseum-like seats at the edge of the were staring towards Noah as their wild auras could be felt. Even though fireworks seemed to be echoing out all around in celebration, there wasn't an ounce of cheer from all those watching as one would wonder...just how would an existence that had stolen a Cosmos of one of the three powerful factions of the Primordial Empire be received?!"]},{"number":1198,"title":"Chapter 1198: Chapter 1197: First in History! II","paragraphs":["An extremely tense situation!","Noah's subordinates felt the unique air around them as they all faced the gazes of trillions of powerful beings, but Noah seemed unfazed as with his chest still bare and glimmering brightly, he stared back at all of them with a gaze of majesty and power that screamed out his regality.","It was akin to a lone Emperor facing the gazes of a myriad of Kings, none of them being able to match to him as at this moment, the apocalyptic broken boundaries and stellar bodies of galaxies and universes began to tremble from the auras of trillions of creatures being exerted in its region!","It felt like things were about to boil over when in the next instant...","\"Haha!\"","A burst of resounding laughter echoed out.","It dispersed the heavy air like nothing as Noah and many others turned their eyes towards the direction this sound came from, glancing at the House of Springforge as among its vast seats, the figure of Daolord Azazel had a childish smile on his face as he conducted multiple teleportations to proceed towards Noah's direction while laughing boisterously.","\"Daolord Osmont...never in my wildest dreams did I expect this show of power from you when I first met you, nor that you would actually show the weakness of the House of Stormdust and cause them to lose a Cosmos!\"","RUMBLE!","Words filled with many meanings and even hidden attacks against another house erupted out, Azazel's movements being akin to oil being poured into a fire as with his movement, the figures of the many trillions that had arrived in the edges of the Cosmic Battlefield began to go towards where the battle took place.","But Azazel and the House of Springforge moved first as in a short period of time, the childish figure of this Daolord arrived before Noah as he wasn't alone, the green robes of multiple Daolords, Antiquities, and Hegemonies from the House of Springforge appearing with him as with a smile, he continued.","\"Let me be the first to congratulate Daolord Osmont on his victory, and also welcome him fully as a Protector of the Bastion of Reality!\"","The boisterous voice of Azazel echoed out as Noah looked at this being carefully, a light smile appearing on his face as he watched this play continue before his eyes.","\"OOOH!\" Grand bellows of power erupted from the trillion that surrounded Noah in one direction from the House of Springforge, a verdant light rising from all around as in the next second, another voice echoed out.","\"Yes...we welcome a new powerful Protector to our Primordial Empire...\" From the side of the House of Havenbreaker, a voice echoed out as it wasn't from the two twin Daolords that Noah had come across before, but from a woman that was adorned in a golden dress hugging her tightly, expressing every one of her curves with utter clarity as one could see the dense cluster of Runic Dao Lines hidden below her fair skin.","Golden hair freely flowed down to her shoulder as she was leading the party of trillions from the House of Havenbreaker, none of the arrogance and pride that Noah had seen in the eyes of the twin like Daolords being present in her eyes as within them...one could actually see immense confidence and power!","When she spoke, gasps rang out as no others spoke, even Azazel holding his tongue solemnly as he didn't continue with his laid back words and laughs.","This wasn't because he was fearful of the woman that had spoken, but it was simply because of status!","She...was far above many beings here as very few would dare speak when she was speaking! There were few, but it didn't mean there weren't any.","Azazel's eyes looked behind him where a veiled figure was currently hidden, this figure pulling down his veil as the face of an Old man with glimmering green hair showed itself, his voice echoing out soon after.","\"Princess Halcyon, this Old Man didn't think an event such as this would draw you in.\"","His voice was powerful and mesmerizing to hear, his figure coming into the light the moment he spoke as Azazel and many others stepped aside respectfully.","Noah looked at these beings with sharp eyes as his warning bells tingled, the golden haired Princess Halcyon and the old man giving off stupendous levels of power as it was unknown how many hundreds if not thousands of Universes these existences were wielding in their Origins!","\"Forefather Isaac...how curious of you to be here as well. And please, call me Foremother Halcyon...the title of a Princess is not one I'm most fond of.\"","RUMBLE!","Yes! The figure from the House of Havenbreaker that had arrived was on the same stage as Forefather Isaac and the hidden figure of Forefather Julius that remained within the crimson gold seats at the edges of the Cosmos, her power being something that was only below the level of the ruling forces of the three houses!","After she spoke to Forefather Isaac, her clear eyes locked onto Noah as she voiced out sonorously.","\"Daolord Osmont, you've just arrived at the Primordial Empire and might not have had the best reception...please, allow my house to welcome you with a Banquet today. We must celebrate the appearance of a powerful new Daolord for our Empire, especially one that is making history from winning a Writ of Challenge as a newcomer!\"","...!","Her voice echoed out to all ears as it made clear why everyone had surrounded Noah's figure after the Writ of Challenge had ended.","A powerful new Daolord! One that people didn't fully know the extent of his power, and only the Forefathers that had appeared and the Princess Halcyon before everyone's eyes were the beings that could comprehend that this Daolord Osmont had reached the stage of <<A Glimpse of Edicts>>!","With all of this in the picture, it posed the question of where would this new Daolord fall?","Which faction would be taking him in?!","This was the grand question in everyone's mind, and why Azazel had forgotten any point of conflict he had shown towards Noah to be the first to congratulate him.","The weak were looked down upon while the strongest were revered. This was the rule of the Cosmos, and one that remained respected throughout!","Towards such a reception, Noah's figure shone with glorious light as his eyes locked with Princess Halcyon and the Forefather Isaac before his eyes. They all seemed to have many expectations as they reached out olive branches for the sake of possibly bringing him to their sides in the near future...but none of these beings had any idea what he had in store, what his eyes were set on!","For him to be swallowed up by one of the three factions of the Primordial Empire?","This idea...was more than laughable to him!!!"]},{"number":1199,"title":"Chapter 1199: Chapter 1198: An Obstacle to be Eliminated!","paragraphs":["In the midst of shattered galactic boundaries and stellar bodies, trillions of beings surrounded Noah and his subordinates, the auras of many Daolords and thousands of Antiquities being stretched throughout as only the existences at the level of Forefathers were speaking on behalf of the Houses of Springforge and Havenbreaker.","The forces from the House of Stormdust remained in their seats at the edge of the Cosmos as they didn't proceed forward, Forefather Julius having stepped up and spread out a certain command as none of the existences on his side moved forward!","This wasn't simply because they could come forward shamelessly after they were subject of the loss, but because Forefather Julius had been here before any others and had even informed the Family Head of the House of Stormdust of what was occurring.","He had received a reply, and it was one that others would have been shocked to hear if it ever came to light!","The message that Forefather Julius had received from the Family Head of the House of Stormdust was as such.","\"This existence is unruly and will not be bending to any of the houses. He is an obstacle that will destabilize the current state of affairs...and he has to be eliminated.\"","THRUM!","A shocking command, and it was one passed by the Head of one of the factions of the Primordial Empire!","So Forefather Julius simply stared from a distance as he collected information, waving his hands as the figures of the many Daolord and Antiquities situated at the edges of the Cosmic Battlefield began to fade away into particles of light.","—","The first Writ of Challenge thus ended as it came with a myriad of rewards, but some were more important than others as they had to be looked at first hand!","In the far away Infinite Cosmos, in the Cerulean Universe.","The stretches of the void of space that were blue in color reflected in Noah's galactic eyes as he was in yet another Universe within his Cosmos for the purposes of seeing all the myriad of things under him. His Universal Body was floating in the beautiful landscape around him as he had a curvaceous woman by his side, her hair bright silver in color as her red eyes were focused on something that Noah recently waved his hands and took out.","It was a line that shone with a myriad of colors, this line seemingly falling off of his palms and into the void below endlessly, the feeling it gave off being very similar to the Runic Dao Lines on Noah's body!","It was some of the rewards to come out of the Writ of Challenge- loot that came from the bodies of Daolord Ilyad and Ray, the [Runic Dao Line Enhancers].","[Runic Dao Line Enhancers] :: The amalgamation of branded Runic Dao Lines that normally fade back into nature after the death of their owner, but the unique power of Noah Osmont has pulled upon this cycle of return and caused the formation of Dao Lines that can enhance the power of branded Daos to form. The Dao Line Enhancers will elevate the base effect of a selected branded Runic Dao Line that stems from Lesser Daos by 20%, Grand Daos by 10%, and Cosmic Daos by 5%. Currently owned Runic Dao Line Enhancers- 8.","Runic Dao Line Enhancers! From the battle, Noah obtained only 8 in number as such things normally faded back into nature when a Daolord died, but he forcefully pulled upon this cycle as he was able to obtain things that others could not even get their hands on!","They elevated the 'base effect' of a branded dao by differing percentages depending on what rank of Dao it was, where a Cosmic Dao would only ever continue to receive a 5% boost of the 10,000,000% base boost, no matter how many enhancers he attached to it.","This meant that for every Enhancer, he would gain an extra 500,000% to the boosts of the branded Runic Dao Lines of Annihilation!","\"Master, these are...\" The voice of the curvaceous silver haired woman beside him rang out as the drop dead beauty and Vampyre Queen Elena was holding onto Noah's arm tightly while looking at the eight glimmering lines that seemed endless.","Noah's eyes briefly left the Dao Line Enhancers to land on Elena, his gaze teasing as he called out lightly. \"I thought you said you'd try your best not to call me Master.\"","Even though his words were light, they nearly caused Elena's heart to burst out of her chest as she looked down shyly. She couldn't so easily deny the bond of blood between her and the Vampyre Progenitor- no matter how powerful he became. To her, she naturally and only ever called him Master as anything apart from it did not feel right!","Noah looked at the glimmering silver hair of this woman as he laughed while shaking his head, bringing up the Runic Dao Line Enhancers as his essence wrapped around one of them and caused it to sink into his body.","It was sinking towards nothing other than the glimmering Runic Dao Lines of the Cosmic Dao of Annihilation, Noah watching this nigh endless line go on to wrap around the Dao Lines of Annihilation in the form of rings!","Rings that gradually turned gold in color as they caused the Runic Dao Tattoo of Annihilation to be set apart from all others, causing it to look even more majestic as the ancient tattoo seemed like it had golden rings surrounding it throughout.","\"It's loot that just further breaks the barriers of power that I can achieve in the future. If you guys can begin comprehending and assimilating Ruination and the Primordial Dao soon, you can also start to enjoy loot like this!\"","Noah replied to the Vampyre Queen as his words caused her eyes to shine with longing and frustration, her reply stretching out a second later as she laid out her grievances.","\"We've been eating the Primordial Apples and Ruination Strawberries daily, only Sis Valentina managing to comprehend Ruination so far. The rest of us are still...ah\"","Her eyes were filled with wanting for strength, Noah seeing this as something not just Elena had, but everyone around him felt this way! But towards the latter stages of power, he could only do so much as his eyes now glanced at the effects of the Runic Dao Lines that gave the boost of 10,500,000%.","A stellar increase of power to an area that others were blocked from even advancing further in!"]},{"number":1200,"title":"Chapter 1200: Chapter 1199: A Cosmic Banquet! I","paragraphs":["His strength continued to ceaselessly climb up as his people struggled to arrive at the same place he was!","Amidst the beauty of the cerulean void of space they were floating in, the Runic Dao Line Enhancers burned fantastically on Noah's hands as they all flew towards the Runic Dao Lines of Annihilation, more and more golden rings seemingly being added to its tattoos as the lines endlessly wrapped around them.","It caused his right chest to now stand out even more on him as apart from the dark runic dao lines covering his upper chest, he now had shimmering golden rings wrapping around the lines on this side of his chest as it gave him an even wilder look!","Elena watched this scene as her heart pounded at the majesty of it all, her mouth not being able to stop itself as it unconsciously moved.","\"Master, your blood is filled with the essences of all of these Daos you've assimilated...maybe I can keep on trying to see if drinking it some more will give me the initial comprehension to Ruination and the Primordial Dao...\"","Her voice turned shy towards the end, but Elena knew very well the power of blood as if Dao Fruits stood a chance to give them comprehension, why should the blood of the being that had assimilated these Daos not be able to achieve a similar effect?!","After all, under the many <<Blood Progenitor>> sub-abilities that Noah held, his blood being a [Panacea] was one of them as Elena was one of the few that had the honor of coming across it and could not help but want more.","Noah took his eyes off of the golden rings forming on his Runic Dao Lines of Annihilation as he smiled towards Elena, his words ringing out as to her, they sounded like the most wondrous words in the world.","\"From the wrist or neck?\"","WAA!","Before his words even finished, bright white fangs revealed themselves from Elena's mouth as with his permission, she rushed towards his neck that glimmered with the light of billions of galaxies!","The blood from an existence of the Universal Race...those who would be lucky enough to have it would be envied by Daolords and even higher ranked existences in the future to come!","—","Those from the House of Stormdust accepted their loss as they began to disappear, only leaving behind the Houses of Springforge and Havenbreaker that were extending an olive branch to Noah.","\"A banquet...sounds fun. I hope to have my perception of the Primordial Empire changed after my first few encounters!\"","Noah was straightforward as he spoke towards Princess Halcyon and Forefather Isaac, his Primordial Ruination Clone adorning a white shirt just before the golden rings that came from the Runic Dao Line Enhancers began to show on his right chest.","At his words and the sudden increase of pressure he released around this time though, the eyes of these two beings squinted as they nearly caused the space before them to bend. Halcyon laughed while bringing her fair white gloved hand to cover her red lips while she spoke.","\"A few lower quality beings shouldn't forge an unchangeable perception of our glorious Bastion of Reality. Will Daolord Osmont grant this young lady the honor to host you within the House of Havenbreaker? It will be within the Golden Citadel of the Propitious Cosmos.\"","...!","Gasps could be heard in the surroundings at the mention of this Cosmos, this location being the very heart of the House of Havenbreaker as at times, even the Family Head of this House being occasionally seen in this location!","The Propitious Cosmos that was one of the core Cosmos of the House of Havenbreaker would be receiving the first Daolord in history to win a Writ of Challenge as a newcomer!","The crowds became abuzz with activity as even Forefather Isaac looked closely at Princess Halcyon who waved her hands to provide a Primal Crystal over to Noah.","\"This will contain all the details and also act as the right of passage across the Primordial Scaffoldings of the various Cosmos one must pass to reach the Propitious Cosmos. We will see Daolord Osmont and those you choose to bring in let's say...half a day?.\"","The golden eyes of Prince Halcyon glanced at the beings that had come behind Noah as they spoke, her eyes gazing over the figures of the prominent women being seen there as she saw how their eyes looked when they glanced at Noah.","Noah accepted the Primal Crystal while nodding lightly, looking at Princess Halcyon and all those around them as he spoke freely- so freely like he didn't see any of those around him as someone more important than him!","\"Half a day it is. If you all excuse me, I have to acquaint myself with a new Cosmos.\"","WAA!","His words resounded out as many were reminded that this being had just gained another Cosmos on him, Princess Halcyon letting out a light laugh once more as she waved her hands as it was taken as a signal for those from the House of Havenbreaker to begin moving away.","Trillions of auras of powerful existences began to fade as Noah didn't spare a glance, his gaze going towards the few hundred Antiquities still kneeling on the ground from the Anthracite Cosmos. The losers of this Writ of Challenge...and those that will now be under him along with another Cosmos!","He ignored any others that remained in the Cosmic Battlefield as the figures of Forefather Isaac and Halcyon faded away, his hands forming into a fist that released a blinding light that wrapped around his forces and the forces of the few hundred Antiquities from the Anthracite Cosmos.","Among the things that the Primordial Light of Authority could do was allow its holder to be capable of locating the coordinates of the Cosmos under their control, one being able to utilize this to teleport into it. And when it came to teleportation, Noah could conduct them en masse with utter ease as in a matter of seconds, his figure along with the hundreds of Antiquities behind him appeared on the entrance of a Primordial Scaffolding of a blazing new environment.","It was the entrance of the rainbow colored bridge that led into another Cosmos.","Anthracite! It was a word that meant coal, ember, or ash- and it was properly represented within this Cosmos as merely the void that surrounded the universes was blazing hot and crimson in color, one uniquely being able to find rivers of magma running through the boundaries of this Cosmos.","Noah glanced at this Cosmos as his eyes burned with a light of Conquest, feeling its essence refilling rapidly once more as he would soon be able to Enhance other Cosmic Daos and turn more of them into Runic Dao Lines!","He looked at this Cosmos as it was the first step into the Primordial Empire, the first of many steps he would take as he would not just stop on winning a single Cosmos!"]}]);
